(1110256, 135805, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really terrific image. The pose and facial expression combines with the windswept hair to lend this shot a feeling of authenticity sorely lacking in many of the portrait shots you see around. Really like the black and white treatment. All in all I can see why you chose this as your best of the year. Well done, 9.</td>', 'Really terrific image. The pose and facial expression combines with the windswept hair to lend this shot a feeling of authenticity sorely lacking in many of the portrait shots you see around. Really like the black and white treatment. All in all I can see why you chose this as your best of the year. Well done, 9.', '2005-01-16 02:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
