(1110274, 134562, 17507, '<td valign="top">Grass could have used a bit higher saturation... a little higher contrast on the castle would have been nice too. Great composition though... I like it.</td>', 'Grass could have used a bit higher saturation... a little higher contrast on the castle would have been nice too. Great composition though... I like it.', '2005-01-16 02:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110275, 133688, 23458, '<td valign="top">hehehe, what a capture. Great timing. 7</td>', 'hehehe, what a capture. Great timing. 7', '2005-01-16 02:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110276, 133704, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is pretty, very effective composition. 7</td>', 'This is pretty, very effective composition. 7', '2005-01-16 02:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110277, 132185, 17507, '<td valign="top">What I find most amazing about this generally excellent photo is the part of the stripes that so closely line up between the two. Fabulous shot- I hope to see it make the top 3.</td>', 'What I find most amazing about this generally excellent photo is the part of the stripes that so closely line up between the two. Fabulous shot- I hope to see it make the top 3.', '2005-01-16 02:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110278, 133230, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great location. She''s got great hair. I think the cropping could have been a bit tighter, though... the space on the far right of the image is kind of dead.</td>', 'Great location. She''s got great hair. I think the cropping could have been a bit tighter, though... the space on the far right of the image is kind of dead.', '2005-01-16 02:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110279, 132177, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the circular wheels and the vertical bars.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the circular wheels and the vertical bars.', '2005-01-16 02:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110280, 136739, 23458, '<td valign="top">Terrific subject - the subjects worn face in combination with that background really does tell a story. The flare over the photos in the background is a little distracting, but this is still a genuinely terrific image.</td>', 'Terrific subject - the subjects worn face in combination with that background really does tell a story. The flare over the photos in the background is a little distracting, but this is still a genuinely terrific image.', '2005-01-16 02:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110281, 136770, 28742, '<td valign="top">Composition: 9<br/>Technical: 9<br/>Appeal: 9<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Overall Score: 9, (weighted)<br/>Very nice shot - just a couple of things that take away from the concept: Seems out of place to have eye makeup, dirt smudges on chest and shoulder look hastily put there - should maybe feather the edges and the hair should be wilder. Still very appealing though!</td>', 'Composition: 9Technical: 9Appeal: 9Challenge: 10Overall Score: 9, (weighted)Very nice shot - just a couple of things that take away from the concept: Seems out of place to have eye makeup, dirt smudges on chest and shoulder look hastily put there - should maybe feather the edges and the hair should be wilder. Still very appealing though!', '2005-01-16 02:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110282, 134345, 17507, '<td valign="top">Those clouds are nuts. I wish I could see the color version... I think it might have helped to see the sky in color.</td>', 'Those clouds are nuts. I wish I could see the color version... I think it might have helped to see the sky in color.', '2005-01-16 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110284, 136427, 23458, '<td valign="top">The spider here blends in a little too closely with the background. (Which is unfortunately a little too busy). Good idea though - nice to see you''ve chosen a spider as your subject rather than some colourful, more cliched insectoid subject.</td>', 'The spider here blends in a little too closely with the background. (Which is unfortunately a little too busy). Good idea though - nice to see you''ve chosen a spider as your subject rather than some colourful, more cliched insectoid subject.', '2005-01-16 02:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110285, 134396, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a really pretty scene. Seems to need somethign more to elevate it above simple prettiness, but its well exposed and nicely composed. 6</td>', 'This is a really pretty scene. Seems to need somethign more to elevate it above simple prettiness, but its well exposed and nicely composed. 6', '2005-01-16 02:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110286, 134028, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, great scene and composition. 8</td>', 'Wow, great scene and composition. 8', '2005-01-16 03:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110287, 132874, 17507, '<td valign="top"><i>To kill a mockingbird?</i> Boy, can''t believe I remembered that one... then again, who else was ever named Atticus?<br/> <br/>Selective sepia tone... now that''s one I haven''t seen before. The different tone of the hair is subtle. I like it for its understatement. I feel like there''s a critical something lacking, though, not sure what, that keeps this picture from having a really strong impact. Nonetheless, an 8<br/></td>', 'To kill a mockingbird? Boy, can''t believe I remembered that one... then again, who else was ever named Atticus? Selective sepia tone... now that''s one I haven''t seen before. The different tone of the hair is subtle. I like it for its understatement. I feel like there''s a critical something lacking, though, not sure what, that keeps this picture from having a really strong impact. Nonetheless, an 8', '2005-01-16 03:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110288, 133277, 17507, '<td valign="top">That squirrel is clearly a harbinger of the Apocalypse.</td>', 'That squirrel is clearly a harbinger of the Apocalypse.', '2005-01-16 03:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110289, 132597, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I like the way the arches and the stairwell frames the scene. Might have been better if the pidgeon on the left had assumed a less ''messy'' pose, but thats just nitpicking. Also I''m not sure whether you have left the potplant in as some sort of commentary, but from a purely aesthetic point of view it is inconguous with the rest o the scene and would be better cloned out. Nicely done. 8.</td>', 'Interesting - I like the way the arches and the stairwell frames the scene. Might have been better if the pidgeon on the left had assumed a less ''messy'' pose, but thats just nitpicking. Also I''m not sure whether you have left the potplant in as some sort of commentary, but from a purely aesthetic point of view it is inconguous with the rest o the scene and would be better cloned out. Nicely done. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110291, 136428, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really terrific DOF and subject here. I''ve seen this idea  a few tims, but never done this well. 8. Great compostition.</td>', 'Really terrific DOF and subject here. I''ve seen this idea  a few tims, but never done this well. 8. Great compostition.', '2005-01-16 03:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110292, 135053, 19952, '<td valign="top">How did you get such a great shot of these fish? I''ve tried to shoot koi and have never managed to get such excellent colors and clarity. Really nice job!</td>', 'How did you get such a great shot of these fish? I''ve tried to shoot koi and have never managed to get such excellent colors and clarity. Really nice job!', '2005-01-16 03:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110293, 136222, 17507, '<td valign="top">Interesting inverted image. Good capture of the birds. I wish they were on the left of the image, though. Being where they are and flying to the right, the whole left of the image winds up looking kind of dead.</td>', 'Interesting inverted image. Good capture of the birds. I wish they were on the left of the image, though. Being where they are and flying to the right, the whole left of the image winds up looking kind of dead.', '2005-01-16 03:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110294, 136606, 17507, '<td valign="top">That dude is definitely wearing the freakiest shirt I''ve seen in a while. Interesting repeat of the square shape in his shirt and on the door/wall thing.</td>', 'That dude is definitely wearing the freakiest shirt I''ve seen in a while. Interesting repeat of the square shape in his shirt and on the door/wall thing.', '2005-01-16 03:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110295, 135427, 17507, '<td valign="top">Lovely girl, nice shot, but postprocessing looks a bit overdone. Too much soft focus is distracting.</td>', 'Lovely girl, nice shot, but postprocessing looks a bit overdone. Too much soft focus is distracting.', '2005-01-16 03:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110296, 136414, 17507, '<td valign="top">Clouds are killer. They definitely make the shot. It''s a bit static for my tastes, though... having a person walking along the shoreline would have helped a lot.  a 7</td>', 'Clouds are killer. They definitely make the shot. It''s a bit static for my tastes, though... having a person walking along the shoreline would have helped a lot.  a 7', '2005-01-16 03:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110297, 133403, 23458, '<td valign="top">Sheesh - clicked vote on the image before this, turned away and when I turned back this was here. I think you know by now this image is a ten from me. Tremendous subject, the monochrome suits in perfectly. The sailboat in the bottom corner completes the composition. Not sure whether the boat in the middle wouldn''t have been better cloned out, but that is a minor gripe. Well done.</td>', 'Sheesh - clicked vote on the image before this, turned away and when I turned back this was here. I think you know by now this image is a ten from me. Tremendous subject, the monochrome suits in perfectly. The sailboat in the bottom corner completes the composition. Not sure whether the boat in the middle wouldn''t have been better cloned out, but that is a minor gripe. Well done.', '2005-01-16 03:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110298, 136180, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hello, Roger. Nice hat.</td>', 'Hello, Roger. Nice hat.', '2005-01-16 03:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110299, 136038, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and the leaf is terrific also, but the lighting seems a little harsh. Additionally, the sterility of the background doesn''t really work with ''sally.''  5.</td>', 'Interesting subject, and the leaf is terrific also, but the lighting seems a little harsh. Additionally, the sterility of the background doesn''t really work with ''sally.''  5.', '2005-01-16 03:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110300, 136863, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice capture... birds are really tough to shoot.</td>', 'Nice capture... birds are really tough to shoot.', '2005-01-16 03:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110301, 133252, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great color. I think the darkening of the sky on the left is a bit overdone though. I''d give it an 8 but subtract one for the darkening = 7</td>', 'Great color. I think the darkening of the sky on the left is a bit overdone though. I''d give it an 8 but subtract one for the darkening = 7', '2005-01-16 03:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110302, 135490, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is definately a nice scene. Composition is strong - I like the puddle under the bench - adds a nice element. The image itself though, seems a little dull - maybe would have been better on a brighter day. Not bad, but lacks a little oomph. 6.</td>', 'This is definately a nice scene. Composition is strong - I like the puddle under the bench - adds a nice element. The image itself though, seems a little dull - maybe would have been better on a brighter day. Not bad, but lacks a little oomph. 6.', '2005-01-16 03:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110303, 136873, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is one of very few set-up shots in this challenge - and as far as set up shots go, its not a bad one. YOu''ve stopped the splash quite effectively, though this image does suffer from being a little untidy - I think some spot editing with respect to some of the water droplets - particularly on the egg would have been a great help here. I''m also not completely sold on the background. Overall, not a bad effort though. Good Luck. 6.</td>', 'This is one of very few set-up shots in this challenge - and as far as set up shots go, its not a bad one. YOu''ve stopped the splash quite effectively, though this image does suffer from being a little untidy - I think some spot editing with respect to some of the water droplets - particularly on the egg would have been a great help here. I''m also not completely sold on the background. Overall, not a bad effort though. Good Luck. 6.', '2005-01-16 03:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110304, 132694, 23458, '<td valign="top">This girl looks like a real character. Great facial expression. The focus is a little soft though.</td>', 'This girl looks like a real character. Great facial expression. The focus is a little soft though.', '2005-01-16 03:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110305, 135639, 23458, '<td valign="top">Definately one of the better butterful shots. Nice and crisp and great colours.</td>', 'Definately one of the better butterful shots. Nice and crisp and great colours.', '2005-01-16 03:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110307, 136551, 4805, '<td valign="top">My pick of the challenge. I think this is a Setzler but I can''t recally exactly. Says a lot about youth, power, authority and responsibilities. His peeking out behind the symbol of authority into the world is very well portrayed here. Nicely done.</td>', 'My pick of the challenge. I think this is a Setzler but I can''t recally exactly. Says a lot about youth, power, authority and responsibilities. His peeking out behind the symbol of authority into the world is very well portrayed here. Nicely done.', '2005-01-16 03:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110308, 132109, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is some of the best lighting I have seen on this site. Ever. Excellent still life. <br/> <br/>10.</td>', 'This is some of the best lighting I have seen on this site. Ever. Excellent still life.  10.', '2005-01-16 03:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110309, 132763, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great expression on both these guys faces. Good capture there - but the flash is a little harsh, and it doesn''t look like much thought has gone into this.</td>', 'Great expression on both these guys faces. Good capture there - but the flash is a little harsh, and it doesn''t look like much thought has gone into this.', '2005-01-16 03:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110310, 136435, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well this is a lesson to everyone who takes photographs of children. Simply terrific. DOF is perfect, you have isolated him tremendously well. One of the best images I have seen so far, this is the kind of stuff that could make you a very nice living as an upscale portrait photographer. 10.</td>', 'Well this is a lesson to everyone who takes photographs of children. Simply terrific. DOF is perfect, you have isolated him tremendously well. One of the best images I have seen so far, this is the kind of stuff that could make you a very nice living as an upscale portrait photographer. 10.', '2005-01-16 03:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110311, 136685, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the golden cast on the windmill. Your walking a thin line when it comes to the processing here, but I think the pushed appearance of this image works in the end. 8.</td>', 'Love the golden cast on the windmill. Your walking a thin line when it comes to the processing here, but I think the pushed appearance of this image works in the end. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110312, 136217, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a scene. You are a lucky person. Really like the boats here. They complete the image. Its a shame the palm is in such bedraggled condition here, but it was a nice idea to use it to frame the image. 7.</td>', 'Wow, what a scene. You are a lucky person. Really like the boats here. They complete the image. Its a shame the palm is in such bedraggled condition here, but it was a nice idea to use it to frame the image. 7.', '2005-01-16 03:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110318, 136602, 8860, '<td valign="top">Poignant scene. This could have been made more impactful by offsetting the subject to the right, leaving some space on the left following his gaze into freedom. Shadows are a bit too dense on his face and I feel I need to see the eyes.</td>', 'Poignant scene. This could have been made more impactful by offsetting the subject to the right, leaving some space on the left following his gaze into freedom. Shadows are a bit too dense on his face and I feel I need to see the eyes.', '2005-01-16 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110319, 132096, 23458, '<td valign="top">This image is a ten in so many ways. Tthe facial expression couldnt be more perfect if it was painted on. The contrast between the almost ''Dickensesque'' subject and the modern plastic chairs and bags is amazingly effective. One of the better candid images I have come across. Straight into my favourites.</td>', 'This image is a ten in so many ways. Tthe facial expression couldnt be more perfect if it was painted on. The contrast between the almost ''Dickensesque'' subject and the modern plastic chairs and bags is amazingly effective. One of the better candid images I have come across. Straight into my favourites.', '2005-01-16 03:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110320, 132625, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting here, not sure about the selective de-sat but this is a fairly strong bit of imagery. The title is great. 7.</td>', 'Nice lighting here, not sure about the selective de-sat but this is a fairly strong bit of imagery. The title is great. 7.', '2005-01-16 03:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110322, 136756, 29241, '<td valign="top">I love your title! I would be proud of it also!</td>', 'I love your title! I would be proud of it also!', '2005-01-16 03:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110323, 136648, 23458, '<td valign="top">What an expression. Terrific capture. Might work better with a closer crop - still a great image.</td>', 'What an expression. Terrific capture. Might work better with a closer crop - still a great image.', '2005-01-16 03:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110324, 133716, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty scene. Perhaps a little busy, but definately pretty. The colours here are great. 6.</td>', 'This is a pretty scene. Perhaps a little busy, but definately pretty. The colours here are great. 6.', '2005-01-16 03:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110326, 132190, 23458, '<td valign="top">I think I have scene this idea before. But done before or not, this remains a really terrific perspective. Captures the romance of the occasion perfectly. Great lighting. 8.</td>', 'I think I have scene this idea before. But done before or not, this remains a really terrific perspective. Captures the romance of the occasion perfectly. Great lighting. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110327, 135987, 19952, '<td valign="top">Recognize you anywhere. ;-) Another excellent self-portrait with a dramatic and interesting pose. Very nice job!</td>', 'Recognize you anywhere. ;-) Another excellent self-portrait with a dramatic and interesting pose. Very nice job!', '2005-01-16 03:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110328, 134322, 23458, '<td valign="top">Normally I''m not one of these impressionisitc shots. But this is simply joyous. Composition is absolutely spot on. 10. One of the first images I''ve seen on this site that wasn''t funny per-se but managed to put a smile on my face. Oh yeah, just in case you hadn''t gathered - that accomplishment alone earns you a ten.</td>', 'Normally I''m not one of these impressionisitc shots. But this is simply joyous. Composition is absolutely spot on. 10. One of the first images I''ve seen on this site that wasn''t funny per-se but managed to put a smile on my face. Oh yeah, just in case you hadn''t gathered - that accomplishment alone earns you a ten.', '2005-01-16 03:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110330, 135345, 29241, '<td valign="top">I''m not into bug pictures very much, but this is very nice!</td>', 'I''m not into bug pictures very much, but this is very nice!', '2005-01-16 03:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110332, 132713, 23458, '<td valign="top">As far as subway type shots go, this is a good one. THe lights on the train are a little too blown out perhaps, but this is still an effective shot. 7.</td>', 'As far as subway type shots go, this is a good one. THe lights on the train are a little too blown out perhaps, but this is still an effective shot. 7.', '2005-01-16 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110335, 133747, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a really bright happy image, Normally a blown out sun like that is distracting, but I think this is one of the few occasions in which it works. 7</td>', 'This is a really bright happy image, Normally a blown out sun like that is distracting, but I think this is one of the few occasions in which it works. 7', '2005-01-16 03:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110336, 136832, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good use of the film grain here. Great subject and lighting is spot on. A nine from me.</td>', 'Good use of the film grain here. Great subject and lighting is spot on. A nine from me.', '2005-01-16 03:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110337, 134074, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Perhaps this would be better if there was more contrast between the cat and the background, he/she seems to blend in to the white house behind.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Perhaps this would be better if there was more contrast between the cat and the background, he/she seems to blend in to the white house behind.', '2005-01-16 03:42:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1110338, 132149, 23458, '<td valign="top">Heheh, nice candid, like the warmth in the mans eyes. Might be better as a black and white ??</td>', 'Heheh, nice candid, like the warmth in the mans eyes. Might be better as a black and white ??', '2005-01-16 03:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110340, 136345, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good solid lanscape shot - perhaps a little too much black on the right, but that is a really cool cloud formation.</td>', 'Good solid lanscape shot - perhaps a little too much black on the right, but that is a really cool cloud formation.', '2005-01-16 03:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110341, 134022, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a really great journalistic silhouette image. Good job.</td>', 'This is a really great journalistic silhouette image. Good job.', '2005-01-16 03:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110343, 134669, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and subject. Nice capture. 7.</td>', 'Good DOF and subject. Nice capture. 7.', '2005-01-16 03:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110344, 134673, 23458, '<td valign="top">Thats a really interesting duck. The reflection here adds another dimension. Good work. 8.</td>', 'Thats a really interesting duck. The reflection here adds another dimension. Good work. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110345, 136624, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the soft almost sensuous feel of this image. Great DOF. 8.</td>', 'I like the soft almost sensuous feel of this image. Great DOF. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110346, 132463, 23458, '<td valign="top">really interesting perspective here. I can''t quite put my finger on why, but this is surprisingly effective. 7.</td>', 'really interesting perspective here. I can''t quite put my finger on why, but this is surprisingly effective. 7.', '2005-01-16 03:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110349, 132307, 23458, '<td valign="top">Surprised I have''t seen at least a couple more eagle shots :P. But as far as eagle shots go this is really good. I like the composition a lot, and you have done a great job of avoiding cliched territory.  8.</td>', 'Surprised I have''t seen at least a couple more eagle shots :P. But as far as eagle shots go this is really good. I like the composition a lot, and you have done a great job of avoiding cliched territory.  8.', '2005-01-16 03:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110351, 133209, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image - great eye. The leaves combined with the reflection of the bare trees really does sum up the beginning of winter wonderfully. Seems to be lacking something - I think the yellow leaves aren''t all that interesting, but an 8 for originality and the aforementioned creative eye.</td>', 'Really interesting image - great eye. The leaves combined with the reflection of the bare trees really does sum up the beginning of winter wonderfully. Seems to be lacking something - I think the yellow leaves aren''t all that interesting, but an 8 for originality and the aforementioned creative eye.', '2005-01-16 03:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110353, 133208, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well cliched as they are, this is certainly a solid waterfall shot. Someone here once noted that everyone needs one in their portfolio - and I think you may have yours here. 8.</td>', 'Well cliched as they are, this is certainly a solid waterfall shot. Someone here once noted that everyone needs one in their portfolio - and I think you may have yours here. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110354, 132693, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well I''ve seen this several times before - I can''t remember for the life of me whether it was jacko''s or someone elses but this is one of the better insect shots I''ve seen. 10. It really tells a story.</td>', 'Well I''ve seen this several times before - I can''t remember for the life of me whether it was jacko''s or someone elses but this is one of the better insect shots I''ve seen. 10. It really tells a story.', '2005-01-16 03:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110355, 133748, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, the tilted horizon is a little offputting. But as far as lighting shots go this is marvellous. A nine for now, but I get the feeling this one may get bumped up.<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'Wow, the tilted horizon is a little offputting. But as far as lighting shots go this is marvellous. A nine for now, but I get the feeling this one may get bumped up. Great job.', '2005-01-16 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110356, 134628, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting flower and really well executed. 8</td>', 'Interesting flower and really well executed. 8', '2005-01-16 03:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110357, 135135, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on this one. Might have worked better detached from the vine - but I really like the texture to this image. 8.</td>', 'Great perspective on this one. Might have worked better detached from the vine - but I really like the texture to this image. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110359, 134270, 23458, '<td valign="top">This would make a terrific postcard - not particularly inspiring, but you''ve chosen a nice perspective. Very easy on the eyes. 8.</td>', 'This would make a terrific postcard - not particularly inspiring, but you''ve chosen a nice perspective. Very easy on the eyes. 8.', '2005-01-16 03:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110360, 132874, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression here. Like the sepia treatment. <br/> <br/>Good work, 8.</td>', 'Great facial expression here. Like the sepia treatment.  Good work, 8.', '2005-01-16 03:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110361, 135457, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well as many times as I''ve now seen this before, its hard to give this a really high score. But I so like the mood created by the silver car. 7 for sheer technical skill.</td>', 'Well as many times as I''ve now seen this before, its hard to give this a really high score. But I so like the mood created by the silver car. 7 for sheer technical skill.', '2005-01-16 03:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110362, 136576, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty subject here and nice composition. 7.</td>', 'Very pretty subject here and nice composition. 7.', '2005-01-16 03:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110367, 136752, 28750, '<td valign="top">great photo <br/>one of the best</td>', 'great photo one of the best', '2005-01-16 04:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110369, 134937, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject here. Doesn''t seem as crisp as some of the other insect macros, but not a bad effort.</td>', 'Interesting subject here. Doesn''t seem as crisp as some of the other insect macros, but not a bad effort.', '2005-01-16 04:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110370, 133132, 23458, '<td valign="top">A great capture of a special moment. Good work!</td>', 'A great capture of a special moment. Good work!', '2005-01-16 04:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110372, 132456, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good still life. I like the painterly feel created by the lighting.</td>', 'Good still life. I like the painterly feel created by the lighting.', '2005-01-16 04:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110373, 135633, 23458, '<td valign="top">Not a bad sunset shot - I think theres a little too much black space on the right, but this remains a solid shot.</td>', 'Not a bad sunset shot - I think theres a little too much black space on the right, but this remains a solid shot.', '2005-01-16 04:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110374, 134411, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is pretty, though I''d like the focus to be just a tad sharper. Nice effort.</td>', 'This is pretty, though I''d like the focus to be just a tad sharper. Nice effort.', '2005-01-16 04:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110376, 132948, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind the framing effect here - though I think you might have a little too much frame and not enough subject.</td>', 'I like the idea behind the framing effect here - though I think you might have a little too much frame and not enough subject.', '2005-01-16 04:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110377, 135208, 23458, '<td valign="top">What a brilliant capture. This might even work a little better with more of a panoramic orientation, but I like it a lot as is. The colourful winter gear and the girl in red kicking her leg out make for a wonderful image. 8.</td>', 'What a brilliant capture. This might even work a little better with more of a panoramic orientation, but I like it a lot as is. The colourful winter gear and the girl in red kicking her leg out make for a wonderful image. 8.', '2005-01-16 04:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110379, 134214, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really really really really fantastic capture. If you didn''t stage this its a 25 on the ten point scale. I''m guessing there is a high probability you did stage this, so I''ll have to lower your score to a ten.</td>', 'Really really really really fantastic capture. If you didn''t stage this its a 25 on the ten point scale. I''m guessing there is a high probability you did stage this, so I''ll have to lower your score to a ten.', '2005-01-16 04:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110380, 135565, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is really effective - I seem to remember seeing a version of this in the forums, but the post processing on this version is much better than I remember of that one. Great colours.</td>', 'This is really effective - I seem to remember seeing a version of this in the forums, but the post processing on this version is much better than I remember of that one. Great colours.', '2005-01-16 04:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110381, 136414, 23458, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sky. One of the better sky''s I''ve ever seen on a landscape shot actually. The land part is a little disappointing in comparison, but its still really nice.</td>', 'Fantastic sky. One of the better sky''s I''ve ever seen on a landscape shot actually. The land part is a little disappointing in comparison, but its still really nice.', '2005-01-16 04:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110382, 136591, 4226, '<td valign="top">oversharpened. You can see the artifacts.</td>', 'oversharpened. You can see the artifacts.', '2005-01-16 04:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110384, 136766, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good composition, though the image does seem a little flat - maybe a little more saturation/ contrast would have helped.</td>', 'Good composition, though the image does seem a little flat - maybe a little more saturation/ contrast would have helped.', '2005-01-16 04:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110385, 132255, 23458, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing here. The soft focus is tremendous...lends the image a feeling of serenity, which is really ironic seeing as these young women are about to engage in one of the most physically demanding sports going. 9.</td>', 'Perfect timing here. The soft focus is tremendous...lends the image a feeling of serenity, which is really ironic seeing as these young women are about to engage in one of the most physically demanding sports going. 9.', '2005-01-16 04:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110386, 136307, 6912, '<td valign="top">absolutelly amazing, nice soft textures of the skin! 10 Nasti</td>', 'absolutelly amazing, nice soft textures of the skin! 10 Nasti', '2005-01-16 04:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110388, 132225, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular. Really really joyous. Normally I would find the yellow a little too much, but it seems to work fairly well here. Oh and the horizone seems to recede fractionally from left to right. Whatever. 9.</td>', 'This is spectacular. Really really joyous. Normally I would find the yellow a little too much, but it seems to work fairly well here. Oh and the horizone seems to recede fractionally from left to right. Whatever. 9.', '2005-01-16 04:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110389, 135207, 26679, '<td valign="top">the contrast of light and dark gives a good twilight and moody feel to this image,. I do however find the angle of the horizon a little distracting.</td>', 'the contrast of light and dark gives a good twilight and moody feel to this image,. I do however find the angle of the horizon a little distracting.', '2005-01-16 04:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110390, 136180, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice well lit portrait a little too static but a solid shot.</td>', 'Nice well lit portrait a little too static but a solid shot.', '2005-01-16 04:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110392, 134513, 26679, '<td valign="top">I saw that same pose in a clothes catalogue this morning..</td>', 'I saw that same pose in a clothes catalogue this morning..', '2005-01-16 04:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110393, 134147, 23458, '<td valign="top">Solid, well lit, stop motion. Really like the background here. Much more interesting than the standard black or white.</td>', 'Solid, well lit, stop motion. Really like the background here. Much more interesting than the standard black or white.', '2005-01-16 04:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110394, 134935, 23458, '<td valign="top">I really like the background of this image - ery painterly, the foreground is perhaps a little too dark, but a good effort nonetheless. 6.</td>', 'I really like the background of this image - ery painterly, the foreground is perhaps a little too dark, but a good effort nonetheless. 6.', '2005-01-16 04:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110396, 132082, 23458, '<td valign="top">Puffins are possibly the coolest birds ever. Terrific stopped motion and I love the tones of the water. The contrast between the fish and the brightly coloured beak is particularly pleasing. 10.</td>', 'Puffins are possibly the coolest birds ever. Terrific stopped motion and I love the tones of the water. The contrast between the fish and the brightly coloured beak is particularly pleasing. 10.', '2005-01-16 04:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110397, 134829, 26679, '<td valign="top">you have captures some determined expressions here.  (Iwonder what the no 31 in looking at)..</td>', 'you have captures some determined expressions here.  (Iwonder what the no 31 in looking at)..', '2005-01-16 04:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110398, 134562, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good landscape shot here. The purple sky is perhaps a little much. But otherwise a nice image. 7.</td>', 'Good landscape shot here. The purple sky is perhaps a little much. But otherwise a nice image. 7.', '2005-01-16 04:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110401, 136337, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot but would be better if you could see more of their faces.</td>', 'Very nice shot but would be better if you could see more of their faces.', '2005-01-16 04:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110403, 133041, 23458, '<td valign="top">The refelection part of this image is nice, but the edges don''t really work for me. They aren''t particularly attractive and would work better with a crisper focus.</td>', 'The refelection part of this image is nice, but the edges don''t really work for me. They aren''t particularly attractive and would work better with a crisper focus.', '2005-01-16 04:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110405, 132622, 23458, '<td valign="top">I''m not completely convinced you haven''t gone too far with the processing here, but you certainly have a bit of skill with the old photoshop. That is a terrific sky, and the perfectly manicured lawn offsets it nicely.</td>', 'I''m not completely convinced you haven''t gone too far with the processing here, but you certainly have a bit of skill with the old photoshop. That is a terrific sky, and the perfectly manicured lawn offsets it nicely.', '2005-01-16 04:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110406, 136704, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great background, feathers in corner a little distracting.</td>', 'Great background, feathers in corner a little distracting.', '2005-01-16 04:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110408, 132625, 26679, '<td valign="top">good selective desaturation, you have captured the feeling well. I wonder whether ''Alone'' is quite the right title here, I feel that these needs is better captured by ''Solace'' or ''Contemplation''.</td>', 'good selective desaturation, you have captured the feeling well. I wonder whether ''Alone'' is quite the right title here, I feel that these needs is better captured by ''Solace'' or ''Contemplation''.', '2005-01-16 04:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110409, 132158, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is relatively well composed, but I think overall its a little flat, the reflection is too muddy and there is too much debris in the water for it to be completely successful.</td>', 'This is relatively well composed, but I think overall its a little flat, the reflection is too muddy and there is too much debris in the water for it to be completely successful.', '2005-01-16 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110410, 135346, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really like the colours and perspective here. 7.</td>', 'Really like the colours and perspective here. 7.', '2005-01-16 04:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110411, 135208, 4805, '<td valign="top">I like this one!</td>', 'I like this one!', '2005-01-16 04:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110412, 132743, 16301, '<td valign="top">You have a good looking model here, the only thing that ruins the photo is the background ===&gt; the trash bin, the mall''s doors, they just don''t enhance this portrait. I would have looked for a more appealing background, or cropped in tight to eliminate the distracting background. Always pay attention to your background because its an important part of a portrait, I hope this helps...</td>', 'You have a good looking model here, the only thing that ruins the photo is the background ===> the trash bin, the mall''s doors, they just don''t enhance this portrait. I would have looked for a more appealing background, or cropped in tight to eliminate the distracting background. Always pay attention to your background because its an important part of a portrait, I hope this helps...', '2005-01-16 04:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110414, 133250, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good reflection shame the sky is a bit bland.</td>', 'Good reflection shame the sky is a bit bland.', '2005-01-16 04:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110415, 136614, 23458, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, though I feel the composition is a little too central, and the barbed wire fence and tacky sign on the right detract from the impact of this image. 5.</td>', 'A nice idea, though I feel the composition is a little too central, and the barbed wire fence and tacky sign on the right detract from the impact of this image. 5.', '2005-01-16 04:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110417, 136823, 4805, '<td valign="top">I like this one. I like how you can tell a lot about the person just by the hands.</td>', 'I like this one. I like how you can tell a lot about the person just by the hands.', '2005-01-16 04:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110418, 136764, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here, the angle you''ve chosen is perhaps a little uninteresting, but this is a technically solid image.</td>', 'Nice colours here, the angle you''ve chosen is perhaps a little uninteresting, but this is a technically solid image.', '2005-01-16 04:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110419, 135921, 4517, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with good colours. Title could be more descriptive.</td>', 'Interesting shot with good colours. Title could be more descriptive.', '2005-01-16 04:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110422, 134009, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great backdrop here and nice subject, she just looks a little too posed, would work really well if it appeared a little more candid. Still a good effort, crisp, clear and great colours.</td>', 'Great backdrop here and nice subject, she just looks a little too posed, would work really well if it appeared a little more candid. Still a good effort, crisp, clear and great colours.', '2005-01-16 04:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110423, 132214, 23458, '<td valign="top">An interesting sunset shot, like the foreground reflections in particular. Perhaps a little too much darkness, but still a solid shot. 7.</td>', 'An interesting sunset shot, like the foreground reflections in particular. Perhaps a little too much darkness, but still a solid shot. 7.', '2005-01-16 04:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110425, 136478, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic night shot. I like. 9</td>', 'Very dramatic night shot. I like. 9', '2005-01-16 04:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
