(1110489, 136870, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well Banmorn, this would come close to winning the architectural challenge about to begin, and as for this challenge, its one of my favourites here too. You should be proud of this (in case you can''t tell I''m a sucker for architectual abstracts). 9</td>', 'Well Banmorn, this would come close to winning the architectural challenge about to begin, and as for this challenge, its one of my favourites here too. You should be proud of this (in case you can''t tell I''m a sucker for architectual abstracts). 9', '2005-01-16 04:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
