(1110516, 134564, 23458, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea - good strong subject for a silhouette photo like this, but the composition is a little too central and the colours could be bumped a little.</td>', 'An interesting idea - good strong subject for a silhouette photo like this, but the composition is a little too central and the colours could be bumped a little.', '2005-01-16 05:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
