(1110582, 132540, 30861, '<td valign="top">The more Iook at this, the more Ilike it. The single face just to the right of center, lookign at the camera, makes the picture. without it, it''s basically a blah show. But it''s there, and everything int he picture revolves around this indvidually. Beautifully-done. I suspect youw eren''t sure about submitting this one, and I''m glad you did.</td>', 'The more Iook at this, the more Ilike it. The single face just to the right of center, lookign at the camera, makes the picture. without it, it''s basically a blah show. But it''s there, and everything int he picture revolves around this indvidually. Beautifully-done. I suspect youw eren''t sure about submitting this one, and I''m glad you did.', '2005-01-16 05:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
