(1110603, 132096, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cristi, this is one of the most beautiful photos I have seen in 2004 and I think it also qualifies for my personal top 100 ever. I thougth that I had it as a favourite, but couldn''t find it anymore. Took me a lot of Googling to find out what the deal was. :)<br/> <br/>I don''t know what it is, but anytime I look at this I come out at the eyes, always the eyes. They draw me in, they look like they tell a story. Her pose enhances that, there is something she is thinking about.... <br/> <br/>The grey tone works very well with this.<br/></td>', 'Cristi, this is one of the most beautiful photos I have seen in 2004 and I think it also qualifies for my personal top 100 ever. I thougth that I had it as a favourite, but couldn''t find it anymore. Took me a lot of Googling to find out what the deal was. :) I don''t know what it is, but anytime I look at this I come out at the eyes, always the eyes. They draw me in, they look like they tell a story. Her pose enhances that, there is something she is thinking about....  The grey tone works very well with this.', '2005-01-16 05:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
