(1110639, 132255, 3032, '<td valign="top">Timeless, as if they are just pushing oiff to do the 1920''s Olympic final.  <br/>Symmetry in repetitive elements; same pose, same look, same clothes, same oars and even the shore continues it.<br/>Great B&amp;W, I like the softness.</td>', 'Timeless, as if they are just pushing oiff to do the 1920''s Olympic final.  Symmetry in repetitive elements; same pose, same look, same clothes, same oars and even the shore continues it.Great B&W, I like the softness.', '2005-01-16 05:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110640, 136435, 10268, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning.  Such a great portrait.  I had any criticism at all, but I don''t.  I love the composition, the depth of field.  Everything works perfectly together.  10.</td>', 'Simply stunning.  Such a great portrait.  I had any criticism at all, but I don''t.  I love the composition, the depth of field.  Everything works perfectly together.  10.', '2005-01-16 06:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
