(1110695, 135233, 26679, '<td valign="top">Good Clouring and composition, - I Like this one...</td>', 'Good Clouring and composition, - I Like this one...', '2005-01-16 06:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110697, 136625, 23458, '<td valign="top">Bobster right ?? This is a really great candid. Would have ribboned in that challenge for sure. I can see why you chose this out of your excellent portfolio (As much as I think some of your other images would have done better in the general DPC scheme of things), it''s certainly worth a chuckle. 9.</td>', 'Bobster right ?? This is a really great candid. Would have ribboned in that challenge for sure. I can see why you chose this out of your excellent portfolio (As much as I think some of your other images would have done better in the general DPC scheme of things), it''s certainly worth a chuckle. 9.', '2005-01-16 06:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110700, 132858, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well captured here - would have perhaps liked a closer crop - squareish - as it is the details of the zebras are a little hard to make out, I just feel that some of that space at the top is a little wasted. But still, great capture.</td>', 'Well captured here - would have perhaps liked a closer crop - squareish - as it is the details of the zebras are a little hard to make out, I just feel that some of that space at the top is a little wasted. But still, great capture.', '2005-01-16 06:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110701, 134361, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, one of the better waterfall photos in this challenge (and there are several very competent ones :P). <br/> <br/>9.</td>', 'Very dramatic, one of the better waterfall photos in this challenge (and there are several very competent ones :P).  9.', '2005-01-16 07:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110702, 133335, 23458, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene here, Like the lush green feel. For some reason the focus seems a little soft though. 6.</td>', 'Pretty scene here, Like the lush green feel. For some reason the focus seems a little soft though. 6.', '2005-01-16 07:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110704, 136433, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like this - the squareish format is very effective here. I also really like the muted lighting. Simple, understated, yet very effective. 8.</td>', 'I like this - the squareish format is very effective here. I also really like the muted lighting. Simple, understated, yet very effective. 8.', '2005-01-16 07:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110705, 132859, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, happy image. Perhaps not all that exciting against the clear sky (some dramatic clouds would have helped) but hey, we can''t choose the weather!</td>', 'Nice, simple, happy image. Perhaps not all that exciting against the clear sky (some dramatic clouds would have helped) but hey, we can''t choose the weather!', '2005-01-16 07:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110707, 136587, 23458, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - gorgeous colours, great silhouette - even the blown out sun rays work. 9.</td>', 'Fantastic - gorgeous colours, great silhouette - even the blown out sun rays work. 9.', '2005-01-16 07:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110708, 132201, 23458, '<td valign="top">Now thats magnification !! It''s practically a moon macro :P.</td>', 'Now thats magnification !! It''s practically a moon macro :P.', '2005-01-16 07:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110709, 132857, 23458, '<td valign="top">A nice idea here - though it comes off as a little busy in the end - would have been better if you cleared some of the dead twigs from the subject and, if possible, used a shallower DOF to isolate it from the background.</td>', 'A nice idea here - though it comes off as a little busy in the end - would have been better if you cleared some of the dead twigs from the subject and, if possible, used a shallower DOF to isolate it from the background.', '2005-01-16 07:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110710, 133758, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful. The composition against the sky works really well here. 8.</td>', 'This is simply beautiful. The composition against the sky works really well here. 8.', '2005-01-16 07:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110711, 132131, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great subject and lighting - the focus could be a little crisper - and Im not sure if a better angle wouldn''t have worked better but I still really like the feeling you have created with this one. The expression on his face really does convey the joy of music. 7.</td>', 'Great subject and lighting - the focus could be a little crisper - and Im not sure if a better angle wouldn''t have worked better but I still really like the feeling you have created with this one. The expression on his face really does convey the joy of music. 7.', '2005-01-16 07:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110712, 136550, 23458, '<td valign="top">Thats certainly a pretty rose - though the focus is not quite spot on. Might also want to try saturating it or upping the contrast a little - that and/or some sharpening may make the focus seems a little clearer.</td>', 'Thats certainly a pretty rose - though the focus is not quite spot on. Might also want to try saturating it or upping the contrast a little - that and/or some sharpening may make the focus seems a little clearer.', '2005-01-16 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110713, 132367, 26679, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like the face in the picture flame is pulling away from the wet sloppy tongue. - I think the dogs needs to be a little sharper.</td>', 'It almost looks like the face in the picture flame is pulling away from the wet sloppy tongue. - I think the dogs needs to be a little sharper.', '2005-01-16 07:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110714, 136680, 23458, '<td valign="top">Thats a really photogenic landscape - I like the extra dimension added by the old brick wall and those yellow bushes.</td>', 'Thats a really photogenic landscape - I like the extra dimension added by the old brick wall and those yellow bushes.', '2005-01-16 07:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110715, 132857, 6999, '<td valign="top">Compositionally strong, adn the basic tonality is good. It''s uch a straightforward image that I wonder if it won''t be hurt by those who are looking for more immediate impact. I wouldn''t quite count myself amonst those, but I do perhaps think that the light is a touch blank and ordinary, and perhaps some pushing of contrast, or of saturation/desaturation might have given it more punch. Good work though.</td>', 'Compositionally strong, adn the basic tonality is good. It''s uch a straightforward image that I wonder if it won''t be hurt by those who are looking for more immediate impact. I wouldn''t quite count myself amonst those, but I do perhaps think that the light is a touch blank and ordinary, and perhaps some pushing of contrast, or of saturation/desaturation might have given it more punch. Good work though.', '2005-01-16 07:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110716, 136637, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice focuse here. I don''t suppose you got a wider angle of this one - that reflection is so crisp its a shame you can''t see the full mirror image of the bird. It might have been too symmetrical that way, but I get the feeling it would have worked really well. 6.</td>', 'Nice focuse here. I don''t suppose you got a wider angle of this one - that reflection is so crisp its a shame you can''t see the full mirror image of the bird. It might have been too symmetrical that way, but I get the feeling it would have worked really well. 6.', '2005-01-16 07:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110717, 132858, 6999, '<td valign="top">It''s a fine moment. I would reall really have taken the clone tool to the gazelles (?) behind the zebra however - they are absolutely a distraction, and i cannot see that they help the shot any, particularly being so partially visible.</td>', 'It''s a fine moment. I would reall really have taken the clone tool to the gazelles (?) behind the zebra however - they are absolutely a distraction, and i cannot see that they help the shot any, particularly being so partially visible.', '2005-01-16 07:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110718, 133848, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting here. The two white towers add a tonne of image. All but one of those birds though should probably be cloned out - they look more like dirty splotches on the screen that birds - the one with its wings extended is gorgeous though. Overall you''ve done a really great job with this. 7.</td>', 'Love the lighting here. The two white towers add a tonne of image. All but one of those birds though should probably be cloned out - they look more like dirty splotches on the screen that birds - the one with its wings extended is gorgeous though. Overall you''ve done a really great job with this. 7.', '2005-01-16 07:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110719, 133635, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very moody image, great composition, and that sky is just terrific for a shot like this. 8.</td>', 'Very moody image, great composition, and that sky is just terrific for a shot like this. 8.', '2005-01-16 07:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110720, 136679, 23561, '<td valign="top">Great model, very sexy. Love the thoughtful look. Only thing I would change is the crop at the top, I don''t like the head being cut off. Every thing else is excellent. 9</td>', 'Great model, very sexy. Love the thoughtful look. Only thing I would change is the crop at the top, I don''t like the head being cut off. Every thing else is excellent. 9', '2005-01-16 07:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110721, 132654, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - almost has a studio feel to the light. A little ( and I mean little - doesn''t have to be Heida-esque) burning around the top right and bottom left of frame might have helped pull the attention more solidly to the toad/frog - and that stick is kind of a shame - it really imposes itself on the composition. I''m not suggesting you could have done anything about it - nevertheless, it has that impact. Good shot</td>', 'Nicely done - almost has a studio feel to the light. A little ( and I mean little - doesn''t have to be Heida-esque) burning around the top right and bottom left of frame might have helped pull the attention more solidly to the toad/frog - and that stick is kind of a shame - it really imposes itself on the composition. I''m not suggesting you could have done anything about it - nevertheless, it has that impact. Good shot', '2005-01-16 07:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110723, 136770, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting, theres something very sexy about this image. I guess I just like my women a little dirty (pun fully intended I''m ashamed to say). Like the sepia here too. 8.</td>', 'Interesting, theres something very sexy about this image. I guess I just like my women a little dirty (pun fully intended I''m ashamed to say). Like the sepia here too. 8.', '2005-01-16 07:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110724, 132625, 23561, '<td valign="top">Very emotional and very well done.</td>', 'Very emotional and very well done.', '2005-01-16 07:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110726, 133785, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. This image makes me want to come back later when I''ve had a little more sleep just to sit, and look, and think about it. That''s enough to get you a ten. Hopefully I''ll come up with a more insightful comment when I''ve had that sleep :P.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. This image makes me want to come back later when I''ve had a little more sleep just to sit, and look, and think about it. That''s enough to get you a ten. Hopefully I''ll come up with a more insightful comment when I''ve had that sleep :P.', '2005-01-16 07:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110727, 132225, 6999, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken this quite a long way from the ''real'' with that sky. It works, compositionally, just fine; but my immediate feeling is that it might have been the more powerful for a more real sky. There is a clash of sentiments, with that very processed look and yet the candid obvious fun of the children - almost a sense of playing on the eve of disaster, perhaps? Though a lot of that comes from your title, I suppose: without which, it would be possible to see this as a depiction of terrror, those poses could be fear and flight as much as anything.</td>', 'You''ve taken this quite a long way from the ''real'' with that sky. It works, compositionally, just fine; but my immediate feeling is that it might have been the more powerful for a more real sky. There is a clash of sentiments, with that very processed look and yet the candid obvious fun of the children - almost a sense of playing on the eve of disaster, perhaps? Though a lot of that comes from your title, I suppose: without which, it would be possible to see this as a depiction of terrror, those poses could be fear and flight as much as anything.', '2005-01-16 07:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110728, 135127, 20608, '<td valign="top">Cropping the grass out at the bottom makes this a stronger image IMO. nice</td>', 'Cropping the grass out at the bottom makes this a stronger image IMO. nice', '2005-01-16 07:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110729, 132735, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well it''s a really pretty waterfall, but there isn''t really too much to separate this from any other shot I''ve seen of the niagra falls - You clearly can handle a camera, so don''t be afraid to get a little creative with you angle - rather than settling for straight on, centred tourist shots like this. <br/> <br/>Good Luck !!</td>', 'Well it''s a really pretty waterfall, but there isn''t really too much to separate this from any other shot I''ve seen of the niagra falls - You clearly can handle a camera, so don''t be afraid to get a little creative with you angle - rather than settling for straight on, centred tourist shots like this.  Good Luck !!', '2005-01-16 07:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110730, 136591, 23458, '<td valign="top">Incredibly cute animal, well captured. 7.</td>', 'Incredibly cute animal, well captured. 7.', '2005-01-16 07:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110731, 132774, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, they really seem to pop.</td>', 'I like the colors, they really seem to pop.', '2005-01-16 07:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110732, 133704, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong detail, sense of texture, lovely light, colours. Well composed too. i''m having a bit of a reaction against the over-processed at the moment, so this speaks to me all the more. Not wholly convinced of the compositional choices, if i were being harsh, which i usually am.</td>', 'Strong detail, sense of texture, lovely light, colours. Well composed too. i''m having a bit of a reaction against the over-processed at the moment, so this speaks to me all the more. Not wholly convinced of the compositional choices, if i were being harsh, which i usually am.', '2005-01-16 07:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110733, 132744, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression here - lighting is a little flat (her eyes in particular could be a little brighter), but focus is spot on. 6.</td>', 'Great facial expression here - lighting is a little flat (her eyes in particular could be a little brighter), but focus is spot on. 6.', '2005-01-16 07:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110734, 132114, 20608, '<td valign="top">gorgeous...</td>', 'gorgeous...', '2005-01-16 07:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110735, 136635, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great background, interesting pose, focus is a little soft, but certainly a good effort.</td>', 'Great background, interesting pose, focus is a little soft, but certainly a good effort.', '2005-01-16 07:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
