(1110737, 134782, 23561, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Postcard perfect. You may get points off from others (not me) for a centered composition. They tend to vote down for that here. 10</td>', 'Very nice shot. Postcard perfect. You may get points off from others (not me) for a centered composition. They tend to vote down for that here. 10', '2005-01-16 07:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
