(1110743, 135164, 23458, '<td valign="top">Is that a doll or something ??? Theres something not quite right about this shot - Don''t know whether its the lighting but it makes her look somewhat plasticky. Th focus is spot on though.</td>', 'Is that a doll or something ??? Theres something not quite right about this shot - Don''t know whether its the lighting but it makes her look somewhat plasticky. Th focus is spot on though.', '2005-01-16 07:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
