(1110773, 136660, 31036, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo with a heavy presence of emotion. Beautifully composed. 10</td>', 'Incredible photo with a heavy presence of emotion. Beautifully composed. 10', '2005-01-16 07:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110774, 136446, 23561, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, my honest first opinion was "I don''t like it", but after a minute or so it kind of rubs off. I do like is the way the flowers seem to jump out off the background (I guess that is the DOF), and the b&amp;w almost make the flowers look like there made out of metal. Like if you were to touch them they would be cold and hard instead of soft and flexible. Conflicting emotions kind of. I gave this an 8.</td>', 'Hmmm, my honest first opinion was "I don''t like it", but after a minute or so it kind of rubs off. I do like is the way the flowers seem to jump out off the background (I guess that is the DOF), and the b&w almost make the flowers look like there made out of metal. Like if you were to touch them they would be cold and hard instead of soft and flexible. Conflicting emotions kind of. I gave this an 8.', '2005-01-16 07:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
