(1110843, 133137, 23561, '<td valign="top">Hmm, what to say. Starting with the title - I need a man. Masturbation is OK, but sex is alway better with a partner. The photo, well I do like it more than the title. The composition is OK, but her left leg cuts off to the left. I may have looked better if it went out at the top corner. And the expression on the face of model seems bored or even like she is sleeping rather than enjoying herself IMO. Overall I gave this a 7.</td>', 'Hmm, what to say. Starting with the title - I need a man. Masturbation is OK, but sex is alway better with a partner. The photo, well I do like it more than the title. The composition is OK, but her left leg cuts off to the left. I may have looked better if it went out at the top corner. And the expression on the face of model seems bored or even like she is sleeping rather than enjoying herself IMO. Overall I gave this a 7.', '2005-01-16 08:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110844, 136757, 3032, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could have been pulled right out of an old sports magazine, simply wonderful, every element of the photo comes together. The cars, the way the driver is dressed, the competitor in the background, the curve of the corners, the motion blur, the tone, the exposure, perfect. 10!<br/>The only way you can see that this is not really old is the helmets. the one in the background with his fullface helmet and the main subject in the foreground with  "Arai" on it. If you''d have used the background driver and his helmet as the main subject it wouldn''t have had the same impact.<br/> <br/>My feeling says: Cooper?<br/></td>', 'This looks like it could have been pulled right out of an old sports magazine, simply wonderful, every element of the photo comes together. The cars, the way the driver is dressed, the competitor in the background, the curve of the corners, the motion blur, the tone, the exposure, perfect. 10!The only way you can see that this is not really old is the helmets. the one in the background with his fullface helmet and the main subject in the foreground with  "Arai" on it. If you''d have used the background driver and his helmet as the main subject it wouldn''t have had the same impact. My feeling says: Cooper?', '2005-01-16 08:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
