(1110922, 132795, 29477, '<td valign="top">great use of rule of thirds...the colours are wonderful...It seems that the focus is on the water and the lady and dog are a little off.  Still a very nice image.</td>', 'great use of rule of thirds...the colours are wonderful...It seems that the focus is on the water and the lady and dog are a little off.  Still a very nice image.', '2005-01-16 08:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
