(1110928, 132880, 31036, '<td valign="top">Heights scare me. Major props to you on that perspective</td>', 'Heights scare me. Major props to you on that perspective', '2005-01-16 08:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110930, 136424, 16739, '<td valign="top">great shot , i saved it and sent it to a polit friend of mine , he loved it as well</td>', 'great shot , i saved it and sent it to a polit friend of mine , he loved it as well', '2005-01-16 08:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110931, 132131, 29477, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and choice to go B&amp;W.  Would have preferred the focus on the legend as when I first looked at this image I was drawn to the microphone.</td>', 'Like the composition and choice to go B&W.  Would have preferred the focus on the legend as when I first looked at this image I was drawn to the microphone.', '2005-01-16 08:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110932, 133975, 31036, '<td valign="top">either on the front row or the stage</td>', 'either on the front row or the stage', '2005-01-16 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110933, 136718, 3032, '<td valign="top">This feels so Scandinavian. You know, as soon as I land and enter the new terminals on Arlanda airport at Stockholm I feel so restful and peaceful. Same thing happens at the airport in Kopenhagen and in many buildings in Sweden, Finland and Norway. This photo has the same effect. I love the idea, the light from the bowl, the soft quiet background and the clarity. Good photo, I had it marked as an 8, but am bumping it up to a 10.</td>', 'This feels so Scandinavian. You know, as soon as I land and enter the new terminals on Arlanda airport at Stockholm I feel so restful and peaceful. Same thing happens at the airport in Kopenhagen and in many buildings in Sweden, Finland and Norway. This photo has the same effect. I love the idea, the light from the bowl, the soft quiet background and the clarity. Good photo, I had it marked as an 8, but am bumping it up to a 10.', '2005-01-16 08:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110934, 133084, 16739, '<td valign="top">this is well shot , a lot of feeling here</td>', 'this is well shot , a lot of feeling here', '2005-01-16 08:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110935, 136602, 16739, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this photo before ,loveded  it then , love it now</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this photo before ,loveded  it then , love it now', '2005-01-16 08:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110936, 136757, 24642, '<td valign="top">I just love these machines.  Very good work, nice angle, good dof and it really captures speed.</td>', 'I just love these machines.  Very good work, nice angle, good dof and it really captures speed.', '2005-01-16 08:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110939, 136752, 16739, '<td valign="top">wow , this is awsome . should be top ten</td>', 'wow , this is awsome . should be top ten', '2005-01-16 08:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110940, 134214, 16739, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2005-01-16 08:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110941, 135155, 3032, '<td valign="top">I think that is a nice portrait, but the lighting is a bit even,  a lack of shadows to give dimension. The way the body stands out from the dark background is good, but at the head it becomes busy in the background and that distracts a bit.</td>', 'I think that is a nice portrait, but the lighting is a bit even,  a lack of shadows to give dimension. The way the body stands out from the dark background is good, but at the head it becomes busy in the background and that distracts a bit.', '2005-01-16 08:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110943, 135457, 16739, '<td valign="top">your nuts , great shot !!</td>', 'your nuts , great shot !!', '2005-01-16 08:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110944, 132853, 31036, '<td valign="top">The bass appears to be missing a portion of its head</td>', 'The bass appears to be missing a portion of its head', '2005-01-16 08:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110945, 132909, 22310, '<td valign="top">You have captured a wonderful moment, the soft side of of a not so soft looking man.  Well done.</td>', 'You have captured a wonderful moment, the soft side of of a not so soft looking man.  Well done.', '2005-01-16 08:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110946, 134600, 16739, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-01-16 09:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110947, 132632, 8624, '<td valign="top">a cute moment, captured. I would like to see more of what she is working on.</td>', 'a cute moment, captured. I would like to see more of what she is working on.', '2005-01-16 09:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110949, 136869, 32111, '<td valign="top">You''ve done well with the glimmering gold, but there are two things about this photo I think are wrong.  1) It could do with being rotated to make the verticals vertical. 2) The stonework looks too orangey - maybe you could selectively tweak the saturation so the gold stays as it is, but the stonework looks less saturated.</td>', 'You''ve done well with the glimmering gold, but there are two things about this photo I think are wrong.  1) It could do with being rotated to make the verticals vertical. 2) The stonework looks too orangey - maybe you could selectively tweak the saturation so the gold stays as it is, but the stonework looks less saturated.', '2005-01-16 09:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110950, 132167, 16739, '<td valign="top">this was a great shot last summer , and is still a great shot</td>', 'this was a great shot last summer , and is still a great shot', '2005-01-16 09:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110951, 132289, 31036, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice on the selective desat. It makes the photo very unique. Good job!</td>', 'Interesting choice on the selective desat. It makes the photo very unique. Good job!', '2005-01-16 09:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110952, 133876, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice macro shot with good clarity. I''d like to see it frame a little better though  -I don''t like that part of the eye gets cut off on the left.</td>', 'nice macro shot with good clarity. I''d like to see it frame a little better though  -I don''t like that part of the eye gets cut off on the left.', '2005-01-16 09:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110954, 134022, 22310, '<td valign="top">Just enough shadow detail to get the point across.  Good job.</td>', 'Just enough shadow detail to get the point across.  Good job.', '2005-01-16 09:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110955, 132303, 32111, '<td valign="top">A perfect silhouette.</td>', 'A perfect silhouette.', '2005-01-16 09:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110957, 136823, 16739, '<td valign="top">very good , I love these moodey shots</td>', 'very good , I love these moodey shots', '2005-01-16 09:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110958, 133397, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice fine detail in the sky.</td>', 'Nice fine detail in the sky.', '2005-01-16 09:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110959, 132880, 31708, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, nothing really stands out, it seem to not have a real focal point.</td>', 'This is a good shot, nothing really stands out, it seem to not have a real focal point.', '2005-01-16 09:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110960, 136174, 16739, '<td valign="top">you can almost see the dent in the helmet , very good</td>', 'you can almost see the dent in the helmet , very good', '2005-01-16 09:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110961, 134050, 3032, '<td valign="top">Looks like Nothern England or Ireland.<br/>I like the greens and the patterns of the fields, it''s always nice to see how some of the fields pop out in the sunlight and others remain in the shadows. The dartk tone in the sky works well to force the viewer downwards. The factory breaks the serenity of the landscape and gives the photo a good impact. Nice work!</td>', 'Looks like Nothern England or Ireland.I like the greens and the patterns of the fields, it''s always nice to see how some of the fields pop out in the sunlight and others remain in the shadows. The dartk tone in the sky works well to force the viewer downwards. The factory breaks the serenity of the landscape and gives the photo a good impact. Nice work!', '2005-01-16 09:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110962, 136675, 16739, '<td valign="top">great curves and color</td>', 'great curves and color', '2005-01-16 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110964, 133401, 31036, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-01-16 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110966, 135565, 3032, '<td valign="top">This may sound strange, but I like it how the technical quality (sharpness and exposure) of the photo fits the rough and filthy staircase. Sure, there are some blowouts on the armchairs, but I think that that is one of the charms of this photo. The colors are great. 8</td>', 'This may sound strange, but I like it how the technical quality (sharpness and exposure) of the photo fits the rough and filthy staircase. Sure, there are some blowouts on the armchairs, but I think that that is one of the charms of this photo. The colors are great. 8', '2005-01-16 09:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110972, 132400, 16739, '<td valign="top">wow , you must have frozed your ass off , any thing for a great capture</td>', 'wow , you must have frozed your ass off , any thing for a great capture', '2005-01-16 09:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110973, 135783, 32111, '<td valign="top">Great, I love it.</td>', 'Great, I love it.', '2005-01-16 09:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110976, 133195, 3032, '<td valign="top">Gallery worthy photo of Manhattan life. Just perfect.</td>', 'Gallery worthy photo of Manhattan life. Just perfect.', '2005-01-16 09:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110977, 136745, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but it seems flat because it is missing a stong white highlight.</td>', 'Nice photo but it seems flat because it is missing a stong white highlight.', '2005-01-16 09:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110980, 136626, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the bird''s face!  A little dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Great expression on the bird''s face!  A little dark on my monitor.', '2005-01-16 09:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110981, 136000, 31708, '<td valign="top">I like this because the water is not too blured out, and it stands alone in the picture. I''m might have tried cropping the bottom a little though. (Just an Opinion)</td>', 'I like this because the water is not too blured out, and it stands alone in the picture. I''m might have tried cropping the bottom a little though. (Just an Opinion)', '2005-01-16 09:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110982, 135980, 22310, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue gradient in the background!</td>', 'Beautiful blue gradient in the background!', '2005-01-16 09:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110983, 132996, 32111, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, less harsh light, and a slightly greater DoF would have improved this shot.</td>', 'In my opinion, less harsh light, and a slightly greater DoF would have improved this shot.', '2005-01-16 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110984, 136648, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great shape and color.  They eye adds a nice sense of humor.</td>', 'Great shape and color.  They eye adds a nice sense of humor.', '2005-01-16 09:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110985, 135240, 32111, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot.  The boats on the right add some interest.</td>', 'Spectacular shot.  The boats on the right add some interest.', '2005-01-16 09:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110986, 133037, 22310, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully saturated colors.</td>', 'Wonderfully saturated colors.', '2005-01-16 09:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110989, 136435, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, I like it how the background tells about the area he is playing in. Good how the sky gives space. Like the toning.</td>', 'Great perspective, I like it how the background tells about the area he is playing in. Good how the sky gives space. Like the toning.', '2005-01-16 09:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110990, 136160, 22310, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in this photo but the it looks a little washed out on my monitor.</td>', 'I like the texture in this photo but the it looks a little washed out on my monitor.', '2005-01-16 09:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110991, 136710, 31282, '<td valign="top">wooow it''s so beautiful....Gorgeous landscape and awsome light.If i could have voted I would have given it a 10 for sure!</td>', 'wooow it''s so beautiful....Gorgeous landscape and awsome light.If i could have voted I would have given it a 10 for sure!', '2005-01-16 09:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110992, 133726, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great texture in this one.  Very good use of black and white.</td>', 'Great texture in this one.  Very good use of black and white.', '2005-01-16 09:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110996, 134722, 22310, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the coast line and the reflection in the water.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the curve of the coast line and the reflection in the water.  Well done.', '2005-01-16 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110997, 136685, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful how the light strikes the mill with that dark background. The best quality of light as well. The only downside of that darkness is that it is hard to judge the size of the windmill. Is it really large, like the standard Dutch windmills, or is it really small or garden sized? The only things that tell are perhaps the windows.  Perhaps it sounds negative, but that is not how I mean it.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wonderful how the light strikes the mill with that dark background. The best quality of light as well. The only downside of that darkness is that it is hard to judge the size of the windmill. Is it really large, like the standard Dutch windmills, or is it really small or garden sized? The only things that tell are perhaps the windows.  Perhaps it sounds negative, but that is not how I mean it. ', '2005-01-16 09:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1110998, 136863, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.  I would have rated higher if the bird we a little more separated from the trees in the background.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.  I would have rated higher if the bird we a little more separated from the trees in the background.', '2005-01-16 09:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111000, 136417, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the stair stands out from the darkness byt the single lightsource. But overall the photo is too empty for me to give it a 10. Perhaps a bit closer in a square crop might work as well. 8</td>', 'I like it how the stair stands out from the darkness byt the single lightsource. But overall the photo is too empty for me to give it a 10. Perhaps a bit closer in a square crop might work as well. 8', '2005-01-16 09:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111002, 133598, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great use of natural light in this one.  The strong diagonal of the strings draws the eye to the beauty of her face.</td>', 'Great use of natural light in this one.  The strong diagonal of the strings draws the eye to the beauty of her face.', '2005-01-16 09:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111003, 136688, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great composition with those shadows. The snow gives a nice balanced texture to make the crosses stand out really well. Good photo.</td>', 'Great composition with those shadows. The snow gives a nice balanced texture to make the crosses stand out really well. Good photo.', '2005-01-16 09:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111004, 132367, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great humor.  Even the expression in the framed photo is perfect.</td>', 'Great humor.  Even the expression in the framed photo is perfect.', '2005-01-16 09:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111006, 132781, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow deail.</td>', 'Nice shadow deail.', '2005-01-16 09:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111008, 135405, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the lines in the sky work with the lines on the ground. The mood and light is very pleasing, but I feel it misses an element to make it realy stand out. I means something like a hunter in the field, a tree or a house, a tractor or something like that. I do like the fence at the bottom. 8</td>', 'I like it how the lines in the sky work with the lines on the ground. The mood and light is very pleasing, but I feel it misses an element to make it realy stand out. I means something like a hunter in the field, a tree or a house, a tractor or something like that. I do like the fence at the bottom. 8', '2005-01-16 09:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111009, 132990, 27562, '<td valign="top">Nice Title</td>', 'Nice Title', '2005-01-16 09:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111010, 136435, 22310, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture in this B&amp;W.  You have captured the ability of a young child to focus on the simple things in life.  Very well done 8.</td>', 'Beautiful texture in this B&W.  You have captured the ability of a young child to focus on the simple things in life.  Very well done 8.', '2005-01-16 09:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111011, 136847, 22310, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Beautiful contrast of saturated colors and the black and white of the the wood and sand.</td>', 'Wow!  Beautiful contrast of saturated colors and the black and white of the the wood and sand.', '2005-01-16 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111012, 133785, 3032, '<td valign="top">Everything in its own box. :)<br/>Works well, I like the idea and setup (not that it necessarily is setup).<br/>What I don''t like is the yellow line in the border, it pulls the eye out of the photo. The scene might also work better with more shadows from a lightsource at the side.</td>', 'Everything in its own box. :)Works well, I like the idea and setup (not that it necessarily is setup).What I don''t like is the yellow line in the border, it pulls the eye out of the photo. The scene might also work better with more shadows from a lightsource at the side.', '2005-01-16 09:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111013, 135164, 22310, '<td valign="top">The skin tones are quite nice in this one but the hair  looks very over shapened to my eye</td>', 'The skin tones are quite nice in this one but the hair  looks very over shapened to my eye', '2005-01-16 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111014, 132456, 22310, '<td valign="top">Nice rustic image but a little dark on my computer.</td>', 'Nice rustic image but a little dark on my computer.', '2005-01-16 09:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111016, 135927, 22310, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Makes me want to get on an airplane.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow!  Makes me want to get on an airplane.  Well done.', '2005-01-16 09:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111017, 136739, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait of this Rastafaria. I like it his pose, the light and the light in his eyes. The tone works really well. It is nice to see these telling objects in the background, like the portrait of Haile Selassie.</td>', 'Cool portrait of this Rastafaria. I like it his pose, the light and the light in his eyes. The tone works really well. It is nice to see these telling objects in the background, like the portrait of Haile Selassie.', '2005-01-16 09:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111019, 133544, 31511, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color, nice shot, with an endearing sunrise feel.</td>', 'Gorgeous color, nice shot, with an endearing sunrise feel.', '2005-01-16 09:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111021, 135034, 22310, '<td valign="top">Touching moment.  I like the beautiful soft skin.  I am not sure that the colored soother adds anything here however.</td>', 'Touching moment.  I like the beautiful soft skin.  I am not sure that the colored soother adds anything here however.', '2005-01-16 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111022, 136770, 3032, '<td valign="top">Her eyes are very powerful in this photo, she looks great despite the state of her hair and the dirt on her skin, that''s the power of her eyes.</td>', 'Her eyes are very powerful in this photo, she looks great despite the state of her hair and the dirt on her skin, that''s the power of her eyes.', '2005-01-16 09:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111024, 133203, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good abstraction and balance in composition.  I find the imbalance between the colours not working somehow.  The green is so incredibly bright.  -7</td>', 'Good abstraction and balance in composition.  I find the imbalance between the colours not working somehow.  The green is so incredibly bright.  -7', '2005-01-16 09:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111026, 133123, 22310, '<td valign="top">Very nice saturated colors.  The curve of the white fence is a nice touch.</td>', 'Very nice saturated colors.  The curve of the white fence is a nice touch.', '2005-01-16 09:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111028, 132349, 22310, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the background and the shadows.</td>', 'Great detail in the background and the shadows.', '2005-01-16 09:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111029, 134909, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very powerful.  I like the colour and the mist.  This is a photograph that can be cropped in numerous ways,  I would have chosen a square from the left.  -8</td>', 'Very powerful.  I like the colour and the mist.  This is a photograph that can be cropped in numerous ways,  I would have chosen a square from the left.  -8', '2005-01-16 09:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111031, 134028, 22310, '<td valign="top">You have captured the intensity of the moment.  Well done.</td>', 'You have captured the intensity of the moment.  Well done.', '2005-01-16 09:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111032, 134322, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it despite all the blur.<br/>The composition is pretty good with the pillars, the line of the square, the circle in the middle and her position in the scene. I like it how you captured the joy of dancing in the rain. Altough there is no rain visible, the reflections of the pillars tell that it is wet.<br/>I give it a 7,  sharpness and blurred raindrops might have made it a 9 or 10. But it can be hard to capture raindrops (slow shutter) and someone dancing (faster shutter). Yelling: "Hold that pose!" spoils the moment. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like it despite all the blur.The composition is pretty good with the pillars, the line of the square, the circle in the middle and her position in the scene. I like it how you captured the joy of dancing in the rain. Altough there is no rain visible, the reflections of the pillars tell that it is wet.I give it a 7,  sharpness and blurred raindrops might have made it a 9 or 10. But it can be hard to capture raindrops (slow shutter) and someone dancing (faster shutter). Yelling: "Hold that pose!" spoils the moment. :) ', '2005-01-16 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
