(1111357, 132782, 20774, '<td valign="top">Very nice the expersion on the babys face. Seems like his having a lot of fun.<br/>Great moment.</td>', 'Very nice the expersion on the babys face. Seems like his having a lot of fun.Great moment.', '2005-01-16 12:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111359, 135615, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a fantastic title.  I somehow dislike the hue, seems like a white balance problem between daylight and electric light.  Perhaps this would be better in b/w or sepia?  -7</td>', 'Good composition and a fantastic title.  I somehow dislike the hue, seems like a white balance problem between daylight and electric light.  Perhaps this would be better in b/w or sepia?  -7', '2005-01-16 12:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
