(1111361, 132782, 30490, '<td valign="top">I love the subject of this image, but it is too soft for my taste, I would like to see the colors more vibrant and the photo sharper, but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'I love the subject of this image, but it is too soft for my taste, I would like to see the colors more vibrant and the photo sharper, but that is just my opinion.', '2005-01-16 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
