(1111378, 133748, 20774, '<td valign="top">Great shot, i love these... Unfortunatly this year i haven''t had any lighting over here, just waiting for it to happen. <br/>I really like the contrast of the city with the lighting seems like the city is so small and the lighting huge... <br/>Great capture.</td>', 'Great shot, i love these... Unfortunatly this year i haven''t had any lighting over here, just waiting for it to happen. I really like the contrast of the city with the lighting seems like the city is so small and the lighting huge... Great capture.', '2005-01-16 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111379, 132247, 30490, '<td valign="top">wow, good image.  I wish the whole flower were more completely in focus though.</td>', 'wow, good image.  I wish the whole flower were more completely in focus though.', '2005-01-16 12:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111380, 134562, 8139, '<td valign="top">Just a little more light and saturation on the foreground green could improve this pic,  good composition.</td>', 'Just a little more light and saturation on the foreground green could improve this pic,  good composition.', '2005-01-16 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111381, 132874, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good portrait - has the feel of a stage shot - probably the backlight on the girl''s hair. Oddly, there is something about the composition that works, for me at least - I wonder if some of the more rigidly opinionated will dismiss it for infringing the ''rules''. The tonality works too - there does seem to be something old-fashioned about it, which re-inforces the idea of the stage.</td>', 'Good portrait - has the feel of a stage shot - probably the backlight on the girl''s hair. Oddly, there is something about the composition that works, for me at least - I wonder if some of the more rigidly opinionated will dismiss it for infringing the ''rules''. The tonality works too - there does seem to be something old-fashioned about it, which re-inforces the idea of the stage.', '2005-01-16 12:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111382, 136578, 30490, '<td valign="top">Compelling image.  A very good candid photo.  This woman obviously is enjoying working outside.</td>', 'Compelling image.  A very good candid photo.  This woman obviously is enjoying working outside.', '2005-01-16 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111383, 132182, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice lights and shadows.</td>', 'Nice lights and shadows.', '2005-01-16 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
