(1111408, 136626, 24454, '<td valign="top">Your focus on this is amazing.    What a beautiful picture!    Good luck!    I can''t see one way this could be improved.   10</td>', 'Your focus on this is amazing.    What a beautiful picture!    Good luck!    I can''t see one way this could be improved.   10', '2005-01-16 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
