(1111418, 133126, 20774, '<td valign="top">What a moment. Very beautiful. i Like the contrast of the colored pinguin and the young one. Very nice.</td>', 'What a moment. Very beautiful. i Like the contrast of the colored pinguin and the young one. Very nice.', '2005-01-16 12:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111420, 133744, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now, here''s one shot that I think had been edited beyond what it deserved. The building springs against it''s background in a manner that clashes with expectation - and it isn''t flash, because it applies equally to the further walls. It looks to me that there were probably some fascinating textures and contrasts to be had around the left-most window, but that''s lost in the lack of contrast there, and the eye anyway is pulled by the selective de-saturation. The sky has become weird, and looks almost painted in. It''s evident that a lot of work has gone into this - but I''m afriad i''m really not a fan of the results of that.</td>', 'Now, here''s one shot that I think had been edited beyond what it deserved. The building springs against it''s background in a manner that clashes with expectation - and it isn''t flash, because it applies equally to the further walls. It looks to me that there were probably some fascinating textures and contrasts to be had around the left-most window, but that''s lost in the lack of contrast there, and the eye anyway is pulled by the selective de-saturation. The sky has become weird, and looks almost painted in. It''s evident that a lot of work has gone into this - but I''m afriad i''m really not a fan of the results of that.', '2005-01-16 12:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111424, 136300, 25787, '<td valign="top">nice color to the background</td>', 'nice color to the background', '2005-01-16 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111425, 132536, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this one!    I love the blue/purple tones, and any picture with the moon in it always appeals to me.   The picture really draws me into it.  I think it''s perfect, so I gave it a 10.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this one!    I love the blue/purple tones, and any picture with the moon in it always appeals to me.   The picture really draws me into it.  I think it''s perfect, so I gave it a 10.  Good luck!', '2005-01-16 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
