(1111441, 132324, 20774, '<td valign="top">The choice of B&amp;W was a great one... Seems like everything is really peacful but as the storm approaches it seems that peace is not the best word to discribe it.<br/>Great photo.</td>', 'The choice of B&W was a great one... Seems like everything is really peacful but as the storm approaches it seems that peace is not the best word to discribe it.Great photo.', '2005-01-16 12:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
