(1111759, 136637, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice wildlife photo.  I will guess that (a) you get comments about the crop not including the bird''s head, and (b) it isn''t available on the original.  If true, I think you might have done better to crop just below the vegetation instead of incuding all BUT the head.  Just my thoughts, still love the picture.  ...8...</td>', 'Very nice wildlife photo.  I will guess that (a) you get comments about the crop not including the bird''s head, and (b) it isn''t available on the original.  If true, I think you might have done better to crop just below the vegetation instead of incuding all BUT the head.  Just my thoughts, still love the picture.  ...8...', '2005-01-16 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111762, 134607, 20662, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-01-16 14:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111764, 132958, 13688, '<td valign="top">Peaceful.  Would have liked the foreground pure black and a little less of the plain sky showing.  And not to be a pain, but maybe a tighter crop on the right so the sun is less centered.</td>', 'Peaceful.  Would have liked the foreground pure black and a little less of the plain sky showing.  And not to be a pain, but maybe a tighter crop on the right so the sun is less centered.', '2005-01-16 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111765, 136689, 20662, '<td valign="top">beautiful eyes</td>', 'beautiful eyes', '2005-01-16 14:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111767, 136685, 20662, '<td valign="top">ditch the frame. the lighting on the mills is fabulous</td>', 'ditch the frame. the lighting on the mills is fabulous', '2005-01-16 14:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111770, 134492, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I love the contrast, the composition, the focus, the framing ... just about everything except the jpeg artifacts which prevent it from being a 10 for me. This image is about 50K and could be as big as 150K. Suggest maxing the file size in the future to avoid the artifacts.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I love the contrast, the composition, the focus, the framing ... just about everything except the jpeg artifacts which prevent it from being a 10 for me. This image is about 50K and could be as big as 150K. Suggest maxing the file size in the future to avoid the artifacts.', '2005-01-16 14:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111771, 136160, 20662, '<td valign="top">what a look! great details and sharpness</td>', 'what a look! great details and sharpness', '2005-01-16 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111773, 134402, 20771, '<td valign="top">Wing tips and buds are out of focus. Needs more depth of field</td>', 'Wing tips and buds are out of focus. Needs more depth of field', '2005-01-16 14:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
