(1111944, 136038, 31606, '<td valign="top">Good close up shot</td>', 'Good close up shot', '2005-01-16 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111945, 133748, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow, amazing.  very nice</td>', 'wow, amazing.  very nice', '2005-01-16 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111946, 135497, 12809, '<td valign="top">I would suggest cropping off the left of this to get rid of the other face in the corner.  Also, if she had turned a bit more towards you I think that would have avoided the dark shadows on that side of her face.</td>', 'I would suggest cropping off the left of this to get rid of the other face in the corner.  Also, if she had turned a bit more towards you I think that would have avoided the dark shadows on that side of her face.', '2005-01-16 15:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111948, 132774, 21621, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, great detail and color.  Nice work.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, great detail and color.  Nice work.', '2005-01-16 15:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111951, 136417, 21621, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space, good work.</td>', 'I like the negative space, good work.', '2005-01-16 15:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111952, 132743, 12809, '<td valign="top">The lighting on her face (what I can see of it) seems alright but the background is too blown out.  I don''t like that her hair is hiding most of her face.  Hair in front of the face can be used well but I think there''s just too much in front on this one.</td>', 'The lighting on her face (what I can see of it) seems alright but the background is too blown out.  I don''t like that her hair is hiding most of her face.  Hair in front of the face can be used well but I think there''s just too much in front on this one.', '2005-01-16 15:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111958, 133252, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the composition which gives the boat a very isolated look, thereby adding to the interest.Nice mix of light and shade in the image also.<br/>Can`t help wondering how it would have looked in B/W.<br/>Good work</td>', 'I like the composition which gives the boat a very isolated look, thereby adding to the interest.Nice mix of light and shade in the image also.Can`t help wondering how it would have looked in B/W.Good work', '2005-01-16 15:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111959, 134050, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like how everything works together.  Only thing I would suggest changing/fixing is that the smoke stack and building seem to be saturated green as well.  I like the fields, haze, and smoke.  Nice image.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like how everything works together.  Only thing I would suggest changing/fixing is that the smoke stack and building seem to be saturated green as well.  I like the fields, haze, and smoke.  Nice image.', '2005-01-16 15:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111961, 136689, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on her eyes.  Good catchlights.  Nice pose and colors.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice focus on her eyes.  Good catchlights.  Nice pose and colors.  Well done.', '2005-01-16 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111962, 132082, 14603, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture..will be interested to find out the story behind this image.</td>', 'Fabulous capture..will be interested to find out the story behind this image.', '2005-01-16 15:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111965, 135164, 6104, '<td valign="top">post processing is way overdone :/</td>', 'post processing is way overdone :/', '2005-01-16 15:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111967, 132779, 31606, '<td valign="top">The background being out of focus works great here.</td>', 'The background being out of focus works great here.', '2005-01-16 15:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111971, 135249, 31606, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The only things is I wish the brush up close was not in the shot.</td>', 'Great shot!  The only things is I wish the brush up close was not in the shot.', '2005-01-16 15:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111972, 132540, 6104, '<td valign="top">cool! :) lensbaby?</td>', 'cool! :) lensbaby?', '2005-01-16 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111973, 133176, 21621, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot, with nice detail.  As far as the motion blur goes, I''m not sure if it was a well timed capture, or VERY skilled editing.  Either way you have done a fantastic job.</td>', 'This is a really great shot, with nice detail.  As far as the motion blur goes, I''m not sure if it was a well timed capture, or VERY skilled editing.  Either way you have done a fantastic job.', '2005-01-16 15:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111974, 134026, 31511, '<td valign="top">Colors gorgeous! They''re pushed, but not too far..</td>', 'Colors gorgeous! They''re pushed, but not too far..', '2005-01-16 15:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111977, 135651, 31606, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2005-01-16 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111979, 134571, 12809, '<td valign="top">Too many cluttered random things.  Lighting is a little harsh on the clogs but the thing in the top middle of the image is very dark and competes for attention.</td>', 'Too many cluttered random things.  Lighting is a little harsh on the clogs but the thing in the top middle of the image is very dark and competes for attention.', '2005-01-16 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
