(1111983, 134270, 14603, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous picture of a gorgeous town..(Brugge, if I`m not mistaken)?<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'A gorgeous picture of a gorgeous town..(Brugge, if I`m not mistaken)?Nicely done.', '2005-01-16 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111985, 136162, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like lighthouses.  Nice shot.  I''m wondering if cropping off the bright sky at the top would make this more powerful; more dramatic?</td>', 'I like lighthouses.  Nice shot.  I''m wondering if cropping off the bright sky at the top would make this more powerful; more dramatic?', '2005-01-16 15:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111986, 136823, 29477, '<td valign="top">Like the fact that you zoomed in on the guitar and hand movement rather than the entire person.  The image is a litte darker than I would like as some of the detail of the guitar is lost.  Very nice composition</td>', 'Like the fact that you zoomed in on the guitar and hand movement rather than the entire person.  The image is a litte darker than I would like as some of the detail of the guitar is lost.  Very nice composition', '2005-01-16 15:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111989, 132255, 4090, '<td valign="top">Wow ... Stunning photo - only one score 10 / 10 good luck</td>', 'Wow ... Stunning photo - only one score 10 / 10 good luck', '2005-01-16 15:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111990, 132654, 12809, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the frog for such shallow dof.</td>', 'Good focus on the frog for such shallow dof.', '2005-01-16 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111991, 136587, 31511, '<td valign="top">Love the blues.</td>', 'Love the blues.', '2005-01-16 15:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111993, 133126, 29477, '<td valign="top">National Geographic should be calling soon...great capture.  Border takes away from this image, but not from my score...good job.</td>', 'National Geographic should be calling soon...great capture.  Border takes away from this image, but not from my score...good job.', '2005-01-16 15:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111994, 134119, 3032, '<td valign="top">I saw in the forum that you only had one comment so far, so I was thinking: let me go and explain my score= 4, because the average was also sub-5 (I am not going to change it)<br/> <br/>The 4 was greatly influenced by the "not very interesting"-factor. Electricity poles and lines, a bit of foliage profile, a colored sky and a very bright spot. Don''t get me wrong, I see the relation of the color of the sky and the powerlines resulting in the idea "Electric Sky" and I think it was good idea. It is just that it doesn''t look very interesting to me. The photo is a subject an sich, the main subject in the photo is not very clear.<br/> <br/>The sky looks like as if the color was changed to these blue tones. It doesn''t look natural. The contrast between the bright spot and the dark foliage is also very big, to the point where the brightness gets annoying. Also because the bright spot is in the middle. Somehow I also get the feeling that the poles lean backwards, especially the one on the left side.<br/>I do like the off-centre positioning of the poles,  the profile of the foliage and how the lines lead trough the frame. But this photo is on my personal voting range for this challenge just not good enough. In a normal challenge it might have been between 5 and 6 depending on the subject of the challenge.<br/>Good luck in 2005. ;)<br/> <br/>Here I am again. Checked your porfolio. Take "Taste Wheat" for example. I would have given that one an 8.</td>', 'I saw in the forum that you only had one comment so far, so I was thinking: let me go and explain my score= 4, because the average was also sub-5 (I am not going to change it) The 4 was greatly influenced by the "not very interesting"-factor. Electricity poles and lines, a bit of foliage profile, a colored sky and a very bright spot. Don''t get me wrong, I see the relation of the color of the sky and the powerlines resulting in the idea "Electric Sky" and I think it was good idea. It is just that it doesn''t look very interesting to me. The photo is a subject an sich, the main subject in the photo is not very clear. The sky looks like as if the color was changed to these blue tones. It doesn''t look natural. The contrast between the bright spot and the dark foliage is also very big, to the point where the brightness gets annoying. Also because the bright spot is in the middle. Somehow I also get the feeling that the poles lean backwards, especially the one on the left side.I do like the off-centre positioning of the poles,  the profile of the foliage and how the lines lead trough the frame. But this photo is on my personal voting range for this challenge just not good enough. In a normal challenge it might have been between 5 and 6 depending on the subject of the challenge.Good luck in 2005. ;) Here I am again. Checked your porfolio. Take "Taste Wheat" for example. I would have given that one an 8.', '2005-01-16 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1111996, 134128, 4090, '<td valign="top">stunning sky and hill - but IMHO the foreground lets it down - look a bit flat 7 /10</td>', 'stunning sky and hill - but IMHO the foreground lets it down - look a bit flat 7 /10', '2005-01-16 16:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112002, 132468, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image is okay, day is  a little dull.  May have looked at a colour tweak to try and lighten the image.  May have cropped (or zoomed) in on the actual boats in the marina rather than have so much sky.</td>', 'Image is okay, day is  a little dull.  May have looked at a colour tweak to try and lighten the image.  May have cropped (or zoomed) in on the actual boats in the marina rather than have so much sky.', '2005-01-16 16:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112005, 136625, 31511, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!</td>', 'Hilarious!', '2005-01-16 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112006, 136630, 4090, '<td valign="top">Love it - very sharp - great colours 10</td>', 'Love it - very sharp - great colours 10', '2005-01-16 16:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112011, 136469, 29477, '<td valign="top">Okay image...I much prefer to see the eyes captured when zoomed in so tight.  Nice crisp focus.</td>', 'Okay image...I much prefer to see the eyes captured when zoomed in so tight.  Nice crisp focus.', '2005-01-16 16:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112012, 132190, 24841, '<td valign="top">I remember when this was accidentally unsubmitted at the last minute and you were so disappointed, glad you were able to submit this year!  Just lovely. 10!</td>', 'I remember when this was accidentally unsubmitted at the last minute and you were so disappointed, glad you were able to submit this year!  Just lovely. 10!', '2005-01-16 16:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112014, 135155, 24841, '<td valign="top">Very sexy and beautiful! 10!</td>', 'Very sexy and beautiful! 10!', '2005-01-16 16:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112016, 134009, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors.  The cropped off tree bothers me a little.  I also think that standing farther away and using the railing to lead to the girl would have had more impact, imo.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors.  The cropped off tree bothers me a little.  I also think that standing farther away and using the railing to lead to the girl would have had more impact, imo.', '2005-01-16 16:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112017, 136539, 10818, '<td valign="top">It really looks like a magazine ad.  Nice shot.</td>', 'It really looks like a magazine ad.  Nice shot.', '2005-01-16 16:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112018, 136307, 24841, '<td valign="top">So Sexy, yummy photo! 10!</td>', 'So Sexy, yummy photo! 10!', '2005-01-16 16:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112019, 133058, 4090, '<td valign="top">Amazing , Stunning - one score says it all 10 - good luck</td>', 'Amazing , Stunning - one score says it all 10 - good luck', '2005-01-16 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112021, 133598, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure - we can still see details in the girl''s black outfit against the black bg.  Nice dof.</td>', 'Very nice exposure - we can still see details in the girl''s black outfit against the black bg.  Nice dof.', '2005-01-16 16:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112022, 136675, 27605, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract.  Curious about what this is.... rock wall of a slot canyon (my guess), or a macro?  ....7....</td>', 'Beautiful abstract.  Curious about what this is.... rock wall of a slot canyon (my guess), or a macro?  ....7....', '2005-01-16 16:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112025, 133588, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great colors, the shallow dof creates a point to centre on in this field of repetitive subjects. That''s good, because without it it would be boring. 8</td>', 'Great colors, the shallow dof creates a point to centre on in this field of repetitive subjects. That''s good, because without it it would be boring. 8', '2005-01-16 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112028, 135599, 29477, '<td valign="top">Seems a little grainy and the horizon looks slightly tilted to the right.  Might have played a little bit with the colours to add some more anger to the sky and given the image some more punch.</td>', 'Seems a little grainy and the horizon looks slightly tilted to the right.  Might have played a little bit with the colours to add some more anger to the sky and given the image some more punch.', '2005-01-16 16:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112029, 133037, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic scene, beutiful photo.</td>', 'Fantastic scene, beutiful photo.', '2005-01-16 16:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112031, 132136, 27605, '<td valign="top">Awesome threatening clouds.  Personally would prefer a hint of more  detail in the silhouette of the house, still a captivating photo.  ....7....</td>', 'Awesome threatening clouds.  Personally would prefer a hint of more  detail in the silhouette of the house, still a captivating photo.  ....7....', '2005-01-16 16:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112032, 135805, 24841, '<td valign="top">WOW! 10!</td>', 'WOW! 10!', '2005-01-16 16:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112033, 132597, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice use of framing.  Not sure if I like, or dislike, the bright potted plant.  It sure does stand out in this somewhat mono-/duotone image.  I like the mix of railings too.</td>', 'Nice use of framing.  Not sure if I like, or dislike, the bright potted plant.  It sure does stand out in this somewhat mono-/duotone image.  I like the mix of railings too.', '2005-01-16 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112034, 136329, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured cadid moment.  Very crisp image, nicely focused and cropped.  B&amp;W adds some more depth and texture.  Good shot.</td>', 'Nicely captured cadid moment.  Very crisp image, nicely focused and cropped.  B&W adds some more depth and texture.  Good shot.', '2005-01-16 16:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112036, 136242, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  I like the dof.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  I like the dof.', '2005-01-16 16:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112037, 132310, 10818, '<td valign="top">Vrooom vrooom.  Great model shot.</td>', 'Vrooom vrooom.  Great model shot.', '2005-01-16 16:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112038, 136045, 31511, '<td valign="top">Where was this taken? Springtime snow is not a surprise hee in Vermont.</td>', 'Where was this taken? Springtime snow is not a surprise hee in Vermont.', '2005-01-16 16:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112039, 136581, 3032, '<td valign="top">As if I just have been in the rollercoaster with three triple loopings for half an hour after drinking a bottle of Vodka. :)<br/>I like the effect. Great colors, especially how the blues go over into the oranges. The top looks like its on fire. Nice work. 8</td>', 'As if I just have been in the rollercoaster with three triple loopings for half an hour after drinking a bottle of Vodka. :)I like the effect. Great colors, especially how the blues go over into the oranges. The top looks like its on fire. Nice work. 8', '2005-01-16 16:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112040, 136690, 27605, '<td valign="top">Good job of creating perspective by including the flag in the foreground to indicate the distance and scale.  Greens and blues look a bit washed out, but the blue of the sky is perfect.  Wish there had been some great clouds to add drama :0)</td>', 'Good job of creating perspective by including the flag in the foreground to indicate the distance and scale.  Greens and blues look a bit washed out, but the blue of the sky is perfect.  Wish there had been some great clouds to add drama :0)', '2005-01-16 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112041, 133598, 24841, '<td valign="top">Sexy and sophisticated!  10! Tones and lighting just lovely.</td>', 'Sexy and sophisticated!  10! Tones and lighting just lovely.', '2005-01-16 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112042, 136635, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cute little girl.  The sky is a little bright/blown out and the girl is somewhat shaddowed.  Maybe locking exposure on her face would have helped...although the sky would have suffered more...</td>', 'Cute little girl.  The sky is a little bright/blown out and the girl is somewhat shaddowed.  Maybe locking exposure on her face would have helped...although the sky would have suffered more...', '2005-01-16 16:09:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1112043, 136217, 10818, '<td valign="top">Looks like its out of a travel brochure.  Great shot.</td>', 'Looks like its out of a travel brochure.  Great shot.', '2005-01-16 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112045, 134492, 24841, '<td valign="top">Just so cool and clear! 10!</td>', 'Just so cool and clear! 10!', '2005-01-16 16:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112046, 135987, 27605, '<td valign="top">You know how good this is :0)  Personal taste:  I would prefer a contrastier background... too close to the skintones in my opinion.  ....9....</td>', 'You know how good this is :0)  Personal taste:  I would prefer a contrastier background... too close to the skintones in my opinion.  ....9....', '2005-01-16 16:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112047, 136870, 3032, '<td valign="top">Layers of patterns. Nice abstract, like it.<br/>Is the inside of the left to right things hollow or framed? Because the brighter parts on the inside enhances the effect.</td>', 'Layers of patterns. Nice abstract, like it.Is the inside of the left to right things hollow or framed? Because the brighter parts on the inside enhances the effect.', '2005-01-16 16:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112048, 135618, 24841, '<td valign="top">Love this piece of art! sooo cool 10!</td>', 'Love this piece of art! sooo cool 10!', '2005-01-16 16:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112049, 134077, 10818, '<td valign="top">I love swamps, great moss...terrific photo.</td>', 'I love swamps, great moss...terrific photo.', '2005-01-16 16:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112050, 135405, 12809, '<td valign="top">Seneca Lake?  Hector side???  I''m curious to find out who took this!  I thought this was Seneca Lake before even glancing up at the title.  This is where I live.<br/> <br/>I like the lighting on the vineyards but the heavily burned area on the left is weighing heavily (for me) and my eyes keep floating over there.  Still a nice image, though.</td>', 'Seneca Lake?  Hector side???  I''m curious to find out who took this!  I thought this was Seneca Lake before even glancing up at the title.  This is where I live. I like the lighting on the vineyards but the heavily burned area on the left is weighing heavily (for me) and my eyes keep floating over there.  Still a nice image, though.', '2005-01-16 16:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112051, 133673, 27605, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus on the tyke''s left eye!  Breaks the convention of having the focal point near dead center of the frame, but I think it works beautifully.  ....8....</td>', 'Perfect focus on the tyke''s left eye!  Breaks the convention of having the focal point near dead center of the frame, but I think it works beautifully.  ....8....', '2005-01-16 16:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112053, 136337, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Like your decision to desaturate.  Subjects seem a little grainy and find the dodging (I think that''s what you''ve done) at the bottom is somewhat distracting.  Focus cood be a bit better.  Still a great candid moment.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Like your decision to desaturate.  Subjects seem a little grainy and find the dodging (I think that''s what you''ve done) at the bottom is somewhat distracting.  Focus cood be a bit better.  Still a great candid moment.', '2005-01-16 16:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112055, 132463, 12809, '<td valign="top">A little too dark and busy for me with the blurred plants in the fg...</td>', 'A little too dark and busy for me with the blurred plants in the fg...', '2005-01-16 16:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112056, 135806, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great how the sun is in one line with the lightchamber of the lighthouse. The effect of the reflection on the water behind it works so well, it creates the depth that you need here. The people on the chairs give a scale of size. What I especially like is the gradation of the blue to the orange tones and than suddenly the dark water.</td>', 'Great how the sun is in one line with the lightchamber of the lighthouse. The effect of the reflection on the water behind it works so well, it creates the depth that you need here. The people on the chairs give a scale of size. What I especially like is the gradation of the blue to the orange tones and than suddenly the dark water.', '2005-01-16 16:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112057, 136740, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.   Could be a tad sharper, at least from where I''m sitting.  ....6....</td>', 'Very nice composition.   Could be a tad sharper, at least from where I''m sitting.  ....6....', '2005-01-16 16:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112058, 132757, 10818, '<td valign="top">I love and own a Harley.  But the badge does not do alot for me.  The entire bike would have scored higher much higher for me.</td>', 'I love and own a Harley.  But the badge does not do alot for me.  The entire bike would have scored higher much higher for me.', '2005-01-16 16:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112059, 136745, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting display.  I don''t usually seeing flowers ''upside down''.  I''m not sure if I like it.  I do like the lighting on the left and center flowers but the other could use some more light or dodging, I think.</td>', 'Interesting display.  I don''t usually seeing flowers ''upside down''.  I''m not sure if I like it.  I do like the lighting on the left and center flowers but the other could use some more light or dodging, I think.', '2005-01-16 16:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112061, 133748, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great capture and color, seems slightly tilted to the right.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great capture and color, seems slightly tilted to the right.  Nice work.', '2005-01-16 16:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112062, 134681, 3032, '<td valign="top">They look Spanish to me, kill ''em all!<br/>Nice work, spears vs spears. I like the expression on the faces and the chaos. Especially the right one has a funny look. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'They look Spanish to me, kill ''em all!Nice work, spears vs spears. I like the expression on the faces and the chaos. Especially the right one has a funny look. :) ', '2005-01-16 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112063, 134153, 12809, '<td valign="top">Wish this wasn''t quite so dark.  I like to see more details, esp. in the name on the awning and the people.</td>', 'Wish this wasn''t quite so dark.  I like to see more details, esp. in the name on the awning and the people.', '2005-01-16 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112064, 132264, 10818, '<td valign="top">What strange but interesting builings.  Very nice.</td>', 'What strange but interesting builings.  Very nice.', '2005-01-16 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112065, 135458, 27605, '<td valign="top">Wish he were green!  Good study.  ....7....</td>', 'Wish he were green!  Good study.  ....7....', '2005-01-16 16:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
