(1112092, 132225, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the real bright sky with the dark silhouettes.  A few things bother me about this though...   I find the yellow in the sky to be very distracting and the running child appears to have only one leg.  I think this would work great as a panoramic image.  I would crop out the yellow part of the sky and crop up from the bottom to leave just a sliver of land - that has more impact for me.  Nice catch though!</td>', 'I really like this - the real bright sky with the dark silhouettes.  A few things bother me about this though...   I find the yellow in the sky to be very distracting and the running child appears to have only one leg.  I think this would work great as a panoramic image.  I would crop out the yellow part of the sky and crop up from the bottom to leave just a sliver of land - that has more impact for me.  Nice catch though!', '2005-01-16 16:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112095, 136468, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  I like it except for the stray piece on the shoe on the right.</td>', 'Interesting image.  I like it except for the stray piece on the shoe on the right.', '2005-01-16 16:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112101, 135697, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting exercise but feel this could have been composed better.  The stump in the foreground is blownout; there''s an elbow entering in the top left corner; the cowboy''s rear and hat are cropped off and there are very bits and pieces of people popping up in the background.  Maybe a larger aperture would have reduced some of the distractions in the bg.</td>', 'Interesting exercise but feel this could have been composed better.  The stump in the foreground is blownout; there''s an elbow entering in the top left corner; the cowboy''s rear and hat are cropped off and there are very bits and pieces of people popping up in the background.  Maybe a larger aperture would have reduced some of the distractions in the bg.', '2005-01-16 16:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
