(1112405, 136849, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and lighting, the curtain on the left is a little distracting, but overall this is certainly a pleasant scene.</td>', 'I like the soft focus and lighting, the curtain on the left is a little distracting, but overall this is certainly a pleasant scene.', '2005-01-16 18:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112410, 132597, 10080, '<td valign="top">Best one I have seen. What wonderful framing and composition. The birds add a perfect touch. 10 and a ribbon!</td>', 'Best one I have seen. What wonderful framing and composition. The birds add a perfect touch. 10 and a ribbon!', '2005-01-16 18:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112412, 133526, 4517, '<td valign="top">It`s a great scene but photo has a bit of a blue cast to it especially in the sand and the horizon is running downhill right to left. But these could both be easily fixed under the advanced editing rules or even the basic rules. This photo has a lot of potential, not saying its bad just could be better.6</td>', 'It`s a great scene but photo has a bit of a blue cast to it especially in the sand and the horizon is running downhill right to left. But these could both be easily fixed under the advanced editing rules or even the basic rules. This photo has a lot of potential, not saying its bad just could be better.6', '2005-01-16 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112415, 136690, 4517, '<td valign="top">I don`t like the flag, i would rather see the wall closer.</td>', 'I don`t like the flag, i would rather see the wall closer.', '2005-01-16 18:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112417, 134639, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on this one, the B&amp;W works well. Maybe a little distracted by the reflections in the right eye, but short of being the grand master of the clone tool, there''s not much you can do about that :).</td>', 'Interesting perspective on this one, the B&W works well. Maybe a little distracted by the reflections in the right eye, but short of being the grand master of the clone tool, there''s not much you can do about that :).', '2005-01-16 18:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112418, 136863, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good capture i`m giving you a 7 had the bird been flying towards you it would have been 10.</td>', 'Good capture i`m giving you a 7 had the bird been flying towards you it would have been 10.', '2005-01-16 18:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112420, 134509, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colours, looks a little grainy or oversharpened, but a good effort nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice composition and colours, looks a little grainy or oversharpened, but a good effort nonetheless.', '2005-01-16 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112425, 132759, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, this one really does look like a deer in the headlights :). Certainly an endeering shot (sorry!).  I just find the composition is a little too straightoward, needs another element to add interest I feel. Still, it''s an attractive animal!</td>', 'Hehehe, this one really does look like a deer in the headlights :). Certainly an endeering shot (sorry!).  I just find the composition is a little too straightoward, needs another element to add interest I feel. Still, it''s an attractive animal!', '2005-01-16 18:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112426, 135208, 10080, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites!  Great work 10</td>', 'One of my favorites!  Great work 10', '2005-01-16 18:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112429, 133058, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the effect of the sunrays here, really is a great scene. I would crop about 2cms up from the bottom - to get rid of the distracting leaves in the left and focus more attention on the terrific foliage and lighting. 7.</td>', 'Love the effect of the sunrays here, really is a great scene. I would crop about 2cms up from the bottom - to get rid of the distracting leaves in the left and focus more attention on the terrific foliage and lighting. 7.', '2005-01-16 18:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112431, 135889, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  I would prefer a more square crop, though, with more bird and less branches.  Just my take.</td>', 'Very pretty!  I would prefer a more square crop, though, with more bird and less branches.  Just my take.', '2005-01-16 18:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112433, 135918, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good colour and sharpness on the bee. The composition doesn`t look right, the bee is bang in the middle and there is too much negetive space. However i can`t see how you could crop this without losing the flower in the top left or without making the photo square.6</td>', 'Good colour and sharpness on the bee. The composition doesn`t look right, the bee is bang in the middle and there is too much negetive space. However i can`t see how you could crop this without losing the flower in the top left or without making the photo square.6', '2005-01-16 18:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112434, 136395, 27605, '<td valign="top">Aren''t you on my FAVORITES list?  Typical excellence.   ...9...</td>', 'Aren''t you on my FAVORITES list?  Typical excellence.   ...9...', '2005-01-16 18:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112435, 136608, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great church, well exposed. Undoubtedly a pretty scene but I feel like the composition is lacking something -  it might be a little too up/down - A wider angle might have worked better.</td>', 'Great church, well exposed. Undoubtedly a pretty scene but I feel like the composition is lacking something -  it might be a little too up/down - A wider angle might have worked better.', '2005-01-16 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112436, 136838, 27605, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and exposure.  Seems just slightly tilted to the right.  ...7...</td>', 'Excellent composition and exposure.  Seems just slightly tilted to the right.  ...7...', '2005-01-16 18:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112437, 133401, 23458, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I love the mist and that tree is just terrific. 8</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I love the mist and that tree is just terrific. 8', '2005-01-16 18:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112439, 136114, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action.  In my opinion, you are a bit too far from the action, I would prefer a closer crop of either set of horses.</td>', 'Nice stop-action.  In my opinion, you are a bit too far from the action, I would prefer a closer crop of either set of horses.', '2005-01-16 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112440, 134242, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great colours here, not sure that the shallow DOF adds anything here - the out of focus areas seem a little messy. But it''s certainly a nice idea and the composition is solid. 6</td>', 'Great colours here, not sure that the shallow DOF adds anything here - the out of focus areas seem a little messy. But it''s certainly a nice idea and the composition is solid. 6', '2005-01-16 18:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112441, 136204, 4517, '<td valign="top">I love IR photos and this is a cracker. It`s got everything, great sky, trees and water everything i great IR shot should have. I have given 10`s to photos not as good as this so i`ll have to give you 10+ in my favorites.</td>', 'I love IR photos and this is a cracker. It`s got everything, great sky, trees and water everything i great IR shot should have. I have given 10`s to photos not as good as this so i`ll have to give you 10+ in my favorites.', '2005-01-16 18:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112444, 132167, 27605, '<td valign="top">Loads of interest in the candid shot, great  composition and colors.  This is one instance where the title really adds to the shot.  ...7...</td>', 'Loads of interest in the candid shot, great  composition and colors.  This is one instance where the title really adds to the shot.  ...7...', '2005-01-16 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112445, 135296, 4517, '<td valign="top">Not a happy picture and could be sharper but certainly tells a story.</td>', 'Not a happy picture and could be sharper but certainly tells a story.', '2005-01-16 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112447, 132167, 23458, '<td valign="top">You can''t not laugh at these guys. Focus seems a little soft on the glassblowers, but I think that might just be the resizing. This shot (thanks to its subjects and your skillful composition) has a lot of character.</td>', 'You can''t not laugh at these guys. Focus seems a little soft on the glassblowers, but I think that might just be the resizing. This shot (thanks to its subjects and your skillful composition) has a lot of character.', '2005-01-16 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112451, 132185, 8891, '<td valign="top">Hey David! Sure do like this...congrats again on your Grand Prize. It is a stunning abstract and I like the frame you added.   Good luck....10 from me!  RoB</td>', 'Hey David! Sure do like this...congrats again on your Grand Prize. It is a stunning abstract and I like the frame you added.   Good luck....10 from me!  RoB', '2005-01-16 18:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
