(1112471, 132193, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp focus...should have taken the dog collar off befor the image, give a more "wildlife" feel.  good shot.</td>', 'Nice crisp focus...should have taken the dog collar off befor the image, give a more "wildlife" feel.  good shot.', '2005-01-16 18:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
