(1112664, 136626, 6388, '<td valign="top">would have won the bokeh challenge...has a good shot at best of 04 too :)  well done.  nice and sharp, focus is where it belongs.  this is the first image i even looked at in the challenge, and i suspect i''m looking at one of the top images.</td>', 'would have won the bokeh challenge...has a good shot at best of 04 too :)  well done.  nice and sharp, focus is where it belongs.  this is the first image i even looked at in the challenge, and i suspect i''m looking at one of the top images.', '2005-01-16 20:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112667, 134153, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, and I like the sepia treatment.  I think a more square crop that included only the cafe (stopping on the left just outside of the lighted window, and on the right so as not to include the corner of the adjacent building) would have been even better.  ...6...</td>', 'Nice night shot, and I like the sepia treatment.  I think a more square crop that included only the cafe (stopping on the left just outside of the lighted window, and on the right so as not to include the corner of the adjacent building) would have been even better.  ...6...', '2005-01-16 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112670, 136688, 14603, '<td valign="top">Ahh now, this one I have in my favourites so I can skip straight to the score...9</td>', 'Ahh now, this one I have in my favourites so I can skip straight to the score...9', '2005-01-16 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112672, 136764, 18349, '<td valign="top">I think this photo shows a really interesting visual parallel between nature and human encroachment upon it.  I love the vibrant colors.  I might have preferred a deeper DOF, but it''s still unique and appealing.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I think this photo shows a really interesting visual parallel between nature and human encroachment upon it.  I love the vibrant colors.  I might have preferred a deeper DOF, but it''s still unique and appealing.  <8>', '2005-01-16 20:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112674, 135655, 27605, '<td valign="top">Composition is balanced, but the choice of the dead tree makes for a somewhat uninteresting subject in my opinion.</td>', 'Composition is balanced, but the choice of the dead tree makes for a somewhat uninteresting subject in my opinion.', '2005-01-16 20:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112676, 133415, 6388, '<td valign="top">lots of haloing around the finer details, which is usually an indication of oversharpening, either in-camera or after the fact in post processing.  <br/> <br/>That aside, i like that you left the reeds in the shot.  nice and deep DOF, and the burning of the clouds adds to the drama.  <br/> <br/>well done.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'lots of haloing around the finer details, which is usually an indication of oversharpening, either in-camera or after the fact in post processing.   That aside, i like that you left the reeds in the shot.  nice and deep DOF, and the burning of the clouds adds to the drama.   well done. P', '2005-01-16 20:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112678, 136478, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very impressive shot..unusual but effective</td>', 'Very impressive shot..unusual but effective', '2005-01-16 20:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112679, 136706, 27605, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  My favorite part of the composition is the contrast between the very BRIGHT white of the falls, blurred as they are with the slow shutter speed,  and the very dark water just above the crest of the falls.  Also like the "S" curve of the top of the falls.  ...8...</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  My favorite part of the composition is the contrast between the very BRIGHT white of the falls, blurred as they are with the slow shutter speed,  and the very dark water just above the crest of the falls.  Also like the "S" curve of the top of the falls.  ...8...', '2005-01-16 20:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112682, 135753, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, the B&amp;W works great.</td>', 'Excellent shot, the B&W works great.', '2005-01-16 20:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112684, 136871, 27605, '<td valign="top">What a hero!  Nice job using the selective colorization.  Right side of the face is a bit too bright IMO.    ....7....</td>', 'What a hero!  Nice job using the selective colorization.  Right side of the face is a bit too bright IMO.    ....7....', '2005-01-16 20:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
