(1112692, 135565, 14603, '<td valign="top">I remember seeing this in a thread and being very impressed with it.<br/>I really like the light and  the colour changes in the image.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'I remember seeing this in a thread and being very impressed with it.I really like the light and  the colour changes in the image.Good luck', '2005-01-16 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
