(1112900, 133142, 2764, '<td valign="top">Interesting texures ans lines.   I suppose they are interesting rocks as well.  The angle is odd and I think that will cost you points - photos with a slightly tilted horison also suffer.  If the viewer feels a little off balance, the phot feels umconfortable.  Your composition is also too straightforward.  putting the object of innterest slightly off center is more visually pleasing to humans - check out the DPC tutorial on the Rule of Thirds.</td>', 'Interesting texures ans lines.   I suppose they are interesting rocks as well.  The angle is odd and I think that will cost you points - photos with a slightly tilted horison also suffer.  If the viewer feels a little off balance, the phot feels umconfortable.  Your composition is also too straightforward.  putting the object of innterest slightly off center is more visually pleasing to humans - check out the DPC tutorial on the Rule of Thirds.', '2005-01-16 22:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
