(1113015, 135296, 17103, '<td valign="top">You caught a unique moment that I like very much.  I think the shot would have worked better from a technical standpoint had the foreground (the child) been much more sharply in focus and the background much more blurred, and it also seems to be a bit underexposed.  It might also work better in black and white.</td>', 'You caught a unique moment that I like very much.  I think the shot would have worked better from a technical standpoint had the foreground (the child) been much more sharply in focus and the background much more blurred, and it also seems to be a bit underexposed.  It might also work better in black and white.', '2005-01-16 22:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
