(1113064, 135618, 29477, '<td valign="top">Did you use Gothic Glow on this shot...almost looks surreal, like a painting.  Great colours and mystic feel.  Cropping seems a little tight on the left but still a nice image.</td>', 'Did you use Gothic Glow on this shot...almost looks surreal, like a painting.  Great colours and mystic feel.  Cropping seems a little tight on the left but still a nice image.', '2005-01-16 22:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113067, 132693, 27574, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one made me sit up in my chair.  I am not quite sure what to say, but WOW!!!!</td>', 'Wow, this one made me sit up in my chair.  I am not quite sure what to say, but WOW!!!!', '2005-01-16 22:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113074, 133176, 29477, '<td valign="top">WOW...Great title and result...The focus is bang on and your "bokeh" is perfect.  Curious to know how you captured this (i.e. actually in flight or smudge tool-lol).  Regardless,  one of my top images I''ve voted on so far.   Good Luck.</td>', 'WOW...Great title and result...The focus is bang on and your "bokeh" is perfect.  Curious to know how you captured this (i.e. actually in flight or smudge tool-lol).  Regardless,  one of my top images I''ve voted on so far.   Good Luck.', '2005-01-16 22:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113078, 136401, 27574, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice...Love the subdued colors and texture.  I can see this one making a wonderful print.</td>', 'Very, very nice...Love the subdued colors and texture.  I can see this one making a wonderful print.', '2005-01-16 22:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113081, 136769, 6600, '<td valign="top">Another WOW !  Can almost reach out and touch them.  GREAT Job!</td>', 'Another WOW !  Can almost reach out and touch them.  GREAT Job!', '2005-01-16 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113082, 134094, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Beautiful bird.  Very nice job!</td>', 'Great capture!  Beautiful bird.  Very nice job!', '2005-01-16 23:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113084, 136114, 29477, '<td valign="top">I love the ponies...Can''t wait for Woodbine to start up again in April...Plan on taking a lot of pictures there in 2005.  Great sports image that could be in the DRF.  Would have played with cropping to zoom in on the two leaders and "get closer to the action"</td>', 'I love the ponies...Can''t wait for Woodbine to start up again in April...Plan on taking a lot of pictures there in 2005.  Great sports image that could be in the DRF.  Would have played with cropping to zoom in on the two leaders and "get closer to the action"', '2005-01-16 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113087, 134714, 29477, '<td valign="top">Cute image, however focus seems slightly off which may negatively impact your score.  Nice innocent expression and use of natural light.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Cute image, however focus seems slightly off which may negatively impact your score.  Nice innocent expression and use of natural light.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-16 23:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113091, 136329, 17103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment!</td>', 'Beautiful moment!', '2005-01-16 23:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113094, 133688, 17103, '<td valign="top">lol!  I''d love to know what happened next.  It looks like the bird coming from behind is ready to pounce!  Great, unbelievable shot!</td>', 'lol!  I''d love to know what happened next.  It looks like the bird coming from behind is ready to pounce!  Great, unbelievable shot!', '2005-01-16 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113095, 132597, 13688, '<td valign="top">I aspire to one day have a style of my own as well.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'I aspire to one day have a style of my own as well.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2005-01-16 23:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113106, 134023, 24976, '<td valign="top">imo i think the faces are a bit dark for this type of photo, now it seems the focus of the picture is the brides white dress because that pops out from the black immediately, a slight  selective dodge in ps might help bring out the faces more.</td>', 'imo i think the faces are a bit dark for this type of photo, now it seems the focus of the picture is the brides white dress because that pops out from the black immediately, a slight  selective dodge in ps might help bring out the faces more.', '2005-01-16 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113112, 135575, 24976, '<td valign="top">deja vu outtake?  still very nice :-)</td>', 'deja vu outtake?  still very nice :-)', '2005-01-16 23:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113114, 133125, 12809, '<td valign="top">Beautiful area and nice action shot.  Colors of the mountains and sky are lovely.  The water seems saturated and almost unbelievable, though.</td>', 'Beautiful area and nice action shot.  Colors of the mountains and sky are lovely.  The water seems saturated and almost unbelievable, though.', '2005-01-16 23:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113117, 136710, 12809, '<td valign="top">Terrific colors in the water!</td>', 'Terrific colors in the water!', '2005-01-16 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113118, 132176, 24976, '<td valign="top">love the colors, especially the little patches of orange against the blue. well done.</td>', 'love the colors, especially the little patches of orange against the blue. well done.', '2005-01-16 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113119, 136428, 12809, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow dof.  I like how the image works in the glasses.  Nice job.</td>', 'Good use of shallow dof.  I like how the image works in the glasses.  Nice job.', '2005-01-16 23:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113122, 133154, 12809, '<td valign="top">Image is a little dark and the ladybug doesn''t stand out as well as it could.  The subject is a bit too centered for me.  Maybe a different angle or crop would work better.</td>', 'Image is a little dark and the ladybug doesn''t stand out as well as it could.  The subject is a bit too centered for me.  Maybe a different angle or crop would work better.', '2005-01-16 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113123, 132109, 12809, '<td valign="top">Ooh, different.  I like the lighting a lot.  The shapes are interesting too - lines, circles, and the oval-like vase.</td>', 'Ooh, different.  I like the lighting a lot.  The shapes are interesting too - lines, circles, and the oval-like vase.', '2005-01-16 23:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113126, 132945, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful shot.  Skin tone seems a little too yellow here.  Nice catchlights in the eyes and comp.</td>', 'Nice colorful shot.  Skin tone seems a little too yellow here.  Nice catchlights in the eyes and comp.', '2005-01-16 23:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113130, 132190, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  I like how it makes you wonder what is happening.  Wish there was a smidgen more room on the left by his heel.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  I like how it makes you wonder what is happening.  Wish there was a smidgen more room on the left by his heel.', '2005-01-16 23:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113134, 136239, 12809, '<td valign="top">Big beautiful eyes!  They are penetrating.  I like the comp. and tones.  Nice choice for sepia.</td>', 'Big beautiful eyes!  They are penetrating.  I like the comp. and tones.  Nice choice for sepia.', '2005-01-16 23:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113139, 136590, 11756, '<td valign="top">Ice image.  not sure about the composition though</td>', 'Ice image.  not sure about the composition though', '2005-01-16 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113140, 132996, 11756, '<td valign="top">would have benefited from greater depth of focus</td>', 'would have benefited from greater depth of focus', '2005-01-16 23:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113141, 136821, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think I remember seeing this recently...  I can''t remember who''s it is though.  I love this shot.  The reflection is so perfect.  Great looking barn.</td>', 'I think I remember seeing this recently...  I can''t remember who''s it is though.  I love this shot.  The reflection is so perfect.  Great looking barn.', '2005-01-16 23:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113143, 135651, 12809, '<td valign="top">The falls look beautiful with the lighting but the black areas are too dark and heavy for me.  Wish there were more city lights or details visible.</td>', 'The falls look beautiful with the lighting but the black areas are too dark and heavy for me.  Wish there were more city lights or details visible.', '2005-01-16 23:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113145, 134205, 12809, '<td valign="top">I can never catch sunrise light this!  Very nice, strong rays.  I like the colors.</td>', 'I can never catch sunrise light this!  Very nice, strong rays.  I like the colors.', '2005-01-16 23:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113148, 134205, 11756, '<td valign="top">wow that''s neat.  woulda cropped a little of the bottom and a tiny bit on the right</td>', 'wow that''s neat.  woulda cropped a little of the bottom and a tiny bit on the right', '2005-01-16 23:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113149, 133688, 12809, '<td valign="top">What a funny capture!  Good timing and focus!</td>', 'What a funny capture!  Good timing and focus!', '2005-01-16 23:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113151, 136697, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great reflections and patterns.</td>', 'Great reflections and patterns.', '2005-01-16 23:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113154, 135047, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh. lol  The focus is on the squirrels tail and I  think it should be on the head or the entire squirrel...imo.</td>', 'I like the bokeh. lol  The focus is on the squirrels tail and I  think it should be on the head or the entire squirrel...imo.', '2005-01-16 23:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113157, 133142, 12809, '<td valign="top">I actually like the brown, slate-like rock in the bg.  It would make a nice, simple image full-frame.  This rock that is the subject isn''t very interesting to me and it''s too centered, imo.</td>', 'I actually like the brown, slate-like rock in the bg.  It would make a nice, simple image full-frame.  This rock that is the subject isn''t very interesting to me and it''s too centered, imo.', '2005-01-16 23:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113158, 136675, 26151, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Good colors and tecture.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Good colors and tecture.', '2005-01-16 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113164, 136307, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very intimate shot.  I love the lighting and tones!</td>', 'Very intimate shot.  I love the lighting and tones!', '2005-01-16 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113165, 136816, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice comp.  I''d prefer a less orange sepia though.</td>', 'Nice comp.  I''d prefer a less orange sepia though.', '2005-01-16 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113168, 133716, 12809, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on the building.  Wish the windmill wasn''t cropped off on top.</td>', 'I love the lighting on the building.  Wish the windmill wasn''t cropped off on top.', '2005-01-16 23:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113169, 133544, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph.  A few minutes earlier or later and you might have lost the magic<br/></td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph.  A few minutes earlier or later and you might have lost the magic', '2005-01-16 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113170, 132622, 12809, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the post-processing on this one.</td>', 'I don''t care for the post-processing on this one.', '2005-01-16 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113172, 132858, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful timing and such power, 10</td>', 'Wonderful timing and such power, 10', '2005-01-16 23:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113175, 134160, 12809, '<td valign="top">Lighting is harsh.  Interesting bike though.  I wonder if this would work better in b&amp;w?  The border is wide for this image.  A nice thin, simple border is best, imo.</td>', 'Lighting is harsh.  Interesting bike though.  I wonder if this would work better in b&w?  The border is wide for this image.  A nice thin, simple border is best, imo.', '2005-01-16 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113176, 132945, 1024, '<td valign="top">There are very few portraits in this challenge that I voted high.  This is the one exception.</td>', 'There are very few portraits in this challenge that I voted high.  This is the one exception.', '2005-01-16 23:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113177, 136597, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice architecture.  I believe this could use more contrast.</td>', 'Nice architecture.  I believe this could use more contrast.', '2005-01-16 23:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113179, 136793, 12809, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the artificial colors.  The blown out sky is also distracting to me.</td>', 'I don''t care for the artificial colors.  The blown out sky is also distracting to me.', '2005-01-16 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113180, 136593, 1024, '<td valign="top">great silloutte.  Personally I would have cloned out the tiny bit of grass hanging from his mouth but that is only my personal opinion.  Still ranks a 10.</td>', 'great silloutte.  Personally I would have cloned out the tiny bit of grass hanging from his mouth but that is only my personal opinion.  Still ranks a 10.', '2005-01-16 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113183, 135927, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like how you used size and placement in this.  The pattern of the clouds works well with the texture in the mountains.  Looks like the snowy areas could be a little more white.  They seem a tad gray on my monitor.  Maybe it''s the shadows from the clouds...?</td>', 'Very nice.  I like how you used size and placement in this.  The pattern of the clouds works well with the texture in the mountains.  Looks like the snowy areas could be a little more white.  They seem a tad gray on my monitor.  Maybe it''s the shadows from the clouds...?', '2005-01-16 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113184, 133230, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best entries in this challenge,</td>', 'This is one of the best entries in this challenge,', '2005-01-16 23:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113187, 136119, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cute little light.  This looks like it could use a slight CCW rotation to straighten it up.</td>', 'Cute little light.  This looks like it could use a slight CCW rotation to straighten it up.', '2005-01-16 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113189, 136551, 1024, '<td valign="top">John, this is one of my favorites images in this challenge.  Regardless of what other prople might say, Black and White works wonderfully to draw  the eye to the young ladys face, as do the stripes on the flag.</td>', 'John, this is one of my favorites images in this challenge.  Regardless of what other prople might say, Black and White works wonderfully to draw  the eye to the young ladys face, as do the stripes on the flag.', '2005-01-16 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113192, 132303, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a little detail in the man.  I like the angle of the roof(?) and the contrast between the black and gray areas, though.</td>', 'I''d like to see a little detail in the man.  I like the angle of the roof(?) and the contrast between the black and gray areas, though.', '2005-01-16 23:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113194, 133203, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this photo,  It is very sharp, the texture in the leaves is wonderful, the lighting is perfect. great job</td>', 'I love everything about this photo,  It is very sharp, the texture in the leaves is wonderful, the lighting is perfect. great job', '2005-01-16 23:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113195, 136581, 12809, '<td valign="top">So cool.  I love this.  It''s abstract and the orange and blue compliment each other.  Would love to know what this was.</td>', 'So cool.  I love this.  It''s abstract and the orange and blue compliment each other.  Would love to know what this was.', '2005-01-16 23:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113198, 136679, 1024, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOOT!!  The photo is not bad either (my best to your model though)</td>', 'All I can say is WOOT!!  The photo is not bad either (my best to your model though)', '2005-01-16 23:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113206, 132735, 12809, '<td valign="top">The falls look good.  Nice veiling.  The moon looks worked on...it looks like two different tones, it''s funny shaped, and there''s a block of color/blue on the lower left of it...<br/> <br/>Edit:  Thanks for explaining that that is a balloon and not a manipulated moon. :-)  For a split second I thought it could possibly be a balloon...but I don''t ever remember seeing one and well, I still thought it was a moon...   So, I''m sorry about that!  Thanks for clarifying.</td>', 'The falls look good.  Nice veiling.  The moon looks worked on...it looks like two different tones, it''s funny shaped, and there''s a block of color/blue on the lower left of it... Edit:  Thanks for explaining that that is a balloon and not a manipulated moon. :-)  For a split second I thought it could possibly be a balloon...but I don''t ever remember seeing one and well, I still thought it was a moon...   So, I''m sorry about that!  Thanks for clarifying.', '2005-01-17 00:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113275, 132625, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective color.</td>', 'Nice use of selective color.', '2005-01-17 00:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113278, 136602, 12809, '<td valign="top">The fencing is distracting.  A shorter dof with focus on the animal would have worked better, imo.</td>', 'The fencing is distracting.  A shorter dof with focus on the animal would have worked better, imo.', '2005-01-17 00:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113286, 135137, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice textures but maybe a little too much contrast?</td>', 'Nice textures but maybe a little too much contrast?', '2005-01-17 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113289, 136345, 12809, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene but the highlights on the water distract.</td>', 'Pretty scene but the highlights on the water distract.', '2005-01-17 00:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113291, 136637, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the bird.  Including the entire reflection would have made this a stronger image, imo.</td>', 'Nice focus on the bird.  Including the entire reflection would have made this a stronger image, imo.', '2005-01-17 00:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113295, 135249, 12809, '<td valign="top">Please use the full 640 pixels given so we can see the details of the image...  People will deduct points if the image is too small.</td>', 'Please use the full 640 pixels given so we can see the details of the image...  People will deduct points if the image is too small.', '2005-01-17 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113302, 135819, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer the standing corn stalks not be in the image.  They distract.</td>', 'I''d prefer the standing corn stalks not be in the image.  They distract.', '2005-01-17 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113308, 136395, 12809, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  Nice focus and catchlights in the eyes.    Maybe clone out the mother''s nipple since it''s only partially in the shot.</td>', 'Adorable.  Nice focus and catchlights in the eyes.    Maybe clone out the mother''s nipple since it''s only partially in the shot.', '2005-01-17 00:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113315, 136033, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks like there was work done onthe moon - the edges are jagged.  I like the crashing wave against the light.</td>', 'Looks like there was work done onthe moon - the edges are jagged.  I like the crashing wave against the light.', '2005-01-17 00:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113319, 133926, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the gradient of colors.</td>', 'I like the gradient of colors.', '2005-01-17 00:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113325, 134229, 12809, '<td valign="top">This would be a good shot to use selective colors on.</td>', 'This would be a good shot to use selective colors on.', '2005-01-17 00:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113327, 135207, 12809, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  I''d like to see more detail.</td>', 'Too dark.  I''d like to see more detail.', '2005-01-17 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113365, 134993, 31642, '<td valign="top">I will give you 8 if this picture is sharp.</td>', 'I will give you 8 if this picture is sharp.', '2005-01-17 00:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113387, 132538, 31642, '<td valign="top">If the boat in the middle does not merge with shadow behind, it will be perfect one and I wii give you 9.</td>', 'If the boat in the middle does not merge with shadow behind, it will be perfect one and I wii give you 9.', '2005-01-17 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1113400, 134937, 31642, '<td valign="top">For this picture, I believe that there is too much flower at the bottom. If you crop it out, this picture will stand out.</td>', 'For this picture, I believe that there is too much flower at the bottom. If you crop it out, this picture will stand out.', '2005-01-17 01:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113406, 132795, 31642, '<td valign="top">It will be a good picture if the sun does not burn out.</td>', 'It will be a good picture if the sun does not burn out.', '2005-01-17 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113457, 132625, 15511, '<td valign="top">Never alone...</td>', 'Never alone...', '2005-01-17 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113490, 136307, 6388, '<td valign="top">Love the softness of this.  Not just from a technical perspective, but the <i>softness</i> of it.  intimate.  personal.  something like that.  perfectly lit and composed.   Outstanding PS treatment as well; beautifully layered.  Must be a pretty passionate eye behind that camera to create a moment like this.</td>', 'Love the softness of this.  Not just from a technical perspective, but the softness of it.  intimate.  personal.  something like that.  perfectly lit and composed.   Outstanding PS treatment as well; beautifully layered.  Must be a pretty passionate eye behind that camera to create a moment like this.', '2005-01-17 02:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113492, 132349, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really great scene, Like the contrast between the vivid foreground and the hazy background. I think this would also make a really great black and white.</td>', 'Really great scene, Like the contrast between the vivid foreground and the hazy background. I think this would also make a really great black and white.', '2005-01-17 02:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113495, 134410, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice capture here. Good crisp focus. You have done a pretty good job photographing what is clearly one of the biggest DPC cliches. As a personal preference I think this might have been better with a bit more negative space to emphaises the riders flight. Doesn''t quite wow me (probably because of the commanality of this type of image on dpc) but you clearly know how to handle a camera! 7.</td>', 'Nice capture here. Good crisp focus. You have done a pretty good job photographing what is clearly one of the biggest DPC cliches. As a personal preference I think this might have been better with a bit more negative space to emphaises the riders flight. Doesn''t quite wow me (probably because of the commanality of this type of image on dpc) but you clearly know how to handle a camera! 7.', '2005-01-17 02:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113496, 135655, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good scene  - great tones, the black and white works well. The sky is a little noisy and the background at the bottom is a little busy, I''d like to see the tree isolated a bit better. But overall a good job on this one.</td>', 'Good scene  - great tones, the black and white works well. The sky is a little noisy and the background at the bottom is a little busy, I''d like to see the tree isolated a bit better. But overall a good job on this one.', '2005-01-17 02:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113497, 135599, 23458, '<td valign="top">That sky is simply wonderful. It''s a shame the foreground does''nt hold the same interest. Additionally the horizon appears a little tilted. I really like the subdued colours here. Good capture. 7</td>', 'That sky is simply wonderful. It''s a shame the foreground does''nt hold the same interest. Additionally the horizon appears a little tilted. I really like the subdued colours here. Good capture. 7', '2005-01-17 02:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113499, 133397, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really strong silhouette here. That sky is just brilliant. I think this would work better with a little less foreground - there is just a fraction too much black for my taste. 8</td>', 'Really strong silhouette here. That sky is just brilliant. I think this would work better with a little less foreground - there is just a fraction too much black for my taste. 8', '2005-01-17 02:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113500, 136114, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the panoramic crop here, the image itself could use a bit more contrast or something. Might also have worked better if you had just focused closely in on the three horses on the left hand side - those three together really hold my interst, and would be really dramatic if isolated.</td>', 'I like the panoramic crop here, the image itself could use a bit more contrast or something. Might also have worked better if you had just focused closely in on the three horses on the left hand side - those three together really hold my interst, and would be really dramatic if isolated.', '2005-01-17 02:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113502, 136794, 23458, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. BW works well, though the focus seems slightly off.</td>', 'Cute picture. BW works well, though the focus seems slightly off.', '2005-01-17 02:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113503, 132858, 31642, '<td valign="top">The picture will stand out if you crop the top part a little part.</td>', 'The picture will stand out if you crop the top part a little part.', '2005-01-17 02:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113504, 135457, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice neat clear focus on this vertigo image. Were you afraid of hitting the camera (on the curb)?</td>', 'Nice neat clear focus on this vertigo image. Were you afraid of hitting the camera (on the curb)?', '2005-01-17 02:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113505, 133652, 23458, '<td valign="top">NIce angle - like the hue shift here. I would like a slightly deeper DOF here - just a little bit more of the eyelashes in focus would work wonders.</td>', 'NIce angle - like the hue shift here. I would like a slightly deeper DOF here - just a little bit more of the eyelashes in focus would work wonders.', '2005-01-17 02:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113507, 136833, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool interlude of reflections and reality. Focus on the face doesn''t seem that sharp.</td>', 'Cool interlude of reflections and reality. Focus on the face doesn''t seem that sharp.', '2005-01-17 02:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113509, 136775, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s one of the coolest skies I''ve ever seen. Perhaps a little too much dark down the bottom of the shot - might have cropped it out if I were you. Otherwise, once again, terrific sky. 7.</td>', 'Wow, that''s one of the coolest skies I''ve ever seen. Perhaps a little too much dark down the bottom of the shot - might have cropped it out if I were you. Otherwise, once again, terrific sky. 7.', '2005-01-17 02:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113510, 133111, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a dark image, in two ways. Nice capture of emotion and style of living conditions.</td>', 'Wow this is a dark image, in two ways. Nice capture of emotion and style of living conditions.', '2005-01-17 02:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113511, 133209, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve captured 3 leaves (number that appeals well). Cool reflection. The leaves seems a bit bright to me.</td>', 'I like how you''ve captured 3 leaves (number that appeals well). Cool reflection. The leaves seems a bit bright to me.', '2005-01-17 02:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113512, 136014, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good subject here, but the frame just appears a little messy and the sky is a bit overexposed. Definately worth re-shooting here. I''d also try it in black and white - I think this subject lends itself really well to a monochrome treatment.</td>', 'Good subject here, but the frame just appears a little messy and the sky is a bit overexposed. Definately worth re-shooting here. I''d also try it in black and white - I think this subject lends itself really well to a monochrome treatment.', '2005-01-17 02:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113513, 135811, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but doesn''t seem to have alot of punch to it.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but doesn''t seem to have alot of punch to it.', '2005-01-17 02:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113514, 132693, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus on this macro. Cool angle you have captured here.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus on this macro. Cool angle you have captured here.', '2005-01-17 02:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113515, 136757, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice nostalgic action shot, I like the movement you captured.</td>', 'Nice nostalgic action shot, I like the movement you captured.', '2005-01-17 02:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113516, 132365, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wonderful flower here - perhaps a tighter crop around the bud ? Love the colours, and the focus is spot on.</td>', 'Wonderful flower here - perhaps a tighter crop around the bud ? Love the colours, and the focus is spot on.', '2005-01-17 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113519, 134899, 23458, '<td valign="top">Certainly is soft, and certainly is pretty. As far as flower shots go (admittedly not my favourite genre) this is a very solid one.</td>', 'Certainly is soft, and certainly is pretty. As far as flower shots go (admittedly not my favourite genre) this is a very solid one.', '2005-01-17 02:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113520, 132463, 9668, '<td valign="top">Saunter: A leisurely walk or stroll.<br/> <br/>Well captured, lovely quietness in this shot.</td>', 'Saunter: A leisurely walk or stroll. Well captured, lovely quietness in this shot.', '2005-01-17 02:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113523, 136045, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, thats a solid snowing. At least for spring!</td>', 'Hehehe, thats a solid snowing. At least for spring!', '2005-01-17 02:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113525, 133726, 9668, '<td valign="top">You''ve gotten quite close to this seagull, I know how hard that can be (or you have an excellent telephoto). I like how you''ve captured the wave roaring in behind.</td>', 'You''ve gotten quite close to this seagull, I know how hard that can be (or you have an excellent telephoto). I like how you''ve captured the wave roaring in behind.', '2005-01-17 02:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113526, 136847, 26756, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of shots like this, but this is one of the coolest.  Seems to be a bit of wide angle bending but that''s okay.  Typically shots like this have some really blown out areas, which even though they appear here too, you managed to control them well.  Great colors.</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of shots like this, but this is one of the coolest.  Seems to be a bit of wide angle bending but that''s okay.  Typically shots like this have some really blown out areas, which even though they appear here too, you managed to control them well.  Great colors.', '2005-01-17 02:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113527, 133126, 23458, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Absolutely fantastic. I would say this is a lucky shot - lucky to be there, lucky to see this. But I''m a firm believer that you make your own luck (plus this shot is technically perfect). Perhaps my favourite thing about this image is the way a fully grown penguin serves as the backdrop for the parental penguin, while the brown babies provide the background for the baby. That division is highly successful in my book. A well deserved 10. I''ll eat my hat if this doesn''t end up in the 7s somewhere!.</td>', 'Fantastic. Absolutely fantastic. I would say this is a lucky shot - lucky to be there, lucky to see this. But I''m a firm believer that you make your own luck (plus this shot is technically perfect). Perhaps my favourite thing about this image is the way a fully grown penguin serves as the backdrop for the parental penguin, while the brown babies provide the background for the baby. That division is highly successful in my book. A well deserved 10. I''ll eat my hat if this doesn''t end up in the 7s somewhere!.', '2005-01-17 02:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113528, 136114, 9668, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what your shooting conditions were, but I think it would have been cooler to have a little closer veiw (like of just the three horses in the back). But I do like the motion of the moment you''ve captured.</td>', 'I don''t know what your shooting conditions were, but I think it would have been cooler to have a little closer veiw (like of just the three horses in the back). But I do like the motion of the moment you''ve captured.', '2005-01-17 02:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113529, 135275, 26756, '<td valign="top">One of the only cow pictures I''ve seen that I thought was very good.  Somehow the crop on the left cow either makes me want to have it''s right eye included, or to have that cow missing altogether, but the main subject is strong enough that it''s just a minor criticism.  Great color, dof and setting for this photo.</td>', 'One of the only cow pictures I''ve seen that I thought was very good.  Somehow the crop on the left cow either makes me want to have it''s right eye included, or to have that cow missing altogether, but the main subject is strong enough that it''s just a minor criticism.  Great color, dof and setting for this photo.', '2005-01-17 02:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113530, 134025, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really solid abstract. I like the grain and the shadows are terrific. Good job. 7 (Though if you cropped out about an inch at the top this would become a little more powerful (and get you an eight from me).</td>', 'Really solid abstract. I like the grain and the shadows are terrific. Good job. 7 (Though if you cropped out about an inch at the top this would become a little more powerful (and get you an eight from me).', '2005-01-17 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113533, 136117, 9668, '<td valign="top">Serenity - a disposition free from stress or emotion.<br/> <br/>I think that you''ve created that sense here, lovely forest shot. Too bad about some of the bright spots in the background.</td>', 'Serenity - a disposition free from stress or emotion. I think that you''ve created that sense here, lovely forest shot. Too bad about some of the bright spots in the background.', '2005-01-17 02:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113534, 133232, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasant image, but seems to lack that extra something to make it jump out at you. I think I might try a couple of shots of the canon a bit cloer in, so that all you have as a background is the blurred wall.</td>', 'This is a pleasant image, but seems to lack that extra something to make it jump out at you. I think I might try a couple of shots of the canon a bit cloer in, so that all you have as a background is the blurred wall.', '2005-01-17 02:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113535, 133403, 26756, '<td valign="top">A fantastic landscape / seascape.  Looks extremely familiar too. Is this near Procida?  Very beautiful work.</td>', 'A fantastic landscape / seascape.  Looks extremely familiar too. Is this near Procida?  Very beautiful work.', '2005-01-17 02:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113536, 134993, 23458, '<td valign="top">NIce idea with the coat - but the facial expression here needs a little work - when I''m photographing kids (and my house is crawling with them :P) I try to ask them questions and photograph them while they are answering me - it gets a natural pose out of them (by the way, I didn''t come up with that myself but read it somewhere).</td>', 'NIce idea with the coat - but the facial expression here needs a little work - when I''m photographing kids (and my house is crawling with them :P) I try to ask them questions and photograph them while they are answering me - it gets a natural pose out of them (by the way, I didn''t come up with that myself but read it somewhere).', '2005-01-17 02:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113537, 133996, 31642, '<td valign="top">You can crop the top part a little bit to make this picture stand out.</td>', 'You can crop the top part a little bit to make this picture stand out.', '2005-01-17 02:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1113538, 132140, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great location here, and your processing is brilliant. Really like the way the light falls on the reeds in the foreground. Good work !!</td>', 'Great location here, and your processing is brilliant. Really like the way the light falls on the reeds in the foreground. Good work !!', '2005-01-17 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
