(1113543, 136775, 9668, '<td valign="top">Amazing sunset here. The only thing that bothers me about this shot is the foreground. I don''t know how possible it was to add more interest to the foreground (or eliminate it), but it''s a minor thing.</td>', 'Amazing sunset here. The only thing that bothers me about this shot is the foreground. I don''t know how possible it was to add more interest to the foreground (or eliminate it), but it''s a minor thing.', '2005-01-17 02:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
