(1113921, 136704, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp focus. An excellent candid. I was going to suggest this might work better in black and white, but on second glance I really like the vivid colours here, it would be a shame to lose them.</td>', 'Nice crisp focus. An excellent candid. I was going to suggest this might work better in black and white, but on second glance I really like the vivid colours here, it would be a shame to lose them.', '2005-01-17 07:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
