(1114027, 136648, 31239, '<td valign="top">You looking at me?</td>', 'You looking at me?', '2005-01-17 08:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114032, 132782, 8522, '<td valign="top">I loved this the first time I saw it, and I still love it. 10</td>', 'I loved this the first time I saw it, and I still love it. 10', '2005-01-17 08:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114045, 133637, 31403, '<td valign="top">nice photo, really bad title</td>', 'nice photo, really bad title', '2005-01-17 08:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114050, 135427, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but take it easy with the soft-focus!</td>', 'Very nice, but take it easy with the soft-focus!', '2005-01-17 09:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114052, 132225, 8522, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, loved this one! 10</td>', 'Oh yeah, loved this one! 10', '2005-01-17 09:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114053, 136677, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression, I like the high-key treatment. 10</td>', 'Wonderful expression, I like the high-key treatment. 10', '2005-01-17 09:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114058, 136337, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the limited depth of field. The selective desat doesn''t work for me, and the mood is a bit heavy on the syrup for my taste... not helped by the faded border which seems a bit overkill. You did capture a good moment though.</td>', 'Shame about the limited depth of field. The selective desat doesn''t work for me, and the mood is a bit heavy on the syrup for my taste... not helped by the faded border which seems a bit overkill. You did capture a good moment though.', '2005-01-17 09:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114062, 132622, 30392, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, a bit artificial maybe?</td>', 'Very dramatic, a bit artificial maybe?', '2005-01-17 09:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114063, 135165, 31642, '<td valign="top">I would like to give you 10 there is less space on the left for this picture.</td>', 'I would like to give you 10 there is less space on the left for this picture.', '2005-01-17 09:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114064, 136718, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is different and very nice. I can''t quite work out how the top of the bowl works... how come it hasn''t distorted her hair and features? Superb lighting... the wide dynamic range has been handled superbly. Great composition and colours. I''m interested to see who the photographer responsible is!</td>', 'Wow, this is different and very nice. I can''t quite work out how the top of the bowl works... how come it hasn''t distorted her hair and features? Superb lighting... the wide dynamic range has been handled superbly. Great composition and colours. I''m interested to see who the photographer responsible is!', '2005-01-17 09:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114066, 133862, 31642, '<td valign="top">Very nice one. If you don''t mind, I would like to copy your idea.</td>', 'Very nice one. If you don''t mind, I would like to copy your idea.', '2005-01-17 09:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114067, 135275, 31403, '<td valign="top">I would try cropping down to just your main subject, the "half-cow'' is kind of a distraction for me.</td>', 'I would try cropping down to just your main subject, the "half-cow'' is kind of a distraction for me.', '2005-01-17 09:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114068, 136597, 31642, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more foreground in order to increase DOF for this one.</td>', 'I would like to see more foreground in order to increase DOF for this one.', '2005-01-17 09:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114069, 134345, 31642, '<td valign="top">Vey nice one 10.</td>', 'Vey nice one 10.', '2005-01-17 09:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114070, 132255, 8522, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb. A bit too soft-focus for me here, but really amazing anyway.</td>', 'Absolutely superb. A bit too soft-focus for me here, but really amazing anyway.', '2005-01-17 09:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114071, 134074, 31642, '<td valign="top">This is interesting idea. The problem with this one is that the cat does not stand out from the background.</td>', 'This is interesting idea. The problem with this one is that the cat does not stand out from the background.', '2005-01-17 09:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114073, 134050, 8522, '<td valign="top">Yep, still looks good. 10</td>', 'Yep, still looks good. 10', '2005-01-17 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114081, 132699, 31403, '<td valign="top">I think adjusting the whites to be whiter, and pushing the saturation a little would strengthen this image.  Maybe shooting with a wider aperature to shorten the DOF would be nice too. Sharp focus, nice work.</td>', 'I think adjusting the whites to be whiter, and pushing the saturation a little would strengthen this image.  Maybe shooting with a wider aperature to shorten the DOF would be nice too. Sharp focus, nice work.', '2005-01-17 09:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114083, 136757, 31403, '<td valign="top">love the angle, love the blur.  Nice shot</td>', 'love the angle, love the blur.  Nice shot', '2005-01-17 09:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114089, 134322, 31403, '<td valign="top">the structure of the architecture and the free form of the girl make this very interesting to look at - I really like it</td>', 'the structure of the architecture and the free form of the girl make this very interesting to look at - I really like it', '2005-01-17 09:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114095, 135948, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the rainbow of colors in the sky, especially the stripes you can see through the trees. Mabye a little too much dead space at the top for my taste, but very well done.</td>', 'I like the rainbow of colors in the sky, especially the stripes you can see through the trees. Mabye a little too much dead space at the top for my taste, but very well done.', '2005-01-17 09:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114099, 136448, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion of this photo but I can''t help but wonder what words made her so upset? Looks like she is crying.</td>', 'I like the compostion of this photo but I can''t help but wonder what words made her so upset? Looks like she is crying.', '2005-01-17 09:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114101, 134028, 31403, '<td valign="top">great photo, so-so title.  With an image this strong, I''d expect drama in the title too.</td>', 'great photo, so-so title.  With an image this strong, I''d expect drama in the title too.', '2005-01-17 09:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114102, 136337, 23561, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desaturation. I could see this in a portfolio or sample book easily.</td>', 'Good use of selective desaturation. I could see this in a portfolio or sample book easily.', '2005-01-17 09:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114119, 135927, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very rich image with the depth and shadows.  B&amp;W conversion gives it an ominous mood. I would be interested to see the colour version.  Good shot.</td>', 'Very rich image with the depth and shadows.  B&W conversion gives it an ominous mood. I would be interested to see the colour version.  Good shot.', '2005-01-17 09:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114120, 135987, 14603, '<td valign="top">I`m a big fan of your recent work which is amongst the most progressive exhibited on the site in my opinion.<br/>The almost pencil like tones of this, combined with the effects of the light on the arms and face reminds me of a "da Vinci"  anatomical drawing.<br/>Very nice work..hope it receives the score it deserves.</td>', 'I`m a big fan of your recent work which is amongst the most progressive exhibited on the site in my opinion.The almost pencil like tones of this, combined with the effects of the light on the arms and face reminds me of a "da Vinci"  anatomical drawing.Very nice work..hope it receives the score it deserves.', '2005-01-17 09:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114124, 132782, 31642, '<td valign="top">Just a little bit overexposure. The rest is very nice.</td>', 'Just a little bit overexposure. The rest is very nice.', '2005-01-17 09:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114126, 136602, 31642, '<td valign="top">It would be nicer if you show the eyes.</td>', 'It would be nicer if you show the eyes.', '2005-01-17 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114127, 134345, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very impressive landscape which really suits the b/w format.<br/>This would look amazing up on the wall in a large frame.</td>', 'Very impressive landscape which really suits the b/w format.This would look amazing up on the wall in a large frame.', '2005-01-17 09:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114131, 136632, 31642, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice. The thing that make picture less impact is the white background.</td>', 'The composition is very nice. The thing that make picture less impact is the white background.', '2005-01-17 09:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114134, 132185, 14603, '<td valign="top">I was certain I had this in my favourites !<br/>I will remedy that now.<br/>Fabulous abstract image..superbly composed.</td>', 'I was certain I had this in my favourites !I will remedy that now.Fabulous abstract image..superbly composed.', '2005-01-17 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114147, 136752, 14603, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and the contrast of light and dark tones has been utilised to the full to give impact to the image.<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'Excellent composition and the contrast of light and dark tones has been utilised to the full to give impact to the image.Nicely done.', '2005-01-17 10:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114148, 136728, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good simplistic concept and the color of the boats works nicely against the bland colors of the rest of the image. Softer contrast might make this look a little less oversharpened.</td>', 'Good simplistic concept and the color of the boats works nicely against the bland colors of the rest of the image. Softer contrast might make this look a little less oversharpened.', '2005-01-17 10:15:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1114150, 132177, 5792, '<td valign="top">The type of image only a photographer can see. :)</td>', 'The type of image only a photographer can see. :)', '2005-01-17 10:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114154, 135783, 14603, '<td valign="top">Oh the feeling of reaching the top !!<br/>Nicely expressed in the orange glow of the late evening ..early morning? light.<br/>If this was late evening..I hope you got down before darkness fell :)<br/>Makes me long to get back up among the Munros.</td>', 'Oh the feeling of reaching the top !!Nicely expressed in the orange glow of the late evening ..early morning? light.If this was late evening..I hope you got down before darkness fell :)Makes me long to get back up among the Munros.', '2005-01-17 10:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114155, 133145, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the model, very beautiful.</td>', 'I like the model, very beautiful.', '2005-01-17 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114156, 133979, 5792, '<td valign="top">Poor focus and lack of intersting foreground hurts this image.</td>', 'Poor focus and lack of intersting foreground hurts this image.', '2005-01-17 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114160, 136424, 9504, '<td valign="top">Holy crap.  That would be scary. Where was this??</td>', 'Holy crap.  That would be scary. Where was this??', '2005-01-17 10:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114165, 136870, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract! Love the way the lighting gives this its 3-D feel.  Colors compliment without jarring th eye.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful abstract! Love the way the lighting gives this its 3-D feel.  Colors compliment without jarring th eye.  Nicely done!', '2005-01-17 10:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114166, 132310, 23561, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and I love the way you captured the reflection on the floor.</td>', 'Great lighting, and I love the way you captured the reflection on the floor.', '2005-01-17 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114169, 134050, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good choice Ed....must finish in the top ten <br/>There, I`ve jinxed you !!!!</td>', 'Good choice Ed....must finish in the top ten There, I`ve jinxed you !!!!', '2005-01-17 10:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114170, 135208, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!  I love the way the personality of each child seems so present!  There''s so much story to this image!</td>', 'Wonderful capture!  I love the way the personality of each child seems so present!  There''s so much story to this image!', '2005-01-17 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114172, 132109, 16488, '<td valign="top">So suprised to see this one!  I see it every morning at work since you posted it in the forums for comment--hope you don''t mind that I took the liberty of making it my desktop image.  I saved it for inspiration--I hope to be able to "paint with light'' and achieve the form and mood you have here.  So painterly.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'So suprised to see this one!  I see it every morning at work since you posted it in the forums for comment--hope you don''t mind that I took the liberty of making it my desktop image.  I saved it for inspiration--I hope to be able to "paint with light'' and achieve the form and mood you have here.  So painterly.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-17 10:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114173, 133528, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very good capture.</td>', 'Very good capture.', '2005-01-17 10:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114177, 133084, 16488, '<td valign="top">What energy!  The motion blur works so well to convey the moment!  Like the way the highlights on her leg blend with the wet pavement and yet detail is there in the rest of the image.  It took me awhile to understand your title as the shadow of the stalker doesn''t jump out at first--so nice when I finally "get it".</td>', 'What energy!  The motion blur works so well to convey the moment!  Like the way the highlights on her leg blend with the wet pavement and yet detail is there in the rest of the image.  It took me awhile to understand your title as the shadow of the stalker doesn''t jump out at first--so nice when I finally "get it".', '2005-01-17 10:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114181, 135208, 14603, '<td valign="top">The stark white wall acts as a good background for the children..nicely candid as well.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'The stark white wall acts as a good background for the children..nicely candid as well.Good luck', '2005-01-17 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114184, 132225, 16488, '<td valign="top">Timeless!  Love the crispness of the silhouette.  Looking forward to your notes as this can''t be easy to achieve.</td>', 'Timeless!  Love the crispness of the silhouette.  Looking forward to your notes as this can''t be easy to achieve.', '2005-01-17 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114185, 135615, 14603, '<td valign="top">What a find...One of my favourites in the challenge</td>', 'What a find...One of my favourites in the challenge', '2005-01-17 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114188, 132693, 16488, '<td valign="top">Delightful!  Beautifully composed!  Great detail and lighting!   Oh heck, I''ll quit babbling and just give you a few more of these: !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Delightful!  Beautifully composed!  Great detail and lighting!   Oh heck, I''ll quit babbling and just give you a few more of these: !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2005-01-17 10:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114190, 132082, 25143, '<td valign="top">talk about being hungry ... great snapshot , very nice texture of the water</td>', 'talk about being hungry ... great snapshot , very nice texture of the water', '2005-01-17 10:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114191, 134026, 9504, '<td valign="top">I find there is too much saturation in this photo for my liking. The colors looks flourescent and not natural.  Did you use a soft-filter for this?   Overall, the effect is good .6</td>', 'I find there is too much saturation in this photo for my liking. The colors looks flourescent and not natural.  Did you use a soft-filter for this?   Overall, the effect is good .6', '2005-01-17 10:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114192, 135431, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of light and dark..very effective.<br/>Suits the tonal treatment also.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'I like the mix of light and dark..very effective.Suits the tonal treatment also.Nice work', '2005-01-17 10:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114193, 132185, 9504, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge so far.  Solid 10.  Best of luck!</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge so far.  Solid 10.  Best of luck!', '2005-01-17 10:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114194, 134411, 23561, '<td valign="top">I love the focus and the background blends perfectly. Should be in the top 10 IMO.</td>', 'I love the focus and the background blends perfectly. Should be in the top 10 IMO.', '2005-01-17 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114195, 136602, 25143, '<td valign="top">maybe in color this would be more interesting ..? the fur would contrast nicely against the grid of the cage</td>', 'maybe in color this would be more interesting ..? the fur would contrast nicely against the grid of the cage', '2005-01-17 10:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114196, 136794, 25143, '<td valign="top">not enough DOF and the white spot should have been removed - nice profile though</td>', 'not enough DOF and the white spot should have been removed - nice profile though', '2005-01-17 10:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114197, 133704, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in the leaves of the fern, but the flowers in the background seem to distract from the fern.</td>', 'I like the detail in the leaves of the fern, but the flowers in the background seem to distract from the fern.', '2005-01-17 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114198, 132996, 25143, '<td valign="top">not enough depth of field for my taste</td>', 'not enough depth of field for my taste', '2005-01-17 10:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114199, 136772, 25143, '<td valign="top">WOW !!</td>', 'WOW !!', '2005-01-17 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114200, 136685, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is already in my favourites and is a true beauty.<br/>Could be a good bet for a ribbon.</td>', 'This is already in my favourites and is a true beauty.Could be a good bet for a ribbon.', '2005-01-17 10:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114203, 132071, 9504, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an island on the Great Barrier Reef in Australia.  You have me wondering where this is...</td>', 'This reminds me of an island on the Great Barrier Reef in Australia.  You have me wondering where this is...', '2005-01-17 10:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114205, 136452, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but not the border. IMO it takes away the from the hard, unyielding nature of the rocks.</td>', 'I like this photo but not the border. IMO it takes away the from the hard, unyielding nature of the rocks.', '2005-01-17 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114207, 135921, 25143, '<td valign="top">the background is too undecided and the leaves are distracting in their pattern of light and shade ; more blur would have been more effective - this messy-looking flower on simple black would have been stunning</td>', 'the background is too undecided and the leaves are distracting in their pattern of light and shade ; more blur would have been more effective - this messy-looking flower on simple black would have been stunning', '2005-01-17 10:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114208, 136414, 23561, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. A like the variety of blue in the sky and the clouds.</td>', 'Nice landscape. A like the variety of blue in the sky and the clouds.', '2005-01-17 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114209, 135618, 25143, '<td valign="top">the view is too slanted back for my taste , nice ambience and set-up though</td>', 'the view is too slanted back for my taste , nice ambience and set-up though', '2005-01-17 10:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114210, 132167, 23561, '<td valign="top">Picture seems slightly slanted. I do like the candid aspect.</td>', 'Picture seems slightly slanted. I do like the candid aspect.', '2005-01-17 10:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114212, 136427, 23561, '<td valign="top">Focus is good but the subject is a little too hard to see as it blends with its background.</td>', 'Focus is good but the subject is a little too hard to see as it blends with its background.', '2005-01-17 10:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114214, 136242, 25143, '<td valign="top">nice blur on the wheels and background</td>', 'nice blur on the wheels and background', '2005-01-17 10:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114218, 133258, 25143, '<td valign="top">interesting that the intensity of the blue makes the flower appear almost pale  , thus wanting to be looked at first - great shot , simple , effective and definitely energizing</td>', 'interesting that the intensity of the blue makes the flower appear almost pale  , thus wanting to be looked at first - great shot , simple , effective and definitely energizing', '2005-01-17 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114220, 136727, 25143, '<td valign="top">one more leg in the picture would have been nicer for my taste , great simple set-up though</td>', 'one more leg in the picture would have been nicer for my taste , great simple set-up though', '2005-01-17 10:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114221, 136596, 25143, '<td valign="top">great face and well-lit  ... but the spelling of the title ??! either I don''t get it or you didn''t -</td>', 'great face and well-lit  ... but the spelling of the title ??! either I don''t get it or you didn''t -', '2005-01-17 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114222, 135188, 9504, '<td valign="top">Great color.  I love the softness of the river.  Very nice. 7</td>', 'Great color.  I love the softness of the river.  Very nice. 7', '2005-01-17 10:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114223, 136757, 25143, '<td valign="top">why remove the color ??? this could have been so much more dynamic !</td>', 'why remove the color ??? this could have been so much more dynamic !', '2005-01-17 10:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114226, 136205, 25143, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way the heads are cut - the lighting is nice</td>', 'I don''t like the way the heads are cut - the lighting is nice', '2005-01-17 10:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114229, 132804, 25143, '<td valign="top">great eye ...!</td>', 'great eye ...!', '2005-01-17 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114231, 134993, 25143, '<td valign="top">too much of an artificial smile in an otherwise well-composed photo</td>', 'too much of an artificial smile in an otherwise well-composed photo', '2005-01-17 10:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114235, 135208, 25143, '<td valign="top">superb picture , simple idea , great framing , nothing special and yet very eye-catching at the same time - not to mention the colors !! looks like a winner to me  - 9</td>', 'superb picture , simple idea , great framing , nothing special and yet very eye-catching at the same time - not to mention the colors !! looks like a winner to me  - 9', '2005-01-17 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114238, 136637, 25143, '<td valign="top">too bad the reflection is not complete , great colors and light</td>', 'too bad the reflection is not complete , great colors and light', '2005-01-17 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114240, 136226, 25143, '<td valign="top">neat spots on the wing - very nice profile and set-up with the wooden parallels and the green works well , too</td>', 'neat spots on the wing - very nice profile and set-up with the wooden parallels and the green works well , too', '2005-01-17 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1114241, 133176, 14603, '<td valign="top">I can recall seeing this before and being amazed at the quality of the shot given the conditions.<br/>Superbly done.<br/></td>', 'I can recall seeing this before and being amazed at the quality of the shot given the conditions.Superbly done.', '2005-01-17 11:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
