(1114268, 136381, 31036, '<td valign="top">Interesting, to say the least. <br/> <br/>My first thought is un-natural positioning of the hand, but it works well with the positioning of the face and the expression (I just might''ve had the hand slightly higher) The expression conveys such a great feeling of intrest and longing.<br/> <br/>Great contrast and lighting- only bad spot is on the upper portion of the breast/chest, where it appears a little too white.<br/> <br/>Kudos to both model and photographer for giving such a strong presence of the model''s mind.<br/> <br/>9, and adding to favorites. Great job!<br/></td>', 'Interesting, to say the least.  My first thought is un-natural positioning of the hand, but it works well with the positioning of the face and the expression (I just might''ve had the hand slightly higher) The expression conveys such a great feeling of intrest and longing. Great contrast and lighting- only bad spot is on the upper portion of the breast/chest, where it appears a little too white. Kudos to both model and photographer for giving such a strong presence of the model''s mind. 9, and adding to favorites. Great job!', '2005-01-17 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
