(1115472, 132774, 14012, '<td valign="top">very vibrant colors..plus purple is my favorite :)<br/> <br/>Nice, sharp, clean, photo. Good job!</td>', 'very vibrant colors..plus purple is my favorite :) Nice, sharp, clean, photo. Good job!', '2005-01-17 19:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115473, 132307, 12809, '<td valign="top">What an incredibly beautiful image.  The fog/mist really sets the mood.  The exposure and coloring on the bird is beautiful.  I like how he''s looking off the frame.  Makes you wonder what he sees.  Gorgeous, gorgeous shot.  I hope this is on a wall of yours.  An easy 10.</td>', 'What an incredibly beautiful image.  The fog/mist really sets the mood.  The exposure and coloring on the bird is beautiful.  I like how he''s looking off the frame.  Makes you wonder what he sees.  Gorgeous, gorgeous shot.  I hope this is on a wall of yours.  An easy 10.', '2005-01-17 19:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115475, 136746, 12809, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Love the lighting and the colors are very pleasing.  Nice comp. and use of the trees in the fg.  -10-</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Love the lighting and the colors are very pleasing.  Nice comp. and use of the trees in the fg.  -10-', '2005-01-17 19:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
