(1115477, 135457, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen shots like this from the rear of the car but never from the front.  Very well done!  This came out great.  -10-</td>', 'I''ve seen shots like this from the rear of the car but never from the front.  Very well done!  This came out great.  -10-', '2005-01-17 19:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115478, 136441, 12809, '<td valign="top">Love this!  So simple but very powerful.  -10-</td>', 'Love this!  So simple but very powerful.  -10-', '2005-01-17 19:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115479, 132185, 12809, '<td valign="top">Really great image.  This one stood out to me from the beginning.  Good eye.  -10-</td>', 'Really great image.  This one stood out to me from the beginning.  Good eye.  -10-', '2005-01-17 19:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115480, 133415, 14763, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!  Nicely done</td>', 'Wow!!!  Nicely done', '2005-01-17 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115484, 136587, 12809, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot.  I like how you caught the parachuter before he went in front of the mountains.  I also like the partially cropped out sun with just the rays shooting down.  Nice color overlay you chose too.  I think I see a tiny dust spot by the tiny cloud by the sunrays.  -9-</td>', 'Really beautiful shot.  I like how you caught the parachuter before he went in front of the mountains.  I also like the partially cropped out sun with just the rays shooting down.  Nice color overlay you chose too.  I think I see a tiny dust spot by the tiny cloud by the sunrays.  -9-', '2005-01-17 19:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115486, 135444, 2310, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I would like to see it a little sharper and with some more contrast...</td>', 'Nice shot but I would like to see it a little sharper and with some more contrast...', '2005-01-17 19:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115487, 136283, 12809, '<td valign="top">My friend took a shot identical to this.  Nice crisp image with good exposure.</td>', 'My friend took a shot identical to this.  Nice crisp image with good exposure.', '2005-01-17 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115488, 134410, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice action shot.  I like the solid sky bg.  I wish the biker and bike were a little brighter but still a great shot.</td>', 'Very nice action shot.  I like the solid sky bg.  I wish the biker and bike were a little brighter but still a great shot.', '2005-01-17 19:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115489, 135057, 12809, '<td valign="top">Love the character in this man.  Very nice tones and good choice for b&amp;w/sepia.  I really like th comp. as well.   I will say, though, my first thought (before looking at your title) was that it didn''t make me think of plugging his ear...instead it made me think of how people jokingly pretend to have a gun to their head.  I don''t mean any offense by that.  It''s just what first popped into my head.  Great pic.  -9-</td>', 'Love the character in this man.  Very nice tones and good choice for b&w/sepia.  I really like th comp. as well.   I will say, though, my first thought (before looking at your title) was that it didn''t make me think of plugging his ear...instead it made me think of how people jokingly pretend to have a gun to their head.  I don''t mean any offense by that.  It''s just what first popped into my head.  Great pic.  -9-', '2005-01-17 19:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115490, 136832, 2310, '<td valign="top">Great shot...I really think the graininess adds to this photo...</td>', 'Great shot...I really think the graininess adds to this photo...', '2005-01-17 19:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115491, 136871, 12809, '<td valign="top">An all-American shot.  I like the selective color you used.  Good choice for this image.</td>', 'An all-American shot.  I like the selective color you used.  Good choice for this image.', '2005-01-17 19:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115492, 133528, 12809, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You''re title sums it up.  Good focus!  Areas of the hand are a little blown out but it''s not like you had time to adjust and prepare!  Well shot!  -9-</td>', 'Wow!  You''re title sums it up.  Good focus!  Areas of the hand are a little blown out but it''s not like you had time to adjust and prepare!  Well shot!  -9-', '2005-01-17 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115493, 133213, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice glamour shot.  Well composed and good lighting.  -9-</td>', 'Nice glamour shot.  Well composed and good lighting.  -9-', '2005-01-17 19:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115495, 135207, 2310, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition but I think that the horizon line is just a little tilted...</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition but I think that the horizon line is just a little tilted...', '2005-01-17 19:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115497, 132693, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and the dof a lot.  It produced a nice overall softness.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the focus and the dof a lot.  It produced a nice overall softness.  Well done.', '2005-01-17 19:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115499, 133544, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...this setting looks very familiar.  :^)  Nice capture.</td>', 'Hmmm...this setting looks very familiar.  :^)  Nice capture.', '2005-01-17 20:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115500, 135240, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer a more natural sky.  This looks very manipulated.  I''d like to see more detail in the sailboats as well.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer a more natural sky.  This looks very manipulated.  I''d like to see more detail in the sailboats as well.', '2005-01-17 20:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115503, 133598, 6600, '<td valign="top">WOW !  If you listen real close you can hear the music.... feel like I''m there.  Georgous shot! Love the color and tones.  Super composition.  My personal favorite!</td>', 'WOW !  If you listen real close you can hear the music.... feel like I''m there.  Georgous shot! Love the color and tones.  Super composition.  My personal favorite!', '2005-01-17 20:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115507, 136815, 6600, '<td valign="top">Ester....  very pretty!  Well done portrait, although I think it would be very hard to take a bad one in this case.  Captivating eyes.  Well done!</td>', 'Ester....  very pretty!  Well done portrait, although I think it would be very hard to take a bad one in this case.  Captivating eyes.  Well done!', '2005-01-17 20:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115508, 132207, 12809, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and focus.  Sharp image considering the photographer was probably trembling. :-)</td>', 'Good exposure and focus.  Sharp image considering the photographer was probably trembling. :-)', '2005-01-17 20:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115520, 133716, 13610, '<td valign="top">Very clean. There''s nothing of much interest in it I think because it lack a subject.</td>', 'Very clean. There''s nothing of much interest in it I think because it lack a subject.', '2005-01-17 20:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115522, 133403, 14763, '<td valign="top">Great Scenery</td>', 'Great Scenery', '2005-01-17 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
