(1115529, 133277, 13610, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh!</td>', 'Good bokeh!', '2005-01-17 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115544, 136747, 29477, '<td valign="top">A Nice Bob Ross style image.  Great colours and reflection in the water.  I might have tweaked the levels to try and bring out some more of the shadows and terrain.  Good shot.</td>', 'A Nice Bob Ross style image.  Great colours and reflection in the water.  I might have tweaked the levels to try and bring out some more of the shadows and terrain.  Good shot.', '2005-01-17 20:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115547, 133726, 29477, '<td valign="top">Strong DOF and great focus.  Like the choice to go with B&amp;W. Nice shot.</td>', 'Strong DOF and great focus.  Like the choice to go with B&W. Nice shot.', '2005-01-17 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115557, 135208, 26500, '<td valign="top">Perfect! 10</td>', 'Perfect! 10', '2005-01-17 20:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115561, 134205, 26500, '<td valign="top">My favorite sunset/rise of the challenge.  The title says it all.  Well done. 10</td>', 'My favorite sunset/rise of the challenge.  The title says it all.  Well done. 10', '2005-01-17 20:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115562, 136435, 26500, '<td valign="top">My favorite "kid" shot of the challenge.  I love the wide angle and the DOF in this shot.  The child is so intent on what he is doing he probably didn''t even know his picture was being taken.  Very nicely done. 10</td>', 'My favorite "kid" shot of the challenge.  I love the wide angle and the DOF in this shot.  The child is so intent on what he is doing he probably didn''t even know his picture was being taken.  Very nicely done. 10', '2005-01-17 20:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115565, 136688, 26500, '<td valign="top">The composition in this shot is just great.  I also love the pristine snow background.  One of my favorites of the challenge.  Sorry I have nothing constructive to add but I can''t suggest anything that needs improvement. 10</td>', 'The composition in this shot is just great.  I also love the pristine snow background.  One of my favorites of the challenge.  Sorry I have nothing constructive to add but I can''t suggest anything that needs improvement. 10', '2005-01-17 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115568, 133748, 26500, '<td valign="top">Great lightning shot.  You have every right to be proud of this!<br/> <br/>Nicely done. 10</td>', 'Great lightning shot.  You have every right to be proud of this! Nicely done. 10', '2005-01-17 20:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115569, 136283, 26500, '<td valign="top">Spectacular... 10<br/> <br/>My pick for blue.</td>', 'Spectacular... 10 My pick for blue.', '2005-01-17 20:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115581, 135345, 26756, '<td valign="top">Returning to comment.  Beautifully crisp and very detailed. I love how the green and blue colors interact.  I also like this angle because typically it''s a close up of the eyes.  This gives a whole other perspective and shows some very intricate details of the dragonfly''s back.  Cool shot!</td>', 'Returning to comment.  Beautifully crisp and very detailed. I love how the green and blue colors interact.  I also like this angle because typically it''s a close up of the eyes.  This gives a whole other perspective and shows some very intricate details of the dragonfly''s back.  Cool shot!', '2005-01-17 21:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115582, 136593, 23561, '<td valign="top">How many points is that?:) Very nice silhouette, and the line of the clouds seem to help the flow of the shot. Feels very peaceful.</td>', 'How many points is that?:) Very nice silhouette, and the line of the clouds seem to help the flow of the shot. Feels very peaceful.', '2005-01-17 21:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115596, 136626, 23561, '<td valign="top">Love the detail of the bird and the position of the wings (very unusual to me because in most pictures I see they are fully extended rather than bent). Not crazy about the change in background color though. The green (or maybe its the blue) is a bit distracting and doesn''t have the same feel as the other side. My husband disagrees, and it is still alot better than I could do, but that''s my 2 cents. I gave this a 9.</td>', 'Love the detail of the bird and the position of the wings (very unusual to me because in most pictures I see they are fully extended rather than bent). Not crazy about the change in background color though. The green (or maybe its the blue) is a bit distracting and doesn''t have the same feel as the other side. My husband disagrees, and it is still alot better than I could do, but that''s my 2 cents. I gave this a 9.', '2005-01-17 21:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115605, 133355, 31708, '<td valign="top">Try focusing on a true focal point,  the tree really doesn''t stand alone.</td>', 'Try focusing on a true focal point,  the tree really doesn''t stand alone.', '2005-01-17 21:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115608, 132124, 31708, '<td valign="top">Try focusing on a main focal point that will really stand out.</td>', 'Try focusing on a main focal point that will really stand out.', '2005-01-17 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115610, 136340, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful and beautiful... great candid withe great tones and outstanding quality. Many stories withing thos one piece. 10,</td>', 'This is wonderful and beautiful... great candid withe great tones and outstanding quality. Many stories withing thos one piece. 10,', '2005-01-17 21:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115611, 135149, 31708, '<td valign="top">the sky is beautiful but, Try focusing on a main focal point that will really stand out.</td>', 'the sky is beautiful but, Try focusing on a main focal point that will really stand out.', '2005-01-17 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115641, 136468, 7485, '<td valign="top">As I mentioned first time around, fantistically imaginative photo! Last time I thought the neon effect was too much, this version is defiinetily better - 9</td>', 'As I mentioned first time around, fantistically imaginative photo! Last time I thought the neon effect was too much, this version is defiinetily better - 9', '2005-01-17 22:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115648, 135655, 29477, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W conversion confuses me with your title.  You may have had more impact in colour with the greenery surrounding your main tree.  I find it too busy for my taste.  Good Luck.</td>', 'The B&W conversion confuses me with your title.  You may have had more impact in colour with the greenery surrounding your main tree.  I find it too busy for my taste.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-17 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1115654, 135980, 7485, '<td valign="top">Love the sharp black tentacles contrasting with the diaphanous bright body. Being such an engaging subject, I wish it occupied more of the frame - 7</td>', 'Love the sharp black tentacles contrasting with the diaphanous bright body. Being such an engaging subject, I wish it occupied more of the frame - 7', '2005-01-17 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115658, 132307, 7743, '<td valign="top">This one reminds me of a Robert Bateman painting.  The ghostly tree in the background sets the mood.</td>', 'This one reminds me of a Robert Bateman painting.  The ghostly tree in the background sets the mood.', '2005-01-17 22:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115660, 134411, 29477, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower.  Focus appears to be a little soft.   I might have used a smaller apeture to get the entire flower in focus.</td>', 'Pretty flower.  Focus appears to be a little soft.   I might have used a smaller apeture to get the entire flower in focus.', '2005-01-17 22:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115663, 133748, 29477, '<td valign="top">I love these shots.  Great capture.</td>', 'I love these shots.  Great capture.', '2005-01-17 22:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115665, 133213, 7485, '<td valign="top">Technically immaculate! And love that mole, and how the lighting gives it extra contrast by putting it right in the middle of a highlight - 10</td>', 'Technically immaculate! And love that mole, and how the lighting gives it extra contrast by putting it right in the middle of a highlight - 10', '2005-01-17 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115666, 134600, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and symmetry of this image.  DOF is nicely done as well.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and symmetry of this image.  DOF is nicely done as well.', '2005-01-17 22:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115667, 136685, 7485, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting. A narrower (and same thickness all around) border would have been better (640 is small enough as is!) 7</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting. A narrower (and same thickness all around) border would have been better (640 is small enough as is!) 7', '2005-01-17 22:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115668, 135613, 7743, '<td valign="top">This creates a great illusion.  There is just enough contrast in the bricks to realize this is the view through the opening in the wall.</td>', 'This creates a great illusion.  There is just enough contrast in the bricks to realize this is the view through the opening in the wall.', '2005-01-17 22:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115670, 134050, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  The top right of the image appears a bit off, not sure if it is a result of a storm or burning of the image.  I find it a little distracting.  A tighter cropping to about an inch above the horizon has slightly more appeal to me. Still a good shot.</td>', 'Nice image.  The top right of the image appears a bit off, not sure if it is a result of a storm or burning of the image.  I find it a little distracting.  A tighter cropping to about an inch above the horizon has slightly more appeal to me. Still a good shot.', '2005-01-17 22:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115672, 136597, 29477, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture...Clouds tell a chilling story.  Image is sharp and appealing to me.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice capture...Clouds tell a chilling story.  Image is sharp and appealing to me.  Good job.', '2005-01-17 22:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115673, 136708, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject and very well composed. Just wish the whole head had been in focus - 7</td>', 'Wonderful subject and very well composed. Just wish the whole head had been in focus - 7', '2005-01-17 22:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115674, 133208, 7485, '<td valign="top">Bet this would have done really well in the "Centered Composition" challenge! 7</td>', 'Bet this would have done really well in the "Centered Composition" challenge! 7', '2005-01-17 22:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115675, 134214, 6388, '<td valign="top">nicely toned...very well lit..nice composition.  i can really indentify with the image through his expression.  my only little technical nit pick is i can see where you burned the highlights reflected in the mirror over his head.  burning darkens in greyscale, so if you burn before you convert to duotone it will take on the same tones as the rest of the pic and be less obvious (that''s a tiny nitpick by the way - don''t mean to seem anal about it...just a thing i learned cuz i LOVE duotones, and i LOVE burning :) )<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'nicely toned...very well lit..nice composition.  i can really indentify with the image through his expression.  my only little technical nit pick is i can see where you burned the highlights reflected in the mirror over his head.  burning darkens in greyscale, so if you burn before you convert to duotone it will take on the same tones as the rest of the pic and be less obvious (that''s a tiny nitpick by the way - don''t mean to seem anal about it...just a thing i learned cuz i LOVE duotones, and i LOVE burning :) ) P', '2005-01-17 22:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115677, 132136, 7485, '<td valign="top">Extraordanary subject! Too bad about all the chromatic noise, you could probably control it somewhat using tools like NoiseNinja or NeatImage. Also, I''d crop half an inch or so off the bottom. 7</td>', 'Extraordanary subject! Too bad about all the chromatic noise, you could probably control it somewhat using tools like NoiseNinja or NeatImage. Also, I''d crop half an inch or so off the bottom. 7', '2005-01-17 22:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115678, 136457, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image is nice and sharp...good focus.  A tighter crop would have brought more detail of the elephant and still support your title.  Try cropping it midway between his front and hind legs to just right of his trunk.  Top just above his head and bottom just underneath his trunk.  I saved and cropped it this way and was more appealing to my tastes.  Just a thought.  Good luck.</td>', 'Image is nice and sharp...good focus.  A tighter crop would have brought more detail of the elephant and still support your title.  Try cropping it midway between his front and hind legs to just right of his trunk.  Top just above his head and bottom just underneath his trunk.  I saved and cropped it this way and was more appealing to my tastes.  Just a thought.  Good luck.', '2005-01-17 22:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115684, 132757, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great focus and DOF...I like the natural lighting.  Colours are dull in a good way giving it a nice historic feel, helping accentuate the history of these great bikes.</td>', 'Great focus and DOF...I like the natural lighting.  Colours are dull in a good way giving it a nice historic feel, helping accentuate the history of these great bikes.', '2005-01-17 22:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115686, 133652, 25583, '<td valign="top">Very Cool!</td>', 'Very Cool!', '2005-01-17 22:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115688, 132307, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and love that fog! I''d have cloned out that twig on the right and darkened the bird''s plumage just a bit, and maybe blurred (or NoiseNinja/NeatImaged) the background just a tad - 7</td>', 'Great composition, and love that fog! I''d have cloned out that twig on the right and darkened the bird''s plumage just a bit, and maybe blurred (or NoiseNinja/NeatImaged) the background just a tad - 7', '2005-01-17 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
