(1115903, 136329, 31481, '<td valign="top">What a moment  you caught here, my favorite photo so far. I go to school for photojournalism and I see a lot of people shots and this is truly one of the best moments I''ve seen, Happy picture that makes you smile, I hope it''s published somewhere.</td>', 'What a moment  you caught here, my favorite photo so far. I go to school for photojournalism and I see a lot of people shots and this is truly one of the best moments I''ve seen, Happy picture that makes you smile, I hope it''s published somewhere.', '2005-01-18 01:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115918, 136282, 30364, '<td valign="top">Look on the bright side ... no-one can say it "doesn''t fit the challenge".  However, I''m afraid the fact that it no doubt has great meaning for you isn''t enough to make it a great photograph.  To my eye, it''s flat and, alas, not very interesting.  I bet it wasn''t REALLY your best shot of 2004.  In which case it doesn''t fit the challenge after all.  Best wishes to Delaney for many more.  3.</td>', 'Look on the bright side ... no-one can say it "doesn''t fit the challenge".  However, I''m afraid the fact that it no doubt has great meaning for you isn''t enough to make it a great photograph.  To my eye, it''s flat and, alas, not very interesting.  I bet it wasn''t REALLY your best shot of 2004.  In which case it doesn''t fit the challenge after all.  Best wishes to Delaney for many more.  3.', '2005-01-18 02:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115919, 135633, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful sunset... but I''m wondering it you could have shot it in a different way... I would have liked to have seen the sun in a more prominent spot.  and maybe zoomed in a bit on that and made it a verticle would have been nice... the dark upper corner in the right bothers me... and I think you could have played a round with this a bit more.  Pretty sunset/rise though!</td>', 'This is a beautiful sunset... but I''m wondering it you could have shot it in a different way... I would have liked to have seen the sun in a more prominent spot.  and maybe zoomed in a bit on that and made it a verticle would have been nice... the dark upper corner in the right bothers me... and I think you could have played a round with this a bit more.  Pretty sunset/rise though!', '2005-01-18 02:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115922, 132779, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ll regret asking, but what are all the little spheres that appear to be flying out of her mouth?  Did she sneeze?  The background seems irrelevant and confusing, and detracts from the portrait, which I would have otherwise rated higher.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'I''ll regret asking, but what are all the little spheres that appear to be flying out of her mouth?  Did she sneeze?  The background seems irrelevant and confusing, and detracts from the portrait, which I would have otherwise rated higher.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-18 02:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115924, 135164, 30364, '<td valign="top">Either the girl or the photo appears heavily over-processed.  Pretty sure it''s the photo.  Sorry.  4.</td>', 'Either the girl or the photo appears heavily over-processed.  Pretty sure it''s the photo.  Sorry.  4.', '2005-01-18 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115929, 133401, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what I''m looking at here... is this some kind of a volcano or hot springs or something?  Love the color that it makes and steam is awesome!  I think I would have cropped off more of the left side of the photo... but otherwise cool photo! - T</td>', 'I''m not sure what I''m looking at here... is this some kind of a volcano or hot springs or something?  Love the color that it makes and steam is awesome!  I think I would have cropped off more of the left side of the photo... but otherwise cool photo! - T', '2005-01-18 02:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115930, 136757, 6172, '<td valign="top">Great atmosphere in this photo! 9</td>', 'Great atmosphere in this photo! 9', '2005-01-18 02:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115932, 132622, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but alas ruined when you let Liberace loose on your computer.  Sorry, I just think the lurid colours are too much.  4.</td>', 'Nice photo, but alas ruined when you let Liberace loose on your computer.  Sorry, I just think the lurid colours are too much.  4.', '2005-01-18 02:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115934, 136770, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think the special effects make-up has detracted from what would otherwise have been a clever portrait of an appealing subject.  It was a 7 without the finger painting.  5.</td>', 'I think the special effects make-up has detracted from what would otherwise have been a clever portrait of an appealing subject.  It was a 7 without the finger painting.  5.', '2005-01-18 02:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115935, 135565, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, but I think the lurid processing lets it down a bit (at least I hope it''s processing &amp; not its natural colours).  6.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, but I think the lurid processing lets it down a bit (at least I hope it''s processing & not its natural colours).  6.', '2005-01-18 02:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
