(1115940, 135783, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  really wonderful colors and good use of a wide dof, I like the different textures here... I only wish the boy was turned the other way.  nicely done though.</td>', 'This is beautiful!  really wonderful colors and good use of a wide dof, I like the different textures here... I only wish the boy was turned the other way.  nicely done though.', '2005-01-18 02:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115952, 135599, 30364, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit tilted, but you''ve heard that (and will again).  It''s actually more the relatively uninteresting subject that lets it down for me.  I''m afraid my reaction to it is "Rain?  OK, yeah ..we''d better go to the pub then."  Sorry to be negative, but it just has no visual impact.  5.</td>', 'Looks a bit tilted, but you''ve heard that (and will again).  It''s actually more the relatively uninteresting subject that lets it down for me.  I''m afraid my reaction to it is "Rain?  OK, yeah ..we''d better go to the pub then."  Sorry to be negative, but it just has no visual impact.  5.', '2005-01-18 03:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
