(1115956, 135615, 30364, '<td valign="top">Arresting image &amp; a nice crisp shot.  Tempted to give it a 6, of course.  Or it could be a 9.  But ...7.</td>', 'Arresting image & a nice crisp shot.  Tempted to give it a 6, of course.  Or it could be a 9.  But ...7.', '2005-01-18 03:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
