(1115959, 132207, 22046, '<td valign="top">What an amazing moment. You caught the drama of birth. I bet you are proud and happy with this picture.</td>', 'What an amazing moment. You caught the drama of birth. I bet you are proud and happy with this picture.', '2005-01-18 03:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115962, 133598, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the look of concentration on the woman''s face. Excellent sharp focus too.</td>', 'I like the look of concentration on the woman''s face. Excellent sharp focus too.', '2005-01-18 03:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115963, 132456, 22046, '<td valign="top">The rich lighting really makes this work. Feels old fashioned and warm.</td>', 'The rich lighting really makes this work. Feels old fashioned and warm.', '2005-01-18 03:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115964, 135057, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great old character.</td>', 'Great old character.', '2005-01-18 03:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115965, 132109, 22046, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful still life. Your lighting is perfect as is the composition and focus.</td>', 'What a beautiful still life. Your lighting is perfect as is the composition and focus.', '2005-01-18 03:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115967, 136283, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot of an important historical moment for our nation.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot of an important historical moment for our nation.', '2005-01-18 03:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115968, 136870, 22046, '<td valign="top">I love interesting abstracts. The lighting really makes this one special.</td>', 'I love interesting abstracts. The lighting really makes this one special.', '2005-01-18 03:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115969, 132804, 22046, '<td valign="top">What amazing colors in this turkey. He is very very ugly and very very beautiful at the same time.</td>', 'What amazing colors in this turkey. He is very very ugly and very very beautiful at the same time.', '2005-01-18 03:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115972, 135208, 22046, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the subdued colors of the building and the bright colors of the kid''s winter clothes. Also their movement against the solid background of the building really works well. This says a great deal about the energy of children.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the subdued colors of the building and the bright colors of the kid''s winter clothes. Also their movement against the solid background of the building really works well. This says a great deal about the energy of children.', '2005-01-18 03:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115974, 134077, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very moody scene. It works well in sepia tone.</td>', 'Very moody scene. It works well in sepia tone.', '2005-01-18 03:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115975, 134935, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition.  Beautiful light, contrast &amp; great intrigue in the waiting figure.  I just can''t make my mind up about the processing.  It nearly works, I think.  Maybe it was an 8 once, but now I think 7.</td>', 'Terrific composition.  Beautiful light, contrast & great intrigue in the waiting figure.  I just can''t make my mind up about the processing.  It nearly works, I think.  Maybe it was an 8 once, but now I think 7.', '2005-01-18 03:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115976, 132117, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait of a beautiful bird.</td>', 'Excellent portrait of a beautiful bird.', '2005-01-18 03:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115978, 136593, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sillhouette of the elk against the amazing sky. I even like the bit of grass hanging from his mouth. Very beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful sillhouette of the elk against the amazing sky. I even like the bit of grass hanging from his mouth. Very beautiful photo.', '2005-01-18 03:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115980, 133252, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great subject &amp; composition.  Processing looks a bit strident to me (but I''m from the South Pacific; maybe way up there at 65°N the light really is that harsh &amp; the colours that vivid?) 6.</td>', 'Great subject & composition.  Processing looks a bit strident to me (but I''m from the South Pacific; maybe way up there at 65°N the light really is that harsh & the colours that vivid?) 6.', '2005-01-18 03:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115986, 132632, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like that you used black and white here, gives it an old fashioned school girl type look.  Nice job with a difficult lighting situation.  I wish you would have gotten down at the side of the table and maybe shot more from the front, and below, so that you could see her face and that deep look of concentration.  as of now there are too many distractions... I might have suggested a shallow DOF so that only the girl and her paper were in focus, and blurring the background.</td>', 'I like that you used black and white here, gives it an old fashioned school girl type look.  Nice job with a difficult lighting situation.  I wish you would have gotten down at the side of the table and maybe shot more from the front, and below, so that you could see her face and that deep look of concentration.  as of now there are too many distractions... I might have suggested a shallow DOF so that only the girl and her paper were in focus, and blurring the background.', '2005-01-18 03:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115989, 136239, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful slightly sepia soft tones... I like how she sort of melts into the background, but I''m slightly distracted by the quite bright light on her left shoulder behind the violin... it takes away some from the softness of the photo.  beautiful eyes which really pop... I also would like to have seen how a slightly darker hue on her lips might have made them pop just a bit, although I would worry that would take away from her innocence.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful slightly sepia soft tones... I like how she sort of melts into the background, but I''m slightly distracted by the quite bright light on her left shoulder behind the violin... it takes away some from the softness of the photo.  beautiful eyes which really pop... I also would like to have seen how a slightly darker hue on her lips might have made them pop just a bit, although I would worry that would take away from her innocence.  Nicely done.', '2005-01-18 03:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115990, 132895, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice golden sunset you''ve got here. Image size seems a tad small to me, but it isn''t that big of a deal.</td>', 'Nice golden sunset you''ve got here. Image size seems a tad small to me, but it isn''t that big of a deal.', '2005-01-18 03:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115991, 136606, 30364, '<td valign="top">Why do I keep coming back to this image?  I don''t even like it (at least I think I don''t).  I come back because I can''t shake the feeling there''s something there that I''m missing.  Which may well make it a lot better than I thought.  I probably should give it a 4, or have the guts to give it a 9.  I don''t: ... so let''s say 7.  But I''m still worried it''s better than that.  Or worse.</td>', 'Why do I keep coming back to this image?  I don''t even like it (at least I think I don''t).  I come back because I can''t shake the feeling there''s something there that I''m missing.  Which may well make it a lot better than I thought.  I probably should give it a 4, or have the guts to give it a 9.  I don''t: ... so let''s say 7.  But I''m still worried it''s better than that.  Or worse.', '2005-01-18 03:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115992, 135919, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool how you''ve frozen this high speed action shot. Also with the tennis text in the background.</td>', 'Cool how you''ve frozen this high speed action shot. Also with the tennis text in the background.', '2005-01-18 03:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115997, 136680, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome scenery, has alot of punch to it. I''m guessing that you were driving along this road and stopped to capture this scene that stood out to you. Nice juxtopostion of the yellows, greens and blues.</td>', 'Awsome scenery, has alot of punch to it. I''m guessing that you were driving along this road and stopped to capture this scene that stood out to you. Nice juxtopostion of the yellows, greens and blues.', '2005-01-18 03:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115998, 135208, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a LOT... but personally I might have tried it as a panoramic type shot... personally I feel you loose some of my interest in the children when I''m looking at the top to see what else there is... I would have cropped it just a tad bit above the 1 level of windows... because it keeps your attention on the children, and also I find that the whole photo seems to look tilted even though it really isn''t, when I''m looking at what you have.</td>', 'I like this photo a LOT... but personally I might have tried it as a panoramic type shot... personally I feel you loose some of my interest in the children when I''m looking at the top to see what else there is... I would have cropped it just a tad bit above the 1 level of windows... because it keeps your attention on the children, and also I find that the whole photo seems to look tilted even though it really isn''t, when I''m looking at what you have.', '2005-01-18 03:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1115999, 136147, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing portrait.  Nice composition.  Understated but effective lighting.  Terrific subject.  7.</td>', 'This is a very appealing portrait.  Nice composition.  Understated but effective lighting.  Terrific subject.  7.', '2005-01-18 03:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116003, 134153, 4967, '<td valign="top">This evokes thoughts of old fashion black and white film photos of old cafes possibly in Paris.  I love it!  The street scene is really wonderful :-)  I''m trying to think of a specific photographer who it reminds me of, but his name is escaping me.  Anyway... very nicely done.  Only suggestion I might make is to play with cropping a little more... especially maybe the left side... but I''m not sure.  Good luck!</td>', 'This evokes thoughts of old fashion black and white film photos of old cafes possibly in Paris.  I love it!  The street scene is really wonderful :-)  I''m trying to think of a specific photographer who it reminds me of, but his name is escaping me.  Anyway... very nicely done.  Only suggestion I might make is to play with cropping a little more... especially maybe the left side... but I''m not sure.  Good luck!', '2005-01-18 03:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116004, 132713, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this subject &amp; point of view, even though it is seen fairly regularly.  In this case I think it loses a bit of the potential impact by having a few too many people on the perimeter; they seem to steal some attention away from the focus of the composition.  Not much you can do about that (I hear you say).  I can''t argue with that, but I also can''t bid higher than a seven for this one.  7.</td>', 'I like this subject & point of view, even though it is seen fairly regularly.  In this case I think it loses a bit of the potential impact by having a few too many people on the perimeter; they seem to steal some attention away from the focus of the composition.  Not much you can do about that (I hear you say).  I can''t argue with that, but I also can''t bid higher than a seven for this one.  7.', '2005-01-18 03:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116006, 136821, 4967, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to have seen this in black and white... or perhaps even sepia.  It''s a beautful scene but to me... it looks OLD, and to pull that emotion you needed the extra suggestion hinted to by black&amp;white/sepia.  Nice use of wide DOF for everything in focus.</td>', 'I would have loved to have seen this in black and white... or perhaps even sepia.  It''s a beautful scene but to me... it looks OLD, and to pull that emotion you needed the extra suggestion hinted to by black&white/sepia.  Nice use of wide DOF for everything in focus.', '2005-01-18 03:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116010, 133785, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very compelling image.  I wish I could offer some specific advice or compliment, but I really can''t.  Oh yes, maybe the frame is not quite right.  But otherwise, it''s irresistible.  8.</td>', 'This is a very compelling image.  I wish I could offer some specific advice or compliment, but I really can''t.  Oh yes, maybe the frame is not quite right.  But otherwise, it''s irresistible.  8.', '2005-01-18 03:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116011, 133230, 15832, '<td valign="top">Þessi á eftir að vera á toppnum! 10</td>', 'Þessi á eftir að vera á toppnum! 10', '2005-01-18 03:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116012, 136345, 4967, '<td valign="top">You have a good angle for this photograph, and a beautiful day.  Seeing as how the sky is so clear, I think I would have been happy cropping off about half of the blue you have at the top... and making this a wider photo, this would not only get rid of the fairly blank sky, but sould make the area you are seeing seem wider because of the width of the photo.  Just an idea.  Also I would have liked a little more substance to the waves which are just TOO white.</td>', 'You have a good angle for this photograph, and a beautiful day.  Seeing as how the sky is so clear, I think I would have been happy cropping off about half of the blue you have at the top... and making this a wider photo, this would not only get rid of the fairly blank sky, but sould make the area you are seeing seem wider because of the width of the photo.  Just an idea.  Also I would have liked a little more substance to the waves which are just TOO white.', '2005-01-18 03:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116018, 136414, 30364, '<td valign="top">Really?  Sky looks like Iceland''s (just kidding).  Nice composition but I think the sky is just a bit overdone.  7.</td>', 'Really?  Sky looks like Iceland''s (just kidding).  Nice composition but I think the sky is just a bit overdone.  7.', '2005-01-18 04:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116019, 134160, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, and how you filled the frame.  I am NOT a big fan of the elaborate framing you did of the photo, although the photos seems to pop off the page... I want to judge on the photo itself and not on the presentation (but that is just me).  Just a couple of ideas that might be fun to play around with here... playing a little with saturation levels might be fun, making the bike really POP out of the leaves, or bringing out the magentas and reds in the flowers, maybe trying a desat of the green?  This is a photo that you could probably play around with to get something a little more artsy and less of a well composed snapshot.</td>', 'I like the colors here, and how you filled the frame.  I am NOT a big fan of the elaborate framing you did of the photo, although the photos seems to pop off the page... I want to judge on the photo itself and not on the presentation (but that is just me).  Just a couple of ideas that might be fun to play around with here... playing a little with saturation levels might be fun, making the bike really POP out of the leaves, or bringing out the magentas and reds in the flowers, maybe trying a desat of the green?  This is a photo that you could probably play around with to get something a little more artsy and less of a well composed snapshot.', '2005-01-18 04:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116020, 135921, 15832, '<td valign="top">Yieks....Not exactly the kind i would give my girlfriend but beautyfull in it´s own way ;)<br/>What the hell is that thing?  6</td>', 'Yieks....Not exactly the kind i would give my girlfriend but beautyfull in it´s own way ;)What the hell is that thing?  6', '2005-01-18 04:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116024, 136283, 30364, '<td valign="top">There must be many thousands of photographs of this elegant memorial statement, but yours is a very good one.  It sure grabbed my attention, and held it for quite a while as well.  Thanks.  8.</td>', 'There must be many thousands of photographs of this elegant memorial statement, but yours is a very good one.  It sure grabbed my attention, and held it for quite a while as well.  Thanks.  8.', '2005-01-18 04:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116025, 132456, 4967, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL!!!  Looks like a painting!  Great job with your lighting... absolutely stunning photo.  Unfortunately the low allowance for KB and your compression caused some artifacting on the pure black which is a shame.  I''m not sure... it''s a little late, and can''t think completely, but I believe you might be able to deal with this by saving for the web in photoshop, instead of just saving straight off at a low compression.  Gorgeous photo though.  I''m giving it a 9... would have been a 10 if it weren''t for the artifacting.  Good luck!</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL!!!  Looks like a painting!  Great job with your lighting... absolutely stunning photo.  Unfortunately the low allowance for KB and your compression caused some artifacting on the pure black which is a shame.  I''m not sure... it''s a little late, and can''t think completely, but I believe you might be able to deal with this by saving for the web in photoshop, instead of just saving straight off at a low compression.  Gorgeous photo though.  I''m giving it a 9... would have been a 10 if it weren''t for the artifacting.  Good luck!', '2005-01-18 04:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116032, 136633, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot... good use of empty black space (and good job with your compression) I love the textures you see here... I LOVE MUSHROOMS :-).  If I had to make a constructive criticism I would say that there might be a tad too much light on the bottom right... corner... although I like the amount that is hitting the stem.  It would have been cute to see a tiny one of these mushrooms a little bit to the left.  Nice solid photo! -9-</td>', 'I like this a lot... good use of empty black space (and good job with your compression) I love the textures you see here... I LOVE MUSHROOMS :-).  If I had to make a constructive criticism I would say that there might be a tad too much light on the bottom right... corner... although I like the amount that is hitting the stem.  It would have been cute to see a tiny one of these mushrooms a little bit to the left.  Nice solid photo! -9-', '2005-01-18 04:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116036, 136551, 30364, '<td valign="top">I somehow wish it was titled.  I''d try "Honi soit qui mal y pense", although it''s traditionally used in another context.  Either way, it''s a good portrait &amp; I think your decision to go B&amp;W is very clever.  7.</td>', 'I somehow wish it was titled.  I''d try "Honi soit qui mal y pense", although it''s traditionally used in another context.  Either way, it''s a good portrait & I think your decision to go B&W is very clever.  7.', '2005-01-18 04:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116044, 136837, 4967, '<td valign="top">Truthfully... I feel that this is a cute photo that one might want to keep for oneself, but as a photograph, I have to say I feel that it isn''t great... I apologize for saying that.  As a photo, and less of a snapshot... you might have made the kitty less centered?  I do like the fact that you seem to have gotten down on the kitties level.</td>', 'Truthfully... I feel that this is a cute photo that one might want to keep for oneself, but as a photograph, I have to say I feel that it isn''t great... I apologize for saying that.  As a photo, and less of a snapshot... you might have made the kitty less centered?  I do like the fact that you seem to have gotten down on the kitties level.', '2005-01-18 04:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116047, 134607, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is just terrific!  It takes a cool head and a remarkable eye to see this, in what I assume were emotional circumstances.  And it is very well executed as well.  8.</td>', 'This is just terrific!  It takes a cool head and a remarkable eye to see this, in what I assume were emotional circumstances.  And it is very well executed as well.  8.', '2005-01-18 04:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116054, 132909, 30364, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait that both of your subjects will treasure for all of their lives.  8.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait that both of your subjects will treasure for all of their lives.  8.', '2005-01-18 04:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116055, 132733, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the colors here... and great focus!  I have to ask... is this bee actually alive?  Something about the crop strikes me as a little off... but I played around with it a bit and can''t find one I like better, maybe if there is more to the photo (which I assume there is) you might want to go back and take a look at the crop again.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the colors here... and great focus!  I have to ask... is this bee actually alive?  Something about the crop strikes me as a little off... but I played around with it a bit and can''t find one I like better, maybe if there is more to the photo (which I assume there is) you might want to go back and take a look at the crop again.  Nicely done.', '2005-01-18 04:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116058, 135987, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unforgettable, bizarre image; brilliantly conceived &amp; photographed.  9.</td>', 'Unforgettable, bizarre image; brilliantly conceived & photographed.  9.', '2005-01-18 04:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116059, 136425, 4967, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS!  I love the lines here!  I just wish there were either some clouds in the sky or not quite so much of it.  Maybe crop some out?  Great use of large DOF... beautiful with everything in focus... love the black and white and the contrast here.  Nicely done.</td>', 'GORGEOUS!  I love the lines here!  I just wish there were either some clouds in the sky or not quite so much of it.  Maybe crop some out?  Great use of large DOF... beautiful with everything in focus... love the black and white and the contrast here.  Nicely done.', '2005-01-18 04:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116063, 133084, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very disturbing image, and the frenetic technique you have used is perfectly suited to the title.  Which came first; the treatment or the title?  Either way ... 9.</td>', 'This is a very disturbing image, and the frenetic technique you have used is perfectly suited to the title.  Which came first; the treatment or the title?  Either way ... 9.', '2005-01-18 04:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116064, 135893, 7263, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice - shame about the lights but I know one can''t do anything about those.<br/></td>', 'This is quite nice - shame about the lights but I know one can''t do anything about those.', '2005-01-18 04:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116065, 135123, 7263, '<td valign="top">nice xposure of the snow - but needs a few stops less on the sky. Try a ND grad they are great!</td>', 'nice xposure of the snow - but needs a few stops less on the sky. Try a ND grad they are great!', '2005-01-18 04:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116067, 135464, 7263, '<td valign="top">nice and scenic, but you need an ND grad on the sky as it''s a little over done.</td>', 'nice and scenic, but you need an ND grad on the sky as it''s a little over done.', '2005-01-18 04:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116068, 136868, 7263, '<td valign="top">very sweet picture, but i think the cuting out could have been better</td>', 'very sweet picture, but i think the cuting out could have been better', '2005-01-18 04:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116069, 135057, 7263, '<td valign="top">if it wasn''t for the red noise around his right eye this would be perfect, great expression and nice BW conversion.</td>', 'if it wasn''t for the red noise around his right eye this would be perfect, great expression and nice BW conversion.', '2005-01-18 04:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116071, 135771, 7263, '<td valign="top">A poloriser here would have darkened that sky and made some needed contrast between the heads. Nice pic tho. would like to see in BW.</td>', 'A poloriser here would have darkened that sky and made some needed contrast between the heads. Nice pic tho. would like to see in BW.', '2005-01-18 04:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116072, 134600, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is the best example of use of depth of field that I''ve seen.  Of course, it has outstanding compositional and conceptual qualities as well.  And doesn''t look like it''s been processed at all, which I also like very much.  9.</td>', 'This is the best example of use of depth of field that I''ve seen.  Of course, it has outstanding compositional and conceptual qualities as well.  And doesn''t look like it''s been processed at all, which I also like very much.  9.', '2005-01-18 04:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116073, 136424, 7263, '<td valign="top">Hahah someone requested a DQ, nice. Top photo - I have seen this so many times, but am very envious of you for actually getting there and taking it. Always looks so fake.<br/> <br/>Even your exposure is spot on, nice and bright.<br/> <br/>Will be sorry if you do not win - my first 10 to you.</td>', 'Hahah someone requested a DQ, nice. Top photo - I have seen this so many times, but am very envious of you for actually getting there and taking it. Always looks so fake. Even your exposure is spot on, nice and bright. Will be sorry if you do not win - my first 10 to you.', '2005-01-18 04:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
