(1116081, 134620, 7263, '<td valign="top">Just a little bit too much going on with no clear point of focus. I think it''s where she is placed - too near the middle. Nice idea. and good exposure in bright sun.</td>', 'Just a little bit too much going on with no clear point of focus. I think it''s where she is placed - too near the middle. Nice idea. and good exposure in bright sun.', '2005-01-18 04:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
