(1116089, 136697, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very elegantly conceived and executed.  I even love the two-dimensional feel.  It would be a ribbon in Architecture, and pretty close here as well.  9.<br/> <br/>P.S.  Spotted Waldo; middle building, second row from the top.  How many challenges do you want to enter this shot in?</td>', 'This is very elegantly conceived and executed.  I even love the two-dimensional feel.  It would be a ribbon in Architecture, and pretty close here as well.  9. P.S.  Spotted Waldo; middle building, second row from the top.  How many challenges do you want to enter this shot in?', '2005-01-18 04:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116091, 134979, 7263, '<td valign="top">I hate selective desat, but man I love this. Probably the best SD I have ever seen!!<br/> <br/>Nice dodging on teh floor too, perhaps only bad point is the pure white fence, but I think it brings in a sens of fairy land which makes this work.<br/> <br/>10<br/></td>', 'I hate selective desat, but man I love this. Probably the best SD I have ever seen!! Nice dodging on teh floor too, perhaps only bad point is the pure white fence, but I think it brings in a sens of fairy land which makes this work. 10', '2005-01-18 04:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116094, 136215, 7263, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, good pose and look but think getting closer would be better.</td>', 'Nice portrait, good pose and look but think getting closer would be better.', '2005-01-18 04:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116096, 136849, 7263, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, good colors and wonderful light. Curtains I am sure were there to frame but i think better withought posibly..</td>', 'This is very nice, good colors and wonderful light. Curtains I am sure were there to frame but i think better withought posibly..', '2005-01-18 04:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116097, 134128, 7263, '<td valign="top">Not enough going on for me - needs a foreground object. Nice sky though</td>', 'Not enough going on for me - needs a foreground object. Nice sky though', '2005-01-18 04:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116098, 136550, 7263, '<td valign="top">Out fo focus no excuse :D<br/></td>', 'Out fo focus no excuse :D', '2005-01-18 04:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116099, 136673, 7263, '<td valign="top">Nice potrait with excellent BW work, but the mans face ruins it for me.</td>', 'Nice potrait with excellent BW work, but the mans face ruins it for me.', '2005-01-18 04:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116100, 134979, 30364, '<td valign="top">Visually spectacular.  Nice vanishing point composition &amp; remarkable light.  Maybe a bit too remarkable, but that''s just my personal taste; it''s still a beautiful photograph.  9.</td>', 'Visually spectacular.  Nice vanishing point composition & remarkable light.  Maybe a bit too remarkable, but that''s just my personal taste; it''s still a beautiful photograph.  9.', '2005-01-18 04:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116101, 135275, 7263, '<td valign="top">Moo! Would be nice to vertical crop the one cow. Would make this from 5 to 9</td>', 'Moo! Would be nice to vertical crop the one cow. Would make this from 5 to 9', '2005-01-18 04:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116104, 132698, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very travel book stuff - great shot. 9</td>', 'Very travel book stuff - great shot. 9', '2005-01-18 04:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116105, 134269, 7263, '<td valign="top">This isn''t my cup of tea :D Too much fuzz in the eye.</td>', 'This isn''t my cup of tea :D Too much fuzz in the eye.', '2005-01-18 04:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116106, 134993, 7263, '<td valign="top">cute, but needs focusing quite a lot.</td>', 'cute, but needs focusing quite a lot.', '2005-01-18 04:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116107, 136469, 7263, '<td valign="top">Nice effort, but whites are too bright on the right</td>', 'Nice effort, but whites are too bright on the right', '2005-01-18 04:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116108, 135811, 7263, '<td valign="top">Aw would be perfect in BW with all those tones and textures.</td>', 'Aw would be perfect in BW with all those tones and textures.', '2005-01-18 04:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116110, 135711, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very good use of WA. 10</td>', 'Very good use of WA. 10', '2005-01-18 04:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116111, 136401, 15832, '<td valign="top">Really nice textures here but it´s a pitty you can´t see the eye</td>', 'Really nice textures here but it´s a pitty you can´t see the eye', '2005-01-18 04:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116112, 132597, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very very nice composition - well thought - need more on DPC! 2 birds just finish it off perfectly. 10</td>', 'Very very nice composition - well thought - need more on DPC! 2 birds just finish it off perfectly. 10', '2005-01-18 04:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116114, 136633, 7263, '<td valign="top">Nice, but would have left this idea for a challenge where it should win - on best of 2004 not really much lasting appeal. 7</td>', 'Nice, but would have left this idea for a challenge where it should win - on best of 2004 not really much lasting appeal. 7', '2005-01-18 04:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116115, 136428, 7263, '<td valign="top">very good idea.</td>', 'very good idea.', '2005-01-18 04:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116117, 133012, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t suppose this will appeal to everyone, but I sure rate it very highly.  It has a classical artistic feel, rather like a Dutch/Belgian Old Masters painting.  Beautiful light, centred yet asymmetrical composition, and what looks to me to be flawless photographic technique.  10.</td>', 'I don''t suppose this will appeal to everyone, but I sure rate it very highly.  It has a classical artistic feel, rather like a Dutch/Belgian Old Masters painting.  Beautiful light, centred yet asymmetrical composition, and what looks to me to be flawless photographic technique.  10.', '2005-01-18 04:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116123, 135457, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nicely done :-)  I like the different bright colors going by, and the white car works nicely... something tells me you weren''t going ALL that fast though ;-) Great shot... I think I might have liked to have seen the rest of the top of the car if possible and maybe some sky... but otherwise very nice.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nicely done :-)  I like the different bright colors going by, and the white car works nicely... something tells me you weren''t going ALL that fast though ;-) Great shot... I think I might have liked to have seen the rest of the top of the car if possible and maybe some sky... but otherwise very nice.  Good luck.', '2005-01-18 05:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116125, 132255, 30364, '<td valign="top">A perfect photograph.  I have given one other 10, so I guess 10.5 is my only option here.  I couldn''t produce something like this, so it''s probably presumptuous of me to critique it, but here goes anyway.  Immaculate composition and framing; the photographer was in the right spot, to the millimeter.  Fabulous subject; like dancers at the barre ... beautiful, graceful, athletic and concentrated.  Sympathetic photographic and processing treatment.  The best of the best.  10.</td>', 'A perfect photograph.  I have given one other 10, so I guess 10.5 is my only option here.  I couldn''t produce something like this, so it''s probably presumptuous of me to critique it, but here goes anyway.  Immaculate composition and framing; the photographer was in the right spot, to the millimeter.  Fabulous subject; like dancers at the barre ... beautiful, graceful, athletic and concentrated.  Sympathetic photographic and processing treatment.  The best of the best.  10.', '2005-01-18 05:09:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1116143, 136675, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light, texture and detail. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful light, texture and detail. I like it a lot.', '2005-01-18 06:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116144, 136395, 21714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Beautiful and creative photography here. Nice one.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Beautiful and creative photography here. Nice one.', '2005-01-18 06:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116148, 136677, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice :)</td>', 'nice :)', '2005-01-18 06:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116150, 136478, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice :)</td>', 'very nice :)', '2005-01-18 06:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116151, 132698, 16241, '<td valign="top">post card, perfect cols, crisp clean, they look similar to african skimmers</td>', 'post card, perfect cols, crisp clean, they look similar to african skimmers', '2005-01-18 06:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116153, 132096, 21714, '<td valign="top">It is so complete and beautiful. I want to call this the best image on DPC, not just 2004.  I hope you think about getting this one published. This is excellent photography.</td>', 'It is so complete and beautiful. I want to call this the best image on DPC, not just 2004.  I hope you think about getting this one published. This is excellent photography.', '2005-01-18 06:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116159, 132193, 24128, '<td valign="top">I like the pic - but think it would have been better if you had removed the collar</td>', 'I like the pic - but think it would have been better if you had removed the collar', '2005-01-18 06:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116171, 132540, 29827, '<td valign="top">The boy in the centre is a very nicely isolated face and provided a nice balance to the shot, but I would have preferred for more of the photo to have been in focus as well.  Good effort!</td>', 'The boy in the centre is a very nicely isolated face and provided a nice balance to the shot, but I would have preferred for more of the photo to have been in focus as well.  Good effort!', '2005-01-18 06:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116172, 135457, 29827, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - can''t wait to find out how you did it - 9</td>', 'Excellent shot - can''t wait to find out how you did it - 9', '2005-01-18 06:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116174, 132737, 29827, '<td valign="top">Stunning scenery, but lack of focus spoils it.</td>', 'Stunning scenery, but lack of focus spoils it.', '2005-01-18 06:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116175, 136637, 29827, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharp focus, and great colours and contrast.  Could IMO have been improved by having the whole of the reflection in the frame though.</td>', 'Lovely sharp focus, and great colours and contrast.  Could IMO have been improved by having the whole of the reflection in the frame though.', '2005-01-18 06:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116176, 133744, 29827, '<td valign="top">Judicious use of desat for once!</td>', 'Judicious use of desat for once!', '2005-01-18 06:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116177, 135613, 29827, '<td valign="top">Clever framing, but seems a little underexposed.</td>', 'Clever framing, but seems a little underexposed.', '2005-01-18 06:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116178, 132247, 29827, '<td valign="top">Classic flower shot - 7</td>', 'Classic flower shot - 7', '2005-01-18 06:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116179, 136174, 29827, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Great timing, but the effect is more that he has a ball stuck to his helmet.  Impossible to capture a one off like this perfectly, but maybe a little more motion might have added to the drama.  Would have been great to see the facial reaction as well.</td>', 'Ouch!  Great timing, but the effect is more that he has a ball stuck to his helmet.  Impossible to capture a one off like this perfectly, but maybe a little more motion might have added to the drama.  Would have been great to see the facial reaction as well.', '2005-01-18 06:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116180, 136677, 29827, '<td valign="top">Like the overexposure effect, and a great expression.</td>', 'Like the overexposure effect, and a great expression.', '2005-01-18 06:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116181, 132507, 29827, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and lovely effect.  Not sure if cropping out the right would have improved it though - like the idea of not actually knowing what you are looking at.</td>', 'Great idea, and lovely effect.  Not sure if cropping out the right would have improved it though - like the idea of not actually knowing what you are looking at.', '2005-01-18 07:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116183, 134945, 29827, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but the out of focus drops at the front detract from the effect a little.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but the out of focus drops at the front detract from the effect a little.', '2005-01-18 07:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116185, 134119, 29827, '<td valign="top">A clever composition, but the blueness is too much IMO.  I would personally have preffered a more natural looking sky.</td>', 'A clever composition, but the blueness is too much IMO.  I would personally have preffered a more natural looking sky.', '2005-01-18 07:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116186, 136581, 29827, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours - very abstract.  Look forward to seeing how you did it!</td>', 'Beautiful colours - very abstract.  Look forward to seeing how you did it!', '2005-01-18 07:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116187, 134322, 29827, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but without anything in focus this will get really marked down.  A shame, as the composition and expression is well captured.</td>', 'Sorry, but without anything in focus this will get really marked down.  A shame, as the composition and expression is well captured.', '2005-01-18 07:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116188, 135771, 29827, '<td valign="top">Just looking for Team America to fly out.... :-)  Nicely framed, but may have benefitted from sunrise/sunset lighting to make the sky more interesting,</td>', 'Just looking for Team America to fly out.... :-)  Nicely framed, but may have benefitted from sunrise/sunset lighting to make the sky more interesting,', '2005-01-18 07:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116190, 132531, 29827, '<td valign="top">Wow - great timing to capture this.  Seeing the facial expression would have given it something more IMO.</td>', 'Wow - great timing to capture this.  Seeing the facial expression would have given it something more IMO.', '2005-01-18 07:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116191, 134402, 29827, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, good focus on the eyes.  In a perfect world, a little more DoF to sharpen the wings would have made it perfect!</td>', 'Lovely shot, good focus on the eyes.  In a perfect world, a little more DoF to sharpen the wings would have made it perfect!', '2005-01-18 07:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116193, 132082, 29827, '<td valign="top">Wow - greedy bird!  Great timing and nicely framed - 8</td>', 'Wow - greedy bird!  Great timing and nicely framed - 8', '2005-01-18 07:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116195, 134396, 29827, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours.  The framing is excellent in that it leads your eye across the bridge - 8</td>', 'Amazing colours.  The framing is excellent in that it leads your eye across the bridge - 8', '2005-01-18 07:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116199, 133926, 29827, '<td valign="top">Really good mood in this photo.  Be interested to see what it was like in B&amp;W. 8</td>', 'Really good mood in this photo.  Be interested to see what it was like in B&W. 8', '2005-01-18 07:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116200, 133176, 29827, '<td valign="top">Yet another that has me scratching my head asking how this was done.  Frame effect works really well too. 8</td>', 'Yet another that has me scratching my head asking how this was done.  Frame effect works really well too. 8', '2005-01-18 07:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116201, 132733, 29827, '<td valign="top">SERIOUS macro shot - great sharpness on the whole insect.  Looks like he''s wearing shades!  8</td>', 'SERIOUS macro shot - great sharpness on the whole insect.  Looks like he''s wearing shades!  8', '2005-01-18 07:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116203, 134342, 29827, '<td valign="top">Jeez!  Not a pleasant photo to look at, but very provocative and emotional.  Hope it ended ok for the wee fella. 8</td>', 'Jeez!  Not a pleasant photo to look at, but very provocative and emotional.  Hope it ended ok for the wee fella. 8', '2005-01-18 07:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116205, 134993, 27605, '<td valign="top">Some much to like about this photo, most of all Isabella.  ....9....</td>', 'Some much to like about this photo, most of all Isabella.  ....9....', '2005-01-18 07:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116206, 136689, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait with captivating eyes. The DOF is great and everything is spot on. This deserves a 10 for sheer technical brilliance. Great job.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait with captivating eyes. The DOF is great and everything is spot on. This deserves a 10 for sheer technical brilliance. Great job.', '2005-01-18 07:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116208, 132763, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice family Christmas shot! Great expressions, and the Santa hat adds a bit of interest.....6....</td>', 'Very nice family Christmas shot! Great expressions, and the Santa hat adds a bit of interest.....6....', '2005-01-18 07:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116209, 133969, 27605, '<td valign="top">Menacing!  Looks like he has just shed his skin.  Photo seems a bit overexposed or overprocessed to me, composition could be improved</td>', 'Menacing!  Looks like he has just shed his skin.  Photo seems a bit overexposed or overprocessed to me, composition could be improved', '2005-01-18 07:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116211, 136501, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nostalgic, but limited interest to the outside viewer IMO.</td>', 'Nostalgic, but limited interest to the outside viewer IMO.', '2005-01-18 07:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116212, 133758, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very nice.....8....</td>', 'Very nice.....8....', '2005-01-18 07:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116215, 133230, 26930, '<td valign="top">Pétur?<br/> <br/>Flott mynd!</td>', 'Pétur? Flott mynd!', '2005-01-18 07:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116219, 132136, 9565, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''ve never seen anything like that. I''m not sure I would want to.</td>', 'Wow! I''ve never seen anything like that. I''m not sure I would want to.', '2005-01-18 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116246, 136674, 23251, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Stunning clarity and colour. If I was to be nit picky I would only say there are some very dark areas but I think they actually help.  Well done. Bumping up from holding number.</td>', 'Returning for comment.Stunning clarity and colour. If I was to be nit picky I would only say there are some very dark areas but I think they actually help.  Well done. Bumping up from holding number.', '2005-01-18 08:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116247, 136709, 14671, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo but the foreground (wood) is more clear then the frog.  I also find the background very distracting.  It looks like its a mirror or something similr but with a shallow DOF  blurred.  Nice try and keep up the good work.</td>', 'An interesting photo but the foreground (wood) is more clear then the frog.  I also find the background very distracting.  It looks like its a mirror or something similr but with a shallow DOF  blurred.  Nice try and keep up the good work.', '2005-01-18 08:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116248, 136345, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful looking place.  A little more foreground (rocks) would have moved the horizon line up a bit.  The horizon is a little too centered I think. 6</td>', 'Beautiful looking place.  A little more foreground (rocks) would have moved the horizon line up a bit.  The horizon is a little too centered I think. 6', '2005-01-18 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116251, 136821, 30049, '<td valign="top">Just add a fishing pole and you''re good to go!  :-)</td>', 'Just add a fishing pole and you''re good to go!  :-)', '2005-01-18 08:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116253, 136119, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the haze takes away to much from the picture.  Perhaps doing selective desaturation on this photo would have made it score more where only the reds stood out and the rest B&amp;W.  I would be interested in seeing it done this way if you ever do decide to do it.</td>', 'Nice shot but the haze takes away to much from the picture.  Perhaps doing selective desaturation on this photo would have made it score more where only the reds stood out and the rest B&W.  I would be interested in seeing it done this way if you ever do decide to do it.', '2005-01-18 08:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116254, 136414, 14671, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful photo.  Lots of vibrant colors, clarity and contrast. well done.  This would make an excellent poster or calender shot. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A very beautiful photo.  Lots of vibrant colors, clarity and contrast. well done.  This would make an excellent poster or calender shot. <8>', '2005-01-18 08:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116255, 136593, 30049, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Hope this one is mounted on the wall - in a frame.  ;^) 10</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Hope this one is mounted on the wall - in a frame.  ;^) 10', '2005-01-18 08:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116256, 136759, 14671, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  Its like your looking at the bird and waiting for it to take it''s next wing flap? or movement.  Nice to see a shot that you can get lost in and just the mind wonder.  Well done.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Amazing.  Its like your looking at the bird and waiting for it to take it''s next wing flap? or movement.  Nice to see a shot that you can get lost in and just the mind wonder.  Well done.  <9>', '2005-01-18 08:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116260, 132361, 30049, '<td valign="top">How ever did you convince that bug to sit still?!  :^)  9</td>', 'How ever did you convince that bug to sit still?!  :^)  9', '2005-01-18 08:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116262, 136459, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I wanna know why this guys was being attacked by a gull?  The colors look a little bland but the looks like the time of year the photo was taken.  Excellent clarity and sharpness.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I wanna know why this guys was being attacked by a gull?  The colors look a little bland but the looks like the time of year the photo was taken.  Excellent clarity and sharpness.', '2005-01-18 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116263, 136550, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but very blurry.  The flower wouldn''t have been so blurry if the DOF wasn''t so shallow but a rather nice shot.  Kepp up the good work.</td>', 'Nice shot but very blurry.  The flower wouldn''t have been so blurry if the DOF wasn''t so shallow but a rather nice shot.  Kepp up the good work.', '2005-01-18 08:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116264, 132158, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but very dark.  Perhaps a little more brightness would have have put more feeling to this photo.  Well done and keep up the good work. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice photo but very dark.  Perhaps a little more brightness would have have put more feeling to this photo.  Well done and keep up the good work. <7>', '2005-01-18 08:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116266, 133137, 23251, '<td valign="top">Well its not often I guess the photog but this would have to be grigrigirl.  If not then congrats because she is a very good photog. Great composition, very suggestive pose, I would have liked to see the face a little more in focus.  Very nice image. Congrats.  Mmmm this could also be Simon?  Natator!</td>', 'Well its not often I guess the photog but this would have to be grigrigirl.  If not then congrats because she is a very good photog. Great composition, very suggestive pose, I would have liked to see the face a little more in focus.  Very nice image. Congrats.  Mmmm this could also be Simon?  Natator!', '2005-01-18 08:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116267, 132757, 14671, '<td valign="top">Altho it is a fairly nice photo it does nothing for me.  I find it very simplistic and lacking subject.  I do like the DOF chosen in this photo and the way it looks like an advertisment shot.  Great clarity, color and contrast  &lt;8&gt;.</td>', 'Altho it is a fairly nice photo it does nothing for me.  I find it very simplistic and lacking subject.  I do like the DOF chosen in this photo and the way it looks like an advertisment shot.  Great clarity, color and contrast  <8>.', '2005-01-18 08:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116269, 135034, 23251, '<td valign="top">A wonderfull image spoilt IMHO by the desat,  maybe if it was also desaturated to about 30% but it is to outstanding for me.</td>', 'A wonderfull image spoilt IMHO by the desat,  maybe if it was also desaturated to about 30% but it is to outstanding for me.', '2005-01-18 08:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116270, 132735, 14671, '<td valign="top">I was planning to shoot the falls very soon.  Its either a double exposure or your time delay was a little to long.  It left some kind of blur in the moon and I find it very distract.  Cleaning the moon up would have improved this shot a lot.  Well done.  Keep up the good work.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'I was planning to shoot the falls very soon.  Its either a double exposure or your time delay was a little to long.  It left some kind of blur in the moon and I find it very distract.  Cleaning the moon up would have improved this shot a lot.  Well done.  Keep up the good work.  <9>', '2005-01-18 08:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116271, 132858, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the way the (gazelles?) in the background aren''t bothered by the zebra action at all.</td>', 'I love the way the (gazelles?) in the background aren''t bothered by the zebra action at all.', '2005-01-18 08:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
