(1116493, 135275, 2310, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the bovine and a nice direct look.  I think I would like to crop out the other cow altogether as it is a little distracting from the main subject.  I might also boost the contrast a little bit to set the subject off of the background a little more...</td>', 'Great expression on the bovine and a nice direct look.  I think I would like to crop out the other cow altogether as it is a little distracting from the main subject.  I might also boost the contrast a little bit to set the subject off of the background a little more...', '2005-01-18 10:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116495, 136596, 2310, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the subject is excellent as is capturing the moment but I find the cropping and the background to be a little less than ideal...I would like to see the entire head and a less distracting background...</td>', 'The lighting on the subject is excellent as is capturing the moment but I find the cropping and the background to be a little less than ideal...I would like to see the entire head and a less distracting background...', '2005-01-18 10:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
