(1116514, 135918, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame this subject (Bee) is so centered.  Have plenty of room to compose this a bit differntly... 6</td>', 'It''s a shame this subject (Bee) is so centered.  Have plenty of room to compose this a bit differntly... 6', '2005-01-18 10:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116516, 133252, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great shot, especially the darkness in it.  This reminds me of images I have seen of the ecological disater created in the Black Sea of Russia because of a poorly conceived irrigation project during the communist rule there. It is dark and brooding and might even have been better as a black and White.  No matter, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great shot, especially the darkness in it.  This reminds me of images I have seen of the ecological disater created in the Black Sea of Russia because of a poorly conceived irrigation project during the communist rule there. It is dark and brooding and might even have been better as a black and White.  No matter, I like it a lot.', '2005-01-18 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116518, 132264, 30392, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2005-01-18 10:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116519, 136856, 29827, '<td valign="top">Some of the most spectular scenery in the world, and yet it still lacks impact in this photo.  I had the same problem myself visiting the valley on a gorgeous summers day - high contrast, pure blue sky and lack of specific interest.  Sunrise, sunset, storm onset - these would really have changed the mood significantly and helped make that dramatic scenery so much more exciting.  Maybe in B&amp;W?</td>', 'Some of the most spectular scenery in the world, and yet it still lacks impact in this photo.  I had the same problem myself visiting the valley on a gorgeous summers day - high contrast, pure blue sky and lack of specific interest.  Sunrise, sunset, storm onset - these would really have changed the mood significantly and helped make that dramatic scenery so much more exciting.  Maybe in B&W?', '2005-01-18 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116520, 134860, 29827, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, can''t quite see what you are trying for here - too soft and overexposed, although I suspect that is what you were looking for.  Different lighting needed somehow.</td>', 'I''m sorry, can''t quite see what you are trying for here - too soft and overexposed, although I suspect that is what you were looking for.  Different lighting needed somehow.', '2005-01-18 10:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116526, 136818, 7263, '<td valign="top">ouch - needs a little focusing. Choice of subject not very aesthetic.</td>', 'ouch - needs a little focusing. Choice of subject not very aesthetic.', '2005-01-18 11:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116527, 136728, 30049, '<td valign="top">I would imagine this same location could yield some very interesting photo opp''s at dusk or dawn?</td>', 'I would imagine this same location could yield some very interesting photo opp''s at dusk or dawn?', '2005-01-18 11:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116528, 134025, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting 90 rotation.</td>', 'Interesting 90 rotation.', '2005-01-18 11:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116530, 132990, 2610, '<td valign="top">A funny candid but a great name!</td>', 'A funny candid but a great name!', '2005-01-18 11:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116533, 133346, 16844, '<td valign="top">I like that.  Nice to see someone stop-action falling water for a change rather that artificially blurring it.</td>', 'I like that.  Nice to see someone stop-action falling water for a change rather that artificially blurring it.', '2005-01-18 11:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116536, 135921, 7263, '<td valign="top">Man quite an ugly flower eh :D<br/> <br/>After your PM, here is a critique.<br/> <br/>People will look at this and say it''s ugly, because, well it is an ugly plant. Nothing wrong with that, and you have done nothing wrong by shooting it. But with over 500 images just in this challenge to critique and comment on, that is the first thing people will say when they see it.<br/> <br/>The same way that on baby shots people will say ''cute''.<br/> <br/>As for the photo, it''s technically OK, well exposed in most areas - is a little soft to be honest but that is only minimal.<br/> <br/>Composition isn''t great, just a plan near center. I think had you gotten closer to the messy parts (sap?) you may score better as this could hold some detail. Or you could have shot it from below to give it a little sens of drama.<br/></td>', 'Man quite an ugly flower eh :D After your PM, here is a critique. People will look at this and say it''s ugly, because, well it is an ugly plant. Nothing wrong with that, and you have done nothing wrong by shooting it. But with over 500 images just in this challenge to critique and comment on, that is the first thing people will say when they see it. The same way that on baby shots people will say ''cute''. As for the photo, it''s technically OK, well exposed in most areas - is a little soft to be honest but that is only minimal. Composition isn''t great, just a plan near center. I think had you gotten closer to the messy parts (sap?) you may score better as this could hold some detail. Or you could have shot it from below to give it a little sens of drama.', '2005-01-18 11:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116540, 136424, 2741, '<td valign="top">I have been here once. Crazy place to sit and take the sun. ;)</td>', 'I have been here once. Crazy place to sit and take the sun. ;)', '2005-01-18 11:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116548, 136205, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ahhh!  tell me that isn''t a gun the young man is holding.  Shot gun wedding?!   BOL  neat capture.  Somewhat over exposed though.</td>', 'Ahhh!  tell me that isn''t a gun the young man is holding.  Shot gun wedding?!   BOL  neat capture.  Somewhat over exposed though.', '2005-01-18 11:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
