(1116646, 133890, 2310, '<td valign="top">Nice drama in this picture.  I think there would be more impact if you cropped the picture so that the horizon line is about a third of the way up from the bottom of the picture.  This will bring more focus to the town and the impending storm and remove the unneccessary empty and distracting water space.</td>', 'Nice drama in this picture.  I think there would be more impact if you cropped the picture so that the horizon line is about a third of the way up from the bottom of the picture.  This will bring more focus to the town and the impending storm and remove the unneccessary empty and distracting water space.', '2005-01-18 12:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
