(1116729, 134023, 4967, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder whether you intentionally blew out the brides'' dress or not... if so I''m not sure I would agree... it looks lik there is a lot of beautiful details that one would want to see.  I love the smoke here, it''s certainly "dreamy" what bothers me is the fact that the bride looks like her eyes are closed, and possibly the groom does as well?  they look like they should be gazing into each other''s eyes, but not quite... I wouldn''t mind her eyes being closed, if she maybe had her head on his shoulder it would have worked.  Nice photo though.</td>', 'I have to wonder whether you intentionally blew out the brides'' dress or not... if so I''m not sure I would agree... it looks lik there is a lot of beautiful details that one would want to see.  I love the smoke here, it''s certainly "dreamy" what bothers me is the fact that the bride looks like her eyes are closed, and possibly the groom does as well?  they look like they should be gazing into each other''s eyes, but not quite... I wouldn''t mind her eyes being closed, if she maybe had her head on his shoulder it would have worked.  Nice photo though.', '2005-01-18 12:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1116735, 133137, 4967, '<td valign="top">Sexy, artsy, and demure.  I like it a lot.  Definitely gives you some intrigue here... without being raunchy.  I love the angle.  I have to say her tattoo(?) on her wrist bothers me... NIce choice doing this in black and white.  -10-</td>', 'Sexy, artsy, and demure.  I like it a lot.  Definitely gives you some intrigue here... without being raunchy.  I love the angle.  I have to say her tattoo(?) on her wrist bothers me... NIce choice doing this in black and white.  -10-', '2005-01-18 12:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
