(1117162, 136222, 2310, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!  It reminds me of a Salvador Dali painting...very creative use of reflection!</td>', 'This is so cool!  It reminds me of a Salvador Dali painting...very creative use of reflection!', '2005-01-18 15:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
