(1117295, 136435, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hi Matt<br/>No problem in my providing feedback, this is one of the nicer children pics entered into this challenge IMHO. I gave it a 7 though I mentally put it at about 7.5!<br/>I like the composition well, though I think you could do with a touch more image at the left and a touch left at the right. He feels too far to the left to me. I love the very low viewpoint; it really takes us into his world. The total concentration is a feeling we have all experienced and the freedom to be so absorbed in leisure, in the way that young children often are, is something we all still hanker after. That''s what makes this a universal image for me rather than a boring shot of someone''s kid. I like your choice to present the image in toned black and white ; it adds a timeless quality. I also like the out of focus crowd far behind, the pretty clouds in the sky and the lovely texture of the sand in the foreground. Altogether a lovely image and grows on me the more I view it.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Hi MattNo problem in my providing feedback, this is one of the nicer children pics entered into this challenge IMHO. I gave it a 7 though I mentally put it at about 7.5!I like the composition well, though I think you could do with a touch more image at the left and a touch left at the right. He feels too far to the left to me. I love the very low viewpoint; it really takes us into his world. The total concentration is a feeling we have all experienced and the freedom to be so absorbed in leisure, in the way that young children often are, is something we all still hanker after. That''s what makes this a universal image for me rather than a boring shot of someone''s kid. I like your choice to present the image in toned black and white ; it adds a timeless quality. I also like the out of focus crowd far behind, the pretty clouds in the sky and the lovely texture of the sand in the foreground. Altogether a lovely image and grows on me the more I view it.Kavey', '2005-01-18 17:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117297, 135188, 32111, '<td valign="top">Great job getting the exposure right.</td>', 'Great job getting the exposure right.', '2005-01-18 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117305, 135490, 7908, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily, this would create competition between subjects (bench and bridge), but I think you overcame that with the color tying them effectively ... nice. If only the bridge could be  closer :)</td>', 'Ordinarily, this would create competition between subjects (bench and bridge), but I think you overcame that with the color tying them effectively ... nice. If only the bridge could be  closer :)', '2005-01-18 17:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117310, 132289, 4767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-01-18 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117313, 136414, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great color saturation. This shot really jumps out.</td>', 'Great color saturation. This shot really jumps out.', '2005-01-18 17:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117316, 132365, 32257, '<td valign="top">pretty 4<br/></td>', 'pretty 4', '2005-01-18 17:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117324, 133889, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for textures and I particularly like the contrast between the rigid, repetitive feather and the worn and faded surface beneath. The composition, with the two sweeping lines of feather quill and edge, is punctuated perfectly by the water droplet. Yellow is also one of my favourite colours. Altogether a beautiful shot. 9</td>', 'I''m a sucker for textures and I particularly like the contrast between the rigid, repetitive feather and the worn and faded surface beneath. The composition, with the two sweeping lines of feather quill and edge, is punctuated perfectly by the water droplet. Yellow is also one of my favourite colours. Altogether a beautiful shot. 9', '2005-01-18 17:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117325, 136452, 8522, '<td valign="top">Border is way too distracting here.</td>', 'Border is way too distracting here.', '2005-01-18 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117326, 132693, 3087, '<td valign="top">The lady bird looks like an item of jewellery. The guilding is perfectly clear and the tiny reflections of light in the legs and underbody add just the right touch of detail. The composition is very unusual and the shallow DOF changes this from the more standard macro image to a much more artistic one. Very nice shallow DOF and particularly love the gradiated colours of the background. 9</td>', 'The lady bird looks like an item of jewellery. The guilding is perfectly clear and the tiny reflections of light in the legs and underbody add just the right touch of detail. The composition is very unusual and the shallow DOF changes this from the more standard macro image to a much more artistic one. Very nice shallow DOF and particularly love the gradiated colours of the background. 9', '2005-01-18 17:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117329, 136685, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, gorgeous light. Have to take off a point though for the overbearing uneven border, which has resulted in a much smaller sized photo. 9</td>', 'Wow, gorgeous light. Have to take off a point though for the overbearing uneven border, which has resulted in a much smaller sized photo. 9', '2005-01-18 17:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117331, 133415, 8522, '<td valign="top">Much to feast the eyes on here. Gorgeous shade of blue. 10</td>', 'Much to feast the eyes on here. Gorgeous shade of blue. 10', '2005-01-18 17:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117333, 135565, 8522, '<td valign="top">Incredible assortment of colours and textures. Very effective composition.</td>', 'Incredible assortment of colours and textures. Very effective composition.', '2005-01-18 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117334, 136597, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wish it was sharper. Lovely sky and textures. 8</td>', 'Wish it was sharper. Lovely sky and textures. 8', '2005-01-18 17:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117355, 134160, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, completely over-the-top and unnecessary border. I want to enjoy the photo, not have my eyes wrestled away by brute force.</td>', 'Nice photo, completely over-the-top and unnecessary border. I want to enjoy the photo, not have my eyes wrestled away by brute force.', '2005-01-18 17:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
