(1117411, 136444, 4517, '<td valign="top">I can read the expression on her face. You captured a perfect moment, but may be lost to fast voters.9</td>', 'I can read the expression on her face. You captured a perfect moment, but may be lost to fast voters.9', '2005-01-18 18:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117419, 135345, 30818, '<td valign="top">awesome! 9</td>', 'awesome! 9', '2005-01-18 18:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117443, 136441, 23478, '<td valign="top">One word... WOW!  (Oppps, that''s three words, wait now that''s....never mind).  10.</td>', 'One word... WOW!  (Oppps, that''s three words, wait now that''s....never mind).  10.', '2005-01-18 18:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117446, 134065, 16488, '<td valign="top">Superb!  There''s so many nice things to say about this!  Depth of field--right on!  Motion blur on that little leg taking its next step!  Colors--so crisp and realistic!  And look at the skin on that baby!  No question, one of the best characterizations of a young child I''ve ever seen.<br/> <br/>Ok...have a few more: !!!!!!!</td>', 'Superb!  There''s so many nice things to say about this!  Depth of field--right on!  Motion blur on that little leg taking its next step!  Colors--so crisp and realistic!  And look at the skin on that baby!  No question, one of the best characterizations of a young child I''ve ever seen. Ok...have a few more: !!!!!!!', '2005-01-18 18:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117447, 133058, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2005-01-18 18:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117451, 136596, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait of a woman!  I feel as though I''m sitting with her conversing.  There''s just enough of her environment to know she is in her own space--at least it feels that way.  The color of her skin is just beautiful--what a wonderfully young old woman!</td>', 'Lovely portrait of a woman!  I feel as though I''m sitting with her conversing.  There''s just enough of her environment to know she is in her own space--at least it feels that way.  The color of her skin is just beautiful--what a wonderfully young old woman!', '2005-01-18 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117457, 132185, 16488, '<td valign="top">Simply a beautiful abstraction of these zebras!  Just enough to know what it is (even which way their facing) and yet just too little to say "Oh look, zebras".....<br/> <br/>(I think you should name the one in from Seven-hundred-ten for the markings to the right.)<br/> <br/>Good luck with your Best of ''04!</td>', 'Simply a beautiful abstraction of these zebras!  Just enough to know what it is (even which way their facing) and yet just too little to say "Oh look, zebras"..... (I think you should name the one in from Seven-hundred-ten for the markings to the right.) Good luck with your Best of ''04!', '2005-01-18 18:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117463, 136769, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh! (I can say that now that I''ve learned a new word.)<br/> <br/>These are beautiful animals caught at a wonderful time.  I''d only suggest that some of the dark area on the right could be cloned out--it doesn''t add much for me, and tends to pull the eye away from your truly fascinating subject.</td>', 'Nice bokeh! (I can say that now that I''ve learned a new word.) These are beautiful animals caught at a wonderful time.  I''d only suggest that some of the dark area on the right could be cloned out--it doesn''t add much for me, and tends to pull the eye away from your truly fascinating subject.', '2005-01-18 18:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117470, 133926, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely bands of color!  I like this very much and think it is aptly titled.  Only quibble I''ll make is with the positioning of the foam--it disects the head of your subject.  Perhaps if you''d taken another frame a second or so later....</td>', 'Lovely bands of color!  I like this very much and think it is aptly titled.  Only quibble I''ll make is with the positioning of the foam--it disects the head of your subject.  Perhaps if you''d taken another frame a second or so later....', '2005-01-18 18:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117476, 136863, 19982, '<td valign="top">As in photos of people...   most animals are more captivating when you can see their eyes.   A view from the front would, in my opinion, be a stronger image.  The other thing that makes this one hard to look at is the proximity of the bird to the horizon.  It confuses the eye a bit as they merge.  There is also something on the far left that keeps begging me to look at it.  It would be better to simply crop things like that out of the picture.  Other than that ... I do like that you placed the bird on the thirds line.  And the colors really look good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'As in photos of people...   most animals are more captivating when you can see their eyes.   A view from the front would, in my opinion, be a stronger image.  The other thing that makes this one hard to look at is the proximity of the bird to the horizon.  It confuses the eye a bit as they merge.  There is also something on the far left that keeps begging me to look at it.  It would be better to simply crop things like that out of the picture.  Other than that ... I do like that you placed the bird on the thirds line.  And the colors really look good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-01-18 18:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117479, 133716, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-01-18 18:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117485, 132082, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-18 18:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117492, 134561, 1827, '<td valign="top">His cousin lives at my house: //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=116271</td>', 'His cousin lives at my house: //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=116271', '2005-01-18 19:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117494, 132458, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love it!  It could be a tad sharper along the sides of the mountain, but I love the overall look and feel of this image.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love it!  It could be a tad sharper along the sides of the mountain, but I love the overall look and feel of this image.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-18 19:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117504, 135427, 1827, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and lovely photo.  Unfortunately the treatment (Neat Image I''m guessing) removes too much facial detail and makes the photo less appealing.</td>', 'Beautiful girl and lovely photo.  Unfortunately the treatment (Neat Image I''m guessing) removes too much facial detail and makes the photo less appealing.', '2005-01-18 19:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117505, 133058, 19982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'A beautiful image.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-18 19:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
