(1117519, 134065, 19982, '<td valign="top">I, personally, would prefer to see the face.  The eyes speak a thousand words...</td>', 'I, personally, would prefer to see the face.  The eyes speak a thousand words...', '2005-01-18 19:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117521, 135427, 19982, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image.  And a lovely daughter too.  Congratulations!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'What a beautiful image.  And a lovely daughter too.  Congratulations!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-18 19:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117525, 134639, 1827, '<td valign="top">While I like the clarity and framing, I feel like I''m looking through a peephole at him.  Lens distortion?  Could be purposeful, but if so I feel the title could better enhance the idea.  If accidental, a different lens perhaps?</td>', 'While I like the clarity and framing, I feel like I''m looking through a peephole at him.  Lens distortion?  Could be purposeful, but if so I feel the title could better enhance the idea.  If accidental, a different lens perhaps?', '2005-01-18 19:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117534, 136648, 16958, '<td valign="top">heh ... I knew you wouldn''t listen. <br/> <br/>great photo</td>', 'heh ... I knew you wouldn''t listen.  great photo', '2005-01-18 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117540, 136815, 1827, '<td valign="top">The model is breathtaking.  The framing is A+.  Two things that bother me: 1) the shoulder seems almost as big as the face.  For this reason, I think I''d like it cropped square from the top, still showing the shoulder and the peeking over it, but less so.  2) The skin around the mouth and eyes has some strange artifacting.  It''s present in the hair too, but not distracting there.  I''m not sure hwat it is or how to fix it. Despite these items, great shot. 8</td>', 'The model is breathtaking.  The framing is A+.  Two things that bother me: 1) the shoulder seems almost as big as the face.  For this reason, I think I''d like it cropped square from the top, still showing the shoulder and the peeking over it, but less so.  2) The skin around the mouth and eyes has some strange artifacting.  It''s present in the hair too, but not distracting there.  I''m not sure hwat it is or how to fix it. Despite these items, great shot. 8', '2005-01-18 19:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117541, 136381, 13610, '<td valign="top">good concept.</td>', 'good concept.', '2005-01-18 19:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117543, 134214, 1827, '<td valign="top">Exceptional moment to have captures.  It''s a wonder he didn''t notice you with the camera.  7</td>', 'Exceptional moment to have captures.  It''s a wonder he didn''t notice you with the camera.  7', '2005-01-18 19:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117549, 135164, 1827, '<td valign="top">Yes, she has beautiful eyes.  This could be a very nice photo, but IMO, it suffers from poor post processing.  The skin has become plastic from Neat Image, and the hair looks like straw from oversharpening.  I would start over with the original.  I think there is potential in this shot.</td>', 'Yes, she has beautiful eyes.  This could be a very nice photo, but IMO, it suffers from poor post processing.  The skin has become plastic from Neat Image, and the hair looks like straw from oversharpening.  I would start over with the original.  I think there is potential in this shot.', '2005-01-18 19:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117552, 134513, 25884, '<td valign="top">this might just be me but this pic. looks a little pixely.... 5</td>', 'this might just be me but this pic. looks a little pixely.... 5', '2005-01-18 19:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117553, 136871, 25884, '<td valign="top">i like this except the eyes are freekin me out..</td>', 'i like this except the eyes are freekin me out..', '2005-01-18 19:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117554, 136718, 20941, '<td valign="top">was going to comment after voting, alot of great entries, but can''t wait on this one...SPECTACLUR SHOT in every way. I think I''m almost done first pass at voting won''t have to go back to bump this one up...10. Really stands out for me. Best of luck!</td>', 'was going to comment after voting, alot of great entries, but can''t wait on this one...SPECTACLUR SHOT in every way. I think I''m almost done first pass at voting won''t have to go back to bump this one up...10. Really stands out for me. Best of luck!', '2005-01-18 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
