(1117565, 136648, 13602, '<td valign="top">Really nice but if I were you I would of cut from the top a bit, too much uninteresting space there.  I would cut it to a 4x3 ratio that IMHO would improove the impact alot. Other than that verry good i like it, good luck!</td>', 'Really nice but if I were you I would of cut from the top a bit, too much uninteresting space there.  I would cut it to a 4x3 ratio that IMHO would improove the impact alot. Other than that verry good i like it, good luck!', '2005-01-18 19:33:57.000000', NULL, 1);
