(1117685, 135613, 6999, '<td valign="top">The classically staggering, yet bleak landscape, with it''s extraordinary frame of the most humdrum brick, yet coupled with a strange sense of perspecive distortion to hwta we know should be a flat wall makes this image throw away presumptions on three levels. Yet somwhow it fails to move me particularly. I wonder if that odd sense of distortion on the wall, doesn''t actually work <i>against</i> the simple weirdness of the scene itself, and draw the mind away from that very simple contrast and it''s effect.</td>', 'The classically staggering, yet bleak landscape, with it''s extraordinary frame of the most humdrum brick, yet coupled with a strange sense of perspecive distortion to hwta we know should be a flat wall makes this image throw away presumptions on three levels. Yet somwhow it fails to move me particularly. I wonder if that odd sense of distortion on the wall, doesn''t actually work against the simple weirdness of the scene itself, and draw the mind away from that very simple contrast and it''s effect.', '2005-01-18 20:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117686, 136837, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is really too dark and doesn''t do justice to the kitty''s beautiful colors and fur patterns.  Also, I think it would be much improved if the eyes were in sharper focus and brighter.</td>', 'This is really too dark and doesn''t do justice to the kitty''s beautiful colors and fur patterns.  Also, I think it would be much improved if the eyes were in sharper focus and brighter.', '2005-01-18 20:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
