(1117707, 132193, 22046, '<td valign="top">Without his collar I''d think he was a white wolf... an elegant and beautiful animal. Good portrait.</td>', 'Without his collar I''d think he was a white wolf... an elegant and beautiful animal. Good portrait.', '2005-01-18 21:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117708, 132176, 6999, '<td valign="top">There are strong elements of a classic stock image here - the boats on still water is an image I think we have all seen on occasions and to that extent part of our mental furniture - and that places particularly high standards for such a shot tot meet: after all, you''re competeing with images in people''s memories, rather than referencible images. This, I think, misses the absolutel simplicity - that branch, the perfect organisation of composition that half hidden boat, their organisation across frame, and lacks drama in the background - which you have nevertheless included. I wonder if perhaps a more powerful image might have been found <i>within</i> this scene, rather than in the entirety of it? The boat with the superstructure and it''s neighbour look promising ... but it certainly has potential. Have you tried simply cropping out the boats to the right? It would, i think, be much stronger compositionally. Just some thoughts.</td>', 'There are strong elements of a classic stock image here - the boats on still water is an image I think we have all seen on occasions and to that extent part of our mental furniture - and that places particularly high standards for such a shot tot meet: after all, you''re competeing with images in people''s memories, rather than referencible images. This, I think, misses the absolutel simplicity - that branch, the perfect organisation of composition that half hidden boat, their organisation across frame, and lacks drama in the background - which you have nevertheless included. I wonder if perhaps a more powerful image might have been found within this scene, rather than in the entirety of it? The boat with the superstructure and it''s neighbour look promising ... but it certainly has potential. Have you tried simply cropping out the boats to the right? It would, i think, be much stronger compositionally. Just some thoughts.', '2005-01-18 21:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117709, 135275, 22046, '<td valign="top">This one makes me laught, not sure why, but it does. Maybe it''s her expression. Anyhow I love it.</td>', 'This one makes me laught, not sure why, but it does. Maybe it''s her expression. Anyhow I love it.', '2005-01-18 21:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117711, 134979, 17103, '<td valign="top">Very nice low perspective, and amazing exposure!  Must have been quite difficult with the white, bright fence and the dark earth and grasses.  And the sky lit up on the right but so dark on the right..... I don''t know what your post-processing has been in terms of exposure, and also if there''s selective desaturation?  In any event, it''s a masterful job - 9.</td>', 'Very nice low perspective, and amazing exposure!  Must have been quite difficult with the white, bright fence and the dark earth and grasses.  And the sky lit up on the right but so dark on the right..... I don''t know what your post-processing has been in terms of exposure, and also if there''s selective desaturation?  In any event, it''s a masterful job - 9.', '2005-01-18 21:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1117714, 136769, 17103, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve seen a butterfly pic I''ve liked more -- wonderful job!</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve seen a butterfly pic I''ve liked more -- wonderful job!', '2005-01-18 21:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
