(1119763, 136593, 26756, '<td valign="top">Simple but very well executed.  Great framing and light.</td>', 'Simple but very well executed.  Great framing and light.', '2005-01-19 17:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119769, 136847, 4767, '<td valign="top">A captivating image!  Interesting dichotomy between the gorgeous water, the foam, the sky (with those great clouds) and the "windows".  Maybe it''s aquadra-chotomy, since there are four elements here.</td>', 'A captivating image!  Interesting dichotomy between the gorgeous water, the foam, the sky (with those great clouds) and the "windows".  Maybe it''s aquadra-chotomy, since there are four elements here.', '2005-01-19 17:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119774, 136446, 26756, '<td valign="top">Perfect toning and light for this subject.  Very well done.</td>', 'Perfect toning and light for this subject.  Very well done.', '2005-01-19 17:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119780, 136204, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!   I HAVE to try that sometime.   This is absolutely beautiful!</td>', 'Wow!   I HAVE to try that sometime.   This is absolutely beautiful!', '2005-01-19 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119782, 136591, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great!      I''ve never seen an actual photograph of a red panda bear.   I LOVE it.   I love the composition, and the focus is so great!   Good luck with this one.   I think it should be way up there at the top!</td>', 'This is great!      I''ve never seen an actual photograph of a red panda bear.   I LOVE it.   I love the composition, and the focus is so great!   Good luck with this one.   I think it should be way up there at the top!', '2005-01-19 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119785, 132264, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very crisp with a really beautiful subject.  Interesting shape, lines and a great supporting landscape.  Good job.</td>', 'Very crisp with a really beautiful subject.  Interesting shape, lines and a great supporting landscape.  Good job.', '2005-01-19 17:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119801, 136329, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh what an amazing picture!   It looks like one of those vintage Norman Rockwell pictures!  I LOVE IT!!!!!    Good luck!   I hope this one scores way, way, WAY at the top!!!   I''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'Oh what an amazing picture!   It looks like one of those vintage Norman Rockwell pictures!  I LOVE IT!!!!!    Good luck!   I hope this one scores way, way, WAY at the top!!!   I''m giving it a 10.', '2005-01-19 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119805, 132131, 32111, '<td valign="top">A classic shot.</td>', 'A classic shot.', '2005-01-19 17:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119818, 132289, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh what an amazing picture!   You have so creatively and beautifully photographed this  special time in a lady''s life.   I know the model will treasure this picture forever.</td>', 'Oh what an amazing picture!   You have so creatively and beautifully photographed this  special time in a lady''s life.   I know the model will treasure this picture forever.', '2005-01-19 17:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119822, 135165, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.</td>', 'I love this picture.', '2005-01-19 17:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119824, 135208, 32111, '<td valign="top">Pretty much everything you could want from a photograph. Great colours, scale, activity, interest. <br/> <br/>On my first look through, this was a 7, then crept its way up to a perfect 10.</td>', 'Pretty much everything you could want from a photograph. Great colours, scale, activity, interest.  On my first look through, this was a 7, then crept its way up to a perfect 10.', '2005-01-19 17:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119826, 136632, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great wildlife capture!   My favorite thing to photograph, and I would feel so good about having a picture like this in my collection!</td>', 'Great wildlife capture!   My favorite thing to photograph, and I would feel so good about having a picture like this in my collection!', '2005-01-19 17:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119829, 132945, 32111, '<td valign="top">Perfectly taken, and the fact that the subject isn''t posing and looking into the camera makes it even better.</td>', 'Perfectly taken, and the fact that the subject isn''t posing and looking into the camera makes it even better.', '2005-01-19 17:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119833, 134205, 24454, '<td valign="top">HOW beautiful ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! !    Man.   Even with 531 entries, this one has to be way, way WAY at the top!    Good Luck.   It''s certainly getting a 10 from me!</td>', 'HOW beautiful ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! !    Man.   Even with 531 entries, this one has to be way, way WAY at the top!    Good Luck.   It''s certainly getting a 10 from me!', '2005-01-19 18:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119835, 136162, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!    This is amazing!</td>', 'Wow!    This is amazing!', '2005-01-19 18:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119837, 136174, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool picture -- unless that was your kid, right?   Perfect timing!</td>', 'This is such a cool picture -- unless that was your kid, right?   Perfect timing!', '2005-01-19 18:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119842, 136816, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a pretty girl.   The perfect compliment to a beautiful scene!   I really like this picture a lot.   The cepia tones make it unique and extra interesting.</td>', 'What a pretty girl.   The perfect compliment to a beautiful scene!   I really like this picture a lot.   The cepia tones make it unique and extra interesting.', '2005-01-19 18:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119844, 133758, 24454, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually care too much for flower pictures, but I love this one!    The composition is perfect, and so is the fact that it''s black and white which makes the white jump out at you with its striking contrast.</td>', 'I don''t usually care too much for flower pictures, but I love this one!    The composition is perfect, and so is the fact that it''s black and white which makes the white jump out at you with its striking contrast.', '2005-01-19 18:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119850, 135805, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous girl!    Great picture!!!</td>', 'What a gorgeous girl!    Great picture!!!', '2005-01-19 18:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119859, 134511, 24454, '<td valign="top">HOW beautiful is THAT!    I love night pictures, and this is one is very well done.   Amazing sharpness from front to back!</td>', 'HOW beautiful is THAT!    I love night pictures, and this is one is very well done.   Amazing sharpness from front to back!', '2005-01-19 18:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119863, 133717, 16230, '<td valign="top">A little bright on the background rocks, but overall a wonderful image.</td>', 'A little bright on the background rocks, but overall a wonderful image.', '2005-01-19 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119864, 134860, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very neat looking picture.   I love it.    It''s so different, but totally not TOO different.   It  just looks great!</td>', 'Very neat looking picture.   I love it.    It''s so different, but totally not TOO different.   It  just looks great!', '2005-01-19 18:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119868, 132795, 24454, '<td valign="top">Sooooooooooo beautiful!!!!!!!</td>', 'Sooooooooooo beautiful!!!!!!!', '2005-01-19 18:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119870, 134359, 16230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! This works very nicely in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Beautiful! This works very nicely in B&W.', '2005-01-19 18:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119871, 135711, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great National Geographic type photo. Well done. 2 questions: why B/W and  why the prominent rocks in the foreground</td>', 'Great National Geographic type photo. Well done. 2 questions: why B/W and  why the prominent rocks in the foreground', '2005-01-19 18:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119876, 135434, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very exciting, and well photographed too. Might be even better if you had caught them a bit earlier so #99 would be more to the right in the frame. As it is, he''s crowding the left side of the frame. A really good image though. Well done!</td>', 'Very exciting, and well photographed too. Might be even better if you had caught them a bit earlier so #99 would be more to the right in the frame. As it is, he''s crowding the left side of the frame. A really good image though. Well done!', '2005-01-19 18:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119879, 136459, 14476, '<td valign="top">You take what you can get in these exciting circumstances, and the skua is a mean old bird.  I would have loved to see this in a vertical pose, but the bird probably wouldn''t have stayed around long enough for that... Good catch.</td>', 'You take what you can get in these exciting circumstances, and the skua is a mean old bird.  I would have loved to see this in a vertical pose, but the bird probably wouldn''t have stayed around long enough for that... Good catch.', '2005-01-19 18:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119880, 136794, 18194, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photo that can mean a lot to the person who took it but not so much to others.  It is not a bad photo of a cat but not a great photo either.  To my tastes the focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'This is the kind of photo that can mean a lot to the person who took it but not so much to others.  It is not a bad photo of a cat but not a great photo either.  To my tastes the focus seems a bit soft.', '2005-01-19 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119881, 136593, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful silhouette, and the composition is nice too!<br/></td>', 'Wonderful silhouette, and the composition is nice too!', '2005-01-19 18:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119883, 135164, 18194, '<td valign="top">For some reason this photo has a very artificial look to it, at least to me, almost like she was a doll. I am not sure if this is from the lighting or post processing but I find it oddly disturbing.</td>', 'For some reason this photo has a very artificial look to it, at least to me, almost like she was a doll. I am not sure if this is from the lighting or post processing but I find it oddly disturbing.', '2005-01-19 18:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119889, 132757, 18194, '<td valign="top">Technically this is a fine photo.  The overall effect does not hold a lot of interest for me.</td>', 'Technically this is a fine photo.  The overall effect does not hold a lot of interest for me.', '2005-01-19 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119890, 135615, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast/detail but otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Not enough contrast/detail but otherwise great shot.', '2005-01-19 18:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119891, 134009, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of reflectors/fill flash.</td>', 'Nice composition and use of reflectors/fill flash.', '2005-01-19 18:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119893, 132622, 18194, '<td valign="top">The effect of this photo seems over the top to me.  The colors are so saturated that it diminishes the dramatic effect the photo could have had.</td>', 'The effect of this photo seems over the top to me.  The colors are so saturated that it diminishes the dramatic effect the photo could have had.', '2005-01-19 18:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119896, 135240, 17033, '<td valign="top">Hue shifted too far...gives a pixellated look especially over mast area. Nice composition</td>', 'Hue shifted too far...gives a pixellated look especially over mast area. Nice composition', '2005-01-19 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119898, 133721, 25516, '<td valign="top">beautiful light and colors</td>', 'beautiful light and colors', '2005-01-19 18:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119899, 135709, 18194, '<td valign="top">This seems like a typical snap shot during a outing.  Nothing wrong with it as a photo but it doesnt have anything in it to make it stand out.</td>', 'This seems like a typical snap shot during a outing.  Nothing wrong with it as a photo but it doesnt have anything in it to make it stand out.', '2005-01-19 18:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119902, 132362, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a flower.  Crisp!  The composition works well, the background gives good context, the colors are believable.  I know there are those here who are tired of flowers, but I hope I never tire of something so delicate yet complex.</td>', 'Nice portrait of a flower.  Crisp!  The composition works well, the background gives good context, the colors are believable.  I know there are those here who are tired of flowers, but I hope I never tire of something so delicate yet complex.', '2005-01-19 18:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119904, 135618, 14476, '<td valign="top">You did a good job on Whaler''s Cove.  Nice angle.</td>', 'You did a good job on Whaler''s Cove.  Nice angle.', '2005-01-19 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119905, 132744, 18194, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to have been missed just a bit, it looks like the sharpest focus is on the sleeve and not her eyes.  In general you always want to try and focus on the eyes, in this case they are the most important part and the photo suffers because they are not in focus.<br/> <br/>I think this is also a case where children we know seem much more interesting to us then to others.  <br/></td>', 'The focus seems to have been missed just a bit, it looks like the sharpest focus is on the sleeve and not her eyes.  In general you always want to try and focus on the eyes, in this case they are the most important part and the photo suffers because they are not in focus. I think this is also a case where children we know seem much more interesting to us then to others.  ', '2005-01-19 18:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119907, 136688, 17033, '<td valign="top">Awful title, very good photo</td>', 'Awful title, very good photo', '2005-01-19 18:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119908, 136426, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful valley on a lovely day!  It is the S shape of the river which holds my attention.  However, as such, I wish there were more river and less pavement.  Another moment, perhaps, when the centered mountains were not darkened by the clouds could also improve the impact of your image.  Still, lovely overall.</td>', 'Beautiful valley on a lovely day!  It is the S shape of the river which holds my attention.  However, as such, I wish there were more river and less pavement.  Another moment, perhaps, when the centered mountains were not darkened by the clouds could also improve the impact of your image.  Still, lovely overall.', '2005-01-19 18:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119910, 132694, 18194, '<td valign="top">Photos of children are hard to score, the photo mean much to the person who took it but to others it may look like just another photo of a kid.</td>', 'Photos of children are hard to score, the photo mean much to the person who took it but to others it may look like just another photo of a kid.', '2005-01-19 18:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119911, 132400, 16488, '<td valign="top">Amazing subject!  I can''t imagine where you were standing when you took this!  Composition seems fine and, given the weather, the lighting is o.k.  Still, I wonder what this loooked like after the storm broke and the light returned.</td>', 'Amazing subject!  I can''t imagine where you were standing when you took this!  Composition seems fine and, given the weather, the lighting is o.k.  Still, I wonder what this loooked like after the storm broke and the light returned.', '2005-01-19 18:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119913, 134681, 17033, '<td valign="top">NO WAAYY is this 2004!!!  Very good action shot....like the fogginess.</td>', 'NO WAAYY is this 2004!!!  Very good action shot....like the fogginess.', '2005-01-19 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119919, 136675, 16230, '<td valign="top">I think I know who this belongs to. Very nice!</td>', 'I think I know who this belongs to. Very nice!', '2005-01-19 18:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119921, 136319, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful fog-shrouded background!  The subject is interesting, a nice choice.  My eye wanders trying to hold onto something, but fails.  I keep thinking how that would change...something sharp, or well lit, or a different (lower?) point of view?</td>', 'Wonderful fog-shrouded background!  The subject is interesting, a nice choice.  My eye wanders trying to hold onto something, but fails.  I keep thinking how that would change...something sharp, or well lit, or a different (lower?) point of view?', '2005-01-19 18:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119923, 136708, 16230, '<td valign="top">Super! A deeper DOF would have been nice, but I love it as-is.</td>', 'Super! A deeper DOF would have been nice, but I love it as-is.', '2005-01-19 18:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119924, 134722, 17033, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar. Despite the great colours, think I like the BW version better: emphasises the form better.</td>', 'Looks familiar. Despite the great colours, think I like the BW version better: emphasises the form better.', '2005-01-19 18:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119925, 134735, 18194, '<td valign="top">Well the photo does have some interest.  Right off you have a problem in that it is very small, it is a good idea to use the full 640 that is allowed.  In the end the photo does not hold my interest for very long.</td>', 'Well the photo does have some interest.  Right off you have a problem in that it is very small, it is a good idea to use the full 640 that is allowed.  In the end the photo does not hold my interest for very long.', '2005-01-19 18:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119927, 133791, 16230, '<td valign="top">A very serene scene. Very nice!</td>', 'A very serene scene. Very nice!', '2005-01-19 18:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119930, 136677, 16488, '<td valign="top">What expression!  The high-key really enhances your subject and composition.  However, I think the skin tone is unsettlingly yellow.  Would this have worked as well (or better) in a duo-tone?  Still, a beautifully captured expression--the life-lights in the eyes draw one in.</td>', 'What expression!  The high-key really enhances your subject and composition.  However, I think the skin tone is unsettlingly yellow.  Would this have worked as well (or better) in a duo-tone?  Still, a beautifully captured expression--the life-lights in the eyes draw one in.', '2005-01-19 18:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119939, 134909, 17033, '<td valign="top">I am very jealous of this photo. It has great originality and impact.</td>', 'I am very jealous of this photo. It has great originality and impact.', '2005-01-19 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119959, 135188, 16488, '<td valign="top">A pretty scenic!  I like the way the colors play throughout the whole.  The background shadow and the stream nearly make a pleasing S shape, but something about the composition just doesn''t feel balanced to me.  I do like motion blur on long exposures of water, but I think this is perhaps a little too long, making the stream silky does create an interesting contrast with the hard and immobile stones...it just feels overdone.  Still, a pleasing image on many levels.</td>', 'A pretty scenic!  I like the way the colors play throughout the whole.  The background shadow and the stream nearly make a pleasing S shape, but something about the composition just doesn''t feel balanced to me.  I do like motion blur on long exposures of water, but I think this is perhaps a little too long, making the stream silky does create an interesting contrast with the hard and immobile stones...it just feels overdone.  Still, a pleasing image on many levels.', '2005-01-19 19:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119968, 136222, 17033, '<td valign="top">Fantastic Venice shot...only improvement would have been to burn the birds a little</td>', 'Fantastic Venice shot...only improvement would have been to burn the birds a little', '2005-01-19 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119976, 136409, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a lucky find you have in your subject!  I''m sure they didn''t pose for long....  It seems the exposure could be better--perhaps burning in on the heads would help?  There''s a great amount of detail lost in the highlights on the shells, as well.  A decent family portrait, it just lacks punch.</td>', 'What a lucky find you have in your subject!  I''m sure they didn''t pose for long....  It seems the exposure could be better--perhaps burning in on the heads would help?  There''s a great amount of detail lost in the highlights on the shells, as well.  A decent family portrait, it just lacks punch.', '2005-01-19 19:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119988, 134904, 17033, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m glad you have the chance to show this off now, Terje. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Well, I''m glad you have the chance to show this off now, Terje. Hope it does well for you.', '2005-01-19 19:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1119990, 136651, 17033, '<td valign="top">Beautifully eerie. This will do well.</td>', 'Beautifully eerie. This will do well.', '2005-01-19 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120003, 133673, 9780, '<td valign="top">Centering the right eye is cool give this image nice touch but the green cast on his/her nose and left eye is disturbing. white paper could have fixd it.  allthoug it is a 7 :)</td>', 'Centering the right eye is cool give this image nice touch but the green cast on his/her nose and left eye is disturbing. white paper could have fixd it.  allthoug it is a 7 :)', '2005-01-19 19:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120004, 132167, 18349, '<td valign="top">This image has potential, IMHO, but suffers from a tilted horizon (needs rotating clockwise or perhaps a slight perspective shift), flat lighting, and not much of a centralized focal point.  My eyes are drawn up to the busy paintings and the whitish splotches on the left side, which IMHO compete for the attention away from the glassblowers.  Focusing in on one or the other might make a big difference.  The colors are nice, which helps, but the light is rather uninteresting at best.  The title, which is fine, is a bit of a misnomer as we have no idea if these guys are glassblowers or not just by looking at this image.  You obviously have an eye for candid moments, which some of us (myself included)  just don''t have.  Keep shooting and pay attention to where your eye is pulled in the image...what draws your focus... and you''ll be ribboning in no time.   :o)</td>', 'This image has potential, IMHO, but suffers from a tilted horizon (needs rotating clockwise or perhaps a slight perspective shift), flat lighting, and not much of a centralized focal point.  My eyes are drawn up to the busy paintings and the whitish splotches on the left side, which IMHO compete for the attention away from the glassblowers.  Focusing in on one or the other might make a big difference.  The colors are nice, which helps, but the light is rather uninteresting at best.  The title, which is fine, is a bit of a misnomer as we have no idea if these guys are glassblowers or not just by looking at this image.  You obviously have an eye for candid moments, which some of us (myself included)  just don''t have.  Keep shooting and pay attention to where your eye is pulled in the image...what draws your focus... and you''ll be ribboning in no time.   :o)', '2005-01-19 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120024, 133566, 6667, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot but unfortunately the back ground is a bit distracting (imho). I would have liked to seen that softened considerably to really bring focus on the fantastic dynamics between horse and rider.  None-the-less, a fantastic capture. BOL  7</td>', 'I like this image a lot but unfortunately the back ground is a bit distracting (imho). I would have liked to seen that softened considerably to really bring focus on the fantastic dynamics between horse and rider.  None-the-less, a fantastic capture. BOL  7', '2005-01-19 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120029, 136606, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nicwly done.  Even  the shirrt is looking to the left.  BOL</td>', 'Nicwly done.  Even  the shirrt is looking to the left.  BOL', '2005-01-19 19:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120044, 133528, 6520, '<td valign="top">There are many chickadees aroud here that will eat from your hand! Very nice 9</td>', 'There are many chickadees aroud here that will eat from your hand! Very nice 9', '2005-01-19 19:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120050, 133250, 6520, '<td valign="top">I would crop this lower 8</td>', 'I would crop this lower 8', '2005-01-19 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1);
