(1120648, 136697, 4767, '<td valign="top">This is probably the photo I have returned to the most of all images in the competition.  I was initially drawn to the smiley face, but the image is SO much stronger than that!  The title is perfect for the photo, the design and exposure is impeccable - it''s a 9 from me.<br/> <br/>That said, I think it''d be even better if you cloned out the smiley face, replacing it with the middle pane of the window to our right.  Did I say I love this photo?  It talks to me and intrigues me every time I see it. (At least 11 times so far!)</td>', 'This is probably the photo I have returned to the most of all images in the competition.  I was initially drawn to the smiley face, but the image is SO much stronger than that!  The title is perfect for the photo, the design and exposure is impeccable - it''s a 9 from me. That said, I think it''d be even better if you cloned out the smiley face, replacing it with the middle pane of the window to our right.  Did I say I love this photo?  It talks to me and intrigues me every time I see it. (At least 11 times so far!)', '2005-01-20 00:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
