(1120952, 132895, 29827, '<td valign="top">The foreground detracts from the sunset here, and having the hill as the backdrop doesn''t do the sky justice.  Also maybe looks a little overexposed.  Beautiful clouds though.</td>', 'The foreground detracts from the sunset here, and having the hill as the backdrop doesn''t do the sky justice.  Also maybe looks a little overexposed.  Beautiful clouds though.', '2005-01-20 07:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120954, 136190, 29827, '<td valign="top">Tripod was needed here - blur is too distracting.  Also would have benefitted from a little rotation - doesn''t look like ground is level.</td>', 'Tripod was needed here - blur is too distracting.  Also would have benefitted from a little rotation - doesn''t look like ground is level.', '2005-01-20 07:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120959, 133203, 10883, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and composition.  Excellent clarity in the leaf.</td>', 'Lovely colours and composition.  Excellent clarity in the leaf.', '2005-01-20 07:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120962, 136675, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent form and shapes.<br/>Good composition and angle.</td>', 'Excellent form and shapes.Good composition and angle.', '2005-01-20 07:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120964, 132201, 10883, '<td valign="top">Wow, you´ve must have attached the camera to a telescope.  Excellent exposure and detail!<br/>Good work!</td>', 'Wow, you´ve must have attached the camera to a telescope.  Excellent exposure and detail!Good work!', '2005-01-20 07:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120965, 136688, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent and a very moving photograph.<br/> <br/>The angle is very good and the shadows and the snow really make this picture!</td>', 'Excellent and a very moving photograph. The angle is very good and the shadows and the snow really make this picture!', '2005-01-20 07:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120969, 133335, 14671, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo except for the haze effect.  I find it is washing out to much of the picture.  Have you ever tried shoot thru a polarized lens? maybe this would reduce the haze.  The photo also appears to be a tad on the blurry side or not as crisp as I think it should be.  Beautiful shot tho.</td>', 'Very nice photo except for the haze effect.  I find it is washing out to much of the picture.  Have you ever tried shoot thru a polarized lens? maybe this would reduce the haze.  The photo also appears to be a tad on the blurry side or not as crisp as I think it should be.  Beautiful shot tho.', '2005-01-20 07:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120972, 134270, 14671, '<td valign="top">What an odd angle.  was this shot wish a fish eye lens?  It looks kinda crooked which is kinda distracting but also kinda cool.  It looks so fictional.  well done and keep up the god work in 2005. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'What an odd angle.  was this shot wish a fish eye lens?  It looks kinda crooked which is kinda distracting but also kinda cool.  It looks so fictional.  well done and keep up the god work in 2005. <8>', '2005-01-20 07:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120974, 132303, 14671, '<td valign="top">A tigter crop in my opinion would have made for a nicer appeal.  I find there is to much wasted space and the nothing to look at other then a silhouette which makes for a fairly boring picture.  I do however like te detail in the silhouette.</td>', 'A tigter crop in my opinion would have made for a nicer appeal.  I find there is to much wasted space and the nothing to look at other then a silhouette which makes for a fairly boring picture.  I do however like te detail in the silhouette.', '2005-01-20 07:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120976, 136794, 27605, '<td valign="top">Plus:  Love the light, especially in the whiskers.  Like the soft focus on the fur.  Minus:  Sure wish the ears weren''t cropped.  Also wish the eye were sharper.</td>', 'Plus:  Love the light, especially in the whiskers.  Like the soft focus on the fur.  Minus:  Sure wish the ears weren''t cropped.  Also wish the eye were sharper.', '2005-01-20 07:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120977, 133137, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very good picture..  No doubt that you´ll be stoned to death by the anti-nudity crowd here.<br/> <br/>Excellent picture, good angle and a relaxed pose by the model.</td>', 'Very good picture..  No doubt that you´ll be stoned to death by the anti-nudity crowd here. Excellent picture, good angle and a relaxed pose by the model.', '2005-01-20 07:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120978, 134562, 27605, '<td valign="top">Incredible sky!  Too much foreground, IMO, and castle is a bit too small for my taste. ...6...</td>', 'Incredible sky!  Too much foreground, IMO, and castle is a bit too small for my taste. ...6...', '2005-01-20 07:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120981, 136815, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Wish the crop was a bit higher....7...</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Wish the crop was a bit higher....7...', '2005-01-20 07:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120982, 135853, 10883, '<td valign="top">I´m a sucker for nightshots and this one is a very good example on how to do them well.<br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'I´m a sucker for nightshots and this one is a very good example on how to do them well. Good job!', '2005-01-20 07:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120983, 133889, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  I especially like the way the yellow &amp; black lines terminate in the white frame - cool!  Would prefer the background to be burned darker, I think.   ...8...</td>', 'Very lovely.  I especially like the way the yellow & black lines terminate in the white frame - cool!  Would prefer the background to be burned darker, I think.   ...8...', '2005-01-20 07:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120985, 133723, 27605, '<td valign="top">Man that water looks black and cold.  Like the slight offset in the large rock in the foreground in relation to the setting sun.  ...8...</td>', 'Man that water looks black and cold.  Like the slight offset in the large rock in the foreground in relation to the setting sun.  ...8...', '2005-01-20 07:45:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1120986, 135240, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish the boats on the right were a little brighter and the sun wasn''t so centered.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish the boats on the right were a little brighter and the sun wasn''t so centered.  <7>', '2005-01-20 07:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120987, 134607, 27605, '<td valign="top">Would love to know the story behind this photo.  Gotta give it a 10.</td>', 'Would love to know the story behind this photo.  Gotta give it a 10.', '2005-01-20 07:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120988, 135047, 27605, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot, but could be even better if the eye were razor sharp.  Love the background too.   ...7...</td>', 'Nice crisp shot, but could be even better if the eye were razor sharp.  Love the background too.   ...7...', '2005-01-20 07:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120990, 134065, 27605, '<td valign="top">Irresistable subject (what a cutie!) and perfect exposure, good job!</td>', 'Irresistable subject (what a cutie!) and perfect exposure, good job!', '2005-01-20 07:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120991, 136718, 14671, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot but it does nothing for me.  To me it says a kid looking into a fish bowl.  However the shot is well compossed and outstanding clarity and contrast with vibrant colors.  Best of luck and keep up the good work in 2005.  Oh yea I also like the crop, centering and size. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'An interesting shot but it does nothing for me.  To me it says a kid looking into a fish bowl.  However the shot is well compossed and outstanding clarity and contrast with vibrant colors.  Best of luck and keep up the good work in 2005.  Oh yea I also like the crop, centering and size. <7>', '2005-01-20 07:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120993, 132990, 27605, '<td valign="top">The photo is pretty good, the title is outstanding!  Would prefer to see a little less background  ...6...</td>', 'The photo is pretty good, the title is outstanding!  Would prefer to see a little less background  ...6...', '2005-01-20 07:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120997, 132887, 14671, '<td valign="top">I usually like B&amp;W photo but this one doesn''t look as crisp as it should. I find it to have a very hazey feel to it.  It''s also no a shot that I would consider hanging on a wall.  To me it just looks like a memory for a scrap book that you can reflect on with fond memories.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I usually like B&W photo but this one doesn''t look as crisp as it should. I find it to have a very hazey feel to it.  It''s also no a shot that I would consider hanging on a wall.  To me it just looks like a memory for a scrap book that you can reflect on with fond memories.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-20 07:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1120999, 133792, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting loking shot but I find the focus to be a little off.  The light against the fur of the animal is very well done but the crispness and clarity just isn''t there.</td>', 'Interesting loking shot but I find the focus to be a little off.  The light against the fur of the animal is very well done but the crispness and clarity just isn''t there.', '2005-01-20 07:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121003, 136775, 14671, '<td valign="top">I think more trees and less sky would have had a greater appeal and would make for a more pleasing picture.  I have similar shots to this taking from a moving car so I know how little thought goes into a shot like this.  For abstract art i is neat but not really for this website, or at least in my opinion.</td>', 'I think more trees and less sky would have had a greater appeal and would make for a more pleasing picture.  I have similar shots to this taking from a moving car so I know how little thought goes into a shot like this.  For abstract art i is neat but not really for this website, or at least in my opinion.', '2005-01-20 07:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121012, 136688, 27524, '<td valign="top">Real nice capture... wonder about different angle but well done.</td>', 'Real nice capture... wonder about different angle but well done.', '2005-01-20 08:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121013, 136769, 27524, '<td valign="top">Ohh...what a beauty... wonderful capture...and great colors.</td>', 'Ohh...what a beauty... wonderful capture...and great colors.', '2005-01-20 08:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121015, 136414, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful sky... i like the light on sand and bunch of birds. Good luck.</td>', 'Very beautiful sky... i like the light on sand and bunch of birds. Good luck.', '2005-01-20 08:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121017, 133890, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m unsure about this one. You seem to have fallen betweentwo subjects, really: a shot that extends from the foreground to the lighthouse, with the suggestion of the dark sky above it, which would concentrate on the tones on the water and the rocks, and a shot of the dark sky looming over the lighthouse. Placing the lighthouse so central in the vertical leaves my eye switching between the two, without ever finding a place to concentrate. I think you could happily have extended the range of the mid-tones here too - the darkness of the sky isn''t threatening, and the water has become almost the same tone throughout: it is those areas that give these shots their impact, and a faster exposure, or processing to bring the levels down in those areas would have given much more drama. You''ve also cropped out, or framed out, the foreground rocks, which would give your image a far greater sense of depth had you included them. It has real potential, this scene, I think, but it is unrealised.</td>', 'I''m unsure about this one. You seem to have fallen betweentwo subjects, really: a shot that extends from the foreground to the lighthouse, with the suggestion of the dark sky above it, which would concentrate on the tones on the water and the rocks, and a shot of the dark sky looming over the lighthouse. Placing the lighthouse so central in the vertical leaves my eye switching between the two, without ever finding a place to concentrate. I think you could happily have extended the range of the mid-tones here too - the darkness of the sky isn''t threatening, and the water has become almost the same tone throughout: it is those areas that give these shots their impact, and a faster exposure, or processing to bring the levels down in those areas would have given much more drama. You''ve also cropped out, or framed out, the foreground rocks, which would give your image a far greater sense of depth had you included them. It has real potential, this scene, I think, but it is unrealised.', '2005-01-20 08:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121019, 133889, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus... i like halfdesaturation aswell.</td>', 'Nice colors and focus... i like halfdesaturation aswell.', '2005-01-20 08:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121023, 136752, 27524, '<td valign="top">Amazing... good balance of brightness and contrast. good luck!</td>', 'Amazing... good balance of brightness and contrast. good luck!', '2005-01-20 08:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121026, 134077, 27524, '<td valign="top">Impressive place... just would like bit lighter.</td>', 'Impressive place... just would like bit lighter.', '2005-01-20 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121033, 134979, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice compozition...interesting light effect...</td>', 'Nice compozition...interesting light effect...', '2005-01-20 08:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121036, 136718, 27524, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful picture. Good luck.', '2005-01-20 08:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121049, 135164, 10883, '<td valign="top">One thing that goes against this picture is that it´s severly oversharpened, it does not have a natural feeling to it..</td>', 'One thing that goes against this picture is that it´s severly oversharpened, it does not have a natural feeling to it..', '2005-01-20 08:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121050, 135057, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like all the textures</td>', 'i really like all the textures', '2005-01-20 08:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121052, 133026, 259, '<td valign="top">great color.  i also like the simplicity.</td>', 'great color.  i also like the simplicity.', '2005-01-20 08:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121055, 136626, 259, '<td valign="top">i love how the bird is sharp yet has a soft painting-like feel to it.  a very nice shot.</td>', 'i love how the bird is sharp yet has a soft painting-like feel to it.  a very nice shot.', '2005-01-20 08:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121057, 133176, 10883, '<td valign="top">If this is not photoshopped, but panned, then this is excellent work!<br/> <br/>The crop also gives a sensation of speed.</td>', 'If this is not photoshopped, but panned, then this is excellent work! The crop also gives a sensation of speed.', '2005-01-20 08:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121062, 134270, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice job with the exposure.  the horse adds greatly to your shot.</td>', 'very nice job with the exposure.  the horse adds greatly to your shot.', '2005-01-20 09:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121069, 133252, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and good composition.<br/> <br/>Then only complaint that I have is that the picture is a bit dark and the sky in the top left corner is unnaturally dark-dark blue.  I figure that this is done intentionally in post processing, but it just doesn´t come out quite right when it´s too dark like this.</td>', 'Nice photo and good composition. Then only complaint that I have is that the picture is a bit dark and the sky in the top left corner is unnaturally dark-dark blue.  I figure that this is done intentionally in post processing, but it just doesn´t come out quite right when it´s too dark like this.', '2005-01-20 09:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121071, 134899, 259, '<td valign="top">great soft coloring</td>', 'great soft coloring', '2005-01-20 09:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121073, 134513, 10883, '<td valign="top">I´m sorry but this picture is too obviously posed and it detracts from what otherwise could have been a good pic.</td>', 'I´m sorry but this picture is too obviously posed and it detracts from what otherwise could have been a good pic.', '2005-01-20 09:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121077, 132774, 259, '<td valign="top">wow, it''s so rich and vibrant it almost looks like it was rendered on a computer.  impressive.</td>', 'wow, it''s so rich and vibrant it almost looks like it was rendered on a computer.  impressive.', '2005-01-20 09:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121081, 133058, 259, '<td valign="top">nice job picking up the mist.</td>', 'nice job picking up the mist.', '2005-01-20 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121084, 134128, 259, '<td valign="top">great looking shot.  i love the simplicity.</td>', 'great looking shot.  i love the simplicity.', '2005-01-20 09:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121093, 134904, 32212, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot! Should be right up there! good job.</td>', 'Amazing shot! Should be right up there! good job.', '2005-01-20 09:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121100, 133137, 32212, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Angles are excellent.</td>', 'Great picture. Angles are excellent.', '2005-01-20 09:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121146, 132187, 14671, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture to say the least but what are they???  I like it.  I makes you think and I find that few and far between on this site.  I am not fussy on the background being so dark  but any more contrast would bring out the hotspot in the center.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'An interesting picture to say the least but what are they???  I like it.  I makes you think and I find that few and far between on this site.  I am not fussy on the background being so dark  but any more contrast would bring out the hotspot in the center.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  <7>', '2005-01-20 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121148, 135328, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The contrast on the awings make this photo really hard to look at.  It also looks a tad on the blurry side.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The contrast on the awings make this photo really hard to look at.  It also looks a tad on the blurry side.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-20 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121149, 136300, 14671, '<td valign="top">WOW well done.  I love the clarity of the water droplets.  Amazing choice of DOF and awesome colors.  Congrats.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'WOW well done.  I love the clarity of the water droplets.  Amazing choice of DOF and awesome colors.  Congrats.  <10>', '2005-01-20 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121151, 133889, 14671, '<td valign="top">Overall its a pretty boring picture to look at.  Great detail and sharpness but not much to look at.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005</td>', 'Overall its a pretty boring picture to look at.  Great detail and sharpness but not much to look at.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005', '2005-01-20 10:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121153, 134681, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find all the spears to distracting in this photo.  Couldn''t you have asked some of them to put some down???  lol j/k.  It makes for a nice almost civil war type shot but all those spears... man alive.  Good job and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I find all the spears to distracting in this photo.  Couldn''t you have asked some of them to put some down???  lol j/k.  It makes for a nice almost civil war type shot but all those spears... man alive.  Good job and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-20 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121154, 136469, 14671, '<td valign="top">I not to fond of this shot.  The lack of background throws it off because of the brightness.  It is however an interesting portrait shot with great clarity and color.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'I not to fond of this shot.  The lack of background throws it off because of the brightness.  It is however an interesting portrait shot with great clarity and color.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-20 10:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121155, 135918, 14671, '<td valign="top">what a crystal clear shot.  I like the choice of DOF and the colors are incredible.  I think this shot would make a great calender picture.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'what a crystal clear shot.  I like the choice of DOF and the colors are incredible.  I think this shot would make a great calender picture.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-20 10:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121163, 132597, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the silhouette/shadow look but hate those birds lol.  I find the picture to be very grainy or almost blurry.  I like that shot it could be the contrast that is thowing off the crispness.  Well done and keep up the good work.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the silhouette/shadow look but hate those birds lol.  I find the picture to be very grainy or almost blurry.  I like that shot it could be the contrast that is thowing off the crispness.  Well done and keep up the good work.  <8>', '2005-01-20 10:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121170, 136833, 14671, '<td valign="top">The title goes well with the shot but I find the reflection in the window to be very distracting.   Also the camera tilted sideways put a fisheye look to the doorjam and makes the picture look unbalanced.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'The title goes well with the shot but I find the reflection in the window to be very distracting.   Also the camera tilted sideways put a fisheye look to the doorjam and makes the picture look unbalanced.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-20 10:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121174, 132202, 14671, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Looks like a scene from a movie.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Looks like a scene from a movie.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.  <8>', '2005-01-20 10:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121199, 132140, 11756, '<td valign="top">would have cropped the sky, but great dof and composition.</td>', 'would have cropped the sky, but great dof and composition.', '2005-01-20 11:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121210, 136551, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice patroitic image, I like the choice of B&amp;W</td>', 'Nice patroitic image, I like the choice of B&W', '2005-01-20 11:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121213, 134714, 18216, '<td valign="top">What a cutie! I love her expression. The lighting is spot-on. It''s a bit out of focus, but that works towards making this photo "softer."</td>', 'What a cutie! I love her expression. The lighting is spot-on. It''s a bit out of focus, but that works towards making this photo "softer."', '2005-01-20 11:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121216, 133722, 18216, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment! Great focus and colors. I also like the background and placement of the subjects.</td>', 'Great capture of the moment! Great focus and colors. I also like the background and placement of the subjects.', '2005-01-20 11:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121217, 136282, 18216, '<td valign="top">How cute! I like that the border color matches the ribbon on the ornament. Congratulations on your baby!</td>', 'How cute! I like that the border color matches the ribbon on the ornament. Congratulations on your baby!', '2005-01-20 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
