(1121228, 135697, 18216, '<td valign="top">yoga for horses? lol. I love that the horse doesn''t seem at all upset about the exercise.</td>', 'yoga for horses? lol. I love that the horse doesn''t seem at all upset about the exercise.', '2005-01-20 11:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121232, 136689, 18216, '<td valign="top">Her blue eyes really stand out in this photo. Great focal point and lighting!</td>', 'Her blue eyes really stand out in this photo. Great focal point and lighting!', '2005-01-20 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121238, 132848, 18216, '<td valign="top">I really like that I can''t tell where the water leaves off and the sky starts. It seems a bit grainy, but doesnt ruin your effect. Good use of negative space.</td>', 'I really like that I can''t tell where the water leaves off and the sky starts. It seems a bit grainy, but doesnt ruin your effect. Good use of negative space.', '2005-01-20 11:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121241, 136727, 18216, '<td valign="top">This photo made me laugh! Good use of negative space. Nice vibrant colors!</td>', 'This photo made me laugh! Good use of negative space. Nice vibrant colors!', '2005-01-20 11:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121245, 133528, 18216, '<td valign="top">Wow! great timing on this shot! I''m also glad to see that the background adds rather than takes away from this picture! Great focus. I also like the thumb ring.  :) I vote this a "10"</td>', 'Wow! great timing on this shot! I''m also glad to see that the background adds rather than takes away from this picture! Great focus. I also like the thumb ring.  :) I vote this a "10"', '2005-01-20 11:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
