(1121383, 133137, 3032, '<td valign="top">Right on the edge, suggestive but not porn.<br/>I like it how your model stands out from the dark and how she is hmmm err, ''tied'''' to that background by the leather stuff she is wearing. The lighting on the body is good, but the face has just a tad too much, or it might be the effect of makeup or something. 7</td>', 'Right on the edge, suggestive but not porn.I like it how your model stands out from the dark and how she is hmmm err, ''tied'''' to that background by the leather stuff she is wearing. The lighting on the body is good, but the face has just a tad too much, or it might be the effect of makeup or something. 7', '2005-01-20 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
