(1121415, 134935, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting how many of the lines in this photo lead to the person on the bench:<br/>- line from the roof along the wall<br/>- shadow/sun border on the floor<br/>- the bench in the foreground<br/>Shame the person is in such a deep shadow. He seems deep asleep as well. :)<br/> <br/>A train it the distance might make it a bit stronger, but I like the setup of the composition, just not how the light falls.</td>', 'Interesting how many of the lines in this photo lead to the person on the bench:- line from the roof along the wall- shadow/sun border on the floor- the bench in the foregroundShame the person is in such a deep shadow. He seems deep asleep as well. :) A train it the distance might make it a bit stronger, but I like the setup of the composition, just not how the light falls.', '2005-01-20 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1121425, 136673, 3032, '<td valign="top">I am not entirely sure about the composition. The photo does not really tell "he''s mine" itself. I also feel that there is not enough space at the right side of the arm, it looks a bit strange in the lower right corner this way.<br/>Technically I think it is very good. Nice dof, good background (smooth, undetailed, darker and not drawing a lot of attention), good light (especially on her face and the hair), nice light in the eyers and good B&amp;W toning.</td>', 'I am not entirely sure about the composition. The photo does not really tell "he''s mine" itself. I also feel that there is not enough space at the right side of the arm, it looks a bit strange in the lower right corner this way.Technically I think it is very good. Nice dof, good background (smooth, undetailed, darker and not drawing a lot of attention), good light (especially on her face and the hair), nice light in the eyers and good B&W toning.', '2005-01-20 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
