(1122057, 132830, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting  character!  The exposure feels wrong to me--just a bit overbright on the cardboard hat and the spectators in the background.  I''d like to see more "context" too--without the title it''s not a very clear subject.</td>', 'Interesting  character!  The exposure feels wrong to me--just a bit overbright on the cardboard hat and the spectators in the background.  I''d like to see more "context" too--without the title it''s not a very clear subject.', '2005-01-20 19:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
