(1122238, 133782, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a nice solid portrait, lighting is good (except perhaps the slight glare off the nose) black and white works wel and the expression is interesting. I don''t find this hugely engaging, but your technical skill is definately something to build on in 2005 - good luck! 6</td>', 'This is a nice solid portrait, lighting is good (except perhaps the slight glare off the nose) black and white works wel and the expression is interesting. I don''t find this hugely engaging, but your technical skill is definately something to build on in 2005 - good luck! 6', '2005-01-20 21:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122240, 136219, 23458, '<td valign="top">As far as fireworks shots go, this one is excellent. Love the contrast between the fading fireworks in the bottom and the fuller fireworks at the top - the trail is a little blown out perhaps, but other than that this is spot on. 8</td>', 'As far as fireworks shots go, this one is excellent. Love the contrast between the fading fireworks in the bottom and the fuller fireworks at the top - the trail is a little blown out perhaps, but other than that this is spot on. 8', '2005-01-20 21:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
