(1122246, 135180, 23458, '<td valign="top">Not a bad capture - you''ve stopped the motion well - I''d like to see this a little closer, also, it looks like (from the shadows) this was taken in the middle of the day, as a result the colours are a bit flat perhaps.</td>', 'Not a bad capture - you''ve stopped the motion well - I''d like to see this a little closer, also, it looks like (from the shadows) this was taken in the middle of the day, as a result the colours are a bit flat perhaps.', '2005-01-20 21:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122249, 136446, 23458, '<td valign="top">Those are great flowers - Im sure they are beautiful in colour, but in black and white they look positively deathly, which creates a terrific mood. Not often that a flower shot is anything but pretty, but you''ve gone above and beyond with this one. 8.</td>', 'Those are great flowers - Im sure they are beautiful in colour, but in black and white they look positively deathly, which creates a terrific mood. Not often that a flower shot is anything but pretty, but you''ve gone above and beyond with this one. 8.', '2005-01-20 21:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122251, 136708, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - I like the colours - tank shots like these aren''t easy and you''ve done well! Even better if this isnt a tank shot (Im just playing the odds :P).</td>', 'Very pretty - I like the colours - tank shots like these aren''t easy and you''ve done well! Even better if this isnt a tank shot (Im just playing the odds :P).', '2005-01-20 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
