(1122658, 136752, 23458, '<td valign="top">If ever an image was made for black and white this was it! Stunning. I love how the dark tone of that beach contrasts with the ocean. The girl provides a nice compositional element, unlike some images of this type her inclusion doesn''t appear forced at all. Well done. 9.</td>', 'If ever an image was made for black and white this was it! Stunning. I love how the dark tone of that beach contrasts with the ocean. The girl provides a nice compositional element, unlike some images of this type her inclusion doesn''t appear forced at all. Well done. 9.', '2005-01-21 03:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122660, 134722, 31642, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice landscape but I can not give you ten because<br/>1. In my feeling, this picture is equally devided into two sections, one is the reflection, and other is everything above water level. These two compete with each other thus there is no primary subject for this one.<br/>2. If the picture is equally devided like this, it would be nice if you can include some boats on the water. However, it is a kind of picture that I would like to take by myself.</td>', 'This is a very nice landscape but I can not give you ten because1. In my feeling, this picture is equally devided into two sections, one is the reflection, and other is everything above water level. These two compete with each other thus there is no primary subject for this one.2. If the picture is equally devided like this, it would be nice if you can include some boats on the water. However, it is a kind of picture that I would like to take by myself.', '2005-01-21 03:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122662, 134977, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective here - like the way his hands and the candle come together to frame the face.  I''m not really all that fussed about the lighting though - that yellowish/reddish cast isn''t quite working for me.</td>', 'Interesting perspective here - like the way his hands and the candle come together to frame the face.  I''m not really all that fussed about the lighting though - that yellowish/reddish cast isn''t quite working for me.', '2005-01-21 03:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
