(1122810, 136319, 23458, '<td valign="top">this image really is one of two halves... the background (i.e buildings through the mist) could not be better, the foreground, through no fault of your own detracts somewhat from the mood of the image due to the tacky colours of the boat, if only you could make your own scene, a couple of worn out wooden fishing boats would have done nicely :P. Still a seven on the strength of that background.</td>', 'this image really is one of two halves... the background (i.e buildings through the mist) could not be better, the foreground, through no fault of your own detracts somewhat from the mood of the image due to the tacky colours of the boat, if only you could make your own scene, a couple of worn out wooden fishing boats would have done nicely :P. Still a seven on the strength of that background.', '2005-01-21 05:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122812, 132664, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking image. I wonder whether the same effect could be accomplished without the solar flare (I find that a little distracting, still the choice of subject and composition are brilliant). And I just noticed the little rainbow - a nice extra touch  - its a 7 as is - without the pink line you''d probably get a nine from me. Good job.</td>', 'This is a very striking image. I wonder whether the same effect could be accomplished without the solar flare (I find that a little distracting, still the choice of subject and composition are brilliant). And I just noticed the little rainbow - a nice extra touch  - its a 7 as is - without the pink line you''d probably get a nine from me. Good job.', '2005-01-21 05:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
