(1122879, 136578, 14671, '<td valign="top">The image doesn''t look crisp enough.  Maybe the contrast is a little off or something but everything but the lady''s shirt looks a tad blurry.   The photo itself is not one I personally would hang on a wall but would find more in a tailors shop.  The composition is well done but just to blurry to get a good feeling for.  Best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'The image doesn''t look crisp enough.  Maybe the contrast is a little off or something but everything but the lady''s shirt looks a tad blurry.   The photo itself is not one I personally would hang on a wall but would find more in a tailors shop.  The composition is well done but just to blurry to get a good feeling for.  Best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 07:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
