(1122882, 133567, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured bird in flight. The backlighting and blue sky really help to accent the beauty of the bird. "Neat" Image might have helped take some of the graininess out of the sky.</td>', 'Nicely captured bird in flight. The backlighting and blue sky really help to accent the beauty of the bird. "Neat" Image might have helped take some of the graininess out of the sky.', '2005-01-21 07:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122883, 133996, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot but if you look just off center there seems to be a smokey spot which I find very distracting.    I would also suggest a tigher crop off the top to at least the top of the tree line (or the cloud line) to give the picture a wider look so it looks a little more panaramic.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot but if you look just off center there seems to be a smokey spot which I find very distracting.    I would also suggest a tigher crop off the top to at least the top of the tree line (or the cloud line) to give the picture a wider look so it looks a little more panaramic.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 07:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122885, 135405, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and wonderful contrast between the clouds and the green pasture.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and wonderful contrast between the clouds and the green pasture.', '2005-01-21 07:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122887, 133801, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an interesting sea creature. I can understand why you wanted to snap a picture of him.</td>', 'Wow, what an interesting sea creature. I can understand why you wanted to snap a picture of him.', '2005-01-21 07:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
