(1122897, 132622, 10883, '<td valign="top">Well this one certainly drew my attention.  Very colourful and vivid image.<br/> <br/>On the otherhand... What was just an ordinary landscape photo has been transformed into this by probably relying heavily on Photoshop.  This picture is a bit too much processed for my taste.  I think that the only time one would see such a vision would be in a nuclear war.</td>', 'Well this one certainly drew my attention.  Very colourful and vivid image. On the otherhand... What was just an ordinary landscape photo has been transformed into this by probably relying heavily on Photoshop.  This picture is a bit too much processed for my taste.  I think that the only time one would see such a vision would be in a nuclear war.', '2005-01-21 07:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122900, 135431, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the light coming in from te back to be to distracting.  I also find the picture to bo noisey or pixelated/grainy.  The shot itself is interesting and leaves me wondering what it is you were shooting.  Looks like a middle eastern coffee shop or something.  Best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'I find the light coming in from te back to be to distracting.  I also find the picture to bo noisey or pixelated/grainy.  The shot itself is interesting and leaves me wondering what it is you were shooting.  Looks like a middle eastern coffee shop or something.  Best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 07:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122901, 136449, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well stone, shell, or petrified pinecone this image is very effective. I really like the way the colouring of your ''stone'' is so similar to the background, yet it is completely distinguishable in spite of the relatively deep DOF due to it''s disparate shape.</td>', 'Well stone, shell, or petrified pinecone this image is very effective. I really like the way the colouring of your ''stone'' is so similar to the background, yet it is completely distinguishable in spite of the relatively deep DOF due to it''s disparate shape.', '2005-01-21 07:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122902, 135207, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, although it would have been nice if the shutter would have been open just a wee bit longer in order to allow more light and detail in.<br/>Also, the picture is a bit tilted to the right.. that distracts a bit.</td>', 'Nice picture, although it would have been nice if the shutter would have been open just a wee bit longer in order to allow more light and detail in.Also, the picture is a bit tilted to the right.. that distracts a bit.', '2005-01-21 07:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122903, 136790, 23458, '<td valign="top">Terrific catch... I hope this wasn''t set up - then I can label you the master of the candid. On the other hand if it was set up I can commend you on your wild imagination and the tremendous perspective you''ve chosen. 10. (by the way - the high key effect works well here).</td>', 'Terrific catch... I hope this wasn''t set up - then I can label you the master of the candid. On the other hand if it was set up I can commend you on your wild imagination and the tremendous perspective you''ve chosen. 10. (by the way - the high key effect works well here).', '2005-01-21 07:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122905, 136685, 14671, '<td valign="top">The border on this picture is just way to wide.  I find it take to much away from the photo. The photo does have an interesting contrast on the blades of the windmill and it accents the red brick very well.  The sky is a little dark but I find it brings out the colors and adds character to the overall picture but again the border is just to big.  Kepp up the good work and best of luck in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'The border on this picture is just way to wide.  I find it take to much away from the photo. The photo does have an interesting contrast on the blades of the windmill and it accents the red brick very well.  The sky is a little dark but I find it brings out the colors and adds character to the overall picture but again the border is just to big.  Kepp up the good work and best of luck in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-21 07:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122908, 133800, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good picture.<br/>It would be interesting to play with this picture a bit by trying a tighter crop to get closer to the lions face.</td>', 'Good picture.It would be interesting to play with this picture a bit by trying a tighter crop to get closer to the lions face.', '2005-01-21 07:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122911, 134670, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the problem with shooting flowers like this is either the white balance is off or the contrats is to high which makes it a little bit blurry.  I think you might suffer from people sitting to close to the monitor  and will see it as blurry.  I like this shot and find the DOF chosen works well.  The bee just adds so much more to it.  I think this would make an excellent callender shot or just a standard picture to hang on a wall.  Thats not achieved by many.  Well done and keep up the great work in 2005.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I find the problem with shooting flowers like this is either the white balance is off or the contrats is to high which makes it a little bit blurry.  I think you might suffer from people sitting to close to the monitor  and will see it as blurry.  I like this shot and find the DOF chosen works well.  The bee just adds so much more to it.  I think this would make an excellent callender shot or just a standard picture to hang on a wall.  Thats not achieved by many.  Well done and keep up the great work in 2005.  <8>', '2005-01-21 07:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122913, 132264, 14671, '<td valign="top">hahaha this has to be the funniest shot I have seen so far in this challenge.  It looks like a bunch of outhouses.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'hahaha this has to be the funniest shot I have seen so far in this challenge.  It looks like a bunch of outhouses.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-21 07:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122914, 136629, 14671, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a white border would have made for a better choice?  Excellent clarity, colors and crispness in this shot and it makes you wonder what he''s looking at.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Perhaps a white border would have made for a better choice?  Excellent clarity, colors and crispness in this shot and it makes you wonder what he''s looking at.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <9>', '2005-01-21 07:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122916, 132255, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but I find the border to wide which makes it distracting.  I like the B&amp;W look and the soft focus adds a lot to this photo.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice photo but I find the border to wide which makes it distracting.  I like the B&W look and the soft focus adds a lot to this photo.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-21 07:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122917, 136174, 14671, '<td valign="top">Great timing.  well done.  keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Great timing.  well done.  keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 07:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122919, 132538, 14671, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  This would make an excellent print.  A shot where the mind can go and just wander and dream about being there.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'beautiful shot.  This would make an excellent print.  A shot where the mind can go and just wander and dream about being there.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  <9>', '2005-01-21 08:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122925, 134904, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  This should have done well on the movie titles challenge for "Deep Impact" or something similar.  Beautiful shot but very grainy in parts. I like it and think it would make for an excellent print.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot.  This should have done well on the movie titles challenge for "Deep Impact" or something similar.  Beautiful shot but very grainy in parts. I like it and think it would make for an excellent print.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  <8>', '2005-01-21 08:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122930, 136847, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting but the fisheye look doesn''t appeal to me.  I also find with the hi contrast shots that the white balance is throwin off and makes everything appear to be a bit blurry.  Beautifuls colors.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Interesting but the fisheye look doesn''t appeal to me.  I also find with the hi contrast shots that the white balance is throwin off and makes everything appear to be a bit blurry.  Beautifuls colors.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  <7>', '2005-01-21 08:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122933, 132214, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow, well done.  I would love to know how you achieved this shot.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Wow, well done.  I would love to know how you achieved this shot.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <10>', '2005-01-21 08:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122937, 136426, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 08:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122940, 134945, 14671, '<td valign="top">thats so cool.  at first glance the tac looks like a water droplet crashing onto the surface.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'thats so cool.  at first glance the tac looks like a water droplet crashing onto the surface.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-21 08:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122945, 133148, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  I think this may have done better in breaking new ground challenge.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  I think this may have done better in breaking new ground challenge.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122953, 136539, 29477, '<td valign="top">Standard portrait shot, nothing special.  Might have tried to maybe get more of the surroundings in the shot, i.e. the counter, the Lion beer dispenser, use the rule of thirds...attempt to make it a little more dynamic.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Standard portrait shot, nothing special.  Might have tried to maybe get more of the surroundings in the shot, i.e. the counter, the Lion beer dispenser, use the rule of thirds...attempt to make it a little more dynamic.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122954, 132859, 29477, '<td valign="top">Image is okay...good use of photography basics with the off-centre framing...It would have had a little more punch if it was possible to capture this image when they "fired" it up.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Image is okay...good use of photography basics with the off-centre framing...It would have had a little more punch if it was possible to capture this image when they "fired" it up.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122955, 132898, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like the post shot editing giving it a more rustic/historical feel.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'I like the post shot editing giving it a more rustic/historical feel.  Nicely composed.', '2005-01-21 08:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122956, 133987, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the action and concentration on the drivers face.   Appears a bit out of focus.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice capture of the action and concentration on the drivers face.   Appears a bit out of focus.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122958, 132303, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot representing all of us here at DPC.</td>', 'Nice simple shot representing all of us here at DPC.', '2005-01-21 08:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122961, 134128, 29477, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting.  The transition in the sky is beautiful...Great shot.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Looks like a painting.  The transition in the sky is beautiful...Great shot.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122962, 133723, 29477, '<td valign="top">This image gives me a feeling of both tranquility and turmoil and I like that. Great job.  Good Luck.</td>', 'This image gives me a feeling of both tranquility and turmoil and I like that. Great job.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122965, 135240, 7485, '<td valign="top">The green is an interesting idea, but the noise/compression artifacts kinda kills it</td>', 'The green is an interesting idea, but the noise/compression artifacts kinda kills it', '2005-01-21 08:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122967, 135164, 29477, '<td valign="top">Yikes...way too much neat image and sharpening...takes away from her real beauty.</td>', 'Yikes...way too much neat image and sharpening...takes away from her real beauty.', '2005-01-21 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122968, 132759, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great capture, however the focus on the deer(fawn) is off.  I assume you had to quickly capture the moment. Good Luck.</td>', 'Great capture, however the focus on the deer(fawn) is off.  I assume you had to quickly capture the moment. Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122969, 136224, 29477, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for reflections and I like the end result.  Simple, effective and to my liking.</td>', 'I am a sucker for reflections and I like the end result.  Simple, effective and to my liking.', '2005-01-21 08:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122971, 136632, 29477, '<td valign="top">National Geographic quality...Nicely composed and like the fact that you got some of the surroundings and didn''t simply zoom all out on the animal.  Great DOF. Well done.</td>', 'National Geographic quality...Nicely composed and like the fact that you got some of the surroundings and didn''t simply zoom all out on the animal.  Great DOF. Well done.', '2005-01-21 08:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122972, 132255, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful photo all the way around.  The composition is EXCELLENT, their looks, the lines, the water... all beautiful.  And the softness of the treatment really gives it that something special.  PERFECT!   up''d to a 10</td>', 'This is such a wonderful photo all the way around.  The composition is EXCELLENT, their looks, the lines, the water... all beautiful.  And the softness of the treatment really gives it that something special.  PERFECT!   up''d to a 10', '2005-01-21 08:51:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1122973, 134077, 7485, '<td valign="top">Marvellous sense of depth, and great usage of duotone. Only improvement I can think of would be to straighten the image (maybe it is level, but something about the alignment of the trees and their reflections makes it feel tilted down on the right) 8</td>', 'Marvellous sense of depth, and great usage of duotone. Only improvement I can think of would be to straighten the image (maybe it is level, but something about the alignment of the trees and their reflections makes it feel tilted down on the right) 8', '2005-01-21 08:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122974, 136743, 29477, '<td valign="top">Has a nice Blair Witch feel to it.  Good job.</td>', 'Has a nice Blair Witch feel to it.  Good job.', '2005-01-21 08:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122975, 135783, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  The colors are wonderful and the addtion of the little boy makes if more than just a nice sunset/sunrise picture.  I would kill to get a shot like this with my little boy.  Well done!</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  The colors are wonderful and the addtion of the little boy makes if more than just a nice sunset/sunrise picture.  I would kill to get a shot like this with my little boy.  Well done!', '2005-01-21 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122976, 136593, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette image with the sunset sky...Good Luck.</td>', 'Nice silhouette image with the sunset sky...Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122978, 136630, 29477, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of Field of Dreams.  Nice Crisp image and really like the composition.  Well Done. Good Luck.</td>', 'Makes me think of Field of Dreams.  Nice Crisp image and really like the composition.  Well Done. Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 08:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122981, 135651, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the Falls at night.  Much better perspective with the lights shining on it rather than the daytime standard shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great capture of the Falls at night.  Much better perspective with the lights shining on it rather than the daytime standard shot.  Good luck.', '2005-01-21 08:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122983, 136435, 29477, '<td valign="top">What a great shot...Wonderfully composed and love the conversion to B&amp;W.  Well Done.</td>', 'What a great shot...Wonderfully composed and love the conversion to B&W.  Well Done.', '2005-01-21 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122985, 134050, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and color - 8</td>', 'Wonderful light and color - 8', '2005-01-21 08:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122986, 136350, 29477, '<td valign="top">Congratulations...We are expecting our second in the next few weeks and I hope to capture a similar image.  The focus seems is a bit off on the little one, but it is still a great capture of an incredible moment.</td>', 'Congratulations...We are expecting our second in the next few weeks and I hope to capture a similar image.  The focus seems is a bit off on the little one, but it is still a great capture of an incredible moment.', '2005-01-21 08:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1122989, 132190, 29477, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before and I like it just has much now as I did then.  Great perspective and is very effective with her heel raised.  Well Done.  Good Luck.</td>', 'I''ve seen this before and I like it just has much now as I did then.  Great perspective and is very effective with her heel raised.  Well Done.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 09:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123007, 135565, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the mix of vertical and horizontal lines.  A very interesting subject that most people would pass up.  The colors make it look more like artwork than a photo.  great work. 9</td>', 'I like the color and the mix of vertical and horizontal lines.  A very interesting subject that most people would pass up.  The colors make it look more like artwork than a photo.  great work. 9', '2005-01-21 09:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123014, 135753, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very rustic, very beautiful tones in the wood.  It tells a nice story.  I''m not usually much for titles, but you really nailed this one.</td>', 'Very rustic, very beautiful tones in the wood.  It tells a nice story.  I''m not usually much for titles, but you really nailed this one.', '2005-01-21 09:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123018, 134214, 26756, '<td valign="top">Has a beautiful 1940''s feel to it.  I''m just amazed you were able to catch Michael Imperioli in the mirror! lol</td>', 'Has a beautiful 1940''s feel to it.  I''m just amazed you were able to catch Michael Imperioli in the mirror! lol', '2005-01-21 09:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123020, 133137, 26756, '<td valign="top">Bold shot for the DPC crowd.  Excellent shot for one of this type.  Great angle, a very effective dof and flattering lighting.  Black and white was a great choice of course.   There are a lot of interesting lines and angles you created.  Overall very nicely done.</td>', 'Bold shot for the DPC crowd.  Excellent shot for one of this type.  Great angle, a very effective dof and flattering lighting.  Black and white was a great choice of course.   There are a lot of interesting lines and angles you created.  Overall very nicely done.', '2005-01-21 09:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123022, 136718, 16241, '<td valign="top">how cute is this?  the lighting is awesome, novel idea   10</td>', 'how cute is this?  the lighting is awesome, novel idea   10', '2005-01-21 09:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123023, 133195, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot...Has a 50''s or 60''s feel to it. Love the composition and focus is nice and crisp.  Well done.</td>', 'Great shot...Has a 50''s or 60''s feel to it. Love the composition and focus is nice and crisp.  Well done.', '2005-01-21 09:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123026, 136424, 29477, '<td valign="top">Holy crap...Not your typical relaxing day at the beach.  This is a great shot.  I can''t wait to read your write-up on this.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Holy crap...Not your typical relaxing day at the beach.  This is a great shot.  I can''t wait to read your write-up on this.  Good Luck.', '2005-01-21 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123027, 132225, 29477, '<td valign="top">Beatiful image and use of basic potography rules.  Great colours.</td>', 'Beatiful image and use of basic potography rules.  Great colours.', '2005-01-21 09:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123031, 135466, 29477, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetrical shot and variation of this heavily photographed bridge.  Focus is nice and sharp...Good shot.</td>', 'Nice symmetrical shot and variation of this heavily photographed bridge.  Focus is nice and sharp...Good shot.', '2005-01-21 09:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123034, 136821, 29477, '<td valign="top">You had me at the reflection...Beautiful composition.  Does appear a little grainy.</td>', 'You had me at the reflection...Beautiful composition.  Does appear a little grainy.', '2005-01-21 09:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123075, 136285, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the size to be to small and no subject.  Keep trying and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'I find the size to be to small and no subject.  Keep trying and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123078, 134296, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice flames but I''m just not fond of this shot.  It looks like a snapshot of a tourist attraction altho you''ve captured the flames well.  Keep trying and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'Nice flames but I''m just not fond of this shot.  It looks like a snapshot of a tourist attraction altho you''ve captured the flames well.  Keep trying and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123081, 132324, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot.  perhaps a 1 inch crop off the top of the photo to make it look more panaramic.  It would have also taken out the sun or high contrast out of the sky.  I find it to distracting.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot.  perhaps a 1 inch crop off the top of the photo to make it look more panaramic.  It would have also taken out the sun or high contrast out of the sky.  I find it to distracting.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123085, 133026, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the water and it has overall appeal but I find it lacks substace or interest.  Excellent clarity and color.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I like the look of the water and it has overall appeal but I find it lacks substace or interest.  Excellent clarity and color.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123091, 136319, 14671, '<td valign="top">wow interesting shot but to much smoke/mist.   Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'wow interesting shot but to much smoke/mist.   Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123092, 135345, 14671, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.  Fantastic color, clarity and DOF.  Very well done.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Excellent picture.  Fantastic color, clarity and DOF.  Very well done.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005. <10>', '2005-01-21 10:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123113, 134639, 16241, '<td valign="top">dunno why but i like eric, something mysterious 10</td>', 'dunno why but i like eric, something mysterious 10', '2005-01-21 10:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123114, 132917, 14671, '<td valign="top">A faster speed would have captured the birds a little more still.  A nice shot but with the blurry birds I find it to distracting.  Good job and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'A faster speed would have captured the birds a little more still.  A nice shot but with the blurry birds I find it to distracting.  Good job and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123117, 134971, 14671, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had some camera shake when you took this shot.  It would have been a very nice shot except for the blur.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Looks like you had some camera shake when you took this shot.  It would have been a very nice shot except for the blur.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123120, 134050, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-01-21 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123136, 132400, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow nice lighthouse but far to much noise?  Altho it could be snow I guess....<br/>Well done and best of luck in 2005.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Wow nice lighthouse but far to much noise?  Altho it could be snow I guess....Well done and best of luck in 2005.  <6>', '2005-01-21 10:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123137, 135565, 24065, '<td valign="top">I loved this the first time I saw it.  I''m glad you enetered it and hope the voters will appreciate it!  Good luck!</td>', 'I loved this the first time I saw it.  I''m glad you enetered it and hope the voters will appreciate it!  Good luck!', '2005-01-21 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123139, 135174, 14671, '<td valign="top">This photo does absolutely nothing for me.  I honestly looks like a snapshot of a guys night out at the strip joint.  I find it also to be slightly OOF and a bad choice in DOF.  I also find the contrast on the left hand to be to bright ad very distracting.  Good luck and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'This photo does absolutely nothing for me.  I honestly looks like a snapshot of a guys night out at the strip joint.  I find it also to be slightly OOF and a bad choice in DOF.  I also find the contrast on the left hand to be to bright ad very distracting.  Good luck and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 10:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123148, 135771, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment...<br/>I love the way you`ve captured this..that sky is straight out of a watercolour.<br/>Very nicely done.</td>', 'Back to comment...I love the way you`ve captured this..that sky is straight out of a watercolour.Very nicely done.', '2005-01-21 10:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123152, 133889, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment..<br/>Fantastic clarity &amp; mix of colour and texture.<br/>I also like the way you`ve divided the image into diagonal thirds.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Back to comment..Fantastic clarity & mix of colour and texture.I also like the way you`ve divided the image into diagonal thirds.Well done.', '2005-01-21 10:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123154, 133277, 24065, '<td valign="top">I have never seen a black squirrel before!  I didn''t know they existed.  This is a squirrel, isn''t it?  And I''ve had this same conversation with the ones in my back yard :)</td>', 'I have never seen a black squirrel before!  I didn''t know they existed.  This is a squirrel, isn''t it?  And I''ve had this same conversation with the ones in my back yard :)', '2005-01-21 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123160, 136675, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment..<br/>Super use of light and shade to emphasise shape.<br/>Very nice abstract..hope it does well.</td>', 'Back to comment..Super use of light and shade to emphasise shape.Very nice abstract..hope it does well.', '2005-01-21 10:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123168, 136764, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow nice pic but extremely blurry.  I find that this picture says a lot and would have scored a 10 had it not been so blurry.  Perhaps change you ISO to 50 in your cameras setting would have helped.   Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'Wow nice pic but extremely blurry.  I find that this picture says a lot and would have scored a 10 had it not been so blurry.  Perhaps change you ISO to 50 in your cameras setting would have helped.   Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-21 11:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123169, 133355, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment...<br/>I get a good feel for the type of landscape you are portraying here...however, I think the image will suffer scorewise for not having a real point of focus.<br/>Perhaps picking out one point of interest from what`s on view and shortening your depth of field to isolate it from the rest would add impact.<br/>However, this is only my opinion and should be treated accordingly.</td>', 'Back to comment...I get a good feel for the type of landscape you are portraying here...however, I think the image will suffer scorewise for not having a real point of focus.Perhaps picking out one point of interest from what`s on view and shortening your depth of field to isolate it from the rest would add impact.However, this is only my opinion and should be treated accordingly.', '2005-01-21 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123174, 132570, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow, great reflection shot.  Its to bad the ground wasn''t clear as well.  Perhaps using a tripod might have helped?  I think clearing the stones would have made for a better pictures if at all possible.  Also a 90 degree rotation CCW may have looked nicer.  Great color and clarity in the reflection.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005</td>', 'Wow, great reflection shot.  Its to bad the ground wasn''t clear as well.  Perhaps using a tripod might have helped?  I think clearing the stones would have made for a better pictures if at all possible.  Also a 90 degree rotation CCW may have looked nicer.  Great color and clarity in the reflection.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005', '2005-01-21 11:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123177, 136777, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot.  I think it would make for a nice calender shot or tourism shot.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot.  I think it would make for a nice calender shot or tourism shot.  well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 11:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123178, 136307, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very good. 10</td>', 'Very good. 10', '2005-01-21 11:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123180, 136620, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but way to grainy.  If the picture was a little more clearer I think it would have done a lot better.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Nice shot but way to grainy.  If the picture was a little more clearer I think it would have done a lot better.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 11:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123187, 136444, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment...<br/>I really like the way you`ve captured this with the child looking at the camera but the adult looking down..it helps to add a candid feel to the image.<br/>I would have preferred a tighter crop (losing the hand) and a touch more sharpness to make this a top pick for me..but I`m bumping it up as it still has a lot to offer.</td>', 'Back to comment...I really like the way you`ve captured this with the child looking at the camera but the adult looking down..it helps to add a candid feel to the image.I would have preferred a tighter crop (losing the hand) and a touch more sharpness to make this a top pick for me..but I`m bumping it up as it still has a lot to offer.', '2005-01-21 11:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123188, 135565, 8139, '<td valign="top">seems to be lots of burning/dodging . The result is not bad, but I''m not sure the saturated colors fits well with the mood of the subject. I had perhaps tryed in B/W.<br/>But it''s just me. Good composition.</td>', 'seems to be lots of burning/dodging . The result is not bad, but I''m not sure the saturated colors fits well with the mood of the subject. I had perhaps tryed in B/W.But it''s just me. Good composition.', '2005-01-21 11:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123193, 136319, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment...<br/>I`ve been agonising over this image for a few days as I don`t know if I prefer it with the two boats or whether it would have had more impact (for me) with just figures in the foreground...I`m just looking for icing on the cake as with or without, it is still a great image</td>', 'Back to comment...I`ve been agonising over this image for a few days as I don`t know if I prefer it with the two boats or whether it would have had more impact (for me) with just figures in the foreground...I`m just looking for icing on the cake as with or without, it is still a great image', '2005-01-21 11:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123198, 134979, 14603, '<td valign="top">Back to comment....<br/>Very powerful image thanks to the way you have captured it and the post processing applied.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Back to comment....Very powerful image thanks to the way you have captured it and the post processing applied.Good work', '2005-01-21 11:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
