(1123464, 134511, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful city shot but one can only assume that that is a plane flying in over the city.  If it is its a little to blurry to see what it is.  Well done and nice exposure time on this shot.  Excellent color and clarity.  Well done.  Keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'A beautiful city shot but one can only assume that that is a plane flying in over the city.  If it is its a little to blurry to see what it is.  Well done and nice exposure time on this shot.  Excellent color and clarity.  Well done.  Keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-21 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123466, 132096, 27375, '<td valign="top">I remember this one and have always loved it. She looks like someone out of the 20''s. I really like the glare she has. She seems determined about something. Photography at it''s best here.</td>', 'I remember this one and have always loved it. She looks like someone out of the 20''s. I really like the glare she has. She seems determined about something. Photography at it''s best here.', '2005-01-21 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
