(1123483, 132874, 14671, '<td valign="top">It looks like Dorothy andTtoto from that movie with the witches.  Nicely done with excellent clarity and desaturation.  The title doesn''t do it justice tho.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'It looks like Dorothy andTtoto from that movie with the witches.  Nicely done with excellent clarity and desaturation.  The title doesn''t do it justice tho.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123493, 136772, 10634, '<td valign="top">Is this a Retic??  Very interesting shot. Never expected to see it here. LOL<br/> <br/>IMO, if the focus were a little lower so the eye was more sharp, this would be even better... would have more impact. Very impressive none the less.</td>', 'Is this a Retic??  Very interesting shot. Never expected to see it here. LOL IMO, if the focus were a little lower so the eye was more sharp, this would be even better... would have more impact. Very impressive none the less.', '2005-01-21 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123497, 136350, 14671, '<td valign="top">Ok the only way for me to get rid of this photo is to vote on it even tho it''s making me sick to look at it. So... from the corner of my eye it has good color and clarity and great composition altho the subject is not for the faint hearted.  I am not fussy on the chosen DOF as te bakground is a little OOF.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Ok the only way for me to get rid of this photo is to vote on it even tho it''s making me sick to look at it. So... from the corner of my eye it has good color and clarity and great composition altho the subject is not for the faint hearted.  I am not fussy on the chosen DOF as te bakground is a little OOF.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123499, 136752, 10634, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet beautiful. Works well in B&amp;W</td>', 'Simple, yet beautiful. Works well in B&W', '2005-01-21 13:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123500, 136651, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  A shot that makes you ponder what the hell a rock statue is looking upward for. lol It has a mindless gaze which allows the viewer to sit there and think and I feel would make for a nice gallery piece.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Nice shot.  A shot that makes you ponder what the hell a rock statue is looking upward for. lol It has a mindless gaze which allows the viewer to sit there and think and I feel would make for a nice gallery piece.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  <9>', '2005-01-21 13:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
