(1123512, 136614, 14671, '<td valign="top">A touching photo but it lacks clarity and there seems to be a lot of noise in the sky.  Perhaps its the camera and I would have scored it a little higher with an ISO 50 to get rid of the noise.  Very touching.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'A touching photo but it lacks clarity and there seems to be a lot of noise in the sky.  Perhaps its the camera and I would have scored it a little higher with an ISO 50 to get rid of the noise.  Very touching.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-21 13:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
