(1123553, 133403, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful costal shot but the contrast off the rock face is very hard to look at because of the brightness.  If I stand back and look its a very nice photo and lots of detail.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'A beautiful costal shot but the contrast off the rock face is very hard to look at because of the brightness.  If I stand back and look its a very nice photo and lots of detail.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-21 13:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
