(1123563, 135892, 19959, '<td valign="top">cliched Fall Scene. This is very nice. Can''t help wishing for something below the bow to give scale... dog walker etc... (but that is just me being picky!) good stuff!</td>', 'cliched Fall Scene. This is very nice. Can''t help wishing for something below the bow to give scale... dog walker etc... (but that is just me being picky!) good stuff!', '2005-01-21 14:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
