(1123571, 134607, 10634, '<td valign="top">The coolness factor of this shot earns it at least a 6 in my book. Suggestions... May have been better with the bottom halves of the people in the picture.</td>', 'The coolness factor of this shot earns it at least a 6 in my book. Suggestions... May have been better with the bottom halves of the people in the picture.', '2005-01-21 14:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
