(1123573, 133084, 19959, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. These shots are in the class ''love ''em or hate ''em'' I think that they have merit and you have made a good shot here. The sense of movement works well, perhaps a little burnt out in the highlights..</td>', 'Hmmm. These shots are in the class ''love ''em or hate ''em'' I think that they have merit and you have made a good shot here. The sense of movement works well, perhaps a little burnt out in the highlights..', '2005-01-21 14:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
