(1123578, 136424, 10634, '<td valign="top">ROFL   Gotta tell me where this was taken because I have got to see this for myself.</td>', 'ROFL   Gotta tell me where this was taken because I have got to see this for myself.', '2005-01-21 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123579, 136745, 25140, '<td valign="top">The lighting is interesting, I can''t quite figure it out. I think a little more light from below would balance the photo better, making the white and red flowers brighter.</td>', 'The lighting is interesting, I can''t quite figure it out. I think a little more light from below would balance the photo better, making the white and red flowers brighter.', '2005-01-21 14:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123581, 133415, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The B&amp;W toning is very good. <br/>Unfortunately there is a lot of clutter in the centre. I mean, many high detailed objects like the rocks, bushes and trees. The unfortunate part is that the 640 wide limit of DPC doesn''t do it justice. I expect it looks much better at 800 wide.<br/>I like the soft mood of the mountain. The last 10 to 15% of the right side doesn''tt add much to the composition except to keep a balance between the reeds on the left and right. 7</td>', 'Nice photo. The B&W toning is very good. Unfortunately there is a lot of clutter in the centre. I mean, many high detailed objects like the rocks, bushes and trees. The unfortunate part is that the 640 wide limit of DPC doesn''t do it justice. I expect it looks much better at 800 wide.I like the soft mood of the mountain. The last 10 to 15% of the right side doesn''tt add much to the composition except to keep a balance between the reeds on the left and right. 7', '2005-01-21 14:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123583, 136679, 10634, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the whole elbow and head, but otherwise a very nice photo... and a yummy model   ;-)</td>', 'Would have liked to see the whole elbow and head, but otherwise a very nice photo... and a yummy model   ;-)', '2005-01-21 14:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123586, 132190, 25140, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, seems a little unbalanced, the left side looks heavy, I think its cropped too close to the back of the man''s legs</td>', 'a nice idea, seems a little unbalanced, the left side looks heavy, I think its cropped too close to the back of the man''s legs', '2005-01-21 14:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123587, 134410, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great catch, excellent detail. There is still some spinning in the wheels left to show that it is not a trick setup (I know it isn''t, seen plenty of this stuff myself). I like it, but am left with an empty feeling. The photo doesn''t show the atmosphere, the setting, the crowd going wild, stuff like that. But maybe that is a bit too much to ask for. :) 7</td>', 'Great catch, excellent detail. There is still some spinning in the wheels left to show that it is not a trick setup (I know it isn''t, seen plenty of this stuff myself). I like it, but am left with an empty feeling. The photo doesn''t show the atmosphere, the setting, the crowd going wild, stuff like that. But maybe that is a bit too much to ask for. :) 7', '2005-01-21 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123590, 136818, 25140, '<td valign="top">snow is too blue, seems a little over saturated.</td>', 'snow is too blue, seems a little over saturated.', '2005-01-21 14:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
