(1123853, 133758, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I think. This is a parallel of that classic really poppy colour study - presumably, from your title, it would have bright punchy reds, yellows, greens, blues ... so, of course, to present it in B/W is intriguing. However (and there''s always a however, isn''t there?) ... I''m not sure whether it''s the knowledge, the familiarity of that referred to image, or whether it''s a genuine thing, but this seems to be lacking real texture, and is more of graphic image - but of course you''ve invited that comparison with the big colour shot ... <br/> <br/>There is a strong sense of fragility on the petals though - that translucency. I''m not quite sure what to make of it at the moment.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I think. This is a parallel of that classic really poppy colour study - presumably, from your title, it would have bright punchy reds, yellows, greens, blues ... so, of course, to present it in B/W is intriguing. However (and there''s always a however, isn''t there?) ... I''m not sure whether it''s the knowledge, the familiarity of that referred to image, or whether it''s a genuine thing, but this seems to be lacking real texture, and is more of graphic image - but of course you''ve invited that comparison with the big colour shot ...  There is a strong sense of fragility on the petals though - that translucency. I''m not quite sure what to make of it at the moment.', '2005-01-21 17:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123854, 133230, 10634, '<td valign="top">Great shot... some people may say lose the girl, but I think she really adds to this photo</td>', 'Great shot... some people may say lose the girl, but I think she really adds to this photo', '2005-01-21 17:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123855, 133748, 18216, '<td valign="top">Great timing! I''ve tried to get a picture of lightning myself, but never this well! Good job.</td>', 'Great timing! I''ve tried to get a picture of lightning myself, but never this well! Good job.', '2005-01-21 17:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123856, 136775, 10634, '<td valign="top">Now that is an awesome sky</td>', 'Now that is an awesome sky', '2005-01-21 17:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123859, 132733, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst there are marvellous qualities to this, it somehow seems to lack that real fragility of fine detail - perhaps a processing thing, which would be good as it would be rescuable, perhaps. For me, it jjust takes the edge off what would otherwise have been a marvellous study.</td>', 'Whilst there are marvellous qualities to this, it somehow seems to lack that real fragility of fine detail - perhaps a processing thing, which would be good as it would be rescuable, perhaps. For me, it jjust takes the edge off what would otherwise have been a marvellous study.', '2005-01-21 17:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123862, 132693, 10634, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the movie "The Aristocats" and the goose sisters. They teach the cats to waddle like they do (in fact insist they waddle along with them) and there is a whole scene devoted to watching them all waddle down the road. LOL  Anyway, very crisp shot... beautiful.</td>', 'Reminds me of the movie "The Aristocats" and the goose sisters. They teach the cats to waddle like they do (in fact insist they waddle along with them) and there is a whole scene devoted to watching them all waddle down the road. LOL  Anyway, very crisp shot... beautiful.', '2005-01-21 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123864, 136239, 21862, '<td valign="top">what big beautiful eyes!</td>', 'what big beautiful eyes!', '2005-01-21 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123865, 132622, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice... is that a gradient?</td>', 'Very nice... is that a gradient?', '2005-01-21 17:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123866, 134270, 6999, '<td valign="top">Special light here - though there''s a sneaking suspicion that it''s very careful editing and use of contrast. I like the composition, although the black triangle of the shop awning to image left adds an unwelcome structural note, i think, especially being so close to the horse''s head. A really great travel shot.</td>', 'Special light here - though there''s a sneaking suspicion that it''s very careful editing and use of contrast. I like the composition, although the black triangle of the shop awning to image left adds an unwelcome structural note, i think, especially being so close to the horse''s head. A really great travel shot.', '2005-01-21 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123867, 136674, 10634, '<td valign="top">I would crop out the other ship... I''d love to see what this looks like in B&amp;W</td>', 'I would crop out the other ship... I''d love to see what this looks like in B&W', '2005-01-21 17:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123871, 133889, 10634, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and detail. I like the contrast between the feather and the wood in both color and texture.</td>', 'Wonderful texture and detail. I like the contrast between the feather and the wood in both color and texture.', '2005-01-21 17:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123873, 132207, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful documentary work. Impeccable - catches that sense of delicacy and brutality of the operating theatre. I would expect, however, that many folks wil find it too bloody for here; a great shame. It should be published.</td>', 'Wonderful documentary work. Impeccable - catches that sense of delicacy and brutality of the operating theatre. I would expect, however, that many folks wil find it too bloody for here; a great shame. It should be published.', '2005-01-21 17:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123875, 132176, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good viewpoint.  Interesting subject and good composition.  Somehow I would like to see a a bit more underexposed image.</td>', 'Very good viewpoint.  Interesting subject and good composition.  Somehow I would like to see a a bit more underexposed image.', '2005-01-21 17:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123878, 133925, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice car.  The only problem that I have with this picture is that it is obviously hand-blurred to make the car stand out.</td>', 'Nice car.  The only problem that I have with this picture is that it is obviously hand-blurred to make the car stand out.', '2005-01-21 17:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123879, 136675, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful subject.  Fantastic texture, light and tones.  The compositon could be more interesting.</td>', 'Very beautiful subject.  Fantastic texture, light and tones.  The compositon could be more interesting.', '2005-01-21 17:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123882, 133723, 10883, '<td valign="top">Great colours and the sea is suitably dark to get a certain mood to this picture.<br/>One or two niggles though.... on the left side of the picture on the horizon, there seems to be some blue that has spilled on to the sea or something....</td>', 'Great colours and the sea is suitably dark to get a certain mood to this picture.One or two niggles though.... on the left side of the picture on the horizon, there seems to be some blue that has spilled on to the sea or something....', '2005-01-21 17:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123885, 133213, 24642, '<td valign="top">Classy, smooth, effortless and yes very retro.</td>', 'Classy, smooth, effortless and yes very retro.', '2005-01-21 17:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123890, 136459, 3569, '<td valign="top">Quit stealing her eggs.  Nice action</td>', 'Quit stealing her eggs.  Nice action', '2005-01-21 17:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123894, 136657, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice robin</td>', 'Nice robin', '2005-01-21 17:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123897, 134492, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very fresh approach to a rather tired subject.  A very clever use of the light and dark background above and below the wire. The dark background really makes the hairs stand ount. I really like the balance and flow in this photograph. -10</td>', 'Very fresh approach to a rather tired subject.  A very clever use of the light and dark background above and below the wire. The dark background really makes the hairs stand ount. I really like the balance and flow in this photograph. -10', '2005-01-21 17:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123899, 136478, 10883, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.  You must have been quite high up to take this one.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.  You must have been quite high up to take this one.', '2005-01-21 17:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123900, 133111, 3569, '<td valign="top">Or Victory</td>', 'Or Victory', '2005-01-21 17:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123903, 136688, 3569, '<td valign="top">great subject and shot</td>', 'great subject and shot', '2005-01-21 17:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123905, 136815, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait (Icelandic by any chance?)<br/>Good lighting and a nice, soft feeling to it.<br/>Good job!</td>', 'Excellent portrait (Icelandic by any chance?)Good lighting and a nice, soft feeling to it.Good job!', '2005-01-21 17:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123906, 135987, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait, nice lightining but could be more dramatic to enhance the tension in the pose. -8</td>', 'Very good portrait, nice lightining but could be more dramatic to enhance the tension in the pose. -8', '2005-01-21 17:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123911, 136581, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good abstract.  Looks like you moved in a semi circle with the shutter open.<br/> <br/>Nice work and what really makes this picture is the beautiful combination of orange and blue.</td>', 'Good abstract.  Looks like you moved in a semi circle with the shutter open. Nice work and what really makes this picture is the beautiful combination of orange and blue.', '2005-01-21 17:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123915, 136746, 10883, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape, very well captured.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape, very well captured.', '2005-01-21 17:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123918, 132479, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good capture, nice colours in this photograph.<br/>Good job.</td>', 'Good capture, nice colours in this photograph.Good job.', '2005-01-21 17:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123966, 135639, 3032, '<td valign="top">I had something like this (in a landscape portrayal) on my wall for a long time. It too had an orange butterfly with a purple/green background.  I don''t know what it is, but these bright colors and especially the orange vs green/purple works refreshing, as if spring is just around the corner (while they just announce a -10 C temperature for the next week).<br/>The shallow dof always works great with these kinds of shots, but with butterflies I think it is important to keep the petals extending from the head in focus. You did a good job with this one. 8</td>', 'I had something like this (in a landscape portrayal) on my wall for a long time. It too had an orange butterfly with a purple/green background.  I don''t know what it is, but these bright colors and especially the orange vs green/purple works refreshing, as if spring is just around the corner (while they just announce a -10 C temperature for the next week).The shallow dof always works great with these kinds of shots, but with butterflies I think it is important to keep the petals extending from the head in focus. You did a good job with this one. 8', '2005-01-21 18:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123972, 136822, 3032, '<td valign="top">I do not entirely like the composition, but softness of the background is soo sweet to the eye, especially with the shallow dof that it makes up for that. There is a great ''mood'' in this photo. 8<br/></td>', 'I do not entirely like the composition, but softness of the background is soo sweet to the eye, especially with the shallow dof that it makes up for that. There is a great ''mood'' in this photo. 8', '2005-01-21 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123974, 133252, 7038, '<td valign="top">I find the exposire slightly off or you''ve done a bit too much burning which kind of distracts.  Great composition and mood captured. 8</td>', 'I find the exposire slightly off or you''ve done a bit too much burning which kind of distracts.  Great composition and mood captured. 8', '2005-01-21 18:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123980, 132744, 9939, '<td valign="top">A cute shot to be sure.</td>', 'A cute shot to be sure.', '2005-01-21 18:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123981, 132945, 3032, '<td valign="top">I kept wondering: This is a great portrait, but why did I give it an 8? I had a look at it several times and I think it is because of the balance between the person and the reed wall. For my feeling there is a bit too much wall, it brings the impact of the photo out of balance.<br/>Had a go at it in Photoshop and cropped this version from the left with a constrained aspect ratio of 5:4. Less wall, more emphasize on the face. IMHO the 5:4 crop works better.<br/></td>', 'I kept wondering: This is a great portrait, but why did I give it an 8? I had a look at it several times and I think it is because of the balance between the person and the reed wall. For my feeling there is a bit too much wall, it brings the impact of the photo out of balance.Had a go at it in Photoshop and cropped this version from the left with a constrained aspect ratio of 5:4. Less wall, more emphasize on the face. IMHO the 5:4 crop works better.', '2005-01-21 18:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123985, 132895, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty- but with the lack of a strong subject this loses a lot of impact.</td>', 'Pretty- but with the lack of a strong subject this loses a lot of impact.', '2005-01-21 18:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123987, 135150, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty, nice composition. Unfortunately doesn''t make me go "wow!"</td>', 'Pretty, nice composition. Unfortunately doesn''t make me go "wow!"', '2005-01-21 18:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123990, 133588, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, nice DOF</td>', 'Lovely colors, nice DOF', '2005-01-21 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123991, 136587, 24911, '<td valign="top">A great shot. My only comment is that ir ia a little bit too centered. 8.</td>', 'A great shot. My only comment is that ir ia a little bit too centered. 8.', '2005-01-21 18:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123992, 136632, 24911, '<td valign="top">Good composition. great use of DOF. Interesting subject. 7.</td>', 'Good composition. great use of DOF. Interesting subject. 7.', '2005-01-21 18:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123993, 136596, 9939, '<td valign="top">The crop here feels odd. To me seeing the top of her head and the entire photo on the wall in the back would make this more comfortable and would help me zero in on the wonderful character in her face instead of being distracted.</td>', 'The crop here feels odd. To me seeing the top of her head and the entire photo on the wall in the back would make this more comfortable and would help me zero in on the wonderful character in her face instead of being distracted.', '2005-01-21 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123995, 134364, 9939, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but doesn''t feel impactful to me.</td>', 'Interesting, but doesn''t feel impactful to me.', '2005-01-21 18:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1123997, 136863, 9939, '<td valign="top">A great capture to be sure. Shame about the lack of separation between the bird and the trees.</td>', 'A great capture to be sure. Shame about the lack of separation between the bird and the trees.', '2005-01-21 18:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124000, 136752, 24911, '<td valign="top">It probably looks great in colors. Why putting all this Blue in B&amp;W?<br/>I also wish we could have some space infront of her, as if to see where she is looking...</td>', 'It probably looks great in colors. Why putting all this Blue in B&W?I also wish we could have some space infront of her, as if to see where she is looking...', '2005-01-21 18:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124001, 133876, 9939, '<td valign="top">Eye shots are very common, and  this one doesn''t have anything special or unusual to make me go "wow!" The reflection in her eye is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Eye shots are very common, and  this one doesn''t have anything special or unusual to make me go "wow!" The reflection in her eye is somewhat distracting.', '2005-01-21 18:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124004, 135057, 3032, '<td valign="top">Heh heh he, check my profule photo. I guess this is how I''ll look like 40 to 50 years from now. :)<br/> <br/>Great portrait, I like the weathered expression, lookes like a seasoned fisherman.<br/>The way the light falls is very good. All the bright tones on the face and beard, all the dark tones on his jacket and background. Makes the face stand out very well.</td>', 'Heh heh he, check my profule photo. I guess this is how I''ll look like 40 to 50 years from now. :) Great portrait, I like the weathered expression, lookes like a seasoned fisherman.The way the light falls is very good. All the bright tones on the face and beard, all the dark tones on his jacket and background. Makes the face stand out very well.', '2005-01-21 18:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124005, 136204, 9939, '<td valign="top">Just crazy beautiful. I love images that make me gasp. Upon seeing this I immediately wanted to learn how to take photos like this one. Thank you for the inspiration. 10.</td>', 'Just crazy beautiful. I love images that make me gasp. Upon seeing this I immediately wanted to learn how to take photos like this one. Thank you for the inspiration. 10.', '2005-01-21 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124008, 136425, 24911, '<td valign="top">A different crop whould get a better composition. There are just too much of the sky IMHO. Since they don''t hols any interest, why show so mucf them?</td>', 'A different crop whould get a better composition. There are just too much of the sky IMHO. Since they don''t hols any interest, why show so mucf them?', '2005-01-21 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124009, 136597, 9939, '<td valign="top">Astoundingly beautiful, a ten.  Please, afterward, tell us how this was processed. I really want to learn to make images with these kind of tones. Wonderful, thank you for this.</td>', 'Astoundingly beautiful, a ten.  Please, afterward, tell us how this was processed. I really want to learn to make images with these kind of tones. Wonderful, thank you for this.', '2005-01-21 18:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124010, 133176, 9939, '<td valign="top">WOW. Incredible. I could do without the border, but that doesn''t stop it from being a ten.</td>', 'WOW. Incredible. I could do without the border, but that doesn''t stop it from being a ten.', '2005-01-21 18:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124011, 133403, 3032, '<td valign="top">The composition is the strengt of this photograph. The lines of the hills take you from the bottom, up and to the right. The boats in the water add some interest to that space and give a scale reference. The blowout brightness at the top prevents the eye from leaving the scene. On the other hand, the brightness on the rocks is a bit too much and there are few shadows. Earlier or later in the day might yield better contrasts. 7</td>', 'The composition is the strengt of this photograph. The lines of the hills take you from the bottom, up and to the right. The boats in the water add some interest to that space and give a scale reference. The blowout brightness at the top prevents the eye from leaving the scene. On the other hand, the brightness on the rocks is a bit too much and there are few shadows. Earlier or later in the day might yield better contrasts. 7', '2005-01-21 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124014, 133969, 9939, '<td valign="top">An odd composition- the leaf in front of the snakes nose makes this lose some impact. Also, is the snake fake? Or oversharpened?</td>', 'An odd composition- the leaf in front of the snakes nose makes this lose some impact. Also, is the snake fake? Or oversharpened?', '2005-01-21 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124015, 135980, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the orange vs blue and how the yellyfish glows.</td>', 'I like the orange vs blue and how the yellyfish glows.', '2005-01-21 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124017, 136872, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but the mottled, noisy quality of the sky really detracts.</td>', 'Lovely, but the mottled, noisy quality of the sky really detracts.', '2005-01-21 18:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124020, 132795, 3032, '<td valign="top">The human element in this makes it have a good impact. I like the roll of the waves, makes the scene more dynamic. The sun looks a bit strange, but that can happen. 7</td>', 'The human element in this makes it have a good impact. I like the roll of the waves, makes the scene more dynamic. The sun looks a bit strange, but that can happen. 7', '2005-01-21 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124022, 135633, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty, nice composition. I wish the dark corner in the upper right was fixed and that the blue of the sky wasn''t quite so noisy.</td>', 'Pretty, nice composition. I wish the dark corner in the upper right was fixed and that the blue of the sky wasn''t quite so noisy.', '2005-01-21 18:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124024, 136870, 9939, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but doesn''t wow me.</td>', 'Interesting, but doesn''t wow me.', '2005-01-21 18:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124027, 133028, 9939, '<td valign="top">These are interesting figures, it would be great if they had a little breathing space - the crop on this feels very cramped to me.</td>', 'These are interesting figures, it would be great if they had a little breathing space - the crop on this feels very cramped to me.', '2005-01-21 18:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124029, 136119, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice, but doesn''t wow me.</td>', 'Nice, but doesn''t wow me.', '2005-01-21 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124036, 136590, 9939, '<td valign="top">This has the potential, to me, to be a great shot. The centered composition of the windmill hurts a bit, and the noise in the sky does as well. The entire image feels a little odd, as if the processing is a little off somehow- too soft in places and too sharp in others. And this is just an aside- is there writing on the top of the hills on either side of the windmill??</td>', 'This has the potential, to me, to be a great shot. The centered composition of the windmill hurts a bit, and the noise in the sky does as well. The entire image feels a little odd, as if the processing is a little off somehow- too soft in places and too sharp in others. And this is just an aside- is there writing on the top of the hills on either side of the windmill??', '2005-01-21 18:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124039, 135711, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but just too much unnaturally curved. Shot with a fisheye?<br/>It is also very busy, especially the element in the foreground draws the attention away from the fisherman.<br/>Despite all that, interesting shot. Makes me think of the saltpanning works on several Carribean Islands. The structure looks to geometrical alligned to not be human made.<br/></td>', 'Interesting perspective, but just too much unnaturally curved. Shot with a fisheye?It is also very busy, especially the element in the foreground draws the attention away from the fisherman.Despite all that, interesting shot. Makes me think of the saltpanning works on several Carribean Islands. The structure looks to geometrical alligned to not be human made.', '2005-01-21 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124044, 134989, 9939, '<td valign="top">To me, this has a lot of potential- great light, great clouds, great capture. The noise in the sky and the fuzziness of the trees hurts it, in my opinion.</td>', 'To me, this has a lot of potential- great light, great clouds, great capture. The noise in the sky and the fuzziness of the trees hurts it, in my opinion.', '2005-01-21 18:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124049, 134492, 3032, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective, entertainting lines. I like the contrast in this photo, both the contrast of light as the contrast between the soft white stuff vs the hard barb-wire. 7</td>', 'Simple but effective, entertainting lines. I like the contrast in this photo, both the contrast of light as the contrast between the soft white stuff vs the hard barb-wire. 7', '2005-01-21 18:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124051, 133232, 9939, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit uninteresting and the subject doesn''t wow me. Nice composition though.</td>', 'The light is a bit uninteresting and the subject doesn''t wow me. Nice composition though.', '2005-01-21 18:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124053, 136426, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like it how the line of the river leads me across the plains, but in that background it lacks a certain punch. 7</td>', 'I like it how the line of the river leads me across the plains, but in that background it lacks a certain punch. 7', '2005-01-21 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124055, 135921, 9939, '<td valign="top">The light here is a bit harsh, and the subject is somewhat unappealing- it looks like someone sneezed on it.</td>', 'The light here is a bit harsh, and the subject is somewhat unappealing- it looks like someone sneezed on it.', '2005-01-21 18:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124060, 135047, 9939, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what''s in sharp focus here- if his eye was sharp, I think this would have been great in the bokeh challenge!</td>', 'Hard to tell what''s in sharp focus here- if his eye was sharp, I think this would have been great in the bokeh challenge!', '2005-01-21 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124062, 136215, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very cold, hard and intimidating. This is caused by his pose, the lighting and the cool toning. It is interesting how this contrasts to the cross around his neck, wich is supposed to stand for warmth, love and community. Interesting.<br/>Without the light in the eyes it would loose its impact.</td>', 'Very cold, hard and intimidating. This is caused by his pose, the lighting and the cool toning. It is interesting how this contrasts to the cross around his neck, wich is supposed to stand for warmth, love and community. Interesting.Without the light in the eyes it would loose its impact.', '2005-01-21 18:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124064, 136539, 9939, '<td valign="top">If we could see a little more of his surroundings - with him in a less centered composition- this might tell a stronger story. Otherwise he''s just a cute guy ;)</td>', 'If we could see a little more of his surroundings - with him in a less centered composition- this might tell a stronger story. Otherwise he''s just a cute guy ;)', '2005-01-21 18:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124067, 132491, 9939, '<td valign="top">For me the composition here feels unbalanced and heavy on the right- not centering the main subject would make this demand more investigation from the viewer. Excellent subject, beautiful exposure.</td>', 'For me the composition here feels unbalanced and heavy on the right- not centering the main subject would make this demand more investigation from the viewer. Excellent subject, beautiful exposure.', '2005-01-21 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124068, 133230, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. I like it how the rock (all of it) seems to express itself trough the steam, but especially trough the wind in her hair. The path provides a nice leading line, adds depth and gives a reference of scale for the background.<br/>Damn, Iceland "rocks". :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting scene. I like it how the rock (all of it) seems to express itself trough the steam, but especially trough the wind in her hair. The path provides a nice leading line, adds depth and gives a reference of scale for the background.Damn, Iceland "rocks". :) ', '2005-01-21 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124071, 136790, 9939, '<td valign="top">Seeing the daughter a tad more in focus would make this more impactful for me. The dark object across the bottom also distracts my eye quite a bit.</td>', 'Seeing the daughter a tad more in focus would make this more impactful for me. The dark object across the bottom also distracts my eye quite a bit.', '2005-01-21 18:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124075, 132114, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lovely, understated.</td>', 'Lovely, understated.', '2005-01-21 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124077, 132909, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, I like the tenderness that is expressed in this shot vs the rough appearence of the father with his bald head, beard and tattoo.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, I like the tenderness that is expressed in this shot vs the rough appearence of the father with his bald head, beard and tattoo.', '2005-01-21 18:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124079, 133277, 9939, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a black squirrel before! Interesting shot, though the light on him looks a little harsh- flash?</td>', 'I''ve never seen a black squirrel before! Interesting shot, though the light on him looks a little harsh- flash?', '2005-01-21 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124082, 136790, 3032, '<td valign="top">Well expressed. She seems like she is standing on guard. :)<br/>The blownout out of  focus foreground is just a bit too extreme, it distracts.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well expressed. She seems like she is standing on guard. :)The blownout out of  focus foreground is just a bit too extreme, it distracts. ', '2005-01-21 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
