(1124085, 135149, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2005-01-21 18:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124087, 133598, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful how they stnad out from the background.</td>', 'Wonderful how they stnad out from the background.', '2005-01-21 18:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124088, 136506, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition- this would feel a lot more personalized to me if I could see his eyes.</td>', 'Lovely composition- this would feel a lot more personalized to me if I could see his eyes.', '2005-01-21 18:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124089, 132733, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great macro.</td>', 'Great macro.', '2005-01-21 18:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124092, 135783, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amazing how one day he will be as big as the pile of stones. Nice work.<br/>His pose and especially his looking out of the frame like this keep me from scoring it higher than a 7.</td>', 'Amazing how one day he will be as big as the pile of stones. Nice work.His pose and especially his looking out of the frame like this keep me from scoring it higher than a 7.', '2005-01-21 18:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124095, 132068, 9939, '<td valign="top">What is the main subject I should be looking at here? The composition and lighting makes it difficult to tell. My eye follows the roofline to the center of the shot to the background horizon and I''m left stranded. I can''t see enough detail or interest in the barn (I wouldn''t have been able to tell that''s what it was, save the title), to make me want to investigate it further.</td>', 'What is the main subject I should be looking at here? The composition and lighting makes it difficult to tell. My eye follows the roofline to the center of the shot to the background horizon and I''m left stranded. I can''t see enough detail or interest in the barn (I wouldn''t have been able to tell that''s what it was, save the title), to make me want to investigate it further.', '2005-01-21 18:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124096, 136602, 9939, '<td valign="top">An interesting statement that loses a bit of impact for me wihtout being able to see the eyes.</td>', 'An interesting statement that loses a bit of impact for me wihtout being able to see the eyes.', '2005-01-21 18:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124098, 133957, 9939, '<td valign="top">To me, not being able to see the eyes of any of the three animals takes away a great deal of impact.</td>', 'To me, not being able to see the eyes of any of the three animals takes away a great deal of impact.', '2005-01-21 18:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124099, 136282, 9939, '<td valign="top">Cute, but probably won''t have impact on any viewer as much as it does for you.</td>', 'Cute, but probably won''t have impact on any viewer as much as it does for you.', '2005-01-21 18:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124101, 132456, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the old painting quality of this, with just enough detail to make me want to see more. Bumping up a notch.</td>', 'I like the old painting quality of this, with just enough detail to make me want to see more. Bumping up a notch.', '2005-01-21 18:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124102, 136745, 9939, '<td valign="top">Lighting here strikes me as a bit odd, the main subject doesn''t seem to be as well lit as the flower in the rear left. Lovely subjects.</td>', 'Lighting here strikes me as a bit odd, the main subject doesn''t seem to be as well lit as the flower in the rear left. Lovely subjects.', '2005-01-21 18:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124103, 134009, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now. There''s an almost cut and paste feel to this, almost like an old-time sea-seide shot where someone posed in front of a backdrop. Purely light of course - and very well handled. The style is slihgtly eastern in feel, fitting to the subject. I like it - photographially, it has a certain stance.</td>', 'Now. There''s an almost cut and paste feel to this, almost like an old-time sea-seide shot where someone posed in front of a backdrop. Purely light of course - and very well handled. The style is slihgtly eastern in feel, fitting to the subject. I like it - photographially, it has a certain stance.', '2005-01-21 18:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124104, 136409, 9939, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but isn''t impactful for me.</td>', 'Interesting, but isn''t impactful for me.', '2005-01-21 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124105, 134673, 9939, '<td valign="top">Cute, but doesn''t wow me.</td>', 'Cute, but doesn''t wow me.', '2005-01-21 18:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124106, 133925, 9939, '<td valign="top">The cramped crop here bothers me a bit. Gorgeous subject.</td>', 'The cramped crop here bothers me a bit. Gorgeous subject.', '2005-01-21 18:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124108, 134571, 6999, '<td valign="top">A lot of things to like here - the light on the kettle, texture in the cloth. It feels slightly over-bright, whether exposure or processing I don''t know, but I would have the levels of the clogs toned down somewhat - they seem almost out of place - and whilst there is detail there, it <i>feels</i> blown out. Also i think the composition is too crowded, especailly the upper right of frame: things there are indistinct, and the confusion of that for me unsettles the rest of the image.</td>', 'A lot of things to like here - the light on the kettle, texture in the cloth. It feels slightly over-bright, whether exposure or processing I don''t know, but I would have the levels of the clogs toned down somewhat - they seem almost out of place - and whilst there is detail there, it feels blown out. Also i think the composition is too crowded, especailly the upper right of frame: things there are indistinct, and the confusion of that for me unsettles the rest of the image.', '2005-01-21 18:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124109, 135164, 19982, '<td valign="top">This has been oversharpened.  You can see it along the edge of the chin, throughout the hair and eyebrows, on the lips, etc.  Yet it also looks softened.  Perhaps NeatImage was used?  Sometimes NI is too agressive and you have to turn it down so you don''t soften too much or sharpen too much.</td>', 'This has been oversharpened.  You can see it along the edge of the chin, throughout the hair and eyebrows, on the lips, etc.  Yet it also looks softened.  Perhaps NeatImage was used?  Sometimes NI is too agressive and you have to turn it down so you don''t soften too much or sharpen too much.', '2005-01-21 18:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124110, 133397, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very beautiful!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 18:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124111, 136162, 6999, '<td valign="top">it''s not bad at all - though I''m not sure you''ve made the correct decision about your cropping: whilst that bright band at the top of the image should serve to emphasise the darkness of the clouds, I think it is unueccesary - as the contrast with the lighthouse serves that purpose anyway, and that build-up of cloud, and the red under-lighting, would be the more powerful for istting in stronger parts of the frame compositionally. More than anything, i think the file size of the submission lets you down - you''ve used around a fifth of the avaiable file size, and that''s severely restricted your level of detail in such a large image, and detail is important in such a small image size as we get here.</td>', 'it''s not bad at all - though I''m not sure you''ve made the correct decision about your cropping: whilst that bright band at the top of the image should serve to emphasise the darkness of the clouds, I think it is unueccesary - as the contrast with the lighthouse serves that purpose anyway, and that build-up of cloud, and the red under-lighting, would be the more powerful for istting in stronger parts of the frame compositionally. More than anything, i think the file size of the submission lets you down - you''ve used around a fifth of the avaiable file size, and that''s severely restricted your level of detail in such a large image, and detail is important in such a small image size as we get here.', '2005-01-21 18:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124113, 134979, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m rapidly going off this processed feel - but I''ll make an exception for this shot. It serves the image perfectly, it''s done with grace, it uses the centred composition marvellously, the slight unevenness in the regression of the fence adds just that touch of fantasy to it, and maintains the interest. Gorgeous stuff.</td>', 'I''m rapidly going off this processed feel - but I''ll make an exception for this shot. It serves the image perfectly, it''s done with grace, it uses the centred composition marvellously, the slight unevenness in the regression of the fence adds just that touch of fantasy to it, and maintains the interest. Gorgeous stuff.', '2005-01-21 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124114, 135123, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!   Great use of negative space and leading lines.  Colors are perfect.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful!   Great use of negative space and leading lines.  Colors are perfect.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124117, 136478, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great compositional eye. Good detail, nicely balanced exposure, even with that squre being so burnt-out. Available presentatin size doesn''t help you, of course, but one can sense tthe detail.</td>', 'Great compositional eye. Good detail, nicely balanced exposure, even with that squre being so burnt-out. Available presentatin size doesn''t help you, of course, but one can sense tthe detail.', '2005-01-21 19:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124118, 136872, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124119, 133060, 26756, '<td valign="top">Returning to comment..<br/>This is very different. Typically with a sunset like this it''s either left at that, or the foreground subject is completely black.  Nice effect with the netting, though the light is uneven.  Overall a good shot.</td>', 'Returning to comment..This is very different. Typically with a sunset like this it''s either left at that, or the foreground subject is completely black.  Nice effect with the netting, though the light is uneven.  Overall a good shot.', '2005-01-21 19:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124121, 136428, 19982, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the view through the glasses is in focus...  I''ll have to try that some time.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Interesting how the view through the glasses is in focus...  I''ll have to try that some time.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124123, 135783, 6999, '<td valign="top">The light, tonality, detail are marvellous. I''ve yet to find shots of kids looking happy particularly appealing, but that''s beside the point. I think the overall composition is a touch weak - your chosen framing/cropping, for me, unblances what could have been a tremendous shot: it doesn''t quite have the flow one would really want.</td>', 'The light, tonality, detail are marvellous. I''ve yet to find shots of kids looking happy particularly appealing, but that''s beside the point. I think the overall composition is a touch weak - your chosen framing/cropping, for me, unblances what could have been a tremendous shot: it doesn''t quite have the flow one would really want.', '2005-01-21 19:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124124, 133111, 26756, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, pot smoking.  The world-wide way to ring in an era of peace.  Great subjects, wide tonality range and good light. A real portrayal of life and a great capture. 8</td>', 'Ah yes, pot smoking.  The world-wide way to ring in an era of peace.  Great subjects, wide tonality range and good light. A real portrayal of life and a great capture. 8', '2005-01-21 19:06:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1124126, 135047, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the shallow DOF.  And even though the squirrel has his back to you, you can still see his eye.  (a major grievance of mine is when you can''t see the eyes of the person or animal)  So big plus for you.  Love the colors in the background too.  Makes the picture very interesting.  My only nit might be a wish for a tad more sharpness around the eye.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love the shallow DOF.  And even though the squirrel has his back to you, you can still see his eye.  (a major grievance of mine is when you can''t see the eyes of the person or animal)  So big plus for you.  Love the colors in the background too.  Makes the picture very interesting.  My only nit might be a wish for a tad more sharpness around the eye.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124127, 136452, 26756, '<td valign="top">Loving the color of the rocks and the motion of the water.  I would like to have seen the guy a little farther to the right with more of a view of where he was hoping to go, rather than him being so centered.  7</td>', 'Loving the color of the rocks and the motion of the water.  I would like to have seen the guy a little farther to the right with more of a view of where he was hoping to go, rather than him being so centered.  7', '2005-01-21 19:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124129, 136706, 6999, '<td valign="top">A bunch of good stuff - exposure particularly, and that whiteness of the falls. Composition? Kind of disappointing, given the evident strength of the rest of the work here. The primary point of focus of this image is dead centre frame, and all the motion of the eye is restricted to the bottom two thirds of frame at most, and mostly to the left and centre thirds; I can''t help but think had you framed it that way you''d have an even more mystical and entrancing image, without looosing that feel of looming out of black that you have caught so well.</td>', 'A bunch of good stuff - exposure particularly, and that whiteness of the falls. Composition? Kind of disappointing, given the evident strength of the rest of the work here. The primary point of focus of this image is dead centre frame, and all the motion of the eye is restricted to the bottom two thirds of frame at most, and mostly to the left and centre thirds; I can''t help but think had you framed it that way you''d have an even more mystical and entrancing image, without looosing that feel of looming out of black that you have caught so well.', '2005-01-21 19:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124134, 133415, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow this looks Ansel Adams like, except it''s Danny Shaw &lt;grin&gt; (I saw your "Come see my photos in a gallery" thread, looked at the image, thought of this, then compared the two, and knew this was yours). Awsome tones, lovely dramitic scene.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow this looks Ansel Adams like, except it''s Danny Shaw <grin> (I saw your "Come see my photos in a gallery" thread, looked at the image, thought of this, then compared the two, and knew this was yours). Awsome tones, lovely dramitic scene. ', '2005-01-21 19:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124135, 135806, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely clear simple shot.  I think this is one of those times when a small border would have enhanced the shot.  The detail of the reflection is amazing.</td>', 'This is a lovely clear simple shot.  I think this is one of those times when a small border would have enhanced the shot.  The detail of the reflection is amazing.', '2005-01-21 19:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124136, 135208, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great photography. It speaks to me of our attempts to regiment our children, our oft-mistaken idea that education is about bringing them all to some accepted ''norm'' - and f the hugely optimistic hoplesness of that aspiration: the individuality of our children will always triumph over our attempts to put them in boxes, and more power to them for that. Even if they have all got the same kind of hat on. Lovely - no, more powerful than that - well, simply great photography.</td>', 'Great photography. It speaks to me of our attempts to regiment our children, our oft-mistaken idea that education is about bringing them all to some accepted ''norm'' - and f the hugely optimistic hoplesness of that aspiration: the individuality of our children will always triumph over our attempts to put them in boxes, and more power to them for that. Even if they have all got the same kind of hat on. Lovely - no, more powerful than that - well, simply great photography.', '2005-01-21 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124138, 134009, 19982, '<td valign="top">This is amazing in that it appears as just a plain old snapshot.  And at the same time, it is anything but!  I like the leading lines (fence, trees, shoreline and waves).  The exposure is perfect in spite of a bright sun with its potential for harsh shadows.  And I love the colors.  My only complaint might be that her arms just disappear out of the picture...  it leaves me wondering why they were cropped.  But other than that, I really like this image.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is amazing in that it appears as just a plain old snapshot.  And at the same time, it is anything but!  I like the leading lines (fence, trees, shoreline and waves).  The exposure is perfect in spite of a bright sun with its potential for harsh shadows.  And I love the colors.  My only complaint might be that her arms just disappear out of the picture...  it leaves me wondering why they were cropped.  But other than that, I really like this image.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124139, 133252, 6999, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t, for me, have the power of speech that the best shots in this challenge have. It has beautiful moments, and some real strength, however.</td>', 'Doesn''t, for me, have the power of speech that the best shots in this challenge have. It has beautiful moments, and some real strength, however.', '2005-01-21 19:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124141, 133566, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am usually not a big fan of motion blur because so many use it when it does not enhance a shot.  This on the other hand is very nearly perfect.  Great focus on the subject.  My only suggestion would be to maybe crop a little tighter on the left, but I understand why you didn''t with the writing on the saddle blanket.</td>', 'I am usually not a big fan of motion blur because so many use it when it does not enhance a shot.  This on the other hand is very nearly perfect.  Great focus on the subject.  My only suggestion would be to maybe crop a little tighter on the left, but I understand why you didn''t with the writing on the saddle blanket.', '2005-01-21 19:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124143, 136794, 19982, '<td valign="top">The thing I would look for in this is a bit more sharpness in the detail.  (not that you need to sharpen it in the computer ... but it appears maybe you were just outside of the focus point for the lens, perhaps too close to focus?)<br/></td>', 'The thing I would look for in this is a bit more sharpness in the detail.  (not that you need to sharpen it in the computer ... but it appears maybe you were just outside of the focus point for the lens, perhaps too close to focus?)', '2005-01-21 19:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124146, 136593, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one is almost too good to be true.  What a beautifully captured silhouette.  The colors and pose and even the dip in grass to add a little interest are all perfect.  Maybe a little grainy in the sky, but it works.</td>', 'This one is almost too good to be true.  What a beautifully captured silhouette.  The colors and pose and even the dip in grass to add a little interest are all perfect.  Maybe a little grainy in the sky, but it works.', '2005-01-21 19:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124147, 136602, 19982, '<td valign="top">A major no-no in my book is... not being able to see the eyes.</td>', 'A major no-no in my book is... not being able to see the eyes.', '2005-01-21 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124148, 132693, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro.  Perfect colors and perfect focus.  I also love the title.</td>', 'Beautiful macro.  Perfect colors and perfect focus.  I also love the title.', '2005-01-21 19:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124149, 136752, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2005-01-21 19:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124151, 136239, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Absolutely stunning eyes.  I just wish that small piece of hair was out of her eye.  Not marking down for that though.  Great work.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Absolutely stunning eyes.  I just wish that small piece of hair was out of her eye.  Not marking down for that though.  Great work.', '2005-01-21 19:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124152, 132255, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great lines, tones, composition, expression.  Perfect.</td>', 'Great lines, tones, composition, expression.  Perfect.', '2005-01-21 19:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124153, 136597, 19982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  The b&amp;w treatment works perfectly here.  I love the drama.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  The b&w treatment works perfectly here.  I love the drama.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124154, 136849, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It makes me want to stay there!</td>', 'Very nice.  It makes me want to stay there!', '2005-01-21 19:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124156, 136630, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124159, 136457, 19982, '<td valign="top">I would like this so much better if the line didn''t cut cross the elephant''s eye.... (sorry, major pet peeve of mine is the either not see the eye, or have something intrude on it)</td>', 'I would like this so much better if the line didn''t cut cross the elephant''s eye.... (sorry, major pet peeve of mine is the either not see the eye, or have something intrude on it)', '2005-01-21 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124160, 132307, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice.   Very nice!   Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Nice.   Very nice!   Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124161, 132804, 19982, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever wanted to see a turkey this close up.  But this is a wonderful image!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever wanted to see a turkey this close up.  But this is a wonderful image!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124163, 133792, 19982, '<td valign="top">Such perfect timing!  This is awesome.  I love the backlight on the deer!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Such perfect timing!  This is awesome.  I love the backlight on the deer!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124164, 133567, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-01-21 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124166, 134214, 19982, '<td valign="top">This image is great in the way it tells a story.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This image is great in the way it tells a story.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124167, 133862, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Love the silhouette and the placement on the left 3rd.  Beautiful sky!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice!  Love the silhouette and the placement on the left 3rd.  Beautiful sky!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124170, 135805, 19982, '<td valign="top">An awesome portrait!  Perfectly lit, with emphasis on the face.  Shallow DOF works well with perfect sharpness where it is needed.  And how about those eyes????  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'An awesome portrait!  Perfectly lit, with emphasis on the face.  Shallow DOF works well with perfect sharpness where it is needed.  And how about those eyes????  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124178, 136463, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice framing for the image!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Nice framing for the image!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124179, 136725, 19982, '<td valign="top">Too cute for words!   Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Too cute for words!   Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124180, 136424, 6999, '<td valign="top">I was once told that the speed and accuracy f writing files toa hard disk equates to flying a jumbo jet at 4 inches above the ground at 4000 miles an hour. I din''t realise someone had ctually done that. Fascinating shot.</td>', 'I was once told that the speed and accuracy f writing files toa hard disk equates to flying a jumbo jet at 4 inches above the ground at 4000 miles an hour. I din''t realise someone had ctually done that. Fascinating shot.', '2005-01-21 19:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124184, 133974, 19982, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered that the bird be on the left 3rd.  Give him room on the right to "fly into".  The centered composition doesn''t work here...</td>', 'I would have prefered that the bird be on the left 3rd.  Give him room on the right to "fly into".  The centered composition doesn''t work here...', '2005-01-21 19:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124186, 136746, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good. For me, yourr crop is a touch loose at the top and tight at the bottom, almthough the stock agencies would love that, I''m sure. It has a grace and sense of light that I like very much.</td>', 'Good. For me, yourr crop is a touch loose at the top and tight at the bottom, almthough the stock agencies would love that, I''m sure. It has a grace and sense of light that I like very much.', '2005-01-21 19:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124187, 134270, 19982, '<td valign="top">A perfect postcard.  I''d love to visit and see this place!  Love the sharpness in the details.  Lighting is great.  I only wish the horse/buggy were a bit further to the right to give them room to walk towards the left.  That .. and the horses face appears to "merge" with something in the background.  Other than that, this is really nice!</td>', 'A perfect postcard.  I''d love to visit and see this place!  Love the sharpness in the details.  Lighting is great.  I only wish the horse/buggy were a bit further to the right to give them room to walk towards the left.  That .. and the horses face appears to "merge" with something in the background.  Other than that, this is really nice!', '2005-01-21 19:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124189, 136718, 19982, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  I love the lighting in the bowl and of the girl and the lack of light above.  Nice and sharp where it counts and soft where it needs to be.  Good work!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  I love the lighting in the bowl and of the girl and the lack of light above.  Nice and sharp where it counts and soft where it needs to be.  Good work!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124191, 132524, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing for the clock.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice framing for the clock.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124193, 135613, 164, '<td valign="top">In as much that this is a picture of a picture it could be done better with a little contrast.</td>', 'In as much that this is a picture of a picture it could be done better with a little contrast.', '2005-01-21 19:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124195, 136033, 11756, '<td valign="top">neat shot.  good plannign, using the long lens.</td>', 'neat shot.  good plannign, using the long lens.', '2005-01-21 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124196, 132909, 19982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Soft and tender.  Love the lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice!  Soft and tender.  Love the lighting.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124198, 132733, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice sharpness, focus is spot on.</td>', 'nice sharpness, focus is spot on.', '2005-01-21 19:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
