(1124206, 132243, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here, the reflections are pretty - its a shame you can see the road on the left. Additionally I think the sunlight is a bit harsh in parts - makes the colours seems a little washed out.</td>', 'Nice composition here, the reflections are pretty - its a shame you can see the road on the left. Additionally I think the sunlight is a bit harsh in parts - makes the colours seems a little washed out.', '2005-01-21 19:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124208, 136424, 6667, '<td valign="top">I am sure you have already been asked but I''ll pile on:  Where in the heck was this taken?!  Nice capture.  BOL</td>', 'I am sure you have already been asked but I''ll pile on:  Where in the heck was this taken?!  Nice capture.  BOL', '2005-01-21 19:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124209, 136777, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty mountains - I really like what you are trying to do  here, but I think the red tree in the foreground ruins the effect to a degree. Would have liked the nice, even, division between green trees, mountain and sky that would have resulted if it were not there. 6</td>', 'Very pretty mountains - I really like what you are trying to do  here, but I think the red tree in the foreground ruins the effect to a degree. Would have liked the nice, even, division between green trees, mountain and sky that would have resulted if it were not there. 6', '2005-01-21 19:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124211, 133598, 19982, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait!  I hope she has that one hanging on her wall!  I like the angles in the lines.  The non-centered composition.  The use of dark negative space to force you into the subject.  The shallow depth of field.  Very nice!  Good luck in the challenge!     (finished voting, returning to say that this is one of my top picks!)</td>', 'A lovely portrait!  I hope she has that one hanging on her wall!  I like the angles in the lines.  The non-centered composition.  The use of dark negative space to force you into the subject.  The shallow depth of field.  Very nice!  Good luck in the challenge!     (finished voting, returning to say that this is one of my top picks!)', '2005-01-21 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124212, 136414, 19982, '<td valign="top">This looks like the lighting might be a bit of dodging and burning via Photoshop.  Nevertheless, I love it.  Great job!   Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This looks like the lighting might be a bit of dodging and burning via Photoshop.  Nevertheless, I love it.  Great job!   Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
