(1124218, 135618, 19982, '<td valign="top">I swear this looks like the house that fell on the witch in wizard of oz!  :-)   I love the technique here.  I hope you''ll detail it later for us.  Good luck in the challenge!  (finished voting, returning to say that this is one of my top picks!)</td>', 'I swear this looks like the house that fell on the witch in wizard of oz!  :-)   I love the technique here.  I hope you''ll detail it later for us.  Good luck in the challenge!  (finished voting, returning to say that this is one of my top picks!)', '2005-01-21 19:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
