(1124221, 133125, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image here, the boaters add a nice feel to this landscape.</td>', 'Nice simple image here, the boaters add a nice feel to this landscape.', '2005-01-21 19:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124223, 136626, 19982, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful.  So many people never get animals right.  You gotta get the eyes, and you did.  You gotta make them look natural, and you did.  You gotta get them sharp, and you did.  And you gotta somehow emphasize them, and your depth of field here is just perfect.  I love it.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is just beautiful.  So many people never get animals right.  You gotta get the eyes, and you did.  You gotta make them look natural, and you did.  You gotta get them sharp, and you did.  And you gotta somehow emphasize them, and your depth of field here is just perfect.  I love it.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-01-21 19:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124224, 136239, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, thought I commented on this one but it has popped up again, basically what I said was that this girls eyes are incredibly engaging, and the lighting you have used accentuates that well - they almost twinkle. The fact that she is staring straight at the lens however, makes the violin seem almost extraneous. Still on the stength of those eyes its a seven.</td>', 'Hmmm, thought I commented on this one but it has popped up again, basically what I said was that this girls eyes are incredibly engaging, and the lighting you have used accentuates that well - they almost twinkle. The fact that she is staring straight at the lens however, makes the violin seem almost extraneous. Still on the stength of those eyes its a seven.', '2005-01-21 19:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124225, 134296, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great candid. Love the guys expression and your composition is spot on. 8.</td>', 'Great candid. Love the guys expression and your composition is spot on. 8.', '2005-01-21 19:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124228, 136578, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice pleasant image, I get the feeling this might work better in black and white, but thats just me. Focus on the face seems fractionally soft. 6.</td>', 'Nice pleasant image, I get the feeling this might work better in black and white, but thats just me. Focus on the face seems fractionally soft. 6.', '2005-01-21 19:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124231, 136727, 23458, '<td valign="top">hehehe, nice take, no doubt inspired by cowspace (check the site favourites page if it wasnt). Love the composition here, the negative space is great. THis would work better with a more level patch of green grass, but still,  I do like this image for its simplicity. 7.</td>', 'hehehe, nice take, no doubt inspired by cowspace (check the site favourites page if it wasnt). Love the composition here, the negative space is great. THis would work better with a more level patch of green grass, but still,  I do like this image for its simplicity. 7.', '2005-01-21 19:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124233, 132779, 23458, '<td valign="top">One pretty nice portrait. Lighting and soft focus are great. Facial expression could perhaps be a little better, but otherwise very well done. An accomplished portrait for sure. 7.</td>', 'One pretty nice portrait. Lighting and soft focus are great. Facial expression could perhaps be a little better, but otherwise very well done. An accomplished portrait for sure. 7.', '2005-01-21 19:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124237, 136779, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the composition here. A couple of distracting elements in the bottom of the frame detract from the effect but this remains a nice idea.</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the composition here. A couple of distracting elements in the bottom of the frame detract from the effect but this remains a nice idea.', '2005-01-21 20:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124239, 133037, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty landscape, the sky was very cooperative wasnt it ? :). 8 from me.</td>', 'Very pretty landscape, the sky was very cooperative wasnt it ? :). 8 from me.', '2005-01-21 20:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124241, 136444, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well it might have been fleeting but you have captured this  moment very well. The focus seems a little off, but that might even heighten the feeling of tenderness this image conveys.</td>', 'Well it might have been fleeting but you have captured this  moment very well. The focus seems a little off, but that might even heighten the feeling of tenderness this image conveys.', '2005-01-21 20:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124246, 133252, 23458, '<td valign="top">Incredibly dramatic image. The scene is tremendous and you have composed it very well. Like the post processing to boot. 9.</td>', 'Incredibly dramatic image. The scene is tremendous and you have composed it very well. Like the post processing to boot. 9.', '2005-01-21 20:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124254, 132337, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, the tall thin crop works well.</td>', 'I like the composition here, the tall thin crop works well.', '2005-01-21 20:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124259, 132540, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really dramatic image. The way you have managed to catch that one boy in focus and looking at something completely different to the rest of the crowd is terrific, and renders the image tremendously impactful.</td>', 'Really dramatic image. The way you have managed to catch that one boy in focus and looking at something completely different to the rest of the crowd is terrific, and renders the image tremendously impactful.', '2005-01-21 20:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124264, 135980, 23458, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition, I really like the abstract feel to this image and the colours are amazing. Great work. I take it this is an acquarium shot ??....if not I am now massively jealous!</td>', 'Terrific composition, I really like the abstract feel to this image and the colours are amazing. Great work. I take it this is an acquarium shot ??....if not I am now massively jealous!', '2005-01-21 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124267, 132632, 23458, '<td valign="top">Like the effect of the sunlight in her hair and the shadows cast by the blinds, I would like to see a little more face, but otherwise this is quite a nice capture. 6.</td>', 'Like the effect of the sunlight in her hair and the shadows cast by the blinds, I would like to see a little more face, but otherwise this is quite a nice capture. 6.', '2005-01-21 20:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124271, 136818, 23458, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene, seems a little too busy perhaps - almost to the point of cluttered - there may be too much to look at in this image for its own good. That said I do like the contrast between the snowy, shadowed area on the right and the brightly lit well treed region on the left.</td>', 'Interesting scene, seems a little too busy perhaps - almost to the point of cluttered - there may be too much to look at in this image for its own good. That said I do like the contrast between the snowy, shadowed area on the right and the brightly lit well treed region on the left.', '2005-01-21 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124275, 136650, 23458, '<td valign="top">Pretty image, I like the simple white tones against the richness of that sky. Still, after seeing angrimur''s shot of this subject I can''t help but feel that you might have done more with it. In particular the trees at the bottom are a little distracting. 6.</td>', 'Pretty image, I like the simple white tones against the richness of that sky. Still, after seeing angrimur''s shot of this subject I can''t help but feel that you might have done more with it. In particular the trees at the bottom are a little distracting. 6.', '2005-01-21 20:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124278, 136337, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice desat here. Great pose, like the noise. Even the haze at the bottom works well. As far as wedding photos go, this is a good one.</td>', 'Nice desat here. Great pose, like the noise. Even the haze at the bottom works well. As far as wedding photos go, this is a good one.', '2005-01-21 20:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124281, 133300, 23458, '<td valign="top">Cute hands, but this is a concept that has been done so many times before that there needs to be something really extraordinary about the image for it to jump out at me. Still on technical merit alone this warrants a six.</td>', 'Cute hands, but this is a concept that has been done so many times before that there needs to be something really extraordinary about the image for it to jump out at me. Still on technical merit alone this warrants a six.', '2005-01-21 20:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124284, 136452, 23458, '<td valign="top">NIce composition and catch, really sorry to say but that border borders on criminal. 6.</td>', 'NIce composition and catch, really sorry to say but that border borders on criminal. 6.', '2005-01-21 20:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124292, 134979, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, those colors are right out of Lord Of The Rings! Of course in the movies, that desaturated look was driving me nuts, but here it looks great. The only improvement I can suggest is that just like you have two tones in the sky, it might be better to have two subtly different tones in the ground too. But that luminous fence is just fabulous - 9</td>', 'Wow, those colors are right out of Lord Of The Rings! Of course in the movies, that desaturated look was driving me nuts, but here it looks great. The only improvement I can suggest is that just like you have two tones in the sky, it might be better to have two subtly different tones in the ground too. But that luminous fence is just fabulous - 9', '2005-01-21 20:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124294, 132864, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a really sad image (which, I''m sure, means succeeded in your aim), not sure I like the viewpoint here, makes the image appear very condescending and de-humanising, on the other hand I guess that is somewhat reflective of what happens to people like this guy.</td>', 'This is a really sad image (which, I''m sure, means succeeded in your aim), not sure I like the viewpoint here, makes the image appear very condescending and de-humanising, on the other hand I guess that is somewhat reflective of what happens to people like this guy.', '2005-01-21 20:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124295, 135783, 23458, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful landscape. The golden cast from the sunset is simply beautiful. The little kid adds to the composition nicely, and his satisfied expression is a nice reflection of the mood you have created with this shot. Very uplifting. 9.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful landscape. The golden cast from the sunset is simply beautiful. The little kid adds to the composition nicely, and his satisfied expression is a nice reflection of the mood you have created with this shot. Very uplifting. 9.', '2005-01-21 20:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124297, 134735, 23458, '<td valign="top">Like the idea here, nice perspective and subject. There are a bit too many distractions though. Also, I''d try and make your next submission a little bigger - it loses a lot of the impact when under about 600 pixels on at least on side.</td>', 'Like the idea here, nice perspective and subject. There are a bit too many distractions though. Also, I''d try and make your next submission a little bigger - it loses a lot of the impact when under about 600 pixels on at least on side.', '2005-01-21 20:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124298, 132782, 23458, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, nice image, seems a little hazy for some reason - have you brightened it a lot or something ? 7.</td>', 'Cute kid, nice image, seems a little hazy for some reason - have you brightened it a lot or something ? 7.', '2005-01-21 20:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124299, 132597, 6999, '<td valign="top">The Old Town Hall in Geneva, again, huh? There are so many signature elements to this composition: the near-incidental (but essential) presence of life, the moment of oddness provided by the plant-pot, the strong sense fo rhythm and repetition in the railings and balustrades, and in the arches, the geometrical framing , the sense of texture in the stone. And a sense of waiting in shadow, which is not uncommon in your work either. It works on very many levels (regression through the various arches, one plant, two birds, three square windows, etc.). I lmost feel I know my way around this place now.</td>', 'The Old Town Hall in Geneva, again, huh? There are so many signature elements to this composition: the near-incidental (but essential) presence of life, the moment of oddness provided by the plant-pot, the strong sense fo rhythm and repetition in the railings and balustrades, and in the arches, the geometrical framing , the sense of texture in the stone. And a sense of waiting in shadow, which is not uncommon in your work either. It works on very many levels (regression through the various arches, one plant, two birds, three square windows, etc.). I lmost feel I know my way around this place now.', '2005-01-21 20:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124301, 133726, 23458, '<td valign="top">hehe, great title. better photo. 8. Black and white is really efffective in this image. The tonal variation between the wet and dry sand is great.</td>', 'hehe, great title. better photo. 8. Black and white is really efffective in this image. The tonal variation between the wet and dry sand is great.', '2005-01-21 20:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124302, 135466, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, but an image like this really does need to be perfectly level and symmetrical to work. This needs to be rotated a couple of degrees. Other than that good work.</td>', 'Nice perspective, but an image like this really does need to be perfectly level and symmetrical to work. This needs to be rotated a couple of degrees. Other than that good work.', '2005-01-21 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124305, 135602, 23458, '<td valign="top">Like your angle, the colours and the crisp focus, good job! To nitpick.... the whiteish blur on the left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Like your angle, the colours and the crisp focus, good job! To nitpick.... the whiteish blur on the left is a bit distracting.', '2005-01-21 20:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124309, 136409, 23458, '<td valign="top">Hehe, really like the title. The image itself unfortunately appears a little haphazard and washed out. I''d like to see this in less intense sunlight, with a bit more contrast and perhaps a little closer in around the turtles, they really are amazing creatures.</td>', 'Hehe, really like the title. The image itself unfortunately appears a little haphazard and washed out. I''d like to see this in less intense sunlight, with a bit more contrast and perhaps a little closer in around the turtles, they really are amazing creatures.', '2005-01-21 20:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
