(1124610, 132136, 16046, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s too weird, nice find</td>', 'Wow, that''s too weird, nice find', '2005-01-22 00:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124614, 134945, 16046, '<td valign="top">simple and awesome</td>', 'simple and awesome', '2005-01-22 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124615, 135987, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great art, nicely lit ,10</td>', 'Great art, nicely lit ,10', '2005-01-22 00:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124618, 133337, 16046, '<td valign="top">good postcard shot</td>', 'good postcard shot', '2005-01-22 00:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124620, 135275, 23458, '<td valign="top">Brilliant cow candid. I can''t help but smile at the expression on her face. Shame about the other cow - it really only distracts from the main feature.</td>', 'Brilliant cow candid. I can''t help but smile at the expression on her face. Shame about the other cow - it really only distracts from the main feature.', '2005-01-22 01:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124622, 136593, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice rack, well done</td>', 'Nice rack, well done', '2005-01-22 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124623, 135149, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice scene, but I can''t help but feel like it needs a little something else to complete it - a couple of people strolling along the water perhaps ? I know I know, you probably didn''t have a couple of spare people floating about, but as it is this image is a little bare. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a really nice scene, but I can''t help but feel like it needs a little something else to complete it - a couple of people strolling along the water perhaps ? I know I know, you probably didn''t have a couple of spare people floating about, but as it is this image is a little bare. Good luck!', '2005-01-22 01:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124625, 136869, 23458, '<td valign="top">Like the colouring here - don''t know whether thats beacause you bumped the saturation but whatever the case it works. The composition is perhaps a little too straightforward, but I quite like this nonetheless.</td>', 'Like the colouring here - don''t know whether thats beacause you bumped the saturation but whatever the case it works. The composition is perhaps a little too straightforward, but I quite like this nonetheless.', '2005-01-22 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124626, 133084, 16046, '<td valign="top">Another fine piece of art in this challange good job 10</td>', 'Another fine piece of art in this challange good job 10', '2005-01-22 01:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124627, 132136, 23458, '<td valign="top">Certainly is hanting - i really like what you''ve done with the sky. It does, however, look a little out of place with that foreground - looks very much pasted on - an artifact of the extent to which you''ve processed the sky perhaps, either way it is a little bit of a shame because that sky is really cool.</td>', 'Certainly is hanting - i really like what you''ve done with the sky. It does, however, look a little out of place with that foreground - looks very much pasted on - an artifact of the extent to which you''ve processed the sky perhaps, either way it is a little bit of a shame because that sky is really cool.', '2005-01-22 01:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124630, 135927, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic scene. Really like the way the cloud formation almost appears to be an extension of the mountain. Congratualtions on a really great shot. 8</td>', 'Nice dramatic scene. Really like the way the cloud formation almost appears to be an extension of the mountain. Congratualtions on a really great shot. 8', '2005-01-22 01:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124632, 132570, 23458, '<td valign="top">really great idea here. Lacking a little something in the execution - I would prefer this if you had kept the bricks in focus too. The colouring might be a little flat too. Still kudos for the great eye.</td>', 'really great idea here. Lacking a little something in the execution - I would prefer this if you had kept the bricks in focus too. The colouring might be a little flat too. Still kudos for the great eye.', '2005-01-22 01:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124634, 134989, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like what your going for here, and that sky is really cool. The foreground however, appears to be out of focus and parts of the image are really noisy - those two factors keep this in the middle of the pack unfortunately.</td>', 'I like what your going for here, and that sky is really cool. The foreground however, appears to be out of focus and parts of the image are really noisy - those two factors keep this in the middle of the pack unfortunately.', '2005-01-22 01:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124635, 136742, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you''ve used here with the hair framing the face. Don''t mind the overexposure on the right, but the girls facial expression is a little odd. Definately a good effort though.</td>', 'I like the idea you''ve used here with the hair framing the face. Don''t mind the overexposure on the right, but the girls facial expression is a little odd. Definately a good effort though.', '2005-01-22 01:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124638, 136229, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. A fantastic scene (and I mean that as in fantastic derived from fantasy) that would be right at home in the pages of any number of fairytales. I''m no expert on hair, but I''d say if I was a woman I''d be wishing I had hers. Perhaps a little too much space, but congrats on this highly appealing, original image. 9.</td>', 'This is terrific. A fantastic scene (and I mean that as in fantastic derived from fantasy) that would be right at home in the pages of any number of fairytales. I''m no expert on hair, but I''d say if I was a woman I''d be wishing I had hers. Perhaps a little too much space, but congrats on this highly appealing, original image. 9.', '2005-01-22 01:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124639, 136160, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good composition and colours here. Nice and crisp focus too. Very little to fault here - perhaps the light is fractionally harsher that I''d like but that really is nitpicking. 8.</td>', 'Good composition and colours here. Nice and crisp focus too. Very little to fault here - perhaps the light is fractionally harsher that I''d like but that really is nitpicking. 8.', '2005-01-22 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124640, 133154, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very cute. You haven''t quite got close enough for this to have much of an impact on me, but I like the thought behind this - a very sweet image.</td>', 'Very cute. You haven''t quite got close enough for this to have much of an impact on me, but I like the thought behind this - a very sweet image.', '2005-01-22 01:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124647, 135711, 1847, '<td valign="top">The first photo I vote on, and it''s stunning.  I''m a sucker for the effective use of a wide angle (or, in this case, fisheye) lens.  Brilliant.</td>', 'The first photo I vote on, and it''s stunning.  I''m a sucker for the effective use of a wide angle (or, in this case, fisheye) lens.  Brilliant.', '2005-01-22 01:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124648, 135127, 1847, '<td valign="top">Really a pretty portrait.  As a fellow "child photo" entrant in this challenge, I hope we''re not suffering too much from anti-kid backlash!</td>', 'Really a pretty portrait.  As a fellow "child photo" entrant in this challenge, I hope we''re not suffering too much from anti-kid backlash!', '2005-01-22 01:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124649, 136746, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very Pretty scene. Nice simple solid landscape shot. Absolutely nothing to fault about this shot. Might not be particularly deep, meaninful or original, but put this on a postcard and you''d make a lot of travellers happy. 8.</td>', 'Very Pretty scene. Nice simple solid landscape shot. Absolutely nothing to fault about this shot. Might not be particularly deep, meaninful or original, but put this on a postcard and you''d make a lot of travellers happy. 8.', '2005-01-22 01:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124654, 136417, 27375, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. Simple and it works. I cant help but to wonder what this shot would look like with someone in the chair looking up at the light or with their head in their hands. Works for me though..I would so hang this on my wall....10</td>', 'This is really cool. Simple and it works. I cant help but to wonder what this shot would look like with someone in the chair looking up at the light or with their head in their hands. Works for me though..I would so hang this on my wall....10', '2005-01-22 01:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124655, 135034, 1847, '<td valign="top">I''m generally not a big fan of the selective desaturation photos.  Not only are they done too much, but, more importantly, they are often misemployed.  In this case, leaving the paci in color draws the eye away from the beautiful child and the beamer mother, and straight to the splash of pink.  This would be a far better photo in straight B&amp;W.</td>', 'I''m generally not a big fan of the selective desaturation photos.  Not only are they done too much, but, more importantly, they are often misemployed.  In this case, leaving the paci in color draws the eye away from the beautiful child and the beamer mother, and straight to the splash of pink.  This would be a far better photo in straight B&W.', '2005-01-22 01:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124657, 136435, 27375, '<td valign="top">Love it. Seen it before and still love it. 10</td>', 'Love it. Seen it before and still love it. 10', '2005-01-22 01:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124658, 132225, 1847, '<td valign="top">A joyous photo, at a place I''m really fond of.  Love the Outer Banks.</td>', 'A joyous photo, at a place I''m really fond of.  Love the Outer Banks.', '2005-01-22 01:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124659, 135057, 27375, '<td valign="top">I would love to know the story behind this shot. What is saying? What is he doing?<br/>Awesome!</td>', 'I would love to know the story behind this shot. What is saying? What is he doing?Awesome!', '2005-01-22 01:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124660, 134681, 23458, '<td valign="top">This image really swallows the viewer whole, takes them right into the thick of the action. Like this a lot 9.</td>', 'This image really swallows the viewer whole, takes them right into the thick of the action. Like this a lot 9.', '2005-01-22 01:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124662, 133310, 23458, '<td valign="top">The sepia style treatment makes this image. Nice composition. I really like the old style feel here.</td>', 'The sepia style treatment makes this image. Nice composition. I really like the old style feel here.', '2005-01-22 01:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124663, 134639, 27375, '<td valign="top">I really like this and it really stands out in the thumbnails. I think you captured his personality well and you just get this feeling like you know this quy. 9...  minus 1 for the cart. I probably would have tried to blur it a little more.</td>', 'I really like this and it really stands out in the thumbnails. I think you captured his personality well and you just get this feeling like you know this quy. 9...  minus 1 for the cart. I probably would have tried to blur it a little more.', '2005-01-22 01:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124666, 133688, 27375, '<td valign="top">Not only is this an awsome shot considering the colors but the moment is fantastic and hilarious. 9</td>', 'Not only is this an awsome shot considering the colors but the moment is fantastic and hilarious. 9', '2005-01-22 01:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124667, 135783, 27375, '<td valign="top">This is a great image with a great title. Maybe just a tiny bit over saturated on the boys face. Beautiful though. 9</td>', 'This is a great image with a great title. Maybe just a tiny bit over saturated on the boys face. Beautiful though. 9', '2005-01-22 01:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124668, 133277, 23458, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is a little harsh - the flash is a little heavy handed. I do like the comp though - positioning him in between the two sets of leaves works really well.</td>', 'The lighting here is a little harsh - the flash is a little heavy handed. I do like the comp though - positioning him in between the two sets of leaves works really well.', '2005-01-22 01:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124669, 135123, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea here, I like the composition, though there is something a little off about the colouration of those trees they seem really washed out. Also I would like this better if there was a distinct end to the trees - at the moment they seem arbitrarily cut off.</td>', 'Nice Idea here, I like the composition, though there is something a little off about the colouration of those trees they seem really washed out. Also I would like this better if there was a distinct end to the trees - at the moment they seem arbitrarily cut off.', '2005-01-22 01:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124670, 133791, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. I really like how still that water appears.</td>', 'Nice perspective. I really like how still that water appears.', '2005-01-22 01:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124673, 136739, 27375, '<td valign="top">The tiniest bit out of focus but I dont even care. His eyes tell many stories. Great shot. 9</td>', 'The tiniest bit out of focus but I dont even care. His eyes tell many stories. Great shot. 9', '2005-01-22 01:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124674, 133977, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette shot - the way the smoke plume trails accross the whole image is very effective. I don''t know if my eyes are playing tricks on me but that horizon seems a little tilted - that distracts me a bit. 7.</td>', 'Good silhouette shot - the way the smoke plume trails accross the whole image is very effective. I don''t know if my eyes are playing tricks on me but that horizon seems a little tilted - that distracts me a bit. 7.', '2005-01-22 01:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124675, 135057, 23458, '<td valign="top">What a character - you''ve done this amazing face justice with this one. Great capture. The browny/grey cast works brilliantly. 10.</td>', 'What a character - you''ve done this amazing face justice with this one. Great capture. The browny/grey cast works brilliantly. 10.', '2005-01-22 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124676, 132693, 27375, '<td valign="top">This is so great. I feel like I can reach out and just grab the ladybug. The dof and colors are fantastic.</td>', 'This is so great. I feel like I can reach out and just grab the ladybug. The dof and colors are fantastic.', '2005-01-22 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124677, 136506, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice candid (or candid appearing) - the perspective you''ve chosen works really well for this shot, as does the black and white. Plus Joshua is a cute kid which never hurts. 7</td>', 'Nice candid (or candid appearing) - the perspective you''ve chosen works really well for this shot, as does the black and white. Plus Joshua is a cute kid which never hurts. 7', '2005-01-22 01:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124678, 132289, 27375, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful. The blue bra makes her a sexy mamma too.   :)</td>', 'Simple and beautiful. The blue bra makes her a sexy mamma too.   :)', '2005-01-22 01:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124679, 133084, 23458, '<td valign="top">Can''t remember who took this one, but no matter I really like the impressionistic effect here (and I generally don''t go for these types of shots so thats saying something). The wet street does wonders for this image. 9.</td>', 'Can''t remember who took this one, but no matter I really like the impressionistic effect here (and I generally don''t go for these types of shots so thats saying something). The wet street does wonders for this image. 9.', '2005-01-22 01:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124680, 134079, 23458, '<td valign="top">Who knew barley could look so perfect. Evidently you did. And that earns you a nine in my book.</td>', 'Who knew barley could look so perfect. Evidently you did. And that earns you a nine in my book.', '2005-01-22 01:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124681, 136441, 23458, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what that is, a capsicum (pepper) perhaps ??????? Ahhh, thanks to my new monitor I can see that this is a flower of some description - the comment below still stands - good work. <br/> <br/>Whatever the case you''ve used the painting with light technique to great effect. 9.</td>', 'I have no idea what that is, a capsicum (pepper) perhaps ??????? Ahhh, thanks to my new monitor I can see that this is a flower of some description - the comment below still stands - good work.  Whatever the case you''ve used the painting with light technique to great effect. 9.', '2005-01-22 01:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124682, 136706, 23458, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of niagra falls shots, several of them even in this very challenge. Well, this is the best of the ones I''ve seen in this challenge, and one of the best I''ve seen full stop. Good job.</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of niagra falls shots, several of them even in this very challenge. Well, this is the best of the ones I''ve seen in this challenge, and one of the best I''ve seen full stop. Good job.', '2005-01-22 01:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124684, 136759, 23458, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the gorgeous colours on this fella and the backdrop. Perhaps the motion could be stopped a fraction better, but I like it a lot nonetheless. 8.</td>', 'Love the contrast between the gorgeous colours on this fella and the backdrop. Perhaps the motion could be stopped a fraction better, but I like it a lot nonetheless. 8.', '2005-01-22 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124688, 136679, 23458, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting here. I had a female in the room when I voted and she was quite enthralled by this. I can see why, if I batted for the other team I''m pretty sure I''d be quite taken aback by this one.</td>', 'Like the lighting here. I had a female in the room when I voted and she was quite enthralled by this. I can see why, if I batted for the other team I''m pretty sure I''d be quite taken aback by this one.', '2005-01-22 01:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124691, 136630, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really like the colouring here, many will feel this is overprocessed, and perhaps it is, but I like the overall impression of this shot. 9 On second look I still really like this. I''d just like to add that this would make you all sorts of money as a stock image!</td>', 'Really like the colouring here, many will feel this is overprocessed, and perhaps it is, but I like the overall impression of this shot. 9 On second look I still really like this. I''d just like to add that this would make you all sorts of money as a stock image!', '2005-01-22 02:03:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1124692, 135987, 23458, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose here. It''s bizarre enough to be effective. 8</td>', 'I really like the pose here. It''s bizarre enough to be effective. 8', '2005-01-22 02:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124697, 134345, 16046, '<td valign="top">fantastic, cool dunes</td>', 'fantastic, cool dunes', '2005-01-22 02:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124698, 136633, 16046, '<td valign="top">great detail, nicely lit</td>', 'great detail, nicely lit', '2005-01-22 02:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124699, 132202, 16046, '<td valign="top">Eerie and excellent 10</td>', 'Eerie and excellent 10', '2005-01-22 02:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124716, 136350, 31637, '<td valign="top">oh my goodness!</td>', 'oh my goodness!', '2005-01-22 02:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124718, 134025, 27375, '<td valign="top">I was looking back at my votes and I gave this a 2...it doesnt deserve a 2. There are some really cool lines in there. It was either an accident or I was in a really bad mood when I was voting. Sorry lol Bumping up</td>', 'I was looking back at my votes and I gave this a 2...it doesnt deserve a 2. There are some really cool lines in there. It was either an accident or I was in a really bad mood when I was voting. Sorry lol Bumping up', '2005-01-22 02:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124720, 133230, 16392, '<td valign="top">Wow, such a powerful photography. Really, really astonishing. Love the dark tones.</td>', 'Wow, such a powerful photography. Really, really astonishing. Love the dark tones.', '2005-01-22 03:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124721, 132109, 16392, '<td valign="top">I can''t find any words except Splendid! That is the most inventive and beautiful photograph that I''ve spotted this year. The stark colours, the perfect contrast... everything. Nice.</td>', 'I can''t find any words except Splendid! That is the most inventive and beautiful photograph that I''ve spotted this year. The stark colours, the perfect contrast... everything. Nice.', '2005-01-22 03:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124723, 133084, 27375, '<td valign="top">This pic has really great lines and colors I cant think of a single thing I would change. Not sure why this isnt in my favorites yet since I have already looked at it about ten times. Everytime I am in your portfolio I think I look at it. It has a very fitting title which makes you feel as the viewer to be the stalker with insanity in your brain. You know you got my 10</td>', 'This pic has really great lines and colors I cant think of a single thing I would change. Not sure why this isnt in my favorites yet since I have already looked at it about ten times. Everytime I am in your portfolio I think I look at it. It has a very fitting title which makes you feel as the viewer to be the stalker with insanity in your brain. You know you got my 10', '2005-01-22 03:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124725, 136448, 27375, '<td valign="top">Very good powerful image. I think it is the lighting which puts the icing on the cake. I also like how everything is oof except the words and the upper part of the girl. Details are great here.</td>', 'Very good powerful image. I think it is the lighting which puts the icing on the cake. I also like how everything is oof except the words and the upper part of the girl. Details are great here.', '2005-01-22 03:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124754, 132193, 4321, '<td valign="top">This is too centered but still very good.</td>', 'This is too centered but still very good.', '2005-01-22 04:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124755, 136739, 4321, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2005-01-22 04:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124757, 136205, 4321, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the heads being cut off was not a good idea, but looking again, it really draws your eye to the boy...very nice!</td>', 'At first I thought the heads being cut off was not a good idea, but looking again, it really draws your eye to the boy...very nice!', '2005-01-22 04:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124758, 136804, 4321, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective</td>', 'Interesting perspective', '2005-01-22 04:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124761, 132698, 4321, '<td valign="top">I love this. It looks like the cover of a Pat Conroy book.</td>', 'I love this. It looks like the cover of a Pat Conroy book.', '2005-01-22 04:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124763, 136319, 4321, '<td valign="top">Stunning!</td>', 'Stunning!', '2005-01-22 04:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124773, 136435, 4805, '<td valign="top">I''d add it to my favourites but it''s already there. One thing I do notice (that may not have been in your other versions) is a light banding in the upper left. Looks like a burning artifact, and it''s distracting. Have you considered a square crop? It has a medium format feel to it and it might suit it well. One of my few 10s. Good luck.</td>', 'I''d add it to my favourites but it''s already there. One thing I do notice (that may not have been in your other versions) is a light banding in the upper left. Looks like a burning artifact, and it''s distracting. Have you considered a square crop? It has a medium format feel to it and it might suit it well. One of my few 10s. Good luck.', '2005-01-22 04:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124819, 136703, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but with her moving it blurrs her and makes the shot OOF.  I love the reflection of the piano keys against the piano but again with the blurry from the girl is just to distracting. Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Nice shot but with her moving it blurrs her and makes the shot OOF.  I love the reflection of the piano keys against the piano but again with the blurry from the girl is just to distracting. Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124822, 132289, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette look and the selective desaturation.  It adds warmth to this photo because its so  subtle.  I am not fond of the subject but oh well it still a nice shot.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I like the silhouette look and the selective desaturation.  It adds warmth to this photo because its so  subtle.  I am not fond of the subject but oh well it still a nice shot.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-22 05:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124825, 134128, 14671, '<td valign="top">I personally would have taken the shot horizontally instead.  I find there is to much wasted space and far to much sky.  A tighter crop and a wider picture would have made for a better shot in my opinion.  I also find that this photo lack subject.  Perhaps if it wasn''t so dark and we could see the road better.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I personally would have taken the shot horizontally instead.  I find there is to much wasted space and far to much sky.  A tighter crop and a wider picture would have made for a better shot in my opinion.  I also find that this photo lack subject.  Perhaps if it wasn''t so dark and we could see the road better.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124826, 135633, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but because of the high contrast from the sun on the clouds in gives a blurry impression in the sky.  A beautiful tranquil picture tho to say the least and a shot that you could get lost in just looking at it.  Best of luck and keep up the good worlk in 2005.</td>', 'I like this shot but because of the high contrast from the sun on the clouds in gives a blurry impression in the sky.  A beautiful tranquil picture tho to say the least and a shot that you could get lost in just looking at it.  Best of luck and keep up the good worlk in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124828, 136581, 14671, '<td valign="top">What an interesting way to shoot a fire.  I''m not sure I like it but then again I''ve been looking at it for about 5 min. now and can''t quite graps it.  Nice motion blurr and excellent colors and despite there being nothing or very little to look at I am drawn to the photo.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'What an interesting way to shoot a fire.  I''m not sure I like it but then again I''ve been looking at it for about 5 min. now and can''t quite graps it.  Nice motion blurr and excellent colors and despite there being nothing or very little to look at I am drawn to the photo.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-22 05:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124830, 135135, 14671, '<td valign="top">I think this would make for a nice calender shot but not something I would have on a wall.  Excellent color and clarity and well centered.  Good job and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I think this would make for a nice calender shot but not something I would have on a wall.  Excellent color and clarity and well centered.  Good job and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124831, 132367, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice trick but not a photo I would hang on a wall.  I''m not fond of the positioning and find I have to turn my head to actually get a good look at the photo.  The photo has excellent cloros and clarity but in my opinion lacks substance.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Nice trick but not a photo I would hang on a wall.  I''m not fond of the positioning and find I have to turn my head to actually get a good look at the photo.  The photo has excellent cloros and clarity but in my opinion lacks substance.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124832, 132781, 14671, '<td valign="top">I think this photo may suffer a bit from people with smaller moniters.  I find it to be unnecessarily to tall and a 1 inch crop off the top would have had the same impact.  I like the B&amp;W  style and the way the contrast from the sun whites out the weather vain on the top.  It also has excellent clarity and good use of ROT.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I think this photo may suffer a bit from people with smaller moniters.  I find it to be unnecessarily to tall and a 1 inch crop off the top would have had the same impact.  I like the B&W  style and the way the contrast from the sun whites out the weather vain on the top.  It also has excellent clarity and good use of ROT.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124833, 136414, 20066, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful sky and overall colors!</td>', 'Really beautiful sky and overall colors!', '2005-01-22 05:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124834, 133890, 14671, '<td valign="top">If you crop out the top part of the clouds so that only about an inch and a half of the dark clouds are showing I think you will find a better picture.  Nice shot tho and nicely leveled.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'If you crop out the top part of the clouds so that only about an inch and a half of the dark clouds are showing I think you will find a better picture.  Nice shot tho and nicely leveled.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 05:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124835, 136222, 19959, '<td valign="top">That is a cool effect. Not sure I quite understand what is going on. I thought at first it was a shot of a reflection, but then all of the pidgeons would be the correct way up!?</td>', 'That is a cool effect. Not sure I quite understand what is going on. I thought at first it was a shot of a reflection, but then all of the pidgeons would be the correct way up!?', '2005-01-22 05:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124836, 134270, 20066, '<td valign="top">Would have scored so high in the tourist guide challenge I think or what the name of that challenge was.  But nice photo anyway and great composition.</td>', 'Would have scored so high in the tourist guide challenge I think or what the name of that challenge was.  But nice photo anyway and great composition.', '2005-01-22 05:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124837, 134979, 19959, '<td valign="top">Woa... that is very nice. Really surreal tones.</td>', 'Woa... that is very nice. Really surreal tones.', '2005-01-22 05:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124838, 133137, 23458, '<td valign="top">Yes this image is sexy, incredibly so (I''ll be surprised if you don''t get a couple of DQ requests for the overt depiction of a sexual act from the more conservative dpcers), but its appeal goes beyond the fact that I''m a guy and it''s a naked picture of a gorgeous woman. Technically speaking, the perspective is wonderful, lighting is spot on, and DOF is absolutely perfect. On the more substantive level you have captured the joy of human sexuality wonderfully. At first glance she appears positively serene in her bliss - yet then you go and throw in the leather gear, which takes the viewer away from the beauty of the pleasure she is experiencing and throws in a raw, forbidden almost animalistic element. Anyway, enough meandering from me, the point is that this is a ten from me, and easily one of the best images in this challenge.</td>', 'Yes this image is sexy, incredibly so (I''ll be surprised if you don''t get a couple of DQ requests for the overt depiction of a sexual act from the more conservative dpcers), but its appeal goes beyond the fact that I''m a guy and it''s a naked picture of a gorgeous woman. Technically speaking, the perspective is wonderful, lighting is spot on, and DOF is absolutely perfect. On the more substantive level you have captured the joy of human sexuality wonderfully. At first glance she appears positively serene in her bliss - yet then you go and throw in the leather gear, which takes the viewer away from the beauty of the pleasure she is experiencing and throws in a raw, forbidden almost animalistic element. Anyway, enough meandering from me, the point is that this is a ten from me, and easily one of the best images in this challenge.', '2005-01-22 05:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124839, 135980, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice shot.  Excellent colors and definition.  The tentacles realy draw your eye into the photo.  Nice positioning and very well done.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Wow, nice shot.  Excellent colors and definition.  The tentacles realy draw your eye into the photo.  Nice positioning and very well done.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.  <7>', '2005-01-22 05:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124842, 136704, 14671, '<td valign="top">We came to this land kicked there ass and now treat them like shit.  Excellent backgroundblurr and the native has excellent definition with fantastic colors and clarity.  Well done.  I would like to see some more if you have any to share, please feel free to contact me.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'We came to this land kicked there ass and now treat them like shit.  Excellent backgroundblurr and the native has excellent definition with fantastic colors and clarity.  Well done.  I would like to see some more if you have any to share, please feel free to contact me.  <9>', '2005-01-22 05:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124843, 136395, 23458, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tender ape portrait. Not my favourite of the challenge, but I guarentee it will fill that role for many. You can''t help but fall for those eyes. It doesn''t get any cuter.</td>', 'Beautiful tender ape portrait. Not my favourite of the challenge, but I guarentee it will fill that role for many. You can''t help but fall for those eyes. It doesn''t get any cuter.', '2005-01-22 06:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124844, 134160, 14671, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but the contrast is just to overpowering.  I find it to be to bright.  I''m also not fussy on the border because in my opinion its to big.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Nice shot but the contrast is just to overpowering.  I find it to be to bright.  I''m also not fussy on the border because in my opinion its to big.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-22 06:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124845, 136685, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Great sky, magnificent light.</td>', 'Excellent. Great sky, magnificent light.', '2005-01-22 06:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124846, 136657, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very cute, crisp sharp and simple. 8.</td>', 'Very cute, crisp sharp and simple. 8.', '2005-01-22 06:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124847, 134673, 20066, '<td valign="top">great reflexion of it''s head.</td>', 'great reflexion of it''s head.', '2005-01-22 06:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124848, 133723, 23458, '<td valign="top">THis image has real drama thanks to that dramatic sky, and the equally dramatic white water in the foreground. Congrats on a really great shot.</td>', 'THis image has real drama thanks to that dramatic sky, and the equally dramatic white water in the foreground. Congrats on a really great shot.', '2005-01-22 06:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124849, 134909, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is really effective. Partially obscured powerlines work really well with the moon here. Nice, crisp, simple and gorgeous colouring. 8. Revisiting this - bumping all the way to a ten. The above  comment still applies, but this image really stands out.</td>', 'This is really effective. Partially obscured powerlines work really well with the moon here. Nice, crisp, simple and gorgeous colouring. 8. Revisiting this - bumping all the way to a ten. The above  comment still applies, but this image really stands out.', '2005-01-22 06:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124851, 136468, 23458, '<td valign="top">I think someone took this exact image for the painting with light challenge. I''m still really impressed by the technical skill behind it though. 8 from me.</td>', 'I think someone took this exact image for the painting with light challenge. I''m still really impressed by the technical skill behind it though. 8 from me.', '2005-01-22 06:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124852, 132264, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition has made the most of these fantastic subjects. This one belongs in a calender. 8.</td>', 'Nice simple composition has made the most of these fantastic subjects. This one belongs in a calender. 8.', '2005-01-22 06:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124853, 135615, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, wonderful subject. Mightily effective abstract here.</td>', 'Great perspective, wonderful subject. Mightily effective abstract here.', '2005-01-22 06:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124854, 132814, 23458, '<td valign="top">This image is very simple in subject and composition, and I like that.... it''s always nice when a photo takes you somewhere - and I can''t help but wonder where that path goes. Theres a couple of pieces of rubbish in the leaves that could be cloned out, but I quite like this one. 7</td>', 'This image is very simple in subject and composition, and I like that.... it''s always nice when a photo takes you somewhere - and I can''t help but wonder where that path goes. Theres a couple of pieces of rubbish in the leaves that could be cloned out, but I quite like this one. 7', '2005-01-22 06:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124856, 133111, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great subjects, the black and white works really well in concert with the subtle grain. Like the way you have cut out the heads of the two people standing but left their t-shirts. 9.</td>', 'Great subjects, the black and white works really well in concert with the subtle grain. Like the way you have cut out the heads of the two people standing but left their t-shirts. 9.', '2005-01-22 06:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124860, 132737, 23458, '<td valign="top">Seems a little flat and out of focus to me, but I like what you have tried to do with the composition.</td>', 'Seems a little flat and out of focus to me, but I like what you have tried to do with the composition.', '2005-01-22 06:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124861, 135948, 23458, '<td valign="top">Looks a little out of focus or something - the image quality just isnt there with this one. Still I like the composition and colours.</td>', 'Looks a little out of focus or something - the image quality just isnt there with this one. Still I like the composition and colours.', '2005-01-22 06:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124862, 132468, 23458, '<td valign="top">THis image is technically solid, but for mine doesn''t really have that something extra to sustain my interest.</td>', 'THis image is technically solid, but for mine doesn''t really have that something extra to sustain my interest.', '2005-01-22 06:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124863, 133792, 23458, '<td valign="top">Cute image - I wish you had got a little sloser though, the foreground serves only to distract from what has the potential to be a really nice image.</td>', 'Cute image - I wish you had got a little sloser though, the foreground serves only to distract from what has the potential to be a really nice image.', '2005-01-22 06:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124864, 136620, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well it would have been amazing to see what I''m sure you saw the day you took this photo. Unfortunately the image itself doesnt quite inspire in the way I''m sure the actual event did. I''d like it if you zoomed in a bit further to get some of the details of the whale.</td>', 'Well it would have been amazing to see what I''m sure you saw the day you took this photo. Unfortunately the image itself doesnt quite inspire in the way I''m sure the actual event did. I''d like it if you zoomed in a bit further to get some of the details of the whale.', '2005-01-22 06:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124865, 134562, 20066, '<td valign="top">Good composition but not sharp enough but that is perhaps the camera not the photographer.</td>', 'Good composition but not sharp enough but that is perhaps the camera not the photographer.', '2005-01-22 06:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124866, 133876, 20066, '<td valign="top">Is this having an eye for a good photo ;)<br/>But nice macro eye shot<br/></td>', 'Is this having an eye for a good photo ;)But nice macro eye shot', '2005-01-22 06:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124868, 136162, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really nice sky, I particularly like the reddish glow on the lighthouse itself. 8.</td>', 'Really nice sky, I particularly like the reddish glow on the lighthouse itself. 8.', '2005-01-22 06:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124869, 136215, 23458, '<td valign="top">Eerie image - I hope this is not a self portrait, but this androgynous figure would be right at home as a junkie in trainspotting. I really like the sever lighting here. A very powerful image. 9.</td>', 'Eerie image - I hope this is not a self portrait, but this androgynous figure would be right at home as a junkie in trainspotting. I really like the sever lighting here. A very powerful image. 9.', '2005-01-22 06:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124870, 133890, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice simple compotion, a very pleasing image, I like the understated feel, almost makes me feel like I''m on holiday.</td>', 'Nice simple compotion, a very pleasing image, I like the understated feel, almost makes me feel like I''m on holiday.', '2005-01-22 06:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124871, 132071, 23458, '<td valign="top">Thats some really cool driftwood and an absolutely stunning bit of ocean. COuld do with out the boats but I can understand that they''d take a fair bit of cloning to remove (a job that would likely be beyond me).</td>', 'Thats some really cool driftwood and an absolutely stunning bit of ocean. COuld do with out the boats but I can understand that they''d take a fair bit of cloning to remove (a job that would likely be beyond me).', '2005-01-22 06:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124872, 132068, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and composition here. I like the warmth of this image.</td>', 'Nice perspective and composition here. I like the warmth of this image.', '2005-01-22 06:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124873, 134860, 23394, '<td valign="top">very dreamy.  nice composition.  this probably won''t score as well as you''d like, but all the same, i''m sure this image represents the result you intended, regardless of scoring.  good work!</td>', 'very dreamy.  nice composition.  this probably won''t score as well as you''d like, but all the same, i''m sure this image represents the result you intended, regardless of scoring.  good work!', '2005-01-22 06:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124874, 136424, 23458, '<td valign="top">Holy snapping ducks. That is an amazing scene. I can''t wait to see the explanation. I also can''t tell you how glad I am this was validated. 8. Can''t see this shot and not exclaim ''wow!''</td>', 'Holy snapping ducks. That is an amazing scene. I can''t wait to see the explanation. I also can''t tell you how glad I am this was validated. 8. Can''t see this shot and not exclaim ''wow!''', '2005-01-22 06:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124875, 133401, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.  i love the balance between lights and darks, greens and reds, land and fog.  you''ve captured it all in hauntingly beautiful image.  great work!</td>', 'excellent composition.  i love the balance between lights and darks, greens and reds, land and fog.  you''ve captured it all in hauntingly beautiful image.  great work!', '2005-01-22 06:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124876, 136226, 23458, '<td valign="top">very cute - I like the way you caught him/her extending its little wing. The title is suitably apt. Good job.</td>', 'very cute - I like the way you caught him/her extending its little wing. The title is suitably apt. Good job.', '2005-01-22 06:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124877, 132400, 23458, '<td valign="top">Now that is completely incredible. Scenes like this make me simultaneously glad and sad we don''t get real winters down under.</td>', 'Now that is completely incredible. Scenes like this make me simultaneously glad and sad we don''t get real winters down under.', '2005-01-22 06:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124879, 133528, 23458, '<td valign="top">Im sure this was a magical experience, and you''ve captured it really well. As an image it would be better without the hand, but then the viewer would lost the sense of wonderment at the interaction here.</td>', 'Im sure this was a magical experience, and you''ve captured it really well. As an image it would be better without the hand, but then the viewer would lost the sense of wonderment at the interaction here.', '2005-01-22 06:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1124884, 134050, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent image (but, for the life of me, i can''t remember why...i had some notes i''d like to refer to, but have misplaced them.  oh well, working off memory...); i love how the fence and row lines partition the image into their own little piecs, how the clouds lay across the land, contributing to the patchwork, how the factory smoke contrasts with the natural clouds.  i think the think i like most about this image is how unlikely it would be to ever reproduce it.</td>', 'excellent image (but, for the life of me, i can''t remember why...i had some notes i''d like to refer to, but have misplaced them.  oh well, working off memory...); i love how the fence and row lines partition the image into their own little piecs, how the clouds lay across the land, contributing to the patchwork, how the factory smoke contrasts with the natural clouds.  i think the think i like most about this image is how unlikely it would be to ever reproduce it.', '2005-01-22 06:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
