(1125071, 136381, 27375, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice shot. When I see her at the window like this it makes you feel like she just threw the shirt on from doing whatever it is that she was doing and walked over to the window to look at the rain.  The pose is what throws me. I think it looks forced. If it was a lttle more subtle, possibly with the shirt closed a little more and her fingers closer together it would be a little more appealing to me. Standing there smoking a cigarette would be cool too, although I would not promote that.  :)  Just my thoughts here. All in all it is a nice shot and I am giving it an 8</td>', 'I think this is a nice shot. When I see her at the window like this it makes you feel like she just threw the shirt on from doing whatever it is that she was doing and walked over to the window to look at the rain.  The pose is what throws me. I think it looks forced. If it was a lttle more subtle, possibly with the shirt closed a little more and her fingers closer together it would be a little more appealing to me. Standing there smoking a cigarette would be cool too, although I would not promote that.  :)  Just my thoughts here. All in all it is a nice shot and I am giving it an 8', '2005-01-22 10:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125072, 135987, 25742, '<td valign="top">Mehmet? Strange but nice portrait.</td>', 'Mehmet? Strange but nice portrait.', '2005-01-22 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125078, 132136, 27375, '<td valign="top">This one is already in my favs. I opened them both and compared them. This one seems a little over processed. The white part of the sky is blown out in this one and seems a bit over sharpened.</td>', 'This one is already in my favs. I opened them both and compared them. This one seems a little over processed. The white part of the sky is blown out in this one and seems a bit over sharpened.', '2005-01-22 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125082, 133785, 27375, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I wonder your purpose for the hair covering the face. Nice comp and colors. Would make a cool photo inside and album</td>', 'This is cool. I wonder your purpose for the hair covering the face. Nice comp and colors. Would make a cool photo inside and album', '2005-01-22 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125085, 136863, 27375, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture. The thing in the water pulls my eyes away from the bird though. I love how the wings run evenly with the tree line. Also the stump(?) on the left could have easily been cropped out.</td>', 'A very nice picture. The thing in the water pulls my eyes away from the bird though. I love how the wings run evenly with the tree line. Also the stump(?) on the left could have easily been cropped out.', '2005-01-22 10:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125088, 132737, 27375, '<td valign="top">This is a bit out of focus. I think it would have also been  improved by getting a different angle so you could see more of the desert.</td>', 'This is a bit out of focus. I think it would have also been  improved by getting a different angle so you could see more of the desert.', '2005-01-22 10:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125090, 136703, 27375, '<td valign="top">This could have been improved with better lighting. The pic looks yellow. If I cant get my colors to come out right I just make it black and white. I think this one would look bettr in black and white but you would have to up the brightness a bit cause it is so dark though.</td>', 'This could have been improved with better lighting. The pic looks yellow. If I cant get my colors to come out right I just make it black and white. I think this one would look bettr in black and white but you would have to up the brightness a bit cause it is so dark though.', '2005-01-22 10:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125092, 136675, 27574, '<td valign="top">This one is just so beautiful, I can''t find the words to express how much I love it.  I can''t wait to see who has such artistic talent and imagination.  Way to go!!!!!  <br/> <br/>The only thing I would like to see changed on this is to crop off just a bit on the left side...but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'This one is just so beautiful, I can''t find the words to express how much I love it.  I can''t wait to see who has such artistic talent and imagination.  Way to go!!!!!   The only thing I would like to see changed on this is to crop off just a bit on the left side...but that is just my opinion.', '2005-01-22 10:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125096, 135490, 14012, '<td valign="top">Why would I want to do that, it looks like it is raining??  :-)<br/> <br/>I like the composition. There appears to be a bit of noise, really notice it in the sky. I''m sure with your PS skills you could clean it up. I think because of the dreary feeling this has (with the rain and flat lighting) converting to B&amp;W (with some dodging&amp; burning) would make this image really nice.<br/> <br/>Who am I to critique the guy that gets paid to take photos everyday, right Joel?  :)</td>', 'Why would I want to do that, it looks like it is raining??  :-) I like the composition. There appears to be a bit of noise, really notice it in the sky. I''m sure with your PS skills you could clean it up. I think because of the dreary feeling this has (with the rain and flat lighting) converting to B&W (with some dodging& burning) would make this image really nice. Who am I to critique the guy that gets paid to take photos everyday, right Joel?  :)', '2005-01-22 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125104, 132694, 14012, '<td valign="top">I''m going to try this again. I went through and typed this all out once and when I cast my vote, it must have timed out and I lost everything. I think this photo has potential, even though, in all honesty, it is technically poorly done.<br/> <br/>You captured a great expression on this childs face, showing the true innocence of a child.<br/>Here are some of my suggestion on making this a better photo:<br/>- While there are some blownout highlights on the jacket, the image overall looks a tad underexposed.<br/>- The white balance is off, as there is a blue/green tint. You can fix this, for the most art in Photoshop, but setting it in camera is best.<br/>- Don''t oversharpen. There are bad "jaggies" around almost all the edges, really noticable on her chin and the pail.<br/>- Using a shallower DOF would blur the background and help seperate the subject from it.<br/>- Move some of the clutter out of the background before taking the shot. The way it is, it looks like she has toys growing from her head and back. :)<br/>- Clone out the toy in the bottom right of the photo<br/> <br/>If you would like to see a re-edit to see how some of these suggestions would improve this photo, feel free to PM me. You don''t need to wait for the end of the challenge, since I have already voted on you photo. I hope my critique helps you.</td>', 'I''m going to try this again. I went through and typed this all out once and when I cast my vote, it must have timed out and I lost everything. I think this photo has potential, even though, in all honesty, it is technically poorly done. You captured a great expression on this childs face, showing the true innocence of a child.Here are some of my suggestion on making this a better photo:- While there are some blownout highlights on the jacket, the image overall looks a tad underexposed.- The white balance is off, as there is a blue/green tint. You can fix this, for the most art in Photoshop, but setting it in camera is best.- Don''t oversharpen. There are bad "jaggies" around almost all the edges, really noticable on her chin and the pail.- Using a shallower DOF would blur the background and help seperate the subject from it.- Move some of the clutter out of the background before taking the shot. The way it is, it looks like she has toys growing from her head and back. :)- Clone out the toy in the bottom right of the photo If you would like to see a re-edit to see how some of these suggestions would improve this photo, feel free to PM me. You don''t need to wait for the end of the challenge, since I have already voted on you photo. I hope my critique helps you.', '2005-01-22 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125135, 135633, 29827, '<td valign="top">Great sunset, but a little noisy.  Reflection is fantastic.</td>', 'Great sunset, but a little noisy.  Reflection is fantastic.', '2005-01-22 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
