(1125203, 132814, 17033, '<td valign="top">I think this is good but could have been very good with a little more contrast on the nice path line. Have you thought about B/W here....the colour isn''t integral to the success of the photo...it might add to the ''mood''.</td>', 'I think this is good but could have been very good with a little more contrast on the nice path line. Have you thought about B/W here....the colour isn''t integral to the success of the photo...it might add to the ''mood''.', '2005-01-22 12:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
