(1125276, 132540, 23394, '<td valign="top">this has to be one of the few lens-baby images that has given me a pause to think that it was put to good use (and if it''s not a lens-baby image, i''m even MORE impressed).  however you did it, this is an amazing capture, and i hope it does well for you.</td>', 'this has to be one of the few lens-baby images that has given me a pause to think that it was put to good use (and if it''s not a lens-baby image, i''m even MORE impressed).  however you did it, this is an amazing capture, and i hope it does well for you.', '2005-01-22 13:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125284, 134673, 23394, '<td valign="top">first, i wish you the best with this image.  second, just a matter of personal taste, i don''t like the color of the bill.  i am not scoring it based on the color, i''m just saying i don''t like it.  the composition and lighting is great, and the captured reflection really moves it up a notch.  good luck!</td>', 'first, i wish you the best with this image.  second, just a matter of personal taste, i don''t like the color of the bill.  i am not scoring it based on the color, i''m just saying i don''t like it.  the composition and lighting is great, and the captured reflection really moves it up a notch.  good luck!', '2005-01-22 13:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125290, 132182, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think this visit has a lot of potential, but i feel this image doesn''t quite achieve it, at least for me.  the darkness of the crevice is a bit too pronounced, and the sun a bit too overblown.  the colors and angle works, but the border is too overdone.  good luck with the rest of the voters, this will get a 5 from me.</td>', 'i think this visit has a lot of potential, but i feel this image doesn''t quite achieve it, at least for me.  the darkness of the crevice is a bit too pronounced, and the sun a bit too overblown.  the colors and angle works, but the border is too overdone.  good luck with the rest of the voters, this will get a 5 from me.', '2005-01-22 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125296, 133800, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing piece of work.  i have nothing else to offer, so, if you don''t mind, i''ll just sit and enjoy it for a bit.  thanks for sharing, good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'this is an amazing piece of work.  i have nothing else to offer, so, if you don''t mind, i''ll just sit and enjoy it for a bit.  thanks for sharing, good luck with the challenge.', '2005-01-22 13:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
