(1125515, 133415, 23394, '<td valign="top">on one hand, this is a stirring image, on the other, the more i look at it, the more it loses its initial impact.  i think the problem i''m having is that all the detail in the mid-ground is running together, creating a visual miasma.  i think this would have been much better in color.  good luck!</td>', 'on one hand, this is a stirring image, on the other, the more i look at it, the more it loses its initial impact.  i think the problem i''m having is that all the detail in the mid-ground is running together, creating a visual miasma.  i think this would have been much better in color.  good luck!', '2005-01-22 15:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125525, 134147, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, i like the colors, the impact, the composition, and the basic execution.  but, there''s just something that''s not clicking for me.  i hate to criticize, especially knowing how hard it is to catch a shot like this, but something just seems off.  maybe it''s the pattern of the splash and the lighting on it?  oh well, don''t mind me.  good luck!<br/> <br/>(ps: i''m not going to hold it against you that you didn''t completely wipe up the surface between takes...)</td>', 'ok, i like the colors, the impact, the composition, and the basic execution.  but, there''s just something that''s not clicking for me.  i hate to criticize, especially knowing how hard it is to catch a shot like this, but something just seems off.  maybe it''s the pattern of the splash and the lighting on it?  oh well, don''t mind me.  good luck! (ps: i''m not going to hold it against you that you didn''t completely wipe up the surface between takes...)', '2005-01-22 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
