(1125545, 136424, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an awesome shot. It reminds me of a picture I took for the Signs Revisited challenge about 2 years ago (//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=11249). Yours is so much better though. Great shot. I love the blues  of the umbrellas and the plane against the blue sky.</td>', 'Wow, this is an awesome shot. It reminds me of a picture I took for the Signs Revisited challenge about 2 years ago (//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=11249). Yours is so much better though. Great shot. I love the blues  of the umbrellas and the plane against the blue sky.', '2005-01-22 15:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
