(1125547, 134242, 23394, '<td valign="top">i really appreciate your effort here.  the colors are beautiful, and the fact that you have to get down on your hands and knees to shoot this speaks volumes about what you''re after.  this is not an easy shot, and criticizing it is just as hard.  i feel, though, that the image would be stronger with more dof, and if you had slightly shielded the light from above the droplets on the right.  droplets are hard work, and, as you see, they can take a life of their own.  good luck with the challenge!</td>', 'i really appreciate your effort here.  the colors are beautiful, and the fact that you have to get down on your hands and knees to shoot this speaks volumes about what you''re after.  this is not an easy shot, and criticizing it is just as hard.  i feel, though, that the image would be stronger with more dof, and if you had slightly shielded the light from above the droplets on the right.  droplets are hard work, and, as you see, they can take a life of their own.  good luck with the challenge!', '2005-01-22 15:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
