(1125770, 134909, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is really nice... I like it a lot... my only comment would have been to fill the frame a little more... I guess the placement of the sun bothers me a bit... but I do like some free space as well... so I don''t know... either way... good job... -9-</td>', 'This is really nice... I like it a lot... my only comment would have been to fill the frame a little more... I guess the placement of the sun bothers me a bit... but I do like some free space as well... so I don''t know... either way... good job... -9-', '2005-01-22 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1125773, 133232, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like the multi-layers and the bright red canon. I could easily see this shooting because of the extra space you left.  the colors are nice and simple.   Pretty solid photo, but nothing that says "wow" to me.</td>', 'I like the multi-layers and the bright red canon. I could easily see this shooting because of the extra space you left.  the colors are nice and simple.   Pretty solid photo, but nothing that says "wow" to me.', '2005-01-22 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
