(1125779, 135618, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks to be an interesting image, but i''m not sure what to make of the cropping that you chose.  the colors and textures look like they have a lot to offer, but somehow the composition you''ve presented seems imcomplete.  hope you have better luck with the other voters, because 6 is the best i can do here.</td>', 'this looks to be an interesting image, but i''m not sure what to make of the cropping that you chose.  the colors and textures look like they have a lot to offer, but somehow the composition you''ve presented seems imcomplete.  hope you have better luck with the other voters, because 6 is the best i can do here.', '2005-01-22 18:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
