(1125782, 133230, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautiful story telling ability here.  Love the black and white and the girls blowing hair.  Where is this?  Solid photo, good framing, nice contrasts... I like it.  -10-</td>', 'Beautiful story telling ability here.  Love the black and white and the girls blowing hair.  Where is this?  Solid photo, good framing, nice contrasts... I like it.  -10-', '2005-01-22 18:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
