(1125786, 136689, 4967, '<td valign="top">Solid portrait... very pretty.  Great lighting... I love her eyes... this is one the girl should love!  not much I can comment on, except I do feel she looks a bit unnatural, because I can''t tell whether that is part of her dress she is leaning on... or something else... it also just slightly bothers me that the tip of her shoulder is cut off... as I think that the roundness would have been good in this photo.. and maybe a bent arm to lean on?  always difficult to cut off limbs.</td>', 'Solid portrait... very pretty.  Great lighting... I love her eyes... this is one the girl should love!  not much I can comment on, except I do feel she looks a bit unnatural, because I can''t tell whether that is part of her dress she is leaning on... or something else... it also just slightly bothers me that the tip of her shoulder is cut off... as I think that the roundness would have been good in this photo.. and maybe a bent arm to lean on?  always difficult to cut off limbs.', '2005-01-22 18:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
