(1126290, 134562, 15026, '<td valign="top">Really like the tones, and the photo overall - the foreground seems forced to me, can''t decide if I''d like this better if the visible weeds in the lower left were cropped or removed.  Also might like it better w/out the tractor path, but those are minor things IMO.</td>', 'Really like the tones, and the photo overall - the foreground seems forced to me, can''t decide if I''d like this better if the visible weeds in the lower left were cropped or removed.  Also might like it better w/out the tractor path, but those are minor things IMO.', '2005-01-22 23:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126306, 136871, 25232, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation in this case has failed. The over saturated eyes in contrast to the gray face seem doll or alien like.  Do you wish to draw more attention to the flag then the child? By draining the skin tones the way you have and leaveing such vivid color in the flag this is exactly what you have done. If you had faded the flag to some extent and left the child with at least a little of his life blood the image would have, in my oppinion, scored much higher. Otherwise the picture has strong composition</td>', 'Selective desaturation in this case has failed. The over saturated eyes in contrast to the gray face seem doll or alien like.  Do you wish to draw more attention to the flag then the child? By draining the skin tones the way you have and leaveing such vivid color in the flag this is exactly what you have done. If you had faded the flag to some extent and left the child with at least a little of his life blood the image would have, in my oppinion, scored much higher. Otherwise the picture has strong composition', '2005-01-23 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126307, 132207, 22479, '<td valign="top">A bold entry of the alternate route of birth. Quite a remarkably sound photograph on technical grounds. I''ve always wished I could take my camera into the OR, but that''s off limits except for family. Well done.</td>', 'A bold entry of the alternate route of birth. Quite a remarkably sound photograph on technical grounds. I''ve always wished I could take my camera into the OR, but that''s off limits except for family. Well done.', '2005-01-23 00:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
