(1126548, 134119, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a really wild image.  these most interesting colors really bring life to what would ordinarily be a boring shot.  good work here and in 2005!</td>', 'this is a really wild image.  these most interesting colors really bring life to what would ordinarily be a boring shot.  good work here and in 2005!', '2005-01-23 07:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126549, 136871, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very cute kid - I think I''d prefer it if you hadn''t left the colour in the eyes - its not a natural eye colour the way you''ve done it (or at least it doesn''t appear to be - I''d imagine you did this with the colour channels rather than the history brush) so that makes the image look slightly tacky. Other than that, the lighting is great, the facial expression is equally great and the image has little else to fault.</td>', 'Very cute kid - I think I''d prefer it if you hadn''t left the colour in the eyes - its not a natural eye colour the way you''ve done it (or at least it doesn''t appear to be - I''d imagine you did this with the colour channels rather than the history brush) so that makes the image look slightly tacky. Other than that, the lighting is great, the facial expression is equally great and the image has little else to fault.', '2005-01-23 07:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126550, 132597, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interestng perspective.  i love the red pot down below, in how that grabs your eye and gives you such a strong sport to start working your way through the image.  good work, and good luck in this and the coming challenges!</td>', 'what an interestng perspective.  i love the red pot down below, in how that grabs your eye and gives you such a strong sport to start working your way through the image.  good work, and good luck in this and the coming challenges!', '2005-01-23 07:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126551, 134402, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty butterfly - good job getting close enough to get this, I''ve found they tend to be skittish little critters. As for the image itself - I''d like it a little better if the tips of the wings and the butterly''s head were fully in focus - you''ve got the middle of it really crisp, but it falls away a littl at the edges. A little saturation/contrast bump probably wouldn''t have hurt your chances either. 6.</td>', 'Very pretty butterfly - good job getting close enough to get this, I''ve found they tend to be skittish little critters. As for the image itself - I''d like it a little better if the tips of the wings and the butterly''s head were fully in focus - you''ve got the middle of it really crisp, but it falls away a littl at the edges. A little saturation/contrast bump probably wouldn''t have hurt your chances either. 6.', '2005-01-23 07:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126552, 136757, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great cars, bw gives this an appropriate old school feel, the motion blur also works well.</td>', 'Great cars, bw gives this an appropriate old school feel, the motion blur also works well.', '2005-01-23 07:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126553, 136426, 23458, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene, I like the fashion in which the river winds throughout the image, leading the eye through the landscape.</td>', 'Pretty scene, I like the fashion in which the river winds throughout the image, leading the eye through the landscape.', '2005-01-23 07:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126554, 132303, 23458, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette. I like the simplicity of the composition here.</td>', 'Good silhouette. I like the simplicity of the composition here.', '2005-01-23 07:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126555, 132958, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, including the grass in the foreground adds nicely to the compostion here.</td>', 'Very pretty, including the grass in the foreground adds nicely to the compostion here.', '2005-01-23 07:24:18.000000', NULL, 1);
