(1126571, 133925, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is sweet.  i''m curious, though, as to why you chose this crop, as opposed to either showing the whole car, or cropping in tighter?  also, i hope you''ll correct me if i''m wrong, but it appears that you used a gaussian blur layer on the background, and that your masking has created a bit of an edge.  forgive me if i''m wrong, because i am fairly new in the digital darkroom.  good luck in this and all the coming challenges!</td>', 'this is sweet.  i''m curious, though, as to why you chose this crop, as opposed to either showing the whole car, or cropping in tighter?  also, i hope you''ll correct me if i''m wrong, but it appears that you used a gaussian blur layer on the background, and that your masking has created a bit of an edge.  forgive me if i''m wrong, because i am fairly new in the digital darkroom.  good luck in this and all the coming challenges!', '2005-01-23 07:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
