(1126606, 135889, 23394, '<td valign="top">what i would give to see a cardinal around here when i have my camera!  it always seems to be either one or the other for me.  i hope you are not getting overlooked, and that you are getting good comments and suggestions.  if this doesn''t score where you want it to, please don''t take it personally; just look at it as a good starting point for the rest of the year.  compositionally, i think you''d have a better image if it wasn''t so centered, and technically, it would probably be better if the focus were a bit sharper.  good luck!</td>', 'what i would give to see a cardinal around here when i have my camera!  it always seems to be either one or the other for me.  i hope you are not getting overlooked, and that you are getting good comments and suggestions.  if this doesn''t score where you want it to, please don''t take it personally; just look at it as a good starting point for the rest of the year.  compositionally, i think you''d have a better image if it wasn''t so centered, and technically, it would probably be better if the focus were a bit sharper.  good luck!', '2005-01-23 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
