(1126856, 132367, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an image!  this puts a whole new twist on the saying, ''a face only a mother could love..."  all kidding aside, this gave me a most welcome grin, and i''m sure it''s brought out many, many other smiles as well.  the only suggestion i''d make would be to burn in the the catchlight on the dog''s eye just a bit; it just doesn''t seem natural.  good luck in this and the coming challenges!</td>', 'what an image!  this puts a whole new twist on the saying, ''a face only a mother could love..."  all kidding aside, this gave me a most welcome grin, and i''m sure it''s brought out many, many other smiles as well.  the only suggestion i''d make would be to burn in the the catchlight on the dog''s eye just a bit; it just doesn''t seem natural.  good luck in this and the coming challenges!', '2005-01-23 11:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
