(1126861, 136283, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, how it pains my heart to see this.  you have done an excellent job memorializing this, and i don''t think any score at dpc will ever do this image justice.  and now, having nothing else to offer, i think i''m just going to sit here and reflect on this a bit, if you don''t mind.  thanks for sharing.  good luck with this and all the challenges to come!</td>', 'oh, how it pains my heart to see this.  you have done an excellent job memorializing this, and i don''t think any score at dpc will ever do this image justice.  and now, having nothing else to offer, i think i''m just going to sit here and reflect on this a bit, if you don''t mind.  thanks for sharing.  good luck with this and all the challenges to come!', '2005-01-23 12:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126864, 134009, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, what a fun place to be!  and what i would give to be there now...<br/>this is a great backdrop for your portrait.  i think, though, the composition is off just a bit, that there is too much background behind your subject that leads the eye away from your subject, rather than to her.  the lighting and colors are wonderful, as is her expression.  hopefully, you''ll get some other comments and suggestions, and that you won''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge!  good luck in this and the challenges to come!</td>', 'oh, what a fun place to be!  and what i would give to be there now...this is a great backdrop for your portrait.  i think, though, the composition is off just a bit, that there is too much background behind your subject that leads the eye away from your subject, rather than to her.  the lighting and colors are wonderful, as is her expression.  hopefully, you''ll get some other comments and suggestions, and that you won''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge!  good luck in this and the challenges to come!', '2005-01-23 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
