(1126894, 134993, 23394, '<td valign="top">boy, this is a tough one to read.  i can''t tell if she''s happy, or just really hoping to get this over with...<br/>i hope you''re getting good comments and suggestions, and not getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  if your scores and comments are not where you want them to be, please don''t take it personally; just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  one suggestion i''d make is that images of children are very risky in challenges, unless they offer something that allows non-related viewers to emotionally connect with the subject.  i get the feeling that this image is not going to connect to too many viewers/voters.  if that''s the case, don''t let it dissuade you.  keep on shooting and submitting, and i''m sure you will get where you want to be!  good luck!</td>', 'boy, this is a tough one to read.  i can''t tell if she''s happy, or just really hoping to get this over with...i hope you''re getting good comments and suggestions, and not getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  if your scores and comments are not where you want them to be, please don''t take it personally; just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  one suggestion i''d make is that images of children are very risky in challenges, unless they offer something that allows non-related viewers to emotionally connect with the subject.  i get the feeling that this image is not going to connect to too many viewers/voters.  if that''s the case, don''t let it dissuade you.  keep on shooting and submitting, and i''m sure you will get where you want to be!  good luck!', '2005-01-23 12:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
