(1126900, 136873, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a wild image you''ve produced, and i''m sure that it was as much work as it was fun.  i also think it is just a bit too busy, that the droplets in the background do more to distract than compliment your subject.  the stop motion is great and the flying droplets are wonderful, but, as is, they are getting lost in the background.  if this image doesn''t wind up where you wanted it, don''t take it personally.  just think of this as a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck here, and in the challenges to come!</td>', 'what a wild image you''ve produced, and i''m sure that it was as much work as it was fun.  i also think it is just a bit too busy, that the droplets in the background do more to distract than compliment your subject.  the stop motion is great and the flying droplets are wonderful, but, as is, they are getting lost in the background.  if this image doesn''t wind up where you wanted it, don''t take it personally.  just think of this as a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck here, and in the challenges to come!', '2005-01-23 12:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1126901, 136747, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow, what an image.  i hope that the viewers are giving this one enough time to take it in, and not just blowing by it.  i think you might be hurt by the horizon so evenly splitting the image in half.  the water is so still that everything seems to be running together.  if the duck is actually the subject, you probably would have done better to compose in such a way to accentuate it, as opposed it being virtually hidden.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'wow, what an image.  i hope that the viewers are giving this one enough time to take it in, and not just blowing by it.  i think you might be hurt by the horizon so evenly splitting the image in half.  the water is so still that everything seems to be running together.  if the duck is actually the subject, you probably would have done better to compose in such a way to accentuate it, as opposed it being virtually hidden.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-23 12:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
