(1127543, 136685, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition', '2005-01-23 19:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127545, 136703, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is what people call "snapshot" quality - which seems to mean: great for scrapbooks but if you dont know the kid it lack enough to interest the masses.  Perhaps you are trying to do too much in this image .  the kid playing is one theme and the reflecting keyboard is another theme - they seem to compete rather than compliment each other - your white balance could be corrected, it looks pinkish - I wish her face showed, all I can see well is her hands, one of which is out of focus and the other is held in an awkward position.</td>', 'This is what people call "snapshot" quality - which seems to mean: great for scrapbooks but if you dont know the kid it lack enough to interest the masses.  Perhaps you are trying to do too much in this image .  the kid playing is one theme and the reflecting keyboard is another theme - they seem to compete rather than compliment each other - your white balance could be corrected, it looks pinkish - I wish her face showed, all I can see well is her hands, one of which is out of focus and the other is held in an awkward position.', '2005-01-23 19:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127547, 136680, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition', '2005-01-23 19:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127560, 136591, 4793, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, I love those natural colors of the panda''s fur, very nice work.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, I love those natural colors of the panda''s fur, very nice work.', '2005-01-23 19:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127561, 133785, 18191, '<td valign="top">The composition here is phenomenal and that green --- oh man, it''s beautiful. I love the textures and tones. This one is a winner for me --- 10.</td>', 'The composition here is phenomenal and that green --- oh man, it''s beautiful. I love the textures and tones. This one is a winner for me --- 10.', '2005-01-23 19:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127565, 136869, 18191, '<td valign="top">Have you tried this in B&amp;W and with burnt in clouds? with some experimentation, this could be made into a very different shot... (VP)</td>', 'Have you tried this in B&W and with burnt in clouds? with some experimentation, this could be made into a very different shot... (VP)', '2005-01-23 19:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127569, 133012, 18191, '<td valign="top">The reflection here is phenomenal and so is the composition and toning. If you had gotten this in a square format with less space on the top and more of what''s below, it would be perfect. Still a 10 in my book...</td>', 'The reflection here is phenomenal and so is the composition and toning. If you had gotten this in a square format with less space on the top and more of what''s below, it would be perfect. Still a 10 in my book...', '2005-01-23 19:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127573, 136756, 2764, '<td valign="top">hmm - i like the pale washed out look - makes it look hot and dry - perhaps the tree could have been paler to match?  crop the green bush on the right? it is an eyecatcher and drags the eye to the right off the edge - you dont want to draw the viewers eye oof screen, especially on DPC where the speed voter thinks "done, next photo".  If you can draw the eye back to center, as the tree does (and its shadow too), the viewer will spend a few extra seconds to appreciate the good points,</td>', 'hmm - i like the pale washed out look - makes it look hot and dry - perhaps the tree could have been paler to match?  crop the green bush on the right? it is an eyecatcher and drags the eye to the right off the edge - you dont want to draw the viewers eye oof screen, especially on DPC where the speed voter thinks "done, next photo".  If you can draw the eye back to center, as the tree does (and its shadow too), the viewer will spend a few extra seconds to appreciate the good points,', '2005-01-23 19:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127574, 132945, 18191, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments...<br/> <br/>The warm tones here are great and so is the candid feeling of the shot. Slightly overexposed, but a great shot nonetheless. 9.</td>', 'Returning for comments... The warm tones here are great and so is the candid feeling of the shot. Slightly overexposed, but a great shot nonetheless. 9.', '2005-01-23 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127576, 135613, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful piece here... looks surreal!  The horizontals may have been aligned better, but this shot is definitely worthy of a high score.</td>', 'Beautiful piece here... looks surreal!  The horizontals may have been aligned better, but this shot is definitely worthy of a high score.', '2005-01-23 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127578, 135805, 18834, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  I really like the use of black and white,and the motion or flow displayed by the hair.</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  I really like the use of black and white,and the motion or flow displayed by the hair.', '2005-01-23 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127583, 135165, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is what I believe is the epitome of a silhoutette. This is such a beautiful piece and I like it more and more every time that I see it. I think that this might make my favs once it starts to grow on me.</td>', 'This is what I believe is the epitome of a silhoutette. This is such a beautiful piece and I like it more and more every time that I see it. I think that this might make my favs once it starts to grow on me.', '2005-01-23 19:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127590, 135127, 4793, '<td valign="top">"Beautiful little girl", this shot would work much better if you crop all the grass out in front, just leaving the brick and crop the sides to the edge of the chair, cropping will make her more of the focal point.</td>', '"Beautiful little girl", this shot would work much better if you crop all the grass out in front, just leaving the brick and crop the sides to the edge of the chair, cropping will make her more of the focal point.', '2005-01-23 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127595, 133137, 2764, '<td valign="top">try this: what if you crop somewhere between the eyes and the mouth - leaving the erotic parts as the focus of the image, also leaving the girl anonymous (let the viewer supply his own fantasy).  I think the head makes the image bottom heavy and the face, being less soft than the body, competes for attention.  Not to say that I dont think its a great picture as it is.</td>', 'try this: what if you crop somewhere between the eyes and the mouth - leaving the erotic parts as the focus of the image, also leaving the girl anonymous (let the viewer supply his own fantasy).  I think the head makes the image bottom heavy and the face, being less soft than the body, competes for attention.  Not to say that I dont think its a great picture as it is.', '2005-01-23 19:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1127596, 132109, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition, I love the tones here, your composition is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition, I love the tones here, your composition is perfect.', '2005-01-23 19:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
