(1128510, 136725, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well its admittedly incredibly cute. Send this one off to hallmark and it''ll be covering greeting cards the world over within a year. 7.</td>', 'Well its admittedly incredibly cute. Send this one off to hallmark and it''ll be covering greeting cards the world over within a year. 7.', '2005-01-24 04:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128511, 132362, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really gorgeous flowers. I like your composition, though it does look a tad over-sharpened.</td>', 'Really gorgeous flowers. I like your composition, though it does look a tad over-sharpened.', '2005-01-24 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128512, 133258, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very happy image - the square crop works well here.</td>', 'Very happy image - the square crop works well here.', '2005-01-24 04:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128514, 132023, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like what you are going for here, you''ve obviously got a good eye. But there are a couple of things that let you down, firstly that street light is a bit of a distraction, and secondly the shadow cast on the right building is a little too strong. I''d try a closer crop to avoid the streetlight and bring the strong geometry of the image to the fore. Not much you can do about the shadow ''cept shoot at a different time of day. <br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'I like what you are going for here, you''ve obviously got a good eye. But there are a couple of things that let you down, firstly that street light is a bit of a distraction, and secondly the shadow cast on the right building is a little too strong. I''d try a closer crop to avoid the streetlight and bring the strong geometry of the image to the fore. Not much you can do about the shadow ''cept shoot at a different time of day.  Good luck', '2005-01-24 04:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128516, 132124, 23458, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, though perhaps missing something to elevate it from the realms of the standard tourist shot - I like the way you''ve attempted to frame it with the tree on the top left.</td>', 'A nice scene, though perhaps missing something to elevate it from the realms of the standard tourist shot - I like the way you''ve attempted to frame it with the tree on the top left.', '2005-01-24 04:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128518, 132388, 23458, '<td valign="top">Nice close up - good classic image here. Focus could perhaps be slightly sharper, but its still a great shot.</td>', 'Nice close up - good classic image here. Focus could perhaps be slightly sharper, but its still a great shot.', '2005-01-24 04:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128519, 132524, 23458, '<td valign="top">I like the creative attempt to frame the tower with the tree. Unfortunately the overexposure on the left is really distracting.</td>', 'I like the creative attempt to frame the tower with the tree. Unfortunately the overexposure on the left is really distracting.', '2005-01-24 04:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128520, 132367, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well the thumbnail made me laugh. Can''t help but like this, it''s a fantastic idea for an image. Focus on the dog is a bit off, but I still like this. 7.</td>', 'Well the thumbnail made me laugh. Can''t help but like this, it''s a fantastic idea for an image. Focus on the dog is a bit off, but I still like this. 7.', '2005-01-24 04:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128521, 132310, 23458, '<td valign="top">Technically superb image, really like the reflection - have no idea what you have used as the backdrop/ underneath it, but it''s great. The image itself is a toy, so it''s not really all that inspiring, but on technical merit alone this earns you a 7 and a possible career as a toy catalogue photographer.</td>', 'Technically superb image, really like the reflection - have no idea what you have used as the backdrop/ underneath it, but it''s great. The image itself is a toy, so it''s not really all that inspiring, but on technical merit alone this earns you a 7 and a possible career as a toy catalogue photographer.', '2005-01-24 04:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128522, 132887, 23458, '<td valign="top">NIce perspective and good use of black and white. 6.</td>', 'NIce perspective and good use of black and white. 6.', '2005-01-24 04:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128523, 132165, 23458, '<td valign="top">Stunning dome, the windows are a little blown out (I''m sure you noticed) which is a little distracting but otherwise this is a very nice image. 7.</td>', 'Stunning dome, the windows are a little blown out (I''m sure you noticed) which is a little distracting but otherwise this is a very nice image. 7.', '2005-01-24 04:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128524, 136606, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great candid here. Its great how he fits so nicely into one of the rectangles. I''d try rotating this slightly to make the verticle lines completely upright and perhaps you should think about cropping away a couple of centimetres at the bottom- the floor and concrete posts are a little unnecessary I feel. Good job though. 7.</td>', 'Great candid here. Its great how he fits so nicely into one of the rectangles. I''d try rotating this slightly to make the verticle lines completely upright and perhaps you should think about cropping away a couple of centimetres at the bottom- the floor and concrete posts are a little unnecessary I feel. Good job though. 7.', '2005-01-24 04:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128525, 133363, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, they do look razor sharp don''t they. Good choice for black and white and I like the effect of the sun reflection from the water drops - does create a steely effect.</td>', 'Wow, they do look razor sharp don''t they. Good choice for black and white and I like the effect of the sun reflection from the water drops - does create a steely effect.', '2005-01-24 04:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128526, 136756, 23458, '<td valign="top">Certainly a solid landscape shot - that tree makes for a really great subject. I wish you''d tried to be a bit more creative with the title though :).</td>', 'Certainly a solid landscape shot - that tree makes for a really great subject. I wish you''d tried to be a bit more creative with the title though :).', '2005-01-24 04:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128528, 136329, 23458, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot - really like the black and white and the high key effect you''ve obtained through the sunlight bouncing off that white wall int he background.</td>', 'Great candid shot - really like the black and white and the high key effect you''ve obtained through the sunlight bouncing off that white wall int he background.', '2005-01-24 04:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128530, 136149, 23458, '<td valign="top">I think I missed this the first time round, but this is really quite stunning, the blue tones make for a really beautiful image. Really like the use of negative space to boot. 8.</td>', 'I think I missed this the first time round, but this is really quite stunning, the blue tones make for a really beautiful image. Really like the use of negative space to boot. 8.', '2005-01-24 04:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128531, 133095, 23458, '<td valign="top">NIce scene, though the boat is a bit distracting, and it might have worked better  without the yellow leaves in the top right.</td>', 'NIce scene, though the boat is a bit distracting, and it might have worked better  without the yellow leaves in the top right.', '2005-01-24 04:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128533, 136677, 23458, '<td valign="top">Really joyous image here, you have captured happiness in all its glory. Some won''t but I really like the post processing here. 8.</td>', 'Really joyous image here, you have captured happiness in all its glory. Some won''t but I really like the post processing here. 8.', '2005-01-24 04:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128535, 132699, 23458, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flower - I''d recommend a shallower dof though to isolate it from the background a little better.</td>', 'Very pretty flower - I''d recommend a shallower dof though to isolate it from the background a little better.', '2005-01-24 04:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128544, 133277, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks to be a most interesting subject.  even though the flash is a bit strong, that is something that can be corrected in post-processing.  compositionally, centered subjects don''t do that well when there are too many competing elements in the background (the high contrast makes this a very busy background).  i hope you''re getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you''re not getting overlooked in this monster challenge.  if you aren''t getting the scores and comments you expected, don''t take it personally; just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck is this and the coming challenges!</td>', 'this looks to be a most interesting subject.  even though the flash is a bit strong, that is something that can be corrected in post-processing.  compositionally, centered subjects don''t do that well when there are too many competing elements in the background (the high contrast makes this a very busy background).  i hope you''re getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you''re not getting overlooked in this monster challenge.  if you aren''t getting the scores and comments you expected, don''t take it personally; just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck is this and the coming challenges!', '2005-01-24 05:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128546, 136673, 5728, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2005-01-24 05:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128547, 133637, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting composition.  i can''t imagine this image doing well simply because it takes a fair amount of viewing time to realize that it really is under control and that it has a lot to offer.  this is a real gem in the challenge, and i hope it is getting enough time from the viewers to be appreciated.  please don''t take it personally, if it gets overlooked in this huge challenge.  thanks for sharing, and good luck!</td>', 'what an interesting composition.  i can''t imagine this image doing well simply because it takes a fair amount of viewing time to realize that it really is under control and that it has a lot to offer.  this is a real gem in the challenge, and i hope it is getting enough time from the viewers to be appreciated.  please don''t take it personally, if it gets overlooked in this huge challenge.  thanks for sharing, and good luck!', '2005-01-24 05:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128548, 133111, 4805, '<td valign="top">One of my few 10s. The hand gesture can mean several different things depending on where you are, and I like that it''s open to interpretation. Depicts youth very well.</td>', 'One of my few 10s. The hand gesture can mean several different things depending on where you are, and I like that it''s open to interpretation. Depicts youth very well.', '2005-01-24 05:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128549, 132759, 23394, '<td valign="top">well, this is not something you expect to see every day.  however, this type of image is probably not going to do to well in a challenge, as it is not doing much more than documenting the presence of a deer in a suburban environment.  one of the ''challenges'' is to connect with the voters and stir their senses, and that requires context.  i know this is not an easy object to photograph, but please don''t take it personally if it gets hammered in the scoring.  maybe just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'well, this is not something you expect to see every day.  however, this type of image is probably not going to do to well in a challenge, as it is not doing much more than documenting the presence of a deer in a suburban environment.  one of the ''challenges'' is to connect with the voters and stir their senses, and that requires context.  i know this is not an easy object to photograph, but please don''t take it personally if it gets hammered in the scoring.  maybe just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128551, 136478, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice. This is one shot where composition makes it or breaks it, as it''s almost an abstract. The lines are very well placed.</td>', 'Nice. This is one shot where composition makes it or breaks it, as it''s almost an abstract. The lines are very well placed.', '2005-01-24 05:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128552, 133203, 23394, '<td valign="top">the colors here are simply luxurious, as are the textures!  what a fun image.  i hope this isn''t getting overlooked by the voters in this monster challenge, and that you are getting enough time from the viewers for this to be appreciated.  good luck in this and the coming challenges!</td>', 'the colors here are simply luxurious, as are the textures!  what a fun image.  i hope this isn''t getting overlooked by the voters in this monster challenge, and that you are getting enough time from the viewers for this to be appreciated.  good luck in this and the coming challenges!', '2005-01-24 05:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128553, 134596, 4805, '<td valign="top">This is nice, though I do remember seeing another shot similar to this where the person was in complete silhouette. This might have worked better here, too.</td>', 'This is nice, though I do remember seeing another shot similar to this where the person was in complete silhouette. This might have worked better here, too.', '2005-01-24 05:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128557, 132361, 4805, '<td valign="top">Nice! Very sharp, excellent contrast between the yellow and the red and black of the fly. Not much DOF to work with here, and the focal plane is well-placed. I know how hard it is to catch them when they''re still.</td>', 'Nice! Very sharp, excellent contrast between the yellow and the red and black of the fly. Not much DOF to work with here, and the focal plane is well-placed. I know how hard it is to catch them when they''re still.', '2005-01-24 05:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128558, 132781, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i appreciate you effort here, i think your image could use some work.  the bottom half is nice and tight, but the top is completely blown out.  if it is on purpose, i''ll admit, i''m not getting it.  if this is not intentional, then please don''t take it personally if you are not getting the scores and comments you expected.  this is a tough challenge, especially in its size, and to do well, you need to connect with the viewers both technically and aesthetically.  good luck!</td>', 'while i appreciate you effort here, i think your image could use some work.  the bottom half is nice and tight, but the top is completely blown out.  if it is on purpose, i''ll admit, i''m not getting it.  if this is not intentional, then please don''t take it personally if you are not getting the scores and comments you expected.  this is a tough challenge, especially in its size, and to do well, you need to connect with the viewers both technically and aesthetically.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 05:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128559, 133230, 4805, '<td valign="top">I must go to Iceland one of these years...</td>', 'I must go to Iceland one of these years...', '2005-01-24 05:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128560, 136752, 4805, '<td valign="top">This looks...Icelandic. I also think it looks like it''ll score high. Very well done.</td>', 'This looks...Icelandic. I also think it looks like it''ll score high. Very well done.', '2005-01-24 05:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128562, 133012, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image.  i really hope this little gem isn''t getting overlooked by the voters in this monster challenge, and that it is getting the viewing time necessary to be appreciated.  there are so many interesting elements working here, this is fun to view.  i really like this as a bw, and can imagine that color would be a bit distracting.  good luck, and please don''t take it personally if this gets overlooked.  keep up the good work!</td>', 'what an interesting image.  i really hope this little gem isn''t getting overlooked by the voters in this monster challenge, and that it is getting the viewing time necessary to be appreciated.  there are so many interesting elements working here, this is fun to view.  i really like this as a bw, and can imagine that color would be a bit distracting.  good luck, and please don''t take it personally if this gets overlooked.  keep up the good work!', '2005-01-24 05:44:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1128565, 134296, 4805, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait. Have you considered a vertical orientation? I''d maybe like it better if the middle third were presented in portrait. The flame on the right side is a redundant element and a closer crop would add a sense of intimacy to the shot, whereas currently it''s a bit distant.</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait. Have you considered a vertical orientation? I''d maybe like it better if the middle third were presented in portrait. The flame on the right side is a redundant element and a closer crop would add a sense of intimacy to the shot, whereas currently it''s a bit distant.', '2005-01-24 05:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128569, 135057, 4805, '<td valign="top">Interesting! The fine detail in the beard and hair would likely be better served by a larger size of image, but there''s nothing you can do about that here. Maybe a bit oversharpened, though my LCD is quite unforgiving when considering sharpness. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting! The fine detail in the beard and hair would likely be better served by a larger size of image, but there''s nothing you can do about that here. Maybe a bit oversharpened, though my LCD is quite unforgiving when considering sharpness. Well done.', '2005-01-24 05:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128571, 135805, 4805, '<td valign="top">I like this, though I''d perhaps try a portrait orientation. All the elements flow vertically, and the background doesn''t add much here.</td>', 'I like this, though I''d perhaps try a portrait orientation. All the elements flow vertically, and the background doesn''t add much here.', '2005-01-24 05:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128572, 136863, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a nick-of-time capture!  great timing!  as far as the image goes, i think you may have let yourself down.  there is a huge difference between producing digital art and bringing out the most of what you captured.  here, i would have cloned out the distractions from the water, and i might have cloned out the part of the tree line that meets the feet.  i also would have pushed the saturization and levels to make the colors pop.  when you click the shutter, you are only halfway home--that is, if you really want to score here.  otherwise, it doesn''t really matter.  you have a fine image, and i bet it would look good nicely framed.  good luck with this!</td>', 'this is a nick-of-time capture!  great timing!  as far as the image goes, i think you may have let yourself down.  there is a huge difference between producing digital art and bringing out the most of what you captured.  here, i would have cloned out the distractions from the water, and i might have cloned out the part of the tree line that meets the feet.  i also would have pushed the saturization and levels to make the colors pop.  when you click the shutter, you are only halfway home--that is, if you really want to score here.  otherwise, it doesn''t really matter.  you have a fine image, and i bet it would look good nicely framed.  good luck with this!', '2005-01-24 05:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128573, 132622, 4805, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. This seems like it needs more of a subject. My eyes are drawn to nowhere in particular. It''s also a bit overprocessed, it seems. I like the idea though.</td>', 'Hmmm. This seems like it needs more of a subject. My eyes are drawn to nowhere in particular. It''s also a bit overprocessed, it seems. I like the idea though.', '2005-01-24 05:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128577, 135164, 23394, '<td valign="top">please bear with me on this.  this is a tough challenge to vote, not just because of its size, but because we are looking at images that people consider to be their best from the past year--and most people have a bit more personal attachment to these images than to one they might submit for a challenge called "kitchen objects".<br/> <br/>you do have a beautiful model, and i hope you have many, many opportunities to photograph her.  in this image, though, yes, her eyes are beautiful, but the image is processed to the point that she no longer looks natural.  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not getting overlooked in this monster-sized challenge; if not, don''t take it personally; just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and all the coming challenges!</td>', 'please bear with me on this.  this is a tough challenge to vote, not just because of its size, but because we are looking at images that people consider to be their best from the past year--and most people have a bit more personal attachment to these images than to one they might submit for a challenge called "kitchen objects". you do have a beautiful model, and i hope you have many, many opportunities to photograph her.  in this image, though, yes, her eyes are beautiful, but the image is processed to the point that she no longer looks natural.  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not getting overlooked in this monster-sized challenge; if not, don''t take it personally; just consider this a good starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and all the coming challenges!', '2005-01-24 05:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128583, 136759, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful capture.  the colors are wonderful.  the unfortunate thing about images such as these is that people don''t realize how much effort they take until they try to shoot it themselves.  good work here.  i hope you aren''t getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  good luck!</td>', 'what a beautiful capture.  the colors are wonderful.  the unfortunate thing about images such as these is that people don''t realize how much effort they take until they try to shoot it themselves.  good work here.  i hope you aren''t getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 05:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128586, 134669, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent composition.  love the colors that the lighting is producing.  this is the type of image people can easily take for granted--until they try to shoot it themselves!  i hope you aren''t getting beaten up for the blown out details, and that you aren''t getting overlooked in this monster challenge!  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'excellent composition.  love the colors that the lighting is producing.  this is the type of image people can easily take for granted--until they try to shoot it themselves!  i hope you aren''t getting beaten up for the blown out details, and that you aren''t getting overlooked in this monster challenge!  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 06:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128596, 136620, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, how much fun was this to shoot!  whale watching is definitely on my list of things to do before i die!  thanks for sharing yours.  i hope you are not getting some good comments and suggestions, and not getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge.  as far as a challenge entry goes, i imagine that this is getting classified more as a ''snapshot'', that is, an image that documents you went whale-watching, than a ''challenge entry'', where you are presenting something that will visually arrest the viewers.  sometimes, a simple snapshot can do that when it is processed for that purpose.  this might be more ''stunning'' if you had cropped it down to the whale''s tail.  the key is to really look at your images to see what you can pull out of them.  now, remember, all of this is just my opinion.  you have a nice image, and i''m sure you had a wonderful afternoon.  please don''t take this challenge personally.  good luck in this and the coming challenges!</td>', 'oh, how much fun was this to shoot!  whale watching is definitely on my list of things to do before i die!  thanks for sharing yours.  i hope you are not getting some good comments and suggestions, and not getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge.  as far as a challenge entry goes, i imagine that this is getting classified more as a ''snapshot'', that is, an image that documents you went whale-watching, than a ''challenge entry'', where you are presenting something that will visually arrest the viewers.  sometimes, a simple snapshot can do that when it is processed for that purpose.  this might be more ''stunning'' if you had cropped it down to the whale''s tail.  the key is to really look at your images to see what you can pull out of them.  now, remember, all of this is just my opinion.  you have a nice image, and i''m sure you had a wonderful afternoon.  please don''t take this challenge personally.  good luck in this and the coming challenges!', '2005-01-24 06:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128602, 136856, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i appreciate what you''ve entered here, i do think it has some things working against it as far as a challenge entry goes.  the lighting at this time of day is anything but helpful, as the light and shadows are too strong for the magnificent details to come through.  compositionally, you are fine, but your sky is not adding anything to the image.  i hope you aren''t getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  if not, please don''t take it personally.  just consider this a starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'while i appreciate what you''ve entered here, i do think it has some things working against it as far as a challenge entry goes.  the lighting at this time of day is anything but helpful, as the light and shadows are too strong for the magnificent details to come through.  compositionally, you are fine, but your sky is not adding anything to the image.  i hope you aren''t getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  if not, please don''t take it personally.  just consider this a starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 06:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128609, 136606, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image.  i like the colors.  what i''m most interested in is what this image means to you.  what made this stand out to you among all the images you took last year?  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge.  if you aren''t getting the views and scores you expected, don''t take it personally.  maybe just consider this a starting point for the rest of the year.  keep in mind, one of the ''challenges'' is to connect with the viewers and voters.  this is not always easy--that''s that makes it a challenge!  good luck in this and the coming challenges!</td>', 'this is an interesting image.  i like the colors.  what i''m most interested in is what this image means to you.  what made this stand out to you among all the images you took last year?  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge.  if you aren''t getting the views and scores you expected, don''t take it personally.  maybe just consider this a starting point for the rest of the year.  keep in mind, one of the ''challenges'' is to connect with the viewers and voters.  this is not always easy--that''s that makes it a challenge!  good luck in this and the coming challenges!', '2005-01-24 06:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128612, 132779, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image.  she really appears to be totally absorbed.  i think the composition is interesting, but the bokeh-type lights are really distracting (very much at odds with the rest of the image).  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and not being overlooked in this monster-size challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'what an interesting image.  she really appears to be totally absorbed.  i think the composition is interesting, but the bokeh-type lights are really distracting (very much at odds with the rest of the image).  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and not being overlooked in this monster-size challenge.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128615, 133744, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image.  i love your composition and treatment of the image.  good work.  i will be surprised if this one gets overlooked.  good luck!</td>', 'what an interesting image.  i love your composition and treatment of the image.  good work.  i will be surprised if this one gets overlooked.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128620, 136449, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image.  pretty wild how the pinecone''s coloring blends in with the rocks.  i hope this is not being overlooked in this monster-sized challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  if not, please don''t take it personally; maybe just consider it a starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and the challenges to come!</td>', 'what an interesting image.  pretty wild how the pinecone''s coloring blends in with the rocks.  i hope this is not being overlooked in this monster-sized challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  if not, please don''t take it personally; maybe just consider it a starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and the challenges to come!', '2005-01-24 06:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128623, 134971, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful image.  however, as a challenge entry, i think it will probably be considered more of a pretty picture that documents your view of the mountain, as opposed to one that arrests the viewers visually.  i hope this is not being overlooked in this monster-sized challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  if not, please don''t take it personally; maybe just consider it a starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and the challenges to come!</td>', 'what a beautiful image.  however, as a challenge entry, i think it will probably be considered more of a pretty picture that documents your view of the mountain, as opposed to one that arrests the viewers visually.  i hope this is not being overlooked in this monster-sized challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  if not, please don''t take it personally; maybe just consider it a starting point for the rest of the year.  good luck in this and the challenges to come!', '2005-01-24 06:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128624, 133126, 23394, '<td valign="top">how sweet is this!  i really hope this doesn''t get lost in the shuffle, and that it gets the attention it deserves.  what an incredible capture.  and now, as i have nothing further to add, i''m just going to sit back and enjoy it for a moment, if you don''t mind.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'how sweet is this!  i really hope this doesn''t get lost in the shuffle, and that it gets the attention it deserves.  what an incredible capture.  and now, as i have nothing further to add, i''m just going to sit back and enjoy it for a moment, if you don''t mind.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 06:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128629, 132622, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image.  although, i''d have to say it really could use a subject.  the way you have processed this, that open area is just begging for there to be something or somebody in it.  i hope this does well for you, and that it doesn''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge!  good luck!</td>', 'what an interesting image.  although, i''d have to say it really could use a subject.  the way you have processed this, that open area is just begging for there to be something or somebody in it.  i hope this does well for you, and that it doesn''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge!  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128630, 136608, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful capture.  the detail is amazing, and i really like the way the lighting works across the dome.  i hope this doesn''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge, and that it gets the attention it deserves.  good luck!</td>', 'what a beautiful capture.  the detail is amazing, and i really like the way the lighting works across the dome.  i hope this doesn''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge, and that it gets the attention it deserves.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128633, 134909, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image, especially in the colors.  i hope this isn''t getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  good luck!</td>', 'what an interesting image, especially in the colors.  i hope this isn''t getting overlooked in this monster-size challenge, and that you are getting some good comments and suggestions.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128639, 136590, 23394, '<td valign="top">this view looks like it is full of potential, with the colors in the foreground, and the way the clouds and light can play across the background.  what you need, though is a strong subject.  by centering the windmill, you have made it the subject here, but it is too far away, and most of its detail blends in with the background.  if you have access to this type of vista on a regular basis, you are in heaven!  all you really need to do is work on composition, and you will be turning out some amazing work!  good luck!</td>', 'this view looks like it is full of potential, with the colors in the foreground, and the way the clouds and light can play across the background.  what you need, though is a strong subject.  by centering the windmill, you have made it the subject here, but it is too far away, and most of its detail blends in with the background.  if you have access to this type of vista on a regular basis, you are in heaven!  all you really need to do is work on composition, and you will be turning out some amazing work!  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128642, 135679, 23394, '<td valign="top">yow!  that''s getting a little close, dontcha think!  this is a pretty wild image, and i hope it''s not getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'yow!  that''s getting a little close, dontcha think!  this is a pretty wild image, and i hope it''s not getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 06:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128646, 135240, 23394, '<td valign="top">i imagine that there is a beautiful image in here, somewhere, but it is too dark for me to really appreciate it.  but, remember, that''s just my opinion.  you do have a nice image.</td>', 'i imagine that there is a beautiful image in here, somewhere, but it is too dark for me to really appreciate it.  but, remember, that''s just my opinion.  you do have a nice image.', '2005-01-24 06:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128652, 133213, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the elegance of the way she holds her head. The scarf frames her face and neck very well, lighting is great and I love the choose of background which works well with her face and the warm colours. I think it''s the mood that caught me, good luck! :-)</td>', 'I love the elegance of the way she holds her head. The scarf frames her face and neck very well, lighting is great and I love the choose of background which works well with her face and the warm colours. I think it''s the mood that caught me, good luck! :-)', '2005-01-24 07:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128657, 136319, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love fog photos! This is a great one with wonderful silhouettes in the background, and great composition. I wish the boats were a bit more sharp and colourful, but I know how difficult it is to take good shot in fog. Your photo makes me wonder aboaut these boats: why are they on the shore, what''s happening. IMHO, a good photo makes people think and yours has made me. :-)</td>', 'I love fog photos! This is a great one with wonderful silhouettes in the background, and great composition. I wish the boats were a bit more sharp and colourful, but I know how difficult it is to take good shot in fog. Your photo makes me wonder aboaut these boats: why are they on the shore, what''s happening. IMHO, a good photo makes people think and yours has made me. :-)', '2005-01-24 07:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128658, 135057, 10858, '<td valign="top">Last night I watched Logan''s run and there is an old man in the movie. Your shot reminds me to him. Wonderful portrait with full of emotions, I love that each hair of his are visible separately, I can almost feel it with my fingers. The composition you used works well, too. Good luck! :-)</td>', 'Last night I watched Logan''s run and there is an old man in the movie. Your shot reminds me to him. Wonderful portrait with full of emotions, I love that each hair of his are visible separately, I can almost feel it with my fingers. The composition you used works well, too. Good luck! :-)', '2005-01-24 07:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128662, 136162, 10858, '<td valign="top">So strange clouds, I always loved strangeness of the nature. The composition works well, the storm is menacing with these colours, and I love the light on the top of the lighthouse. Though, I still miss something that I can''t explain. I tried to hide the upper 40% and this way I felt your photo a bit more balanced.</td>', 'So strange clouds, I always loved strangeness of the nature. The composition works well, the storm is menacing with these colours, and I love the light on the top of the lighthouse. Though, I still miss something that I can''t explain. I tried to hide the upper 40% and this way I felt your photo a bit more balanced.', '2005-01-24 07:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128664, 136727, 10858, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh. :-))) Simple and humorous. :-) I wish the cow was a bit more sharp and greens a bit more saturated green.</td>', 'This one made me laugh. :-))) Simple and humorous. :-) I wish the cow was a bit more sharp and greens a bit more saturated green.', '2005-01-24 07:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128669, 135135, 10858, '<td valign="top">Simple and classical, but I don''t feel much creativity in it. The composition is not bad, though, I would have cropped a bit on the top and right side to follow the rule of thirds. I like the sharpness of the main subject.</td>', 'Simple and classical, but I don''t feel much creativity in it. The composition is not bad, though, I would have cropped a bit on the top and right side to follow the rule of thirds. I like the sharpness of the main subject.', '2005-01-24 07:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128671, 133791, 10858, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that the whole house is floating on the small bridge (?) coming from the bottom left corner. :-) Simple subject and so wonderful colours, so moody and crisp. I love this one, good luck! :-)</td>', 'It seems to me that the whole house is floating on the small bridge (?) coming from the bottom left corner. :-) Simple subject and so wonderful colours, so moody and crisp. I love this one, good luck! :-)', '2005-01-24 07:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128685, 136224, 2764, '<td valign="top">This looked better in the thumbnail - I think it would benefit from some post processing - the rock is so dark and the sky is so pale - they seem to compete with eachother rather than work together.  I like that the rock is hard/harsh and the sky is soft.  I like the way it seems to be floating.  Would it look better or worse if the colors of the sky were enhanced?  I wonder/</td>', 'This looked better in the thumbnail - I think it would benefit from some post processing - the rock is so dark and the sky is so pale - they seem to compete with eachother rather than work together.  I like that the rock is hard/harsh and the sky is soft.  I like the way it seems to be floating.  Would it look better or worse if the colors of the sky were enhanced?  I wonder/', '2005-01-24 07:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128739, 134028, 22964, '<td valign="top">thats true eric!</td>', 'thats true eric!', '2005-01-24 08:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128740, 134074, 23394, '<td valign="top">how fun!  i think, though, as a challenge entry, the composition is what is holding the score down.  as a centered subject, it is too deep in the image.  also, there''s not quite enough contrast between the subject and the white house behind it.  this is a nice bw, and i hope it doesn''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  good luck!</td>', 'how fun!  i think, though, as a challenge entry, the composition is what is holding the score down.  as a centered subject, it is too deep in the image.  also, there''s not quite enough contrast between the subject and the white house behind it.  this is a nice bw, and i hope it doesn''t get lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 08:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1128744, 136651, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image.  you''ve done a good job with the composition, and controlling the exposure.  i hope that this is not getting overlooked, and that it is getting the attention it deserves.  one note, on a technical aspect.  if you are going to use a gaussian blur layer for the background, you may want to work with the feathering to reduce the slight halo-effect.  even though it is only slightly noticeable.  (and, if i''m wrong, please correct me!).  good luck in this and the challenges to come!</td>', 'interesting image.  you''ve done a good job with the composition, and controlling the exposure.  i hope that this is not getting overlooked, and that it is getting the attention it deserves.  one note, on a technical aspect.  if you are going to use a gaussian blur layer for the background, you may want to work with the feathering to reduce the slight halo-effect.  even though it is only slightly noticeable.  (and, if i''m wrong, please correct me!).  good luck in this and the challenges to come!', '2005-01-24 08:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
