(1128754, 136750, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a great crate image!  i hope this doesn''t get overlooked, and that you get some good comments and suggestions.  i think (and this is just <i>my</i> opinion), that if you had cropped it a bit tighter, it would have been much, much stronger; the really blurry bars are a major distraction.  i''m thinking 10% off the bottom, 25% off the top, and 25% off the right.  try it, and i think you''ll be surprised at just how much more it pops out at you...<br/> <br/>good luck in this and all the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'what a great crate image!  i hope this doesn''t get overlooked, and that you get some good comments and suggestions.  i think (and this is just my opinion), that if you had cropped it a bit tighter, it would have been much, much stronger; the really blurry bars are a major distraction.  i''m thinking 10% off the bottom, 25% off the top, and 25% off the right.  try it, and i think you''ll be surprised at just how much more it pops out at you... good luck in this and all the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 08:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
