(1128773, 136709, 23394, '<td valign="top">most aptly titled!  excellent capture.  the only two suggestions i''d make would have been to have cropped off the right 40% and to have slightly burned in the hotspots on the frog.  i suggest the cropping because placing him further to the right would have him facing into the image as opposed out of it (and the right part really isn''t adding anything).  what a great expression!  i do hope this isn''t getting lost in the shuffle of this super-sized challenge, and that it is getting the attention it deserves.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'most aptly titled!  excellent capture.  the only two suggestions i''d make would have been to have cropped off the right 40% and to have slightly burned in the hotspots on the frog.  i suggest the cropping because placing him further to the right would have him facing into the image as opposed out of it (and the right part really isn''t adding anything).  what a great expression!  i do hope this isn''t getting lost in the shuffle of this super-sized challenge, and that it is getting the attention it deserves.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 08:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
