(1128958, 136594, 19010, '<td valign="top">while i can''t imagine how a shot like this would score in a challenge, I gave you an 8. An old tire. A rope, some dirty water. and an ugly shadow. Not very a very pleasing combination. Or atleast that would have been what I would have said if I hadn''t seen the shot. You did a wonderfull job of making garbage look like gold.<br/> <br/>Keep up the great work</td>', 'while i can''t imagine how a shot like this would score in a challenge, I gave you an 8. An old tire. A rope, some dirty water. and an ugly shadow. Not very a very pleasing combination. Or atleast that would have been what I would have said if I hadn''t seen the shot. You did a wonderfull job of making garbage look like gold. Keep up the great work', '2005-01-24 10:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
