(1129497, 136457, 26756, '<td valign="top">Back to comment..<br/>There are two ways to look at this.  I would prefer to see the elephant without the fence, with more detail and with softer, more diffused light so the detail in the skin is not washed out.  The fence does of course reflect that it is indeed a captive and brings an emotional response, but for me I would even then like to see better light and maybe a different angle.</td>', 'Back to comment..There are two ways to look at this.  I would prefer to see the elephant without the fence, with more detail and with softer, more diffused light so the detail in the skin is not washed out.  The fence does of course reflect that it is indeed a captive and brings an emotional response, but for me I would even then like to see better light and maybe a different angle.', '2005-01-24 17:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129504, 132743, 26756, '<td valign="top">Just from her eye and her hair, you can tell right off the bat that you have a beautiful model to work with...but in my opinion you didn''t take full advantage of that.  The background is distracting and there are a lot of annoying hot spots.  The light on her is nice, but the background doesn''t fit the photo.<br/> <br/> If I were you I''d get this girl back for some more photos in a nice, flattering environment and see what you can do.</td>', 'Just from her eye and her hair, you can tell right off the bat that you have a beautiful model to work with...but in my opinion you didn''t take full advantage of that.  The background is distracting and there are a lot of annoying hot spots.  The light on her is nice, but the background doesn''t fit the photo.  If I were you I''d get this girl back for some more photos in a nice, flattering environment and see what you can do.', '2005-01-24 17:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129510, 133337, 26756, '<td valign="top">Back to comment..<br/>An potentially interesting shot.  You have a lot of colors to work with, a charming setting and a beautiful background.  First of all I would submit your pic at the full 640 pixels allowed so we get the full effect.  Maybe a polarizer could have helped to reduce the glare from the sand.  All in all a good photo, lighting was a bit harsh.</td>', 'Back to comment..An potentially interesting shot.  You have a lot of colors to work with, a charming setting and a beautiful background.  First of all I would submit your pic at the full 640 pixels allowed so we get the full effect.  Maybe a polarizer could have helped to reduce the glare from the sand.  All in all a good photo, lighting was a bit harsh.', '2005-01-24 17:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129527, 136756, 32482, '<td valign="top">One of the best landscape compositions I have seen so far. 10~</td>', 'One of the best landscape compositions I have seen so far. 10~', '2005-01-24 17:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
