(1129830, 135233, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture.  Simple but elegant.  Great detail and color.  9</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture.  Simple but elegant.  Great detail and color.  9', '2005-01-24 20:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129831, 132255, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is my top rated shot this challenge, great job!  Good capture of the symmetry and is enhanced by the softness.  Frame works well.</td>', 'This is my top rated shot this challenge, great job!  Good capture of the symmetry and is enhanced by the softness.  Frame works well.', '2005-01-24 20:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129832, 133791, 29404, '<td valign="top">"very"...welldone</td>', '"very"...welldone', '2005-01-24 20:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129982, 133566, 32612, '<td valign="top">Love the blurred background, looks very majestic</td>', 'Love the blurred background, looks very majestic', '2005-01-24 22:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129986, 133230, 30959, '<td valign="top">Well done...nice capture of mood, light, drama and just all round coolness...10</td>', 'Well done...nice capture of mood, light, drama and just all round coolness...10', '2005-01-24 22:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129991, 136244, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting image, especially the hues in the water.  the haze in the background is rather distracting, but there are some post-processing techniques that can actually handle that niceley.  i''m not too keen on how centered the subject is, but i also realize you can''t always control your perspective.  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not getting overlooked in this monster challenge.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'what an interesting image, especially the hues in the water.  the haze in the background is rather distracting, but there are some post-processing techniques that can actually handle that niceley.  i''m not too keen on how centered the subject is, but i also realize you can''t always control your perspective.  i hope you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not getting overlooked in this monster challenge.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129994, 136718, 23394, '<td valign="top">how fun is this!  what a tricky lighting job.  i really want to learn how to do this, and hope you share your set up in your photog notes.  i also hope this image is getting the attention it deserves, and that it is not getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'how fun is this!  what a tricky lighting job.  i really want to learn how to do this, and hope you share your set up in your photog notes.  i also hope this image is getting the attention it deserves, and that it is not getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129997, 136752, 6520, '<td valign="top">looks like one of yours Heida? Really nice 10</td>', 'looks like one of yours Heida? Really nice 10', '2005-01-24 22:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1129999, 134065, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, how fun!  those colors certainly catch the eye.  i hope that you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not being overlooked in this monster-sized challenge.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'oh, how fun!  those colors certainly catch the eye.  i hope that you are getting some good comments and suggestions, and that you are not being overlooked in this monster-sized challenge.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130001, 135296, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting composition.  i sure hope this little gem isn''t getting overlooked, and that it is getting the views it deserves.  well done!  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'what an interesting composition.  i sure hope this little gem isn''t getting overlooked, and that it is getting the views it deserves.  well done!  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130004, 134628, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent work, bringing this most interesting flower to life, and in the middle of the day, at that!  great job.  and might i say, a love bokeh, as well.  i hope this image is not getting blown over in this super-sized challenge; this is quite a shot, but unfortunately it is also one that takes more than a blip to appreciate.  good luck with this, and with the challenges yet to come!  thanks for sharing.</td>', 'excellent work, bringing this most interesting flower to life, and in the middle of the day, at that!  great job.  and might i say, a love bokeh, as well.  i hope this image is not getting blown over in this super-sized challenge; this is quite a shot, but unfortunately it is also one that takes more than a blip to appreciate.  good luck with this, and with the challenges yet to come!  thanks for sharing.', '2005-01-24 22:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130007, 134714, 23394, '<td valign="top">how adorable.  what an expression you have captured.  excellent work. i know this isn''t the type of image that does well in open challenges, but i really hope viewers are stopping to give this one the time it deserves.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'how adorable.  what an expression you have captured.  excellent work. i know this isn''t the type of image that does well in open challenges, but i really hope viewers are stopping to give this one the time it deserves.  good luck in this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130011, 135490, 23394, '<td valign="top">i will, thank you!  what a view you have captured here.  and, as i have nothing else to offer, i''ll just sit and enjoy it a while, if you don''t mind.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'i will, thank you!  what a view you have captured here.  and, as i have nothing else to offer, i''ll just sit and enjoy it a while, if you don''t mind.  good luck with this and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130015, 133716, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think i''ve been here.  isn''t it on interstate 64, not to far from the va border?  (you don''t have to pm me an answer, just put it in your photog notes)  this is a nice image that you''ve captured.  though it''s not the type of image that normally scores high, it does have its place here, and i thank you for sharing.  you''ve done a good job with this, and it does stand out from the typical snapshot type images.  i do hope it is getting the attention it deserves.  good luck with this, and in the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'i think i''ve been here.  isn''t it on interstate 64, not to far from the va border?  (you don''t have to pm me an answer, just put it in your photog notes)  this is a nice image that you''ve captured.  though it''s not the type of image that normally scores high, it does have its place here, and i thank you for sharing.  you''ve done a good job with this, and it does stand out from the typical snapshot type images.  i do hope it is getting the attention it deserves.  good luck with this, and in the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130019, 134345, 23394, '<td valign="top">whu-whu-whu-whu-WWOOOWWWWWWWW!!!!! this is flat out AWESOME!  i don''t have anything else to say, so, if you don''t mind, i think i''m just going to hang out and enjoy this a bit!  thanks for sharing.  i really hope this does well for you!</td>', 'whu-whu-whu-whu-WWOOOWWWWWWWW!!!!! this is flat out AWESOME!  i don''t have anything else to say, so, if you don''t mind, i think i''m just going to hang out and enjoy this a bit!  thanks for sharing.  i really hope this does well for you!', '2005-01-24 22:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130020, 132400, 27856, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!! Disipointed that you didn''t give the location of the Litehouse but none the less I love the shot!</td>', 'Outstanding!!! Disipointed that you didn''t give the location of the Litehouse but none the less I love the shot!', '2005-01-24 22:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130021, 132958, 6520, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice 9</td>', 'Simple but nice 9', '2005-01-24 22:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130034, 132337, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, i''m really not quite sure what to make of this.  there''s nothing wrong with it technically (it''s in focus, the exposure is under control, it has an appropriate dof).  it is somewhat interesting compositionally, with all the lines, and the colors.  there''s just something i can''t put my finger on.  i guess it''s just that even though images as this have their place here, and i do appreciate them, i just can''t believe that this is the best image you produced last year.  just with what i see here, i know you have the equipment, eye, and capability; that''s why i just don''t get it.  i''m sorry if this sounds harsh, and i promise you, after this is over, if i can''t find any indication that you could have picked a better entry, i''ll start a thread and publicly apologize.  it just seems to me that you have the ability to do very well here, and, unless you have some emotional attachment to this image, you entered the wrong one.  good luck!</td>', 'ok, i''m really not quite sure what to make of this.  there''s nothing wrong with it technically (it''s in focus, the exposure is under control, it has an appropriate dof).  it is somewhat interesting compositionally, with all the lines, and the colors.  there''s just something i can''t put my finger on.  i guess it''s just that even though images as this have their place here, and i do appreciate them, i just can''t believe that this is the best image you produced last year.  just with what i see here, i know you have the equipment, eye, and capability; that''s why i just don''t get it.  i''m sorry if this sounds harsh, and i promise you, after this is over, if i can''t find any indication that you could have picked a better entry, i''ll start a thread and publicly apologize.  it just seems to me that you have the ability to do very well here, and, unless you have some emotional attachment to this image, you entered the wrong one.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130035, 135575, 31307, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Awesome spectral smoke effect!  How''d you do that?</td>', 'Whoa!  Awesome spectral smoke effect!  How''d you do that?', '2005-01-24 22:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130041, 132303, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting image and a well-executed capture.  i don''t have anything else to say except that i''m just going to sit here and enjoy this a bit.  good luck!</td>', 'interesting image and a well-executed capture.  i don''t have anything else to say except that i''m just going to sit here and enjoy this a bit.  good luck!', '2005-01-24 22:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130042, 133148, 31307, '<td valign="top">I like how you turned the photo upside down.  That''s very unusual, but I like it here.</td>', 'I like how you turned the photo upside down.  That''s very unusual, but I like it here.', '2005-01-24 22:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1130045, 132864, 23394, '<td valign="top">what an interesting, evocative image.  i hope that it isn''t getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge, and that it is getting the time it deserves.  good luck with this, and all the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'what an interesting, evocative image.  i hope that it isn''t getting lost in the shuffle of this huge challenge, and that it is getting the time it deserves.  good luck with this, and all the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-24 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
