(1130106, 136625, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a kick!  i''ll bet this was a blast to shoot.  excellent work here, all the way around.  the colors rock, and the composition is perfect!  i hope this gets the attention it deserves--it really is a breath of fresh air.  good luck with this, and the challenges yet to come!<br/> <br/>[and, as a side note, you might want to look into entering this in your state fair this year.  our va state fair actually has a submission category for "state fair images", and something like this would do very, very well.  just an idea to keep in mind.]</td>', 'what a kick!  i''ll bet this was a blast to shoot.  excellent work here, all the way around.  the colors rock, and the composition is perfect!  i hope this gets the attention it deserves--it really is a breath of fresh air.  good luck with this, and the challenges yet to come! [and, as a side note, you might want to look into entering this in your state fair this year.  our va state fair actually has a submission category for "state fair images", and something like this would do very, very well.  just an idea to keep in mind.]', '2005-01-24 22:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
