(1130560, 136033, 23394, '<td valign="top">well, this certainly is eye catching!  i hope you are not getting overlooked in this super-sized challenge, and that you are getting good comments and suggestions.  i like what you''ve got here, but it does feel somewhat muted (and that''s pretty hard to over come at this time of day).  you might consider playing with the saturization levels to make it pop just a bit more.   good luck with this, and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'well, this certainly is eye catching!  i hope you are not getting overlooked in this super-sized challenge, and that you are getting good comments and suggestions.  i like what you''ve got here, but it does feel somewhat muted (and that''s pretty hard to over come at this time of day).  you might consider playing with the saturization levels to make it pop just a bit more.   good luck with this, and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-25 07:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
