(1130660, 132795, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful moment you have captured.  i have a seriously love/hate relationship pursuing sunrise photography.  it''s not automatic, and sometimes i spend so much time working at it that i miss the actual experience!  it is really difficult to get an exposure that captures everything, and you''ve done a good job here.  and, i really hate saying this, i think your image would really rock if you cropped out the right 30% (meaning the sun, itself).  it is just so overpowering that it really takes away from the overall image.  hold your hand up to the screen, and you''ll see what i mean.  but, that''s just my opinion.  you have a fine image, and i hope it does well for you here.  good luck in this, and the challenges yet to come!</td>', 'what a beautiful moment you have captured.  i have a seriously love/hate relationship pursuing sunrise photography.  it''s not automatic, and sometimes i spend so much time working at it that i miss the actual experience!  it is really difficult to get an exposure that captures everything, and you''ve done a good job here.  and, i really hate saying this, i think your image would really rock if you cropped out the right 30% (meaning the sun, itself).  it is just so overpowering that it really takes away from the overall image.  hold your hand up to the screen, and you''ll see what i mean.  but, that''s just my opinion.  you have a fine image, and i hope it does well for you here.  good luck in this, and the challenges yet to come!', '2005-01-25 08:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
