(1131292, 136414, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast, especially in the sky.<br/>I like it how the foreground shoreline leads to the cloud formations and that it has some bird at the end. Would work better in a larger size like 800 to 1024 wide I think. The light on the sand is also interesting with that small stripe of gold. The ripples in the water add some interest there. Good composition.</td>', 'Interesting contrast, especially in the sky.I like it how the foreground shoreline leads to the cloud formations and that it has some bird at the end. Would work better in a larger size like 800 to 1024 wide I think. The light on the sand is also interesting with that small stripe of gold. The ripples in the water add some interest there. Good composition.', '2005-01-25 16:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
