(1131327, 136689, 3032, '<td valign="top">For two weeks I have been returning to this photograph. I like portraits but didn''t give this higher than a 7. Why, I wondered, because those eyes and her face come out splendid, the crown in the hair and the necklace gives the idea that it is a special occasion and the lying in a landscape composition is a good idea as well.<br/>I think my ''problem'' is the arm under her head leading out of the frame to the right. It looks strange, out of place and it is lit in a similar way as the upside of the face (low fill-light?) and therefore draws attention it doesn''t deserve.</td>', 'For two weeks I have been returning to this photograph. I like portraits but didn''t give this higher than a 7. Why, I wondered, because those eyes and her face come out splendid, the crown in the hair and the necklace gives the idea that it is a special occasion and the lying in a landscape composition is a good idea as well.I think my ''problem'' is the arm under her head leading out of the frame to the right. It looks strange, out of place and it is lit in a similar way as the upside of the face (low fill-light?) and therefore draws attention it doesn''t deserve.', '2005-01-25 16:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
