(1131339, 132540, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amazing how this photo ''works''. Somehow it is very active, like it is alive and all the motion seems to be directed to the one person who is perfectly in focus. I love it how you captured his expression in this sea of people. He is the one standing out of the crowd and you caught it.  The shallow DOF and wide view works so well. Great shot.</td>', 'Amazing how this photo ''works''. Somehow it is very active, like it is alive and all the motion seems to be directed to the one person who is perfectly in focus. I love it how you captured his expression in this sea of people. He is the one standing out of the crowd and you caught it.  The shallow DOF and wide view works so well. Great shot.', '2005-01-25 16:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131342, 136551, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2005-01-25 16:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1131343, 136815, 3032, '<td valign="top">The huge lump of body below the face looks a bit strange. Is it her shoulder or her knee? Especially since it has a distinctive darker skintone as her face. It makes the whole composition look a bit strange.<br/>I like the light on her face, the power of and the light in her eyes.</td>', 'The huge lump of body below the face looks a bit strange. Is it her shoulder or her knee? Especially since it has a distinctive darker skintone as her face. It makes the whole composition look a bit strange.I like the light on her face, the power of and the light in her eyes.', '2005-01-25 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
