(1131367, 133346, 24511, '<td valign="top">After two month away this is my first vote this year.  I like the black and white choice you`ve made here.  The upper horizontal line at the top isn`t parallel with the framed with the edge of the photo.  This makes me want to lean right.  It`s odd and eye catching to see a break in the water line again  in the middle of the falls where the bar meets water.  The santa beard white form has great wavy lines and is my favorite part of the photo.  I found the photo very much surrounded by dark shadow.  You get a five vote and everyone else will be judged higher or lower depending on how they compare to your photo.  Good luck.</td>', 'After two month away this is my first vote this year.  I like the black and white choice you`ve made here.  The upper horizontal line at the top isn`t parallel with the framed with the edge of the photo.  This makes me want to lean right.  It`s odd and eye catching to see a break in the water line again  in the middle of the falls where the bar meets water.  The santa beard white form has great wavy lines and is my favorite part of the photo.  I found the photo very much surrounded by dark shadow.  You get a five vote and everyone else will be judged higher or lower depending on how they compare to your photo.  Good luck.', '2005-01-25 17:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
