(1131561, 135427, 20779, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I expect you will get a certain share of "too much Neat Image used" type of comments - it is such a personal taste and choice. For me, I think this is just stunning and makes a photo into a portrait. If I were to nit-pik, then I would say that the cheeks just around the nose are a touch light compared to the other skin, and there is a somewhat distracting halo of pink above the upper lip. 8.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I expect you will get a certain share of "too much Neat Image used" type of comments - it is such a personal taste and choice. For me, I think this is just stunning and makes a photo into a portrait. If I were to nit-pik, then I would say that the cheeks just around the nose are a touch light compared to the other skin, and there is a somewhat distracting halo of pink above the upper lip. 8.', '2005-01-25 18:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
