(1132798, 136752, 16636, '<td valign="top">supperb image - hope this does well for you</td>', 'supperb image - hope this does well for you', '2005-01-26 07:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132850, 132114, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo but I think your gonna take a beating because of the fog.  I find it makes the overall photo a tad blurry even tho it may not be.  I love the reflection off the water and the photo almost has a B&amp;W type look.  Have you considered converting to B&amp;W to see what the photo would have looked like?  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'A beautiful photo but I think your gonna take a beating because of the fog.  I find it makes the overall photo a tad blurry even tho it may not be.  I love the reflection off the water and the photo almost has a B&W type look.  Have you considered converting to B&W to see what the photo would have looked like?  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-26 08:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132853, 136660, 14671, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo but his back looks more blurry then his neck.  It looks uneven.  I think this would have made an excelent entry for the faceless challenge.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'An interesting photo but his back looks more blurry then his neck.  It looks uneven.  I think this would have made an excelent entry for the faceless challenge.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-26 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132872, 132117, 14671, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Great colors and clarity and the feathers are extremely clear.  Nice capture and very well done.  Keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Great colors and clarity and the feathers are extremely clear.  Nice capture and very well done.  Keep up the good work in 2005. <8>', '2005-01-26 08:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1132883, 136677, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow way to white.  I find it overpowering and very hard to look at because of the contrast.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Wow way to white.  I find it overpowering and very hard to look at because of the contrast.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-26 08:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133024, 136425, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b/w landscape...  The layering in the foreground is beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful b/w landscape...  The layering in the foreground is beautiful.', '2005-01-26 10:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133029, 136688, 772, '<td valign="top">The siimplicity of this photo is excellent.  I gave this a 10, but I think it would benefit from a slight contrast push also... great work :)</td>', 'The siimplicity of this photo is excellent.  I gave this a 10, but I think it would benefit from a slight contrast push also... great work :)', '2005-01-26 10:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133030, 134322, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, wow!  this is simply wonderful.  you have captured the spirit of life.  thank you for sharing.  i really, really hope this is getting the attention it deserves, and hopefully without any comments about what to do differently.  this image is exactly what you wanted it to be, and i''m loving it!  this site needs more images like this!  [ok, i''m starting to ramble...just can''t help it--this tends to happen when i hit a breath of fresh air like this!]  good luck with this and all the challenges yet to come!<br/> <br/>[added this to my faves!]</td>', 'oh, wow!  this is simply wonderful.  you have captured the spirit of life.  thank you for sharing.  i really, really hope this is getting the attention it deserves, and hopefully without any comments about what to do differently.  this image is exactly what you wanted it to be, and i''m loving it!  this site needs more images like this!  [ok, i''m starting to ramble...just can''t help it--this tends to happen when i hit a breath of fresh air like this!]  good luck with this and all the challenges yet to come! [added this to my faves!]', '2005-01-26 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133033, 133748, 7560, '<td valign="top">Having spent a good deal of time trying to catch lightning, I have oodles of appreciation for people who do this successfully. You need a slight CCW rotation to level out the ground. The colors are amazing, and I like the way you cropped. Very, very cool image. Hats off to you. 9</td>', 'Having spent a good deal of time trying to catch lightning, I have oodles of appreciation for people who do this successfully. You need a slight CCW rotation to level out the ground. The colors are amazing, and I like the way you cropped. Very, very cool image. Hats off to you. 9', '2005-01-26 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133036, 132190, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait without faces. The slight lift of the woman''s heel tells the story of the image. Great choice in tones for the image.</td>', 'This is a great portrait without faces. The slight lift of the woman''s heel tells the story of the image. Great choice in tones for the image.', '2005-01-26 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133037, 132264, 7560, '<td valign="top">I confess, I''m a color junkie. I love the colors in this shot. The interesting shape of the houses compliments the curving lines along the shoreline. This would be a great place to shoot at sunet. Beautifully done. 9</td>', 'I confess, I''m a color junkie. I love the colors in this shot. The interesting shape of the houses compliments the curving lines along the shoreline. This would be a great place to shoot at sunet. Beautifully done. 9', '2005-01-26 10:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133040, 132109, 7560, '<td valign="top">This was flat out one of my favorite pictures this year, I love the simple composition and the exquis...the darned spiffy lighting. :) I''ve been trying to replicate this shot for months with no luck. You''ve really inspired me.</td>', 'This was flat out one of my favorite pictures this year, I love the simple composition and the exquis...the darned spiffy lighting. :) I''ve been trying to replicate this shot for months with no luck. You''ve really inspired me.', '2005-01-26 10:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133042, 136847, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is making me think Kenny Chesney. Beautiful sand and amazing water. The exposure is very good cinsidering the difficulty of exposing all that white correctly. I love the feeling of motion created by the waves. I think the best choice you made here was in being off center. It really emphasizes the different textures and colors. 10</td>', 'This is making me think Kenny Chesney. Beautiful sand and amazing water. The exposure is very good cinsidering the difficulty of exposing all that white correctly. I love the feeling of motion created by the waves. I think the best choice you made here was in being off center. It really emphasizes the different textures and colors. 10', '2005-01-26 10:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133046, 133401, 7560, '<td valign="top">This strongly reminds me of a Japaneese painting. Amazing colors, and a nice tree balancing things out. II''d consider doing a bit of a patch job in the lower left corner and possibly clone out the  stick nexto/under the tree. I think those changes would make the image that much stronger. 9</td>', 'This strongly reminds me of a Japaneese painting. Amazing colors, and a nice tree balancing things out. II''d consider doing a bit of a patch job in the lower left corner and possibly clone out the  stick nexto/under the tree. I think those changes would make the image that much stronger. 9', '2005-01-26 10:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133048, 132185, 7560, '<td valign="top">Awesome abstract image. Excellent choice of border as well. The white is coming out a tad grey on my screen. Might be worth tweaking your white point a bit more to really emphasize the overall contrasts. <br/> <br/>I wanna know how you got the zebras to all stand the right way. 10</td>', 'Awesome abstract image. Excellent choice of border as well. The white is coming out a tad grey on my screen. Might be worth tweaking your white point a bit more to really emphasize the overall contrasts.  I wanna know how you got the zebras to all stand the right way. 10', '2005-01-26 10:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133050, 134945, 7560, '<td valign="top">Clever and well lit. Pindrops. :) DOF is a bit off on the last drop,  One of the very best ideas I saw this challenge. 10</td>', 'Clever and well lit. Pindrops. :) DOF is a bit off on the last drop,  One of the very best ideas I saw this challenge. 10', '2005-01-26 10:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133061, 132693, 7560, '<td valign="top">I never noticed the colors on a ladybug before this. You think that they are just black and red. The gold color comes as a surprise. I love the visual contrast between the hard shell of the bug and the soft petals of the flower. One of the many shots in this challenge that I just sit back and look at for a good bit. 10</td>', 'I never noticed the colors on a ladybug before this. You think that they are just black and red. The gold color comes as a surprise. I love the visual contrast between the hard shell of the bug and the soft petals of the flower. One of the many shots in this challenge that I just sit back and look at for a good bit. 10', '2005-01-26 10:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133062, 133688, 7560, '<td valign="top">One of the ultimate you had to be there shots. :) Not only is this a funny image, it''s compositionally strong as well. You have an interesting sense of scale with the edge of the cliff and the wide expanse of ocean behind the subject.  The image seems a bit sofrt, like the autofocus wasn''t able to totally lock in. A bit of sharpening around just the second bird might help it pop out a bit more. 8</td>', 'One of the ultimate you had to be there shots. :) Not only is this a funny image, it''s compositionally strong as well. You have an interesting sense of scale with the edge of the cliff and the wide expanse of ocean behind the subject.  The image seems a bit sofrt, like the autofocus wasn''t able to totally lock in. A bit of sharpening around just the second bird might help it pop out a bit more. 8', '2005-01-26 10:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133065, 134214, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like this image the more I look at it. Her studied indifference, and his obvious interest make for a very entertaining story. I like images that tell me a story. And yours does that in first glance. I might move the ashtray, just because it''s not really adding much to the image for me. 9</td>', 'I like this image the more I look at it. Her studied indifference, and his obvious interest make for a very entertaining story. I like images that tell me a story. And yours does that in first glance. I might move the ashtray, just because it''s not really adding much to the image for me. 9', '2005-01-26 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133069, 133791, 7560, '<td valign="top">Amazing angle here. I love the totally still water, the way it just creates a totally neutral backdrop for the main subject of the shot. The overall shot is a little dark, and might benifit from being reshot on a slightly brighter day. (Not sunny, just a little brighter). The blanket on the rail  helps add a human element to the composition. 8</td>', 'Amazing angle here. I love the totally still water, the way it just creates a totally neutral backdrop for the main subject of the shot. The overall shot is a little dark, and might benifit from being reshot on a slightly brighter day. (Not sunny, just a little brighter). The blanket on the rail  helps add a human element to the composition. 8', '2005-01-26 10:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133071, 136757, 11895, '<td valign="top">I am old enought to remember when these beautiful machines ruled the F1 circuit, color film had already been invented and was in common usage for a shot like this one</td>', 'I am old enought to remember when these beautiful machines ruled the F1 circuit, color film had already been invented and was in common usage for a shot like this one', '2005-01-26 10:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133074, 132996, 7560, '<td valign="top">The first challenge with this shot is the focus. It looks like you were too close for your AF to lock properly. Step back about 2 paces and try again. That particular DOF choice isn''t doing much for this shot. The biggest thing here is controling light. THe light used is way too hard. You can see the reflected light on the bagel. You can use some simple things around the house (Nylons, papertowels, paper) to help diffuse the light and get you a better quality of light.  You also might want to think of background. Putting this on a sheet of white paper would help emphasize the subject, and prevent you from being distracted by things like the plate.</td>', 'The first challenge with this shot is the focus. It looks like you were too close for your AF to lock properly. Step back about 2 paces and try again. That particular DOF choice isn''t doing much for this shot. The biggest thing here is controling light. THe light used is way too hard. You can see the reflected light on the bagel. You can use some simple things around the house (Nylons, papertowels, paper) to help diffuse the light and get you a better quality of light.  You also might want to think of background. Putting this on a sheet of white paper would help emphasize the subject, and prevent you from being distracted by things like the plate.', '2005-01-26 10:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133079, 136427, 7560, '<td valign="top">The big thing here is light. It''s direct sunlight which is washing any and all color out of the image. That creates that "flat" look to the shot. Composition is actually pretty good though. I  think with less sunlight on the spider you could have ended up with some pretty cool shadows from the legs.</td>', 'The big thing here is light. It''s direct sunlight which is washing any and all color out of the image. That creates that "flat" look to the shot. Composition is actually pretty good though. I  think with less sunlight on the spider you could have ended up with some pretty cool shadows from the legs.', '2005-01-26 10:49:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1133082, 134860, 7560, '<td valign="top">For me personally, this is just too high key. You  need a tad more shadow on the nose area to give it some more shape. The nostrils end up just dominating the center of the image. I''m pretty sure that wasn''t the goal. :) Interesting idea, trying to replicate a Marylyn Monoroe shot. Might be fun to try again, but paint in some red on the lips?</td>', 'For me personally, this is just too high key. You  need a tad more shadow on the nose area to give it some more shape. The nostrils end up just dominating the center of the image. I''m pretty sure that wasn''t the goal. :) Interesting idea, trying to replicate a Marylyn Monoroe shot. Might be fun to try again, but paint in some red on the lips?', '2005-01-26 10:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133085, 132857, 7560, '<td valign="top">There was something about this pile of rusted bits that attracted you to it. I''m having a hard time seeing what you saw. Part of the problem for me is the additional visual clutter. There''s too much going on here, and nothing of strong enough interest to pull me in. Clening the area up a bit before shooting would have made the parts more of the focus.</td>', 'There was something about this pile of rusted bits that attracted you to it. I''m having a hard time seeing what you saw. Part of the problem for me is the additional visual clutter. There''s too much going on here, and nothing of strong enough interest to pull me in. Clening the area up a bit before shooting would have made the parts more of the focus.', '2005-01-26 10:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133089, 136045, 7560, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, the beauty of first snow. Or third or fourth. ;) This really doesn''t tell me anything remarkible about the snow this day. What was it that drew you out to shoot it? First snow? A big fat flake that spaltted against the window? Youve successfully documented the snow. Now take me the next step- snow me, I mean show me something special about the snow. That''s part of what differentiates a snapshot from a "artistic" shot.</td>', 'Ah yes, the beauty of first snow. Or third or fourth. ;) This really doesn''t tell me anything remarkible about the snow this day. What was it that drew you out to shoot it? First snow? A big fat flake that spaltted against the window? Youve successfully documented the snow. Now take me the next step- snow me, I mean show me something special about the snow. That''s part of what differentiates a snapshot from a "artistic" shot.', '2005-01-26 10:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133093, 132694, 7560, '<td valign="top">Aww! Cute face. Overall, the image is pretty dark and has a bit of a green color cast to it. I''ll usually try to get the skintones in a shot to balance out with how my subject actually looks. The other place to look for color balancing is a birght primary color. In this case the yellow bucket. See the green tint? An adorable moment though.</td>', 'Aww! Cute face. Overall, the image is pretty dark and has a bit of a green color cast to it. I''ll usually try to get the skintones in a shot to balance out with how my subject actually looks. The other place to look for color balancing is a birght primary color. In this case the yellow bucket. See the green tint? An adorable moment though.', '2005-01-26 11:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133095, 135164, 7560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes yes. Not sure if you did this or not, but the whole image feels way post processed. The skin looks like it was hit with Neat Image, and then the hair sharpened seperatley. If it wasn''t in post processing, then the image is somehow giving off a very artifical feel.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes yes. Not sure if you did this or not, but the whole image feels way post processed. The skin looks like it was hit with Neat Image, and then the hair sharpened seperatley. If it wasn''t in post processing, then the image is somehow giving off a very artifical feel.', '2005-01-26 11:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133119, 133060, 19010, '<td valign="top">Aw bummer I thought I had a good shot. But it''s shots like this one that bring me to realize I havn''t yet managed it. This shot is an inperational shot that shows how flawless and lovely a shot can be with just the addition of somthing as siple as a net. Without the net this might have been a 5 or six. But just adding a simple net you managed to win one of my tightly hel 10. Great shot keep up the wonderfull work.</td>', 'Aw bummer I thought I had a good shot. But it''s shots like this one that bring me to realize I havn''t yet managed it. This shot is an inperational shot that shows how flawless and lovely a shot can be with just the addition of somthing as siple as a net. Without the net this might have been a 5 or six. But just adding a simple net you managed to win one of my tightly hel 10. Great shot keep up the wonderfull work.', '2005-01-26 11:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133130, 134860, 19010, '<td valign="top">while I can appresiate a good High key shot. I feel that this one is slightly out of focus and a bit too washed out. This was a wonderfull concept but I think that you lost too much in going hight key.</td>', 'while I can appresiate a good High key shot. I feel that this one is slightly out of focus and a bit too washed out. This was a wonderfull concept but I think that you lost too much in going hight key.', '2005-01-26 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133147, 135034, 19010, '<td valign="top">while technicaly a great image I found a few aspect I didn''t care for in the shot. The largets being the selective desatration. While I am a huge fan of the style, I feel that choosing the pacifier as the object of intrest was not the best choice. Such a soft baby in a heartining seen with its mother. Then theres this huge pink pacifier leaping out at you. I think that the blanket or perhaps the baby would have been better choices for leaving color. Othe rhtan that the lighting is good the focus is great. The scene works well and dosn''t feel like a snapshot.  Other than the pacifier I would have to say this is a great shot....</td>', 'while technicaly a great image I found a few aspect I didn''t care for in the shot. The largets being the selective desatration. While I am a huge fan of the style, I feel that choosing the pacifier as the object of intrest was not the best choice. Such a soft baby in a heartining seen with its mother. Then theres this huge pink pacifier leaping out at you. I think that the blanket or perhaps the baby would have been better choices for leaving color. Othe rhtan that the lighting is good the focus is great. The scene works well and dosn''t feel like a snapshot.  Other than the pacifier I would have to say this is a great shot....', '2005-01-26 11:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133150, 134935, 208, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like the posterizing effect in the background, but I understand why you did it. It''s well done, subtle. 8</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like the posterizing effect in the background, but I understand why you did it. It''s well done, subtle. 8', '2005-01-26 11:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133154, 133145, 19010, '<td valign="top">For me the sky being blown out mixed with the high light on the forehead  just realy hurt a wonderfull shot.  The two together cause the model to have no definable forhead. I think a filter or softer lighting would have brought this up to an image I could easily have givin around an 8. As is with the hash highlites a cant go above saying this is a pretty average shot...</td>', 'For me the sky being blown out mixed with the high light on the forehead  just realy hurt a wonderfull shot.  The two together cause the model to have no definable forhead. I think a filter or softer lighting would have brought this up to an image I could easily have givin around an 8. As is with the hash highlites a cant go above saying this is a pretty average shot...', '2005-01-26 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133214, 132895, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is this a case of poor-voter-monitor-calibration?  To me it is very dark. Perhaps a building and some bushes in the forground - maybe hills in the back - the bank of clouds might be interesting if I could see them.  This shot needs some post processing editing to bring up the contrast and maybe improve the colors whichare an uniteresting brown - maybe bring up some of the purples that hardly show?</td>', 'Is this a case of poor-voter-monitor-calibration?  To me it is very dark. Perhaps a building and some bushes in the forground - maybe hills in the back - the bank of clouds might be interesting if I could see them.  This shot needs some post processing editing to bring up the contrast and maybe improve the colors whichare an uniteresting brown - maybe bring up some of the purples that hardly show?', '2005-01-26 11:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133220, 132400, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oh my - oh my - this is soo cool - and cold - and nice - and everything.  I can feel the wind!</td>', 'Oh my - oh my - this is soo cool - and cold - and nice - and everything.  I can feel the wind!', '2005-01-26 12:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133228, 134829, 16636, '<td valign="top">great sports action shot, great faces on the kids - nicely done</td>', 'great sports action shot, great faces on the kids - nicely done', '2005-01-26 12:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133253, 132536, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and nicely timed shot, with trees that were not dead center. ((8))</td>', 'Well seen and nicely timed shot, with trees that were not dead center. ((8))', '2005-01-26 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133254, 136395, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and composed.<br/>Those eyes!! Had this been just a little clearer, it would have been in the top ten in my opinion. ((8))</td>', 'Well seen and composed.Those eyes!! Had this been just a little clearer, it would have been in the top ten in my opinion. ((8))', '2005-01-26 12:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
