(1133261, 132225, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely timed and composed photograph, with good detail. Horizon slightly off level, but didn''t take anything away because of it. ((8))</td>', 'Nicely timed and composed photograph, with good detail. Horizon slightly off level, but didn''t take anything away because of it. ((8))', '2005-01-26 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
