(1133370, 136833, 30818, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been really good without the reflection.  A polarizing filter would cut out the glare.</td>', 'This would''ve been really good without the reflection.  A polarizing filter would cut out the glare.', '2005-01-26 13:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133377, 135208, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual shot - and very striking. Love the candid actions of the kids and I think the lack of colour everywhere else works well without selective desturation. Composition is strong too.<br/> <br/>On a personal note - the only kid wearing the right gear is the one at the front! Looks like a little snowboarder - whereas the others look like skiers! <br/>; )</td>', 'Unusual shot - and very striking. Love the candid actions of the kids and I think the lack of colour everywhere else works well without selective desturation. Composition is strong too. On a personal note - the only kid wearing the right gear is the one at the front! Looks like a little snowboarder - whereas the others look like skiers! ; )', '2005-01-26 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133389, 133058, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene indeed. Makes me want to be there, so it''s a sign of a good photo!<br/>Just a touch over exposed in places as well as slightly over sharpened.</td>', 'Beautiful scene indeed. Makes me want to be there, so it''s a sign of a good photo!Just a touch over exposed in places as well as slightly over sharpened.', '2005-01-26 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133392, 133688, 8860, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant! Top marks for a perfectly timed capture. The second bird coming in for the ''kill'' really nails this one. <br/> <br/>Picking nits - the vertical posts in the background could have been cloned out to avoid distraction.</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant! Top marks for a perfectly timed capture. The second bird coming in for the ''kill'' really nails this one.  Picking nits - the vertical posts in the background could have been cloned out to avoid distraction.', '2005-01-26 13:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133400, 132774, 4793, '<td valign="top">Sharp details, colors and composition wonderful, love this shot.</td>', 'Sharp details, colors and composition wonderful, love this shot.', '2005-01-26 13:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133403, 136856, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view</td>', 'Beautiful view', '2005-01-26 13:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133405, 135711, 4793, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, love this in B&amp;W</td>', 'Wonderful shot, love this in B&W', '2005-01-26 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133416, 136746, 4793, '<td valign="top">Sadly parts of the Rockies have very little snow now like your shot, and it is 52 days before spring. Very nice capture, you show the vastness here.</td>', 'Sadly parts of the Rockies have very little snow now like your shot, and it is 52 days before spring. Very nice capture, you show the vastness here.', '2005-01-26 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133418, 132859, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.', '2005-01-26 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133481, 134979, 10438, '<td valign="top">Great perspective</td>', 'Great perspective', '2005-01-26 14:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133494, 136424, 25742, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for the validation on this. I still don''t see how this could be real, mainly because of the lack of reaction on ppl on the beach, but no matter how this is created I like it and you deserve a 8</td>', 'I was waiting for the validation on this. I still don''t see how this could be real, mainly because of the lack of reaction on ppl on the beach, but no matter how this is created I like it and you deserve a 8', '2005-01-26 14:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133526, 133890, 7560, '<td valign="top">Little bit dark and flat, but I imagine that''s due to time of year this was shot. I love the sweeping coastline leading you to the lighthouse and small village. Nice sense of scale with the person. This is a great spot to keep coming back to over the year. I bet you can get some amazing weather related shots. 8</td>', 'Little bit dark and flat, but I imagine that''s due to time of year this was shot. I love the sweeping coastline leading you to the lighthouse and small village. Nice sense of scale with the person. This is a great spot to keep coming back to over the year. I bet you can get some amazing weather related shots. 8', '2005-01-26 14:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133527, 136307, 7560, '<td valign="top">Love the soft focus and intensity here. I basically just sat here for about 10 minutes just lookin''. :) 10</td>', 'Love the soft focus and intensity here. I basically just sat here for about 10 minutes just lookin''. :) 10', '2005-01-26 14:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133532, 132782, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is the ultimate childhood portrait. The look of joy on her face is simply amazing. You can clearly see that not only is the child having a blast, but she really loves the person that she is with. That''s a rare and precious gift. This is one you should really have on your wall. Her parents should also have one on the wall. :) Simply spectacular shot, and I think truly one of your best. 10</td>', 'This is the ultimate childhood portrait. The look of joy on her face is simply amazing. You can clearly see that not only is the child having a blast, but she really loves the person that she is with. That''s a rare and precious gift. This is one you should really have on your wall. Her parents should also have one on the wall. :) Simply spectacular shot, and I think truly one of your best. 10', '2005-01-26 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133540, 136049, 7560, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the pattern created by the canyon. This is a place for you to go back and continue to shoot in a variety of lighting conditions. Usually I see the canyon from closer. I truly enjoy seeing it pulled back a bit. Not totally sure on the cropping, but without the original shot I can''t make a determination. 8</td>', 'Wow, I love the pattern created by the canyon. This is a place for you to go back and continue to shoot in a variety of lighting conditions. Usually I see the canyon from closer. I truly enjoy seeing it pulled back a bit. Not totally sure on the cropping, but without the original shot I can''t make a determination. 8', '2005-01-26 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133541, 132089, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen image. Totally eerie. The lit window lower center makes the picture. Thumbs up!</td>', 'Beautifully seen image. Totally eerie. The lit window lower center makes the picture. Thumbs up!', '2005-01-26 14:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133543, 136414, 30861, '<td valign="top">While I realize the horizon is level, this has a sense of being tilted clockwise just a little bit. This frequently happens with this sort of shot, and it''s disconterting. It has also been oversharpened, to my eye, or if this is how it came from the camera it could use a tad of softening. A very nice image regardless.</td>', 'While I realize the horizon is level, this has a sense of being tilted clockwise just a little bit. This frequently happens with this sort of shot, and it''s disconterting. It has also been oversharpened, to my eye, or if this is how it came from the camera it could use a tad of softening. A very nice image regardless.', '2005-01-26 14:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133546, 135405, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very eeire, painterly rendering. There''s an overall greenish hue that I find slightly off, and it''s losing a hair too much detail to the left for my tastes. Just a whisper of dodging on the left, and a selection at the forward treeline to drop some green out of the BG would do wonders for me I think. Not much, just a little...</td>', 'Very eeire, painterly rendering. There''s an overall greenish hue that I find slightly off, and it''s losing a hair too much detail to the left for my tastes. Just a whisper of dodging on the left, and a selection at the forward treeline to drop some green out of the BG would do wonders for me I think. Not much, just a little...', '2005-01-26 15:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133551, 136673, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extremely sweet and effective. I suspect it won''t do as well as I think it ought to, but I''d be proud of it if it were mine. the focus plane is spot-on, the cropping of the man''s face is wonderful. The vertical component of the oof background, being slightly skewed, is a little off-putting to me. I''d have tried a hair more blur there, perhaps...</td>', 'This is extremely sweet and effective. I suspect it won''t do as well as I think it ought to, but I''d be proud of it if it were mine. the focus plane is spot-on, the cropping of the man''s face is wonderful. The vertical component of the oof background, being slightly skewed, is a little off-putting to me. I''d have tried a hair more blur there, perhaps...', '2005-01-26 15:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133552, 135805, 30861, '<td valign="top">I recognize this gal :-) The pcture''s perfect of her, something is not quite spot on about the oof tree background though.</td>', 'I recognize this gal :-) The pcture''s perfect of her, something is not quite spot on about the oof tree background though.', '2005-01-26 15:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133556, 136426, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice sensitivity to light, a pleasing and well-composed landscape. I wish the frightmost curve of the river were not so perfectly tangent to the right edge of the frame; I''s like to see a whisper of yellow grasses there.</td>', 'Nice sensitivity to light, a pleasing and well-composed landscape. I wish the frightmost curve of the river were not so perfectly tangent to the right edge of the frame; I''s like to see a whisper of yellow grasses there.', '2005-01-26 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133557, 135633, 7560, '<td valign="top">I confess, I''m a sucker for sunsets. This one generates a nice feeling of serenity. Nice color balance, pretty clouds. I might crop the bottom a smidge more, because I think you have slightly too much of the 1/3, 1/3, 1/3 balance going. Basically the horizion is dead smack in the middle. Very nice scene though.</td>', 'I confess, I''m a sucker for sunsets. This one generates a nice feeling of serenity. Nice color balance, pretty clouds. I might crop the bottom a smidge more, because I think you have slightly too much of the 1/3, 1/3, 1/3 balance going. Basically the horizion is dead smack in the middle. Very nice scene though.', '2005-01-26 15:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133559, 136204, 30861, '<td valign="top">Serene and evocative, suffering a bit for lack od separation of trees in middle distance from clouds behind them, making the image lose a significant amount of "depth".</td>', 'Serene and evocative, suffering a bit for lack od separation of trees in middle distance from clouds behind them, making the image lose a significant amount of "depth".', '2005-01-26 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133561, 132858, 30861, '<td valign="top">Fine action/animal capture. Did you try upping the yellow component on the grass a hair? It seems a little flat to me, color-wise.</td>', 'Fine action/animal capture. Did you try upping the yellow component on the grass a hair? It seems a little flat to me, color-wise.', '2005-01-26 15:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133563, 136433, 30861, '<td valign="top">The title is a lovely pun, the image is delightfully down-key. I don''t suppose it will finish above the middle of the pack, but I am very fond of it.</td>', 'The title is a lovely pun, the image is delightfully down-key. I don''t suppose it will finish above the middle of the pack, but I am very fond of it.', '2005-01-26 15:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133568, 132400, 7560, '<td valign="top">Cold, cold, cold. I''m gonna need hot chocolate here shortly.  The appeal in this shot is the novelty of the ice. I really like the way it looks like frozen waves. (Which is really what it was) My question is, was the ice slightly grey to begin with or was it more on the white side? I''d also suggest cloning out the walkway to the tower to make the image stronger. 8</td>', 'Cold, cold, cold. I''m gonna need hot chocolate here shortly.  The appeal in this shot is the novelty of the ice. I really like the way it looks like frozen waves. (Which is really what it was) My question is, was the ice slightly grey to begin with or was it more on the white side? I''d also suggest cloning out the walkway to the tower to make the image stronger. 8', '2005-01-26 15:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133569, 133767, 30861, '<td valign="top">Strange, strange picture. I quite like it.</td>', 'Strange, strange picture. I quite like it.', '2005-01-26 15:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133571, 132117, 30861, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp, well-composed, really no nits but just short of the line that takes it into toal WOW country.</td>', 'Clean and crisp, well-composed, really no nits but just short of the line that takes it into toal WOW country.', '2005-01-26 15:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133574, 135613, 7560, '<td valign="top">This looks like it has a slight tilt to me. Other than that- I love the idea. Very creative. The brick is an excellent canvas for the second shot. Might warrent a bit more sharpening. One of my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'This looks like it has a slight tilt to me. Other than that- I love the idea. Very creative. The brick is an excellent canvas for the second shot. Might warrent a bit more sharpening. One of my favorites this challenge.', '2005-01-26 15:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133578, 134296, 30861, '<td valign="top">Remarkably well-balanced in every respect, not least of which is the true horizontal of the wand. The guiy''s expression makes the picture. One wonders what he''s looking at, up therte somewhere, and the sense of anticipation is palpable. Flawless rendition of the flames. The protruding thumb is an essential element of the composition. I admire this very much.</td>', 'Remarkably well-balanced in every respect, not least of which is the true horizontal of the wand. The guiy''s expression makes the picture. One wonders what he''s looking at, up therte somewhere, and the sense of anticipation is palpable. Flawless rendition of the flames. The protruding thumb is an essential element of the composition. I admire this very much.', '2005-01-26 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133579, 134492, 7560, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I love the composition and the coloring choice. Excellent bokeh. ANd last but not least, very nicely lit. The catchlight on the hair makes the shot for me. 10</td>', 'Awesome. I love the composition and the coloring choice. Excellent bokeh. ANd last but not least, very nicely lit. The catchlight on the hair makes the shot for me. 10', '2005-01-26 15:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133580, 135918, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...perhaps a tighter crop or having the bee uncentered (rule of thirds) would add to it.</td>', 'Nice capture...perhaps a tighter crop or having the bee uncentered (rule of thirds) would add to it.', '2005-01-26 15:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133581, 135135, 28141, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective...I like it.</td>', 'Interesting perspective...I like it.', '2005-01-26 15:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133584, 132362, 28141, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, depth of field and composition.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Very nice color, depth of field and composition.  Excellent shot.', '2005-01-26 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133585, 136300, 7560, '<td valign="top">I see you! Interesting self portrait in a way. The delicate strands of the web contrast nicely with the fat drops of water. Like a spider, it pulls you into the shot. 9</td>', 'I see you! Interesting self portrait in a way. The delicate strands of the web contrast nicely with the fat drops of water. Like a spider, it pulls you into the shot. 9', '2005-01-26 15:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133586, 133728, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...I love the expression.</td>', 'Nice capture...I love the expression.', '2005-01-26 15:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133587, 136283, 30861, '<td valign="top">You have leveled the waterline, but the verticals are off. In a shot like this, unelss you are shooting at true right angle to the shoreline, it will NOT be horizontal, as the image recedes slightly. Squaring the verticals would have worked better IMO. But a lovely capture in all other regards. The separation of black building components against almost-black sky is perfect.</td>', 'You have leveled the waterline, but the verticals are off. In a shot like this, unelss you are shooting at true right angle to the shoreline, it will NOT be horizontal, as the image recedes slightly. Squaring the verticals would have worked better IMO. But a lovely capture in all other regards. The separation of black building components against almost-black sky is perfect.', '2005-01-26 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133589, 136424, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, HOW I wish attention had been paid in post-processing to a richer expression of tonal values in this image. The whole is about a half stop too light, and the foreground even more washed out, perhaps a full stop. Also, it''s leaning half a degree to the right, and that disturbs slightly. Wonderful capture!</td>', 'Oh, HOW I wish attention had been paid in post-processing to a richer expression of tonal values in this image. The whole is about a half stop too light, and the foreground even more washed out, perhaps a full stop. Also, it''s leaning half a degree to the right, and that disturbs slightly. Wonderful capture!', '2005-01-26 15:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133592, 135188, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s odd. The water''s wonderful, the right side and distant areas are terrific, but the left side foliage is flat and lackluster. It''s SO close...</td>', 'It''s odd. The water''s wonderful, the right side and distant areas are terrific, but the left side foliage is flat and lackluster. It''s SO close...', '2005-01-26 15:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133595, 136597, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture, losing imapct because the dark tones aren''t fully expressed. In other words, it ;lacks contrast in the middle range, and this makes the pure, detailed white of the glowing dome appear out of range, even though it''s actually not.</td>', 'Wonderful picture, losing imapct because the dark tones aren''t fully expressed. In other words, it ;lacks contrast in the middle range, and this makes the pure, detailed white of the glowing dome appear out of range, even though it''s actually not.', '2005-01-26 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133596, 133528, 7560, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is a shot that better be up on your wall. This is all about contrasting textures, and trust. the soft moving wings, against the tree branches, and the extended hand. The thumb ring adds an extra bit of texture to the hand, and makes it more real. Nice crop. 10</td>', 'Wow. This is a shot that better be up on your wall. This is all about contrasting textures, and trust. the soft moving wings, against the tree branches, and the extended hand. The thumb ring adds an extra bit of texture to the hand, and makes it more real. Nice crop. 10', '2005-01-26 15:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133598, 135633, 29789, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2005-01-26 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133601, 136685, 30861, '<td valign="top">Afternoon light, indeed. Striking image, made less striking by the murky treatment of the sky/landscape separation and an overalls ense of blocky softness. The massive black frame is not helping at all IMO, either.</td>', 'Afternoon light, indeed. Striking image, made less striking by the murky treatment of the sky/landscape separation and an overalls ense of blocky softness. The massive black frame is not helping at all IMO, either.', '2005-01-26 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133602, 136417, 7560, '<td valign="top">Stark spotlight, single chair. And every 30s film noir cop movie cliche in the book. Love the contrast between the dusty floor and the chair. Dark and moody. I keep expecting Jimmy Cagney to walk in. 9</td>', 'Stark spotlight, single chair. And every 30s film noir cop movie cliche in the book. Love the contrast between the dusty floor and the chair. Dark and moody. I keep expecting Jimmy Cagney to walk in. 9', '2005-01-26 15:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133605, 133785, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great photojournalism style shot. Makes me think of National Geographic particularly with the yellow and black border. A nice example of where a border can help. I  like the juxtaposition here. Nice use of strong diagonal line in the shot (girl to guitar). 9</td>', 'Great photojournalism style shot. Makes me think of National Geographic particularly with the yellow and black border. A nice example of where a border can help. I  like the juxtaposition here. Nice use of strong diagonal line in the shot (girl to guitar). 9', '2005-01-26 15:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133608, 133544, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the soft pastels here. The fog further softens the overall image. I wish the water was a bit stiller, so you had a better reflection, but this isn''t really bad at all. 8</td>', 'I love the soft pastels here. The fog further softens the overall image. I wish the water was a bit stiller, so you had a better reflection, but this isn''t really bad at all. 8', '2005-01-26 15:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133610, 132536, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing choice here. Nice colors as well. I might clone out the tree just below the moon, it''s slightly distracting from the overall shot.</td>', 'I really like the framing choice here. Nice colors as well. I might clone out the tree just below the moon, it''s slightly distracting from the overall shot.', '2005-01-26 15:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133612, 133566, 7560, '<td valign="top">This shot is all about motion. Excellent motion capture. You really nailed the concentration on both rider and horse, and show how much of this kind of sport is true teamwork. Focus seems a bit sharper on the horse than the girl. I would  guess that''s an autofocus issue. Might be worth playing around a bit in manual mode to see if you can get a sharper image? 9</td>', 'This shot is all about motion. Excellent motion capture. You really nailed the concentration on both rider and horse, and show how much of this kind of sport is true teamwork. Focus seems a bit sharper on the horse than the girl. I would  guess that''s an autofocus issue. Might be worth playing around a bit in manual mode to see if you can get a sharper image? 9', '2005-01-26 15:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133629, 135613, 25095, '<td valign="top">I actually saw a similar shot of this but at a different angle on a other website.  They had some sky over the brick wall which I think added to the image showing it was real, but I like the portrait feel to this.</td>', 'I actually saw a similar shot of this but at a different angle on a other website.  They had some sky over the brick wall which I think added to the image showing it was real, but I like the portrait feel to this.', '2005-01-26 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133630, 132848, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nature''s perfect gradient- fog. :)  I love the crop here. It really helps to emphasize the subject. 8</td>', 'Nature''s perfect gradient- fog. :)  I love the crop here. It really helps to emphasize the subject. 8', '2005-01-26 15:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133640, 134322, 7560, '<td valign="top">I loved this the first time I saw it, and that hasn''t changed. Pictures should tell a story, and this one tells a story of joy and the simple pleasure of dancing in the rain. What can be more fun than that? 9</td>', 'I loved this the first time I saw it, and that hasn''t changed. Pictures should tell a story, and this one tells a story of joy and the simple pleasure of dancing in the rain. What can be more fun than that? 9', '2005-01-26 15:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133646, 134205, 28141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light...it looks like a postcard.</td>', 'Beautiful light...it looks like a postcard.', '2005-01-26 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133648, 136847, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like the composition...all the lines work very well together.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like the composition...all the lines work very well together.', '2005-01-26 15:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133650, 134322, 28141, '<td valign="top">Would prefer it without the motion blur.</td>', 'Would prefer it without the motion blur.', '2005-01-26 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133653, 133058, 7560, '<td valign="top">beautiful stream scene. The light is a bit bright, and washes some of the colors out a tad. I can see that you were going for the overall sun streaming through trees effect. That came out well. The green trees end up being a bit washed out though. I''d love seeing this reshot at a different time of day if possible. Maybe later afternoon? 7</td>', 'beautiful stream scene. The light is a bit bright, and washes some of the colors out a tad. I can see that you were going for the overall sun streaming through trees effect. That came out well. The green trees end up being a bit washed out though. I''d love seeing this reshot at a different time of day if possible. Maybe later afternoon? 7', '2005-01-26 15:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133655, 132538, 28141, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the silhouettes and the colors.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the silhouettes and the colors.', '2005-01-26 15:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133659, 133716, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice little farm scene. Throws me back in time. Which reminds me, this could be fun to try out in a duotone. Nice colors, nice clouds. Not too sure that I like the corner of the building in the shot. The windmill could also possibly benifit from being a bit more distinct from the tree. Possibly worth moving around a bit more to get a less cluttered angle on the shot. You could try lying on the ground and shooting up at an angle? It''s always fun to change your POV on what you are shooting. 6</td>', 'Nice little farm scene. Throws me back in time. Which reminds me, this could be fun to try out in a duotone. Nice colors, nice clouds. Not too sure that I like the corner of the building in the shot. The windmill could also possibly benifit from being a bit more distinct from the tree. Possibly worth moving around a bit more to get a less cluttered angle on the shot. You could try lying on the ground and shooting up at an angle? It''s always fun to change your POV on what you are shooting. 6', '2005-01-26 15:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133665, 134079, 7560, '<td valign="top">A classic stock shot. The power of grain! These are some of my favorite "farm" agriculture types of shots. You render this one very nicely. You have one major (what the heck do they call a single barley plant? ) barley  as the main element, and have the rest of it faded out pretty well. I might have moved the lower barley to further isolate the to one. The biggest improvement that can be made here is more previsualization, and as a result more environment control. (ie. move the stalk of something (stalk! That;s the word I wanted) that moves at an odd angle, move the lower stalk etc.) Still a really cool shot. 8</td>', 'A classic stock shot. The power of grain! These are some of my favorite "farm" agriculture types of shots. You render this one very nicely. You have one major (what the heck do they call a single barley plant? ) barley  as the main element, and have the rest of it faded out pretty well. I might have moved the lower barley to further isolate the to one. The biggest improvement that can be made here is more previsualization, and as a result more environment control. (ie. move the stalk of something (stalk! That;s the word I wanted) that moves at an odd angle, move the lower stalk etc.) Still a really cool shot. 8', '2005-01-26 16:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133666, 132202, 7560, '<td valign="top">It''s Halloween, it''s Halloween, the moon is full and bright. One of the shots this challenge that''s just fun to sit back and look at. :)  I''d like less twig in the moon, which can be fixed either by cloning it out, or moving your feetskies a bit more when you were framing the shot. Makes me think of Bram Stoker, Frankenstein, and random Igors. 8</td>', 'It''s Halloween, it''s Halloween, the moon is full and bright. One of the shots this challenge that''s just fun to sit back and look at. :)  I''d like less twig in the moon, which can be fixed either by cloning it out, or moving your feetskies a bit more when you were framing the shot. Makes me think of Bram Stoker, Frankenstein, and random Igors. 8', '2005-01-26 16:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133673, 136224, 7560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clear water makes a great pallate for the sky. The rock adds just enough surface texture to keep the whole thing from being boring. I love the soft colors in the image. A couple of the glass bits below the surface distract me from the overall placidness of everything. Might be worth playing around with clone to eliminate em. 8</td>', 'Beautiful clear water makes a great pallate for the sky. The rock adds just enough surface texture to keep the whole thing from being boring. I love the soft colors in the image. A couple of the glass bits below the surface distract me from the overall placidness of everything. Might be worth playing around with clone to eliminate em. 8', '2005-01-26 16:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133674, 133889, 7560, '<td valign="top">This shot is all about texture and contrast. The smooth drop, ridged feather, and rough wood. It''s a pleasure to sit back and just look at it.</td>', 'This shot is all about texture and contrast. The smooth drop, ridged feather, and rough wood. It''s a pleasure to sit back and just look at it.', '2005-01-26 16:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133676, 132898, 7560, '<td valign="top">Moo cow! And in sepia to boot. Very nice tones here. I like fog pictures. THis one makes me think back to the days when we didn''t have cars and trucks and things that go. Nice use of leading lines between the fence and the road. 8</td>', 'Moo cow! And in sepia to boot. Very nice tones here. I like fog pictures. THis one makes me think back to the days when we didn''t have cars and trucks and things that go. Nice use of leading lines between the fence and the road. 8', '2005-01-26 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133679, 135783, 7560, '<td valign="top">The more I look, the more I like. Excellent time of day to shoot. It gives you that nice warm evening light. The little guy gives you a great sense of scale here. It reminds me of being young and seeing everything out before me. It also reminds me that I''m never too old to be a kid. Thank you for the reminder. 9</td>', 'The more I look, the more I like. Excellent time of day to shoot. It gives you that nice warm evening light. The little guy gives you a great sense of scale here. It reminds me of being young and seeing everything out before me. It also reminds me that I''m never too old to be a kid. Thank you for the reminder. 9', '2005-01-26 16:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133680, 132136, 28141, '<td valign="top">Those are some mighty interesting clouds...nice capture.   The colors are nice too.</td>', 'Those are some mighty interesting clouds...nice capture.   The colors are nice too.', '2005-01-26 16:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133681, 134345, 7560, '<td valign="top">Wow. Simply breathtaking image. I love the contrast and texture here. You can just see the ripples in the sand. The shadows are not so black that you lose detail, and the highlights are not blown out. Very dramatic sky. A classic black and white image, and I say that as a very high compliment. 10</td>', 'Wow. Simply breathtaking image. I love the contrast and texture here. You can just see the ripples in the sand. The shadows are not so black that you lose detail, and the highlights are not blown out. Very dramatic sky. A classic black and white image, and I say that as a very high compliment. 10', '2005-01-26 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133689, 132114, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love fog shots. It''s natures own soft focus. :) Soft, moody, very impressionistic actually. I love the symmtry created by the still water, and just a hint of bank in the background. 9</td>', 'I love fog shots. It''s natures own soft focus. :) Soft, moody, very impressionistic actually. I love the symmtry created by the still water, and just a hint of bank in the background. 9', '2005-01-26 16:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133703, 136551, 7560, '<td valign="top">One of the areas I''ve seen you improve most in over the last year is your ability to capture good non studio portraits. It''s something I really hadn''t seen much of from you prior to this year. The challenge is to capture the emotion of the moment, and do it in such a way that you communicate it to the viewer. This shot really does that. Because the cadet is peeking from behind the flag, it makes him appear younger, more vulnerable, and maybe a tad curious. It allows the viewer to read into the image what they want. Do they want to protest war? Feel pride in being American? Or just remember fleeting moments of youth? This shot allows all those things, and that makes it an exceptional portrait. Oh yeah, and color would totally hose it. So there. 10</td>', 'One of the areas I''ve seen you improve most in over the last year is your ability to capture good non studio portraits. It''s something I really hadn''t seen much of from you prior to this year. The challenge is to capture the emotion of the moment, and do it in such a way that you communicate it to the viewer. This shot really does that. Because the cadet is peeking from behind the flag, it makes him appear younger, more vulnerable, and maybe a tad curious. It allows the viewer to read into the image what they want. Do they want to protest war? Feel pride in being American? Or just remember fleeting moments of youth? This shot allows all those things, and that makes it an exceptional portrait. Oh yeah, and color would totally hose it. So there. 10', '2005-01-26 16:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133706, 134094, 7560, '<td valign="top">Right time, Right place, and losts of blown shots I bet. :) You''ve captured the power and grace of a bird of prey here. Nice sharp focus and detail all the way across. I might crop the left side a bit to eliminate teh building if possible. This is actually a great animal portrait, you can see the concentration in the bird''s face as he lands. 9</td>', 'Right time, Right place, and losts of blown shots I bet. :) You''ve captured the power and grace of a bird of prey here. Nice sharp focus and detail all the way across. I might crop the left side a bit to eliminate teh building if possible. This is actually a great animal portrait, you can see the concentration in the bird''s face as he lands. 9', '2005-01-26 16:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133712, 136630, 7560, '<td valign="top">The addition of a hand here really adds a nice sense of scale. I like the colors. Looks like the composition was carefully thought out here, and that bumps up the score. 9</td>', 'The addition of a hand here really adds a nice sense of scale. I like the colors. Looks like the composition was carefully thought out here, and that bumps up the score. 9', '2005-01-26 16:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133721, 136424, 30608, '<td valign="top">Wow!! That''s quite a capture. Good job. Looking forward in learning more about this photo.</td>', 'Wow!! That''s quite a capture. Good job. Looking forward in learning more about this photo.', '2005-01-26 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133746, 132255, 7560, '<td valign="top">Perfect symmetry all the way through here. This is all about balance. Balance in the tones, balance in the boat, teamwork at it''s finest. I like the slightly soft feel to the image. This is a great team portrait. 10</td>', 'Perfect symmetry all the way through here. This is all about balance. Balance in the tones, balance in the boat, teamwork at it''s finest. I like the slightly soft feel to the image. This is a great team portrait. 10', '2005-01-26 17:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133761, 134322, 7190, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good photo if it were in focus. If the girl were out of focus or blurred by motion it still would have been very exciting only if the columns were really sharp and in focus for the contrast of motion and un moveable.</td>', 'This would have been a good photo if it were in focus. If the girl were out of focus or blurred by motion it still would have been very exciting only if the columns were really sharp and in focus for the contrast of motion and un moveable.', '2005-01-26 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1133768, 135602, 7190, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo but here is the "but" one if left on the horizontal it doesn''t work but rotated counter clockwise and cropped along the dark area and the light colored blob removed, it would be a much stronger image. You have the color and the fluid movement of the petal carrying your through the image. You had me rotating my lapatop.</td>', 'i really like this photo but here is the "but" one if left on the horizontal it doesn''t work but rotated counter clockwise and cropped along the dark area and the light colored blob removed, it would be a much stronger image. You have the color and the fluid movement of the petal carrying your through the image. You had me rotating my lapatop.', '2005-01-26 17:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
