(1134041, 134269, 7560, '<td valign="top">very nice high key shot. My only problem is the reflection, it''s almost too much in the composition. It also looks like you lost some eyelash/lid detail when you converted to high key.</td>', 'very nice high key shot. My only problem is the reflection, it''s almost too much in the composition. It also looks like you lost some eyelash/lid detail when you converted to high key.', '2005-01-26 19:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134042, 136435, 24079, '<td valign="top">This needs to get a ribbon. I love the angle, the lighting, great composition and sharpness.</td>', 'This needs to get a ribbon. I love the angle, the lighting, great composition and sharpness.', '2005-01-26 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134043, 136822, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Minimal depth of field (yes, a pun - sorry) does well here. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Minimal depth of field (yes, a pun - sorry) does well here. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134046, 135345, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Excellent macro!  ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Excellent macro!  ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134047, 135618, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasts here, the tree, house, and ground balanced out by the green of the sky. The shot would be too overpowering if the sky was blue, so the touch of grey sky really helps to balance the image. 8</td>', 'I love the contrasts here, the tree, house, and ground balanced out by the green of the sky. The shot would be too overpowering if the sky was blue, so the touch of grey sky really helps to balance the image. 8', '2005-01-26 19:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134048, 136759, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Just enough wing blur to hint at the movement here. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Just enough wing blur to hint at the movement here. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134050, 134511, 7560, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome cityscape. Well exposed and well composed. I like the balance of colors here. Well seen. 9</td>', 'this is an awesome cityscape. Well exposed and well composed. I like the balance of colors here. Well seen. 9', '2005-01-26 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134054, 133977, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. A little more contrast may help this (if you want to go dabble a little later) ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. A little more contrast may help this (if you want to go dabble a little later) ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134057, 136685, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. A little big on the framing, but took nothing away because of it. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. A little big on the framing, but took nothing away because of it. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134058, 136414, 7560, '<td valign="top">great sky, great clouds, and nice use of a wide angle lens. I love the bit of reflection in the water. A serene, well balanced landscape. This one kept me looking for a good bit.</td>', 'great sky, great clouds, and nice use of a wide angle lens. I love the bit of reflection in the water. A serene, well balanced landscape. This one kept me looking for a good bit.', '2005-01-26 19:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134059, 136468, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot in this challenge. Quite the excercise in lighting, using only the laces to illuminate the surface of the boots ((8))</td>', 'Very unique shot in this challenge. Quite the excercise in lighting, using only the laces to illuminate the surface of the boots ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134062, 136426, 7560, '<td valign="top">nice use of the classic S curve to pull your viewer through the image. A tad more height might make the composition stronger. I''d also rather see this shot closer to sunset. The colors are good, but I think the light is a bit strong. 8</td>', 'nice use of the classic S curve to pull your viewer through the image. A tad more height might make the composition stronger. I''d also rather see this shot closer to sunset. The colors are good, but I think the light is a bit strong. 8', '2005-01-26 19:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134063, 136162, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Good timing on the shot with the lighthouse being lit that way. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Good timing on the shot with the lighthouse being lit that way. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134065, 136319, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated while maintaining the hazy look to the background.  ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated while maintaining the hazy look to the background.  ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134071, 136229, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good. As I scrolled to see the whole shot, I think a minor crop off the top would balance this a little better. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good. As I scrolled to see the whole shot, I think a minor crop off the top would balance this a little better. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134072, 132307, 7560, '<td valign="top">This isn''t one of the technically strongest images I''ve seen, but there''s something captivating about it. I find myself wanting to see what the eagle see''s off camera. I think moving a tad to the right might seperate the eagle more from some of the background clutter. That could help strengthen the whole composition. 8</td>', 'This isn''t one of the technically strongest images I''ve seen, but there''s something captivating about it. I find myself wanting to see what the eagle see''s off camera. I think moving a tad to the right might seperate the eagle more from some of the background clutter. That could help strengthen the whole composition. 8', '2005-01-26 19:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134073, 134242, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Nicely done macro of something we tromp all over and never look at.  ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Nicely done macro of something we tromp all over and never look at.  ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134075, 136417, 24079, '<td valign="top">Very very good. I Absolutely love the lighting and shadows. The sharpness and contrast are perfect.</td>', 'Very very good. I Absolutely love the lighting and shadows. The sharpness and contrast are perfect.', '2005-01-26 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134076, 136242, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Narrow depth of field works well here, with just enough motion blur in the wheels. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Narrow depth of field works well here, with just enough motion blur in the wheels. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134078, 135155, 7560, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I like the use of duotone here. It''s a sensual image without being overtly sexual. Good lighting as well. 8</td>', 'Very well done. I like the use of duotone here. It''s a sensual image without being overtly sexual. Good lighting as well. 8', '2005-01-26 19:20:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1134080, 133635, 24079, '<td valign="top">The sky is so beautiful and the sharp contrast adds a nice punch.</td>', 'The sky is so beautiful and the sharp contrast adds a nice punch.', '2005-01-26 19:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134083, 136506, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''m such a sucker for B&amp;W kid shots. This is sure to make a parent beam looking at it. Well done &amp; composed. ((8))</td>', 'I''m such a sucker for B&W kid shots. This is sure to make a parent beam looking at it. Well done & composed. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134085, 136000, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134086, 133862, 7560, '<td valign="top">My favorite kind of image is one that clearly tells me a story. This one captures that. YOu can see the interest between the couple. The low sun just serves to accent their interaction- it''s not dominating the shot. 8</td>', 'My favorite kind of image is one that clearly tells me a story. This one captures that. YOu can see the interest between the couple. The low sun just serves to accent their interaction- it''s not dominating the shot. 8', '2005-01-26 19:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134087, 132507, 24079, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2005-01-26 19:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134089, 133748, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. I am waiting for the day when I can try my hand at shooting lighting.  Minor uneven horizon, but took nothing away because of it. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. I am waiting for the day when I can try my hand at shooting lighting.  Minor uneven horizon, but took nothing away because of it. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134090, 132507, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unusual composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated, and has an interesting point of view. ((8))</td>', 'Unusual composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated, and has an interesting point of view. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134093, 134639, 24079, '<td valign="top">His eyes are captivating. I bet they''re the prettiest blue in real life.</td>', 'His eyes are captivating. I bet they''re the prettiest blue in real life.', '2005-01-26 19:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134094, 133704, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Good use of diagnonals with the ferns set that way. ((8))</td>', 'Great composition and subject matter. Lighting and detail are good, rich in color without being over-saturated. Good use of diagnonals with the ferns set that way. ((8))', '2005-01-26 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134099, 132763, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot for the scrapbook. :) One of the keys in photography is deciding if you want an artistic image, or a snapshot. For me, a snapshot is something that just documents an event. It doesn''t create a sense of connection between the image and the viewer. It tends to require the viewer coming from a specific frame of reference. This is a classic snapshot. Which isn''t a bad thing at all. :) The next time you take this kind of shot, think a little about what''s going on behind the action. Try and move youself to better optamize use of blank walls, or background that better demonstrate the story you are trying to tell. In this case, the doorway is distracting from the curiosity on the little boys face.</td>', 'This is a great shot for the scrapbook. :) One of the keys in photography is deciding if you want an artistic image, or a snapshot. For me, a snapshot is something that just documents an event. It doesn''t create a sense of connection between the image and the viewer. It tends to require the viewer coming from a specific frame of reference. This is a classic snapshot. Which isn''t a bad thing at all. :) The next time you take this kind of shot, think a little about what''s going on behind the action. Try and move youself to better optamize use of blank walls, or background that better demonstrate the story you are trying to tell. In this case, the doorway is distracting from the curiosity on the little boys face.', '2005-01-26 19:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134101, 136706, 7560, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Just...wow. This is awesome. The dark water exploding into white falls and foam. I never thought you could get this kind of shot at the falls. It''s mystical and etherial. I love it. 10</td>', 'Stunning. Just...wow. This is awesome. The dark water exploding into white falls and foam. I never thought you could get this kind of shot at the falls. It''s mystical and etherial. I love it. 10', '2005-01-26 19:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134109, 132774, 31456, '<td valign="top">excellent focus, colors, and detail</td>', 'excellent focus, colors, and detail', '2005-01-26 19:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134118, 132632, 7560, '<td valign="top">a great storytelling portrait here. You can feel the focus and intensity. I''d move the bottle by her elbow and the whatever it is you can see through her hair. Both items distract a bit. 7</td>', 'a great storytelling portrait here. You can feel the focus and intensity. I''d move the bottle by her elbow and the whatever it is you can see through her hair. Both items distract a bit. 7', '2005-01-26 19:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134120, 132082, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is one of those wow moments. Right time, right place, and a little bit of prep work. The color of the water really makes the colors of the beak stand out. Nicely cropped. I wish I had been there. :) 8</td>', 'This is one of those wow moments. Right time, right place, and a little bit of prep work. The color of the water really makes the colors of the beak stand out. Nicely cropped. I wish I had been there. :) 8', '2005-01-26 19:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134124, 133635, 7560, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, the forboding skys of the American West. :) There''s a lot of history in Yuma. I don''t think most people know about that. By accident or design you''ve captured the spirit of that place. Dark, forboding, and with a hint of a promise of freedom. Makes me miss Colorado even more. 9</td>', 'Ah yes, the forboding skys of the American West. :) There''s a lot of history in Yuma. I don''t think most people know about that. By accident or design you''ve captured the spirit of that place. Dark, forboding, and with a hint of a promise of freedom. Makes me miss Colorado even more. 9', '2005-01-26 19:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134128, 136551, 14012, '<td valign="top">Only thing I don''t like about this, is the drop shadow in the border. It is really not needed and takes away from the beautiful photo. Without the drop shadow, I would score this at least a point higher.</td>', 'Only thing I don''t like about this, is the drop shadow in the border. It is really not needed and takes away from the beautiful photo. Without the drop shadow, I would score this at least a point higher.', '2005-01-26 19:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134131, 135892, 2553, '<td valign="top">Easily one of my favorites this challenge, and reminds me so much of one of my "Favorites" that I have a print of, which is hanging in my home.  The colors are wonderful, and the composition draws my eyes right into the scene.  I love the kind of hazy feel of it, it gives a mysterious quality that really appeals to me.</td>', 'Easily one of my favorites this challenge, and reminds me so much of one of my "Favorites" that I have a print of, which is hanging in my home.  The colors are wonderful, and the composition draws my eyes right into the scene.  I love the kind of hazy feel of it, it gives a mysterious quality that really appeals to me.', '2005-01-26 19:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134133, 134669, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is just cool. I love the waves breaking behind the bird. YOu also have a great angle on the shot. Nice and low, it really makes you feel part of the action. I also like the hint of a reflection on the sand. 9</td>', 'This is just cool. I love the waves breaking behind the bird. YOu also have a great angle on the shot. Nice and low, it really makes you feel part of the action. I also like the hint of a reflection on the sand. 9', '2005-01-26 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134137, 135150, 14012, '<td valign="top">a little overexposed, as you are losing details in the petals on the left.</td>', 'a little overexposed, as you are losing details in the petals on the left.', '2005-01-26 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134140, 132225, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this shot!  Nothing "gets you" quite like blazing color and exhuberant children.  The more I see this, the more I like it.  Hope you have this framed and hanging in the house - this would be something that would make you smile everyday!</td>', 'Absolutely love this shot!  Nothing "gets you" quite like blazing color and exhuberant children.  The more I see this, the more I like it.  Hope you have this framed and hanging in the house - this would be something that would make you smile everyday!', '2005-01-26 19:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134141, 135615, 7560, '<td valign="top">Argh! The gamma is off on the monitor I''m using right now. Nice strong composition here with the curving lines. The bad thing is the monitor is too dark, so the stairs are melding together as we follow them down. The lines themselves aren''t quite smooth, which makes my eyes hop around the page a bit much. 8</td>', 'Argh! The gamma is off on the monitor I''m using right now. Nice strong composition here with the curving lines. The bad thing is the monitor is too dark, so the stairs are melding together as we follow them down. The lines themselves aren''t quite smooth, which makes my eyes hop around the page a bit much. 8', '2005-01-26 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134142, 133310, 14012, '<td valign="top">too bad the sky is so washed out. Also, maybe bump the shadows up just a tad in the Levels.</td>', 'too bad the sky is so washed out. Also, maybe bump the shadows up just a tad in the Levels.', '2005-01-26 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134145, 132124, 7560, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of things going on. Problem is, there are too many things. You have several buildings arguing for dominence due to scale, color, or architectural detail. Lots of people, but no real feel for what people are doing. Try moving around a bit and picking one thing to focus on. One element to communicate to the viewer.</td>', 'This shot has a lot of things going on. Problem is, there are too many things. You have several buildings arguing for dominence due to scale, color, or architectural detail. Lots of people, but no real feel for what people are doing. Try moving around a bit and picking one thing to focus on. One element to communicate to the viewer.', '2005-01-26 19:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
