(1134156, 133137, 14012, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are getting beat to hell on this one. :-(<br/> <br/>Nice angle and lighting.</td>', 'I''m sure you are getting beat to hell on this one. :-( Nice angle and lighting.', '2005-01-26 19:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134157, 136794, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for cats. I have two of them myself. They are really tough to shoot. In this case, it looks like you were too close. There''s no sharp focus point. So kitty is fuzzy, but not in a good way. Try taking a step back. Also consider cropping so more ear shows. Cat ears are very expressive. Plus they add a nice leading line to the shot.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for cats. I have two of them myself. They are really tough to shoot. In this case, it looks like you were too close. There''s no sharp focus point. So kitty is fuzzy, but not in a good way. Try taking a step back. Also consider cropping so more ear shows. Cat ears are very expressive. Plus they add a nice leading line to the shot.', '2005-01-26 19:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134158, 134909, 7560, '<td valign="top">Love the color here. It really makes me think of smog, and pollution. Then there''s just a hint of powerlines/tower coming out of the smog. As we sow, so shall we reap. Make you think. And just looks cool too. :) 9</td>', 'Love the color here. It really makes me think of smog, and pollution. Then there''s just a hint of powerlines/tower coming out of the smog. As we sow, so shall we reap. Make you think. And just looks cool too. :) 9', '2005-01-26 19:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
