(1134503, 132735, 28141, '<td valign="top">Is that the moon in the upper left?  Why the blue spot?  Maybe it''s a balloon rather than the moon.  In any case, I like this shot quite a bit, the water looks really good, but the mysterious round thing is distracting.  If it''s not the moon it''s just plain distracting, if it is the moon it''s distracting because there''s something wrong with it.  If it looked like a nice natural moon that belonged in the scene it would be ok.</td>', 'Is that the moon in the upper left?  Why the blue spot?  Maybe it''s a balloon rather than the moon.  In any case, I like this shot quite a bit, the water looks really good, but the mysterious round thing is distracting.  If it''s not the moon it''s just plain distracting, if it is the moon it''s distracting because there''s something wrong with it.  If it looked like a nice natural moon that belonged in the scene it would be ok.', '2005-01-26 23:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134504, 135892, 26756, '<td valign="top">This is framed really well and has some beautiful color and mist.  Love the softness of the background and the fence just in view.  Seems like it could be a bit sharper but it''s a good photo anyway.  Looks like a calander shot.</td>', 'This is framed really well and has some beautiful color and mist.  Love the softness of the background and the fence just in view.  Seems like it could be a bit sharper but it''s a good photo anyway.  Looks like a calander shot.', '2005-01-26 23:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134506, 134735, 28141, '<td valign="top">Too small...sorry</td>', 'Too small...sorry', '2005-01-26 23:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134510, 135047, 28141, '<td valign="top">The border is distracting and the squirrel seems a little out of focus.  I like the colors in the background though.</td>', 'The border is distracting and the squirrel seems a little out of focus.  I like the colors in the background though.', '2005-01-26 23:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134515, 136629, 28141, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and great capture.  I love his expression.</td>', 'Excellent composition and great capture.  I love his expression.', '2005-01-26 23:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134671, 136752, 6172, '<td valign="top">heida?</td>', 'heida?', '2005-01-27 02:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134683, 133566, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on this, great focus on the horses face, and near perfect on the girls.</td>', 'Very nice job on this, great focus on the horses face, and near perfect on the girls.', '2005-01-27 02:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134799, 136752, 17850, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos that I have ever seen... awesome, incredible capture, congratulations! (10)</td>', 'One of the best photos that I have ever seen... awesome, incredible capture, congratulations! (10)', '2005-01-27 04:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134803, 132693, 2553, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot, worthy of being a "sale-able" print.  I love your composition, it works wonderfully to lead the eye throughout the shot bringing you directly to the ladybug.  DOF is great, putting all the "focus" on your subject.  I also really like the way the photo is kind of split diagonally by the dark on the bottom and the light on the top, it''s very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Terrific shot, worthy of being a "sale-able" print.  I love your composition, it works wonderfully to lead the eye throughout the shot bringing you directly to the ladybug.  DOF is great, putting all the "focus" on your subject.  I also really like the way the photo is kind of split diagonally by the dark on the bottom and the light on the top, it''s very pleasing to the eye.', '2005-01-27 04:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134804, 135615, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautifully thought out, beautifully composed, beautifully shot.  This would make a great print and/or poster.</td>', 'Beautifully thought out, beautifully composed, beautifully shot.  This would make a great print and/or poster.', '2005-01-27 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134811, 136675, 2553, '<td valign="top">Stunning concept,color and composition.  Your lighting brings out all the incredible texture and movement so beautifully.  This shot is one that I "feel".  There''s a lot to like in this challenge, but I hope to see this place very high.</td>', 'Stunning concept,color and composition.  Your lighting brings out all the incredible texture and movement so beautifully.  This shot is one that I "feel".  There''s a lot to like in this challenge, but I hope to see this place very high.', '2005-01-27 04:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134815, 133748, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lightning shots are just so powerful to look at.  This is lovely, and I like the blue/black coloring that seems to contradict the "heat" of the lightning.  The horizon feels tilted to me, just a tiny bit, but then again it''s so very early and I haven''t had coffee yet, so it could be me!</td>', 'Lightning shots are just so powerful to look at.  This is lovely, and I like the blue/black coloring that seems to contradict the "heat" of the lightning.  The horizon feels tilted to me, just a tiny bit, but then again it''s so very early and I haven''t had coffee yet, so it could be me!', '2005-01-27 04:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134818, 133800, 2553, '<td valign="top">What an image!! Certainly one to proud of, and I''d have this hanging on my walls if it were mine!  I like the nice, tight close-up a lot, It gives a lot of power to the shot.  In a challenge with a lot to like, this is a stand-out.</td>', 'What an image!! Certainly one to proud of, and I''d have this hanging on my walls if it were mine!  I like the nice, tight close-up a lot, It gives a lot of power to the shot.  In a challenge with a lot to like, this is a stand-out.', '2005-01-27 04:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134821, 136710, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, if this isn''t a inspirational poster, I don''t know what is!  I absolutely love the color on this shot, it''s what "makes" it for me.</td>', 'Wow, if this isn''t a inspirational poster, I don''t know what is!  I absolutely love the color on this shot, it''s what "makes" it for me.', '2005-01-27 04:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134824, 134050, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a great shot, and what an amazing view.  I can''t wait to find out where this was taken.  This image has almost a magical, mystical look and feel to it that is just wonderful.  At first, I thought that the industrial "smokestack" would detract from the overall feel of the shot, but no;  it almost feels like an anomaly, an anachronism that adds to the unreal quality of the shot.  Whatever...I love it.</td>', 'What a great shot, and what an amazing view.  I can''t wait to find out where this was taken.  This image has almost a magical, mystical look and feel to it that is just wonderful.  At first, I thought that the industrial "smokestack" would detract from the overall feel of the shot, but no;  it almost feels like an anomaly, an anachronism that adds to the unreal quality of the shot.  Whatever...I love it.', '2005-01-27 05:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134828, 133203, 2553, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to realize that the green was the negative space, NOT the leaf!  An imaginative shot with bold color and composition, not to mention terrific lighting.</td>', 'It took me a moment to realize that the green was the negative space, NOT the leaf!  An imaginative shot with bold color and composition, not to mention terrific lighting.', '2005-01-27 05:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134830, 132117, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love bird shots myself, and I love this. I love that it makes you want to reach out and touch the feathers.  Great lighting and detail.</td>', 'I love bird shots myself, and I love this. I love that it makes you want to reach out and touch the feathers.  Great lighting and detail.', '2005-01-27 05:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134831, 132536, 2553, '<td valign="top">I LOVE moonsets!   This shot has gorgeous color, pleasing composition, and I love seeing the silhouettes of the trees.</td>', 'I LOVE moonsets!   This shot has gorgeous color, pleasing composition, and I love seeing the silhouettes of the trees.', '2005-01-27 05:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134832, 135345, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of "into" dragonflies lately, and this has to be one of the best shots I''ve seen.  The color is just stunning, and the detail is unbelievable.  I think I see your reflection on his head - oop, just kidding!  I cannot imagine how you got this close. I can chase the darn things all day and they never let me get this close.  Great shot.</td>', 'I''m kind of "into" dragonflies lately, and this has to be one of the best shots I''ve seen.  The color is just stunning, and the detail is unbelievable.  I think I see your reflection on his head - oop, just kidding!  I cannot imagine how you got this close. I can chase the darn things all day and they never let me get this close.  Great shot.', '2005-01-27 05:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134894, 134979, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like the subtle colors.</td>', 'Great shot, I like the subtle colors.', '2005-01-27 06:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134897, 134359, 23478, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail.</td>', 'Wonderful detail.', '2005-01-27 06:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134900, 134935, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot... I like the interplay of light and shadows.</td>', 'Great shot... I like the interplay of light and shadows.', '2005-01-27 06:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134902, 133258, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great color... the contrast of yellow and blue works great.</td>', 'Great color... the contrast of yellow and blue works great.', '2005-01-27 06:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134920, 132909, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''ve been through a lot of photos at this point, but this one really touches me.   What a tender portrait.  It may not be the most difficult to photograph, or have the fanciest technique, but it moves me.  Congratulations on capturing a wonderful memory.</td>', 'I''ve been through a lot of photos at this point, but this one really touches me.   What a tender portrait.  It may not be the most difficult to photograph, or have the fanciest technique, but it moves me.  Congratulations on capturing a wonderful memory.', '2005-01-27 07:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134927, 135927, 6999, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of those buildings nicely helps the sense of scale here. I''m never really sure that the limitations of 8-bit web display are terribly helpful for black and white images, and those of such grandeur as this also suffer from the size limitations. It should be a 20" print to give it its full impact, I should think. I like the composition, and I think I like the processing - thoough the bright areas feel more like burning than light, as such, and seem a touch out of the real. A very strong shot.</td>', 'The inclusion of those buildings nicely helps the sense of scale here. I''m never really sure that the limitations of 8-bit web display are terribly helpful for black and white images, and those of such grandeur as this also suffer from the size limitations. It should be a 20" print to give it its full impact, I should think. I like the composition, and I think I like the processing - thoough the bright areas feel more like burning than light, as such, and seem a touch out of the real. A very strong shot.', '2005-01-27 07:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134930, 132307, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think I remember a shot a lot like this from a previous challenge - or maybe I''m just remembering browsing through this challenge before. Not a suggestion that you''ve previously entered this, I assure you. I like it - the almost (stress almost) photoshop nature of that background tree. Well composed, different and approachable image.</td>', 'I think I remember a shot a lot like this from a previous challenge - or maybe I''m just remembering browsing through this challenge before. Not a suggestion that you''ve previously entered this, I assure you. I like it - the almost (stress almost) photoshop nature of that background tree. Well composed, different and approachable image.', '2005-01-27 07:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134938, 136821, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m uncertain about tthe composition of this: the framing to the left of image seems more imposed than actual - perhaps a touch more of the foliage there would seem less to restrict the barn, and more to show us the natural framing that seems apparent there, and help the barn to sit more comfortably in frame. I see a conflict between the placing of tthe barn in the image and the areas of strength in this view of it: it''s the gabled ends of it that most intrigu my eye, and yet your composition pulls my eye more to the longer part of the building than allowing my eye to settle on those gable ends. I think opening the image to the left would have helped reduce that conflict.</td>', 'I''m uncertain about tthe composition of this: the framing to the left of image seems more imposed than actual - perhaps a touch more of the foliage there would seem less to restrict the barn, and more to show us the natural framing that seems apparent there, and help the barn to sit more comfortably in frame. I see a conflict between the placing of tthe barn in the image and the areas of strength in this view of it: it''s the gabled ends of it that most intrigu my eye, and yet your composition pulls my eye more to the longer part of the building than allowing my eye to settle on those gable ends. I think opening the image to the left would have helped reduce that conflict.', '2005-01-27 07:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134940, 135602, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sense of motion and colour. In such a graphicly styled image I would have certainly done something about that grey-white blur image right - it''s like having something in your eye, and it''s so difffuse, so different in feel from the majority of it, that I cannot see what purpose it serves. Certainly the composition requires the crop you''ve chosen, so i can see why it''s included ... but it really does attract the attention, and in such an otherwise top image ...</td>', 'Beautiful sense of motion and colour. In such a graphicly styled image I would have certainly done something about that grey-white blur image right - it''s like having something in your eye, and it''s so difffuse, so different in feel from the majority of it, that I cannot see what purpose it serves. Certainly the composition requires the crop you''ve chosen, so i can see why it''s included ... but it really does attract the attention, and in such an otherwise top image ...', '2005-01-27 07:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134944, 132136, 6999, '<td valign="top">I remember this from the forums ... though I don''t remember the weirdness image left - with the other branches there one suspects a cloning accident, but i cannot say. An extraordinary moment. There are artefacts from what appears to be very very heavy sharpening, which is a pity in my eyes, as they make the silhouette too attention-grabbing, and odd. Good shooting though.</td>', 'I remember this from the forums ... though I don''t remember the weirdness image left - with the other branches there one suspects a cloning accident, but i cannot say. An extraordinary moment. There are artefacts from what appears to be very very heavy sharpening, which is a pity in my eyes, as they make the silhouette too attention-grabbing, and odd. Good shooting though.', '2005-01-27 07:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134946, 132255, 6999, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d already commented on this. Powerful, wonderful, and massively sellable. I get a sense of a soft focus treatment from it, which I really don''t either like or find appropriate - it feels like an attempt to make a great shot somehow ''feminine'' in a cliched manner. It''s a great moment however, it just works against the sense of purpose and preparation and the coming trial.</td>', 'I thought I''d already commented on this. Powerful, wonderful, and massively sellable. I get a sense of a soft focus treatment from it, which I really don''t either like or find appropriate - it feels like an attempt to make a great shot somehow ''feminine'' in a cliched manner. It''s a great moment however, it just works against the sense of purpose and preparation and the coming trial.', '2005-01-27 07:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134948, 132202, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good tonality, good sense of threat, excellent focus.</td>', 'Good tonality, good sense of threat, excellent focus.', '2005-01-27 07:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134951, 133716, 6999, '<td valign="top">I can see why it would be a personal favourite - that light is certainly gorgeous. I find the framing/cropping uncomfortable - can''t see what you''ve kept at the bottom of frame that requires the clipping of the windmill like that. It would benefit, to my eye, from some work to calm the very bright areas of sky toward the horizon - the blue becomes a touch pasty and washed out there. The tonality of tthe wood work is well caught, and the sense of organisation.</td>', 'I can see why it would be a personal favourite - that light is certainly gorgeous. I find the framing/cropping uncomfortable - can''t see what you''ve kept at the bottom of frame that requires the clipping of the windmill like that. It would benefit, to my eye, from some work to calm the very bright areas of sky toward the horizon - the blue becomes a touch pasty and washed out there. The tonality of tthe wood work is well caught, and the sense of organisation.', '2005-01-27 07:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134953, 132693, 6999, '<td valign="top">Really marvellous. Tonality, composition, detail, focus - all expertly caught. Very graceful indeed.</td>', 'Really marvellous. Tonality, composition, detail, focus - all expertly caught. Very graceful indeed.', '2005-01-27 07:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1134967, 134077, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.<br/> <br/>But despite that I will upgrade it to a 10 - BECAUSE I LOVE IT! This had better ribbon or I''ll run naked along the platform at Camden Town tube station.  : )</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero. But despite that I will upgrade it to a 10 - BECAUSE I LOVE IT! This had better ribbon or I''ll run naked along the platform at Camden Town tube station.  : )', '2005-01-27 08:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135027, 136452, 30959, '<td valign="top">Like the photo, the border is a bit large...</td>', 'Like the photo, the border is a bit large...', '2005-01-27 09:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135036, 136425, 30959, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding photo....into my favs.</td>', 'This is an outstanding photo....into my favs.', '2005-01-27 09:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135041, 136049, 14671, '<td valign="top">A very nice pictyure but I find it confusing.  By this I mean there is sooooo much to look at that its hard to focus on on part of the picture and because of the distance it appears blurry even tho it may not be.  It has beautiful colors and good feeling of depth but I''m just not fussy on the clarity.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'A very nice pictyure but I find it confusing.  By this I mean there is sooooo much to look at that its hard to focus on on part of the picture and because of the distance it appears blurry even tho it may not be.  It has beautiful colors and good feeling of depth but I''m just not fussy on the clarity.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-27 09:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135044, 136871, 32111, '<td valign="top">I''m certain this will attract some good scores. Skilfully shot, but I don''t find it appealing. I think the blue eyes contribute to that. Not sure about the background either.</td>', 'I''m certain this will attract some good scores. Skilfully shot, but I don''t find it appealing. I think the blue eyes contribute to that. Not sure about the background either.', '2005-01-27 09:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135046, 135464, 14671, '<td valign="top">Its very basic.  I find this photo lacks interest or subject.  The choice in DOF may be a little off as well.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'Its very basic.  I find this photo lacks interest or subject.  The choice in DOF may be a little off as well.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-27 09:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135049, 133598, 14671, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and clarity and awesome choice in DOF.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Excellent colors and clarity and awesome choice in DOF.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005.  <8>', '2005-01-27 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135053, 134142, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find this photo has a washed look about it.  By this I mean that the only thing that is crisp in focus is the snake.  I also find this photo lacks subject and by this I mean that I find it dull and not very interesting to look at.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I find this photo has a washed look about it.  By this I mean that the only thing that is crisp in focus is the snake.  I also find this photo lacks subject and by this I mean that I find it dull and not very interesting to look at.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-27 09:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135055, 132023, 14671, '<td valign="top">No offence but this looks like a last minute entry to entry a challenge.  Perhaps if the center building was level it would have made for a more appealing photo,  I also think this photo lacks clarity and is kinda blurry.  The silhouette of the street light is also very distracting.  Good luck and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'No offence but this looks like a last minute entry to entry a challenge.  Perhaps if the center building was level it would have made for a more appealing photo,  I also think this photo lacks clarity and is kinda blurry.  The silhouette of the street light is also very distracting.  Good luck and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-27 09:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135057, 134214, 14671, '<td valign="top">As interesting as this photo is I''m just not fond of it.  I''ve never seen a photo where I thought noise could help but in this case I think it would have given an older feeling to the photo.  Excellent clarity and great use of B&amp;W and realy well done on the reflection in the mirror.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'As interesting as this photo is I''m just not fond of it.  I''ve never seen a photo where I thought noise could help but in this case I think it would have given an older feeling to the photo.  Excellent clarity and great use of B&W and realy well done on the reflection in the mirror.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-27 09:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135061, 135405, 32111, '<td valign="top">I like how almost all the lines in this photo, including the shades of sky, shores and road all converge off to an imaginary point. Perhaps a touch too dark overall though, and I''d have cloned out a few bits and pieces like the telephone pole to the right.</td>', 'I like how almost all the lines in this photo, including the shades of sky, shores and road all converge off to an imaginary point. Perhaps a touch too dark overall though, and I''d have cloned out a few bits and pieces like the telephone pole to the right.', '2005-01-27 10:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135062, 132763, 14671, '<td valign="top">This photo probably means more to you then it does to me but I don''t think this is your best of 2004.  The photo appears to be over sharpened and lacking subject.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'This photo probably means more to you then it does to me but I don''t think this is your best of 2004.  The photo appears to be over sharpened and lacking subject.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-27 10:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135063, 133704, 14671, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of DOF and the colors and clarity are outstanding.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;8&gt;  <br/> <br/>Honestly its just a plant but very well shot.</td>', 'Excellent choice of DOF and the colors and clarity are outstanding.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <8>   Honestly its just a plant but very well shot.', '2005-01-27 10:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135065, 136790, 14671, '<td valign="top">If she''s getting ready to give her daughter away then why does she look so grumpy???  I find there is to much blurr in this photo.  Perhaps its because of how wide it is.  Good luck and all the best in 2005.</td>', 'If she''s getting ready to give her daughter away then why does she look so grumpy???  I find there is to much blurr in this photo.  Perhaps its because of how wide it is.  Good luck and all the best in 2005.', '2005-01-27 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135066, 136427, 14671, '<td valign="top">I hate spider but pictures are ok.  I find the body of the spider to lack clarity and the rocks have a little to much contrast.  Very interesting subject tho.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.</td>', 'I hate spider but pictures are ok.  I find the body of the spider to lack clarity and the rocks have a little to much contrast.  Very interesting subject tho.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005.', '2005-01-27 10:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135067, 134395, 14671, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  You managed to capture the clarity of the water AND the feathures all in one.  Well dne.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.</td>', 'Great shot.  You managed to capture the clarity of the water AND the feathures all in one.  Well dne.  Keep up the good work and best of luck in 2005.', '2005-01-27 10:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135068, 136727, 14671, '<td valign="top">hahaha I saw this photo and started to laugh.  Altho I find it a fairly boring photo I find it drawing me into the photo.  Nice colors and excellent clarity. I think this would make for a nice milk calender entry.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;<br/> <br/>too funny</td>', 'hahaha I saw this photo and started to laugh.  Altho I find it a fairly boring photo I find it drawing me into the photo.  Nice colors and excellent clarity. I think this would make for a nice milk calender entry.  Good luck and keep up the good work in 2005. <7> too funny', '2005-01-27 10:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
