(1135238, 132945, 14614, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors; you and your model captured emotion and the moment... one of my ribbon picks a 10, going in my favorites, too</td>', 'Stunning colors; you and your model captured emotion and the moment... one of my ribbon picks a 10, going in my favorites, too', '2005-01-27 13:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135239, 133195, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderfully composde, excellent sepia tones, leading lines are perfect, one of my ribbon picks this challenge -- nicely done -- a 10 -- going in my favorites</td>', 'wonderfully composde, excellent sepia tones, leading lines are perfect, one of my ribbon picks this challenge -- nicely done -- a 10 -- going in my favorites', '2005-01-27 13:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135241, 134028, 14614, '<td valign="top">so intense - perfectly exposed -- both photojournalistic and artistic, one of my ribbon picks (10)</td>', 'so intense - perfectly exposed -- both photojournalistic and artistic, one of my ribbon picks (10)', '2005-01-27 13:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135250, 132182, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good angle and composition.<br/>I like the lighting also, good colours in the sunset.</td>', 'Good angle and composition.I like the lighting also, good colours in the sunset.', '2005-01-27 13:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135253, 136283, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good night capture!  Pretty much flawless.</td>', 'Good night capture!  Pretty much flawless.', '2005-01-27 13:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135254, 134979, 10883, '<td valign="top">That is actually a very interesting photograph, and a good one.<br/>It is though pretty clear that quite a bit of dodge&amp;burn work has been done to it + some more stuff, but it comes out very nicely.<br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'That is actually a very interesting photograph, and a good one.It is though pretty clear that quite a bit of dodge&burn work has been done to it + some more stuff, but it comes out very nicely. Good job!', '2005-01-27 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135267, 133012, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice quiet mood to this one.  Good choice to use b&amp;w.<br/>Good job.</td>', 'Nice quiet mood to this one.  Good choice to use b&w.Good job.', '2005-01-27 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135271, 134242, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good colours in this picture, nice narrow Dof. <br/>Also a good composition, good job.</td>', 'Good colours in this picture, nice narrow Dof. Also a good composition, good job.', '2005-01-27 13:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135272, 134951, 10883, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours there, good capture!</td>', 'Interesting colours there, good capture!', '2005-01-27 13:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135274, 136626, 10883, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and the dof is great.  The image is sharp and the colours are spot on.</td>', 'Excellent capture and the dof is great.  The image is sharp and the colours are spot on.', '2005-01-27 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135276, 133704, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very nice and clear picture.  The background is a bit distracting to, a narrower dof would have helped.</td>', 'Very nice and clear picture.  The background is a bit distracting to, a narrower dof would have helped.', '2005-01-27 13:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135277, 135457, 4805, '<td valign="top">I really like this. It must have taken a bit of work to set up a bracket on the front of the old bimmer. Does seem a bit underexposed on the car. A dodge here and there might have done it some good. One of the top shots in the challenge anyways. Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this. It must have taken a bit of work to set up a bracket on the front of the old bimmer. Does seem a bit underexposed on the car. A dodge here and there might have done it some good. One of the top shots in the challenge anyways. Good luck.', '2005-01-27 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135282, 134050, 32598, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, it reminds me of when I was a child in social studies, and later history, looking at paintings/photographs text books.  I often don''t like many far off landscapes, but this one works for me.  NICE</td>', 'This is a nice composition, it reminds me of when I was a child in social studies, and later history, looking at paintings/photographs text books.  I often don''t like many far off landscapes, but this one works for me.  NICE', '2005-01-27 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135284, 136635, 32111, '<td valign="top">The trees on the left make this feel a bit unbalanced, and don''t add anything. A slightly different angle with the mountains as the only backdrop might be better.</td>', 'The trees on the left make this feel a bit unbalanced, and don''t add anything. A slightly different angle with the mountains as the only backdrop might be better.', '2005-01-27 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135288, 134242, 10432, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>Excellent shot. Great shallow DoF and dramatic macro.  I love the color tone of this picture. I really have no suggestions for improving it. 9</td>', 'Returning for comment.Excellent shot. Great shallow DoF and dramatic macro.  I love the color tone of this picture. I really have no suggestions for improving it. 9', '2005-01-27 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135290, 136794, 32111, '<td valign="top">Hi!. Nice cat :-)<br/> <br/>Two things about this photo: Firstly, I think it could do with a little sharper focus. Second, I''m not sure about the crop. I think a little more space on the left would feel better and not cut off the whiskers so abruptly.</td>', 'Hi!. Nice cat :-) Two things about this photo: Firstly, I think it could do with a little sharper focus. Second, I''m not sure about the crop. I think a little more space on the left would feel better and not cut off the whiskers so abruptly.', '2005-01-27 13:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135292, 136550, 32111, '<td valign="top">Slightly soft focus, but nice colour and background.</td>', 'Slightly soft focus, but nice colour and background.', '2005-01-27 13:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135294, 133635, 32111, '<td valign="top">Striking image, but the sky looks too selectively edited (whether it is or not) for my taste - just my opinion though. Apart from that, good detail.</td>', 'Striking image, but the sky looks too selectively edited (whether it is or not) for my taste - just my opinion though. Apart from that, good detail.', '2005-01-27 13:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135295, 136597, 10432, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  This is a very nicely shot photo.  I like the B&amp;W treatment.  I think it could use some increased contrast and some details are blown out on the building.  The tree in the lower right corner is a tad distracting.  7</td>', 'Returning for comment.  This is a very nicely shot photo.  I like the B&W treatment.  I think it could use some increased contrast and some details are blown out on the building.  The tree in the lower right corner is a tad distracting.  7', '2005-01-27 13:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135298, 135466, 32111, '<td valign="top">The verticals seem a touch off, but the stone detail and sky are pretty impressive!</td>', 'The verticals seem a touch off, but the stone detail and sky are pretty impressive!', '2005-01-27 14:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135300, 132456, 10432, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Looks like an oil painting.  A couple of more apples or maybe some other item added to the photo might have increased the drama or interest.  But I''m not sure what to suggest to add.  I scored this an 8.  I think this would look beautiful framed on a wall.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Looks like an oil painting.  A couple of more apples or maybe some other item added to the photo might have increased the drama or interest.  But I''m not sure what to suggest to add.  I scored this an 8.  I think this would look beautiful framed on a wall.', '2005-01-27 14:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135301, 135565, 32598, '<td valign="top">Wow the colors, and contrast you have captured/acheived are wonderful, i feel like I am there just in mood and feeling.</td>', 'Wow the colors, and contrast you have captured/acheived are wonderful, i feel like I am there just in mood and feeling.', '2005-01-27 14:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135302, 135207, 32111, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the off horizon lets it down. If you rotated and changed the crop be even with respect to the lines of light on each side, this would be improved.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the off horizon lets it down. If you rotated and changed the crop be even with respect to the lines of light on each side, this would be improved.', '2005-01-27 14:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135308, 136424, 32598, '<td valign="top">Uh... Wow.</td>', 'Uh... Wow.', '2005-01-27 14:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135351, 133126, 2780, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos in the challenge by a long shot. 10</td>', 'One of the best photos in the challenge by a long shot. 10', '2005-01-27 14:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135352, 134361, 2780, '<td valign="top">The drama and dynamics of this photo are fantastic. Great colouring too. 10</td>', 'The drama and dynamics of this photo are fantastic. Great colouring too. 10', '2005-01-27 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135353, 136307, 2780, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and darkness add a whole depth to this photo. I expect to see it high up in the rankings! Great work, 10.</td>', 'The soft focus and darkness add a whole depth to this photo. I expect to see it high up in the rankings! Great work, 10.', '2005-01-27 14:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135356, 132635, 2780, '<td valign="top">This has great movement and the processing really adds an edge! Nice work. 9</td>', 'This has great movement and the processing really adds an edge! Nice work. 9', '2005-01-27 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135357, 132365, 13119, '<td valign="top">I would expect the tip of the flower to be in fucus.<br/>Nice picture but not extrodinary.<br/>5</td>', 'I would expect the tip of the flower to be in fucus.Nice picture but not extrodinary.5', '2005-01-27 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135380, 136239, 4226, '<td valign="top">back for comments.. <br/>when I first saw this, I knew i have seen this girl and then yes I was right, the same girl from music ribbon winning shot :) <br/>A very neat image, the color tones are very soft and soothing and the expression in her eyes is great too. thanx for sharing</td>', 'back for comments.. when I first saw this, I knew i have seen this girl and then yes I was right, the same girl from music ribbon winning shot :) A very neat image, the color tones are very soft and soothing and the expression in her eyes is great too. thanx for sharing', '2005-01-27 15:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135437, 136307, 26661, '<td valign="top">what a great shot! i love the shadow lighting and the intimacy of the picture! great shot!</td>', 'what a great shot! i love the shadow lighting and the intimacy of the picture! great shot!', '2005-01-27 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135441, 132202, 26661, '<td valign="top">i love this shot! great picture!</td>', 'i love this shot! great picture!', '2005-01-27 16:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135475, 136449, 8970, '<td valign="top">The subject feels too centered</td>', 'The subject feels too centered', '2005-01-27 16:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135491, 135188, 30787, '<td valign="top">I like this image and gave it an 8. I would have gone higher but it looks a little unreal to me. Maybe over saturated.</td>', 'I like this image and gave it an 8. I would have gone higher but it looks a little unreal to me. Maybe over saturated.', '2005-01-27 16:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135517, 133126, 6630, '<td valign="top">VERY nice!!!  Great capture.  Can you see my face turning green?  I''m so jealous.  I wanna go to Antarctica too!</td>', 'VERY nice!!!  Great capture.  Can you see my face turning green?  I''m so jealous.  I wanna go to Antarctica too!', '2005-01-27 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135551, 132190, 3087, '<td valign="top">A masterful image that conveys such a huge amount in such a minimal way. It really taps into that shared western cultural history of romantic black and white films and also speaks to us of our fond memories of dancing with loved ones. A superbly simply yet affective image. 8</td>', 'A masterful image that conveys such a huge amount in such a minimal way. It really taps into that shared western cultural history of romantic black and white films and also speaks to us of our fond memories of dancing with loved ones. A superbly simply yet affective image. 8', '2005-01-27 17:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135553, 134492, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of lighting to make these hairs into such a strong visual element. The graduated background works well, especially in the way that the main division between dark and light echoes the position of the barbed wire. Composition nie though feels a touch tight on the left. 8</td>', 'Beautiful use of lighting to make these hairs into such a strong visual element. The graduated background works well, especially in the way that the main division between dark and light echoes the position of the barbed wire. Composition nie though feels a touch tight on the left. 8', '2005-01-27 17:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135555, 133084, 3087, '<td valign="top">I liked this very much when I first saw it during a thread on impressionism and like it still. It conveys absolutely a sense of the moment, a sense of the sound, smell and feel of that wet rain and the motivation of that rushed individual racing along the street. Composition works well. Strong lighting is well used. 8</td>', 'I liked this very much when I first saw it during a thread on impressionism and like it still. It conveys absolutely a sense of the moment, a sense of the sound, smell and feel of that wet rain and the motivation of that rushed individual racing along the street. Composition works well. Strong lighting is well used. 8', '2005-01-27 17:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135559, 136300, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract. Like strings of jewels. Nice choice of blue colour cast. Nice use of shallow DOF. 8</td>', 'Beautiful abstract. Like strings of jewels. Nice choice of blue colour cast. Nice use of shallow DOF. 8', '2005-01-27 17:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135560, 136307, 3087, '<td valign="top">Highly sensuous image. Excellent use of shadow to give a less explicit and more dreamy ambience to the image. The man''s face feels much too tightly cropped into the corner of the frame - would prefer more space below. 8</td>', 'Highly sensuous image. Excellent use of shadow to give a less explicit and more dreamy ambience to the image. The man''s face feels much too tightly cropped into the corner of the frame - would prefer more space below. 8', '2005-01-27 17:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135561, 133724, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful study of a small detail supported by well considered desaturation and toning. Also a nice use of light and shadow to communicate shape, texture and setting. 8</td>', 'Beautiful study of a small detail supported by well considered desaturation and toning. Also a nice use of light and shadow to communicate shape, texture and setting. 8', '2005-01-27 17:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135562, 135057, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an absolutely marvellous portrait. Reminiscent of images from the dawn of the photographic era yet still utterly appealing today. I like the high contrast, the harsh lighting, the composition, the background and, of course, the model and his pose and expression. 10<br/>What a superb image!</td>', 'What an absolutely marvellous portrait. Reminiscent of images from the dawn of the photographic era yet still utterly appealing today. I like the high contrast, the harsh lighting, the composition, the background and, of course, the model and his pose and expression. 10What a superb image!', '2005-01-27 17:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135563, 136583, 3087, '<td valign="top">I recognise this - I remember recommending this very crop. I think it works really, really well because of that strong diagonal intersecting the lower corner. The toning is a little too orange for my tastes, I think it would better suit a more subtle yellowey-brown sepia-like tone. 9<br/>It''s a lovely capture of a moment frozen in time. I''m sure many of us can identify with how utterly engrossed in his own world the little boy is at this moment. <br/></td>', 'I recognise this - I remember recommending this very crop. I think it works really, really well because of that strong diagonal intersecting the lower corner. The toning is a little too orange for my tastes, I think it would better suit a more subtle yellowey-brown sepia-like tone. 9It''s a lovely capture of a moment frozen in time. I''m sure many of us can identify with how utterly engrossed in his own world the little boy is at this moment. ', '2005-01-27 17:43:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1135564, 136417, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stark, emotive, high impact black and white. The high contrast works well to emphasise both the spotlight and the inky blackness surrounding it. I like the use of lots of negative space to emphasise the loneliness of that position. The soft detail of brick behind the chair definitely adds something. Lovely! 10</td>', 'Stark, emotive, high impact black and white. The high contrast works well to emphasise both the spotlight and the inky blackness surrounding it. I like the use of lots of negative space to emphasise the loneliness of that position. The soft detail of brick behind the chair definitely adds something. Lovely! 10', '2005-01-27 17:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135568, 136226, 3087, '<td valign="top">Delightful bird portrait! I like the way we have the front breast of the bird, a slightly opened wing with the feather pattern clearly visible and the side of the head showing lots of eye and crown detail. An exceptionally appealing pose from the bird. The composition is just perfect with just the right amount of wood to green background ratio. Really lovely shot. 8</td>', 'Delightful bird portrait! I like the way we have the front breast of the bird, a slightly opened wing with the feather pattern clearly visible and the side of the head showing lots of eye and crown detail. An exceptionally appealing pose from the bird. The composition is just perfect with just the right amount of wood to green background ratio. Really lovely shot. 8', '2005-01-27 17:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135570, 132185, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh it''s a couple of Grevy''s zebra! Beautiful! <br/>Really nice use of a natural pattern to create a strong abstract. The waved line of the spine of the animal in the foreground really creates an excellent composition. <br/>Very nice! 8</td>', 'Oooh it''s a couple of Grevy''s zebra! Beautiful! Really nice use of a natural pattern to create a strong abstract. The waved line of the spine of the animal in the foreground really creates an excellent composition. Very nice! 8', '2005-01-27 17:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135571, 136688, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simple, strong composition and nicely exposed. The image works well on both an emotional and visual level. 8</td>', 'Simple, strong composition and nicely exposed. The image works well on both an emotional and visual level. 8', '2005-01-27 17:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135572, 134242, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrancy and immediacy to this shot. Many macro/ macro-style shots don''t achieve that. Lovely! 8</td>', 'Lovely vibrancy and immediacy to this shot. Many macro/ macro-style shots don''t achieve that. Lovely! 8', '2005-01-27 17:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135576, 133785, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely excellent use of this architectural detail to create frames within the image for the girl and the guitar. The composition just shouts out and the image is highly creative to boot. My only criticism would be of the yellow within the border since it doesn''t echo a colour from within the image I find it somewhat glaring. If you prefer a colour rather than grey or white, I''d try the green from the guitar instead. 8</td>', 'Absolutely excellent use of this architectural detail to create frames within the image for the girl and the guitar. The composition just shouts out and the image is highly creative to boot. My only criticism would be of the yellow within the border since it doesn''t echo a colour from within the image I find it somewhat glaring. If you prefer a colour rather than grey or white, I''d try the green from the guitar instead. 8', '2005-01-27 17:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135589, 136147, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the crop, though I have to say I don''t find the pose very flattering. Would have also been nice to get just a tiny bit of light in his right eye.</td>', 'I like the crop, though I have to say I don''t find the pose very flattering. Would have also been nice to get just a tiny bit of light in his right eye.', '2005-01-27 17:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135594, 136742, 9939, '<td valign="top">The crop here feels cramped to me, and with the exception of a bit of reflection we really can''t see any light in her eye. I''d also really like to be able to see a little more of her left eye. All in all this doesn''t strike me as a very flattering photo.</td>', 'The crop here feels cramped to me, and with the exception of a bit of reflection we really can''t see any light in her eye. I''d also really like to be able to see a little more of her left eye. All in all this doesn''t strike me as a very flattering photo.', '2005-01-27 17:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135597, 132158, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here. I wish the leaf had a little more breathing space on the right of the frame.</td>', 'I like the colors here. I wish the leaf had a little more breathing space on the right of the frame.', '2005-01-27 17:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135600, 135466, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice as a "record" shot (a record of your vacation, the bridge''s existence, etc), but nothing here really wows me.</td>', 'Nice as a "record" shot (a record of your vacation, the bridge''s existence, etc), but nothing here really wows me.', '2005-01-27 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135603, 136869, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice as a "record" shot (a record of your vacation, Big Ben''s existence, etc) but nothing here really wows me.</td>', 'Nice as a "record" shot (a record of your vacation, Big Ben''s existence, etc) but nothing here really wows me.', '2005-01-27 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135607, 136551, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great composition, if just a tad cramped for my taste. Too bad you couldn''t get a little bit of light into the eyes.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great composition, if just a tad cramped for my taste. Too bad you couldn''t get a little bit of light into the eyes. ', '2005-01-27 18:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135609, 132458, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but seems a tad soft. The borders are overkill in my opinion.</td>', 'Pretty, but seems a tad soft. The borders are overkill in my opinion.', '2005-01-27 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135612, 133146, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t wow me, but it''s a cute shot.</td>', 'Doesn''t wow me, but it''s a cute shot.', '2005-01-27 18:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135615, 134411, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t wow me, but I do like the colors very much.</td>', 'Doesn''t wow me, but I do like the colors very much.', '2005-01-27 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135616, 136620, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Bumping one.</td>', 'Nice capture. Bumping one.', '2005-01-27 18:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135619, 132243, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t wow me, but it''s very pretty.</td>', 'Doesn''t wow me, but it''s very pretty.', '2005-01-27 18:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135620, 134571, 9939, '<td valign="top">I think the colors here would have popped so much more in late afternoon/sunset light. Nice composition.</td>', 'I think the colors here would have popped so much more in late afternoon/sunset light. Nice composition.', '2005-01-27 18:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135623, 132917, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice careful composition. I might have saturated it just a bit more to add a bit of pop. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Very pretty, nice careful composition. I might have saturated it just a bit more to add a bit of pop. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 18:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135626, 133716, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t wow me, but looks like a neat place. Love the colors.</td>', 'Doesn''t wow me, but looks like a neat place. Love the colors.', '2005-01-27 18:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135629, 136871, 9939, '<td valign="top">Looks like a greeting card. Nice light. Bumping one.</td>', 'Looks like a greeting card. Nice light. Bumping one.', '2005-01-27 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135634, 132182, 9939, '<td valign="top">First I think the borders are a bit of overkill.  Nice compositional idea, but I don''t think you need quite so much rock in the frame. Finally I might have stopped down a tad to darken the colors and possibly get a little more detail in the sun. This is a lovely photo with a lot of potential in my opinion.</td>', 'First I think the borders are a bit of overkill.  Nice compositional idea, but I don''t think you need quite so much rock in the frame. Finally I might have stopped down a tad to darken the colors and possibly get a little more detail in the sun. This is a lovely photo with a lot of potential in my opinion.', '2005-01-27 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135637, 136821, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t wow me- the colors and sky are a bit drab- but I really like the composition.</td>', 'Doesn''t wow me- the colors and sky are a bit drab- but I really like the composition.', '2005-01-27 18:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135641, 132622, 21862, '<td valign="top">Hey, I saw this one on deviantArt!</td>', 'Hey, I saw this one on deviantArt!', '2005-01-27 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135643, 134937, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab me, as it''s a pretty common theme. To make something like this really pop there needs to be something about it that is unusual (or unusually beautiful) for this type of shot, whether it be in the light, what the creature is doing, etc.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab me, as it''s a pretty common theme. To make something like this really pop there needs to be something about it that is unusual (or unusually beautiful) for this type of shot, whether it be in the light, what the creature is doing, etc.', '2005-01-27 18:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135646, 132524, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab me, but it''s pretty. Seems oversaturated.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab me, but it''s pretty. Seems oversaturated.', '2005-01-27 18:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135649, 133977, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab me, though I do like the colors and composition.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab me, though I do like the colors and composition.', '2005-01-27 18:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135652, 132781, 9939, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t pop for me- the tones feel flat. Interesting sky though.</td>', 'This doesn''t pop for me- the tones feel flat. Interesting sky though.', '2005-01-27 18:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135656, 136428, 9939, '<td valign="top">If this was just a hair less centered I think it would improve it greatly. I really like the subject and the setting, as well as what we''re seeing in the glass. Bumping up one.</td>', 'If this was just a hair less centered I think it would improve it greatly. I really like the subject and the setting, as well as what we''re seeing in the glass. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
