(1135678, 135655, 9939, '<td valign="top">By converting to black and white the noise in the sky really stands out, and the centered composition here just isn''t exciting.  Not enough separation and contrast in this image to make the eye really investigate the details. Keep trying!</td>', 'By converting to black and white the noise in the sky really stands out, and the centered composition here just isn''t exciting.  Not enough separation and contrast in this image to make the eye really investigate the details. Keep trying!', '2005-01-27 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
