(1135682, 133363, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the decision to go with black and white, though I wish there was a bit more contrast and maybe a tighter crop on the central plant to make this really pop.</td>', 'I like the decision to go with black and white, though I wish there was a bit more contrast and maybe a tighter crop on the central plant to make this really pop.', '2005-01-27 18:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
