(1135687, 132680, 9939, '<td valign="top">Hmm, doesn''t look to peaceful- it looks like a storm is coming. Not enough info here to tell what I''m looking at. Sorry, just doesn''t wow me.</td>', 'Hmm, doesn''t look to peaceful- it looks like a storm is coming. Not enough info here to tell what I''m looking at. Sorry, just doesn''t wow me.', '2005-01-27 18:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
