(1135690, 136766, 9939, '<td valign="top">When I see shots like this I feel that they could really benefit from a black and white or duotone (or even tri or quad) treatment. While the color of the sky pops, the detail of the canyon looks a bit bland. I think black and white, more contrast, and perhaps a tigher less centered crop could really make this pop.</td>', 'When I see shots like this I feel that they could really benefit from a black and white or duotone (or even tri or quad) treatment. While the color of the sky pops, the detail of the canyon looks a bit bland. I think black and white, more contrast, and perhaps a tigher less centered crop could really make this pop.', '2005-01-27 18:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135691, 136614, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the placement, though I might have gone with a less centered composition.</td>', 'I like the placement, though I might have gone with a less centered composition.', '2005-01-27 18:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135694, 134511, 9939, '<td valign="top">Sky looks a bit overprocessed. Otherwise a very cool shot- bumping one.</td>', 'Sky looks a bit overprocessed. Otherwise a very cool shot- bumping one.', '2005-01-27 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
