(1135706, 135207, 9939, '<td valign="top">I''m usually not a stickler for tilted horizons, but this one really stands out. A pretty composiiton to be sure but a little extra post processing could have helped to make the sky less noisy. Nice colors.</td>', 'I''m usually not a stickler for tilted horizons, but this one really stands out. A pretty composiiton to be sure but a little extra post processing could have helped to make the sky less noisy. Nice colors.', '2005-01-27 18:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
