(1135884, 136215, 9939, '<td valign="top">Rock star! Great shot. The subject really pops.</td>', 'Rock star! Great shot. The subject really pops.', '2005-01-27 19:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135886, 135805, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice capture- her expression really tells a bit of a story, which always makes a photo more interesting. I like the composition.</td>', 'Nice capture- her expression really tells a bit of a story, which always makes a photo more interesting. I like the composition.', '2005-01-27 19:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135889, 133598, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones. By moving to your left it might have been possible to get a bit of separation between her and the voilin player and made of a bit stronger framing.</td>', 'Very nice tones. By moving to your left it might have been possible to get a bit of separation between her and the voilin player and made of a bit stronger framing.', '2005-01-27 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135891, 133782, 9939, '<td valign="top">Skin tone feels a little dark and flar here- I love the facial expression.</td>', 'Skin tone feels a little dark and flar here- I love the facial expression.', '2005-01-27 19:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135896, 135328, 9939, '<td valign="top">Odd but cool in a slice-of-Americana kind of way. Would be interesting to see different crops- including the entire rightmost awning but cropping out the bit of sky in the upper right. My eye keeps going there as a "way out" of the photo.</td>', 'Odd but cool in a slice-of-Americana kind of way. Would be interesting to see different crops- including the entire rightmost awning but cropping out the bit of sky in the upper right. My eye keeps going there as a "way out" of the photo.', '2005-01-27 19:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135897, 136217, 9939, '<td valign="top">Wow, a Corona ad waiting to happen. Really nice.</td>', 'Wow, a Corona ad waiting to happen. Really nice.', '2005-01-27 19:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135898, 132388, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but awfully centered and seemd a tiny bit dark.</td>', 'Nice capture, but awfully centered and seemd a tiny bit dark.', '2005-01-27 19:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135901, 134670, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab me, as it''s a pretty common theme. To make something like this really pop there needs to be something about it that is unusual (or unusually beautiful) for this type of shot, whether it be in the light, what the creature is doing, etc.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab me, as it''s a pretty common theme. To make something like this really pop there needs to be something about it that is unusual (or unusually beautiful) for this type of shot, whether it be in the light, what the creature is doing, etc.', '2005-01-27 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135907, 136180, 9939, '<td valign="top">The light on Roger''s face is a bit harsh and having it coming from the lower left seems a bit odd. We lose any light in his left eye.</td>', 'The light on Roger''s face is a bit harsh and having it coming from the lower left seems a bit odd. We lose any light in his left eye.', '2005-01-27 20:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135909, 132782, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great composition, beautiful colors. The eyes lok a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Great composition, beautiful colors. The eyes lok a little oversharpened.', '2005-01-27 20:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135913, 136832, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, great sense of mood. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Nice capture, great sense of mood. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135916, 132830, 9939, '<td valign="top">Quirky, nice capture. Might have been more impactful had he looked up, even a little bit.</td>', 'Quirky, nice capture. Might have been more impactful had he looked up, even a little bit.', '2005-01-27 20:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135918, 136459, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great action capture. Composition feels a little cramped top and bottom and a little loose left to right, but I''m sure that was due to the quick timing on getting the shot. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Great action capture. Composition feels a little cramped top and bottom and a little loose left to right, but I''m sure that was due to the quick timing on getting the shot. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135919, 136689, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait! Beautiful eyes. The centered double catchlights feel a bit odd.</td>', 'Nice portrait! Beautiful eyes. The centered double catchlights feel a bit odd.', '2005-01-27 20:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135933, 133397, 9939, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color, great placement. Might be a little oversharpened though...</td>', 'Gorgeous color, great placement. Might be a little oversharpened though...', '2005-01-27 20:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135936, 133145, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus, fitting for the occasion. Brights seems overly hot here, but still a lovely capture.</td>', 'Nice soft focus, fitting for the occasion. Brights seems overly hot here, but still a lovely capture.', '2005-01-27 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135938, 135639, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab me, as it''s a pretty common theme. To make something like this really pop there needs to be something about it that is unusual (or unusually beautiful) for this type of shot, whether it be in the light, what the creature is doing, etc. That said, I do like the colors very much.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab me, as it''s a pretty common theme. To make something like this really pop there needs to be something about it that is unusual (or unusually beautiful) for this type of shot, whether it be in the light, what the creature is doing, etc. That said, I do like the colors very much.', '2005-01-27 20:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135940, 136307, 9939, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition showing good emotion, but tones seem a little dark and flat to me.</td>', 'Really nice composition showing good emotion, but tones seem a little dark and flat to me.', '2005-01-27 20:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135941, 134681, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Very cool capture. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135942, 133084, 9939, '<td valign="top">Unusual and evocative. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Unusual and evocative. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135944, 136770, 9939, '<td valign="top">Her expression doesn''t say wild to me, but I like the composition and the idea. Tones might be just a tiny bit flat.</td>', 'Her expression doesn''t say wild to me, but I like the composition and the idea. Tones might be just a tiny bit flat.', '2005-01-27 20:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135946, 136329, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very cute capture. I do wish we could really see at least someone''s eyes.</td>', 'Very cute capture. I do wish we could really see at least someone''s eyes.', '2005-01-27 20:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135948, 132887, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, nice composition. Would be more impactful if we could see the eyes.</td>', 'Great perspective, nice composition. Would be more impactful if we could see the eyes.', '2005-01-27 20:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135949, 136779, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice photojournalistic shot of photojournalism!</td>', 'Nice photojournalistic shot of photojournalism!', '2005-01-27 20:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135951, 135697, 9939, '<td valign="top">Unusual position to see a horse in- nicely done! Does seem a tad overexposted.</td>', 'Unusual position to see a horse in- nicely done! Does seem a tad overexposted.', '2005-01-27 20:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135952, 136673, 9939, '<td valign="top">Feels like something out of a foreign film. Nice capture.</td>', 'Feels like something out of a foreign film. Nice capture.', '2005-01-27 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135953, 136539, 18194, '<td valign="top">There is nothing really special about this photo.  Technically it is a good photo but there really isnt much of interest to it.</td>', 'There is nothing really special about this photo.  Technically it is a good photo but there really isnt much of interest to it.', '2005-01-27 20:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135955, 136677, 9939, '<td valign="top">I like the high key and the capture of emotion here- I wish her face was just a tad more in focus/sharp.</td>', 'I like the high key and the capture of emotion here- I wish her face was just a tad more in focus/sharp.', '2005-01-27 20:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135957, 132779, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice expression- high key works with her, but by the same token seeing a little more contrast in her features would be nice. The background feels odd to me, by not being able to really tell what it is the dark area makes it feel as if part of the background has simply been torn away. Too much border for me.</td>', 'Nice expression- high key works with her, but by the same token seeing a little more contrast in her features would be nice. The background feels odd to me, by not being able to really tell what it is the dark area makes it feel as if part of the background has simply been torn away. Too much border for me.', '2005-01-27 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135958, 136629, 9939, '<td valign="top">Love the light, love the expression. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Love the light, love the expression. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135961, 136718, 9939, '<td valign="top">Love the color and the light is great on her face. The hot spots in the water sure are too bad though. Still bumping up one- tells a cute story.</td>', 'Love the color and the light is great on her face. The hot spots in the water sure are too bad though. Still bumping up one- tells a cute story.', '2005-01-27 20:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135965, 135174, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice, though some detail seems to have been lost in her costume with the high contrast. Her eye looks a bit odd, as if there was red eye before this was converted to B &amp; W? Great capture of mood!</td>', 'Nice, though some detail seems to have been lost in her costume with the high contrast. Her eye looks a bit odd, as if there was red eye before this was converted to B & W? Great capture of mood!', '2005-01-27 20:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135966, 136452, 18194, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks pretty flat in this photo, I know there is not a lot you can do about that.  We kind of lose the surfer against the rocks.  Again I know you did not have control of this but I think this would be a whole lot better if he was facing us.</td>', 'The lighting looks pretty flat in this photo, I know there is not a lot you can do about that.  We kind of lose the surfer against the rocks.  Again I know you did not have control of this but I think this would be a whole lot better if he was facing us.', '2005-01-27 20:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135968, 136868, 9939, '<td valign="top">The detail lost in her eyes is a shame. I like the muted colors a lot.</td>', 'The detail lost in her eyes is a shame. I like the muted colors a lot.', '2005-01-27 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135970, 132737, 18194, '<td valign="top">I expect that the full size photo is very good but that you lost a lot when you resized it.  There as several things that could have been done to make the resized photo look better.  The focus looks very soft in this photo, most likely this happened during resizing, try using USM after resizing to sharpen it up a bit.  The photo also could have be resized to a larger size then this, using the full 640 will get you higher votes.  The last point is try saving it at a high quality setting, this seems to be suffering from jpeg artifact due to too much compression.</td>', 'I expect that the full size photo is very good but that you lost a lot when you resized it.  There as several things that could have been done to make the resized photo look better.  The focus looks very soft in this photo, most likely this happened during resizing, try using USM after resizing to sharpen it up a bit.  The photo also could have be resized to a larger size then this, using the full 640 will get you higher votes.  The last point is try saving it at a high quality setting, this seems to be suffering from jpeg artifact due to too much compression.', '2005-01-27 20:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135975, 134600, 14012, '<td valign="top">Back for comment.  I knew I had seen this before, because I really liked it. I finally figured it out tonight...great shot Michael. This is an great photo. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Back for comment.  I knew I had seen this before, because I really liked it. I finally figured it out tonight...great shot Michael. This is an great photo. I hope it does well.', '2005-01-27 20:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135977, 135987, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t grab me, but I like the movement and tones here.</td>', 'Doesn''t grab me, but I like the movement and tones here.', '2005-01-27 20:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135978, 132632, 9939, '<td valign="top">The light here is great. Being able to see at least one eye would give this a little more impact for me.</td>', 'The light here is great. Being able to see at least one eye would give this a little more impact for me.', '2005-01-27 20:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135980, 132190, 9939, '<td valign="top">nice idea, well shot.</td>', 'nice idea, well shot.', '2005-01-27 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135982, 134904, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice power shown here. Seems a tad dark though.</td>', 'Nice power shown here. Seems a tad dark though.', '2005-01-27 20:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135987, 135127, 9939, '<td valign="top">Very nice. For me, cropping out more of the foreground so she takes up more of the frame would have given this a little more impact. That is a great face to take up such little space. Still a lovely portait and bumping it up one.</td>', 'Very nice. For me, cropping out more of the foreground so she takes up more of the frame would have given this a little more impact. That is a great face to take up such little space. Still a lovely portait and bumping it up one.', '2005-01-27 20:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135989, 132990, 9939, '<td valign="top">Being a dancer and fan of photographing dancing, I know how hard it can be to get a good shot of folks on the floor! This is nicely done, shame her eyes are closed!</td>', 'Being a dancer and fan of photographing dancing, I know how hard it can be to get a good shot of folks on the floor! This is nicely done, shame her eyes are closed!', '2005-01-27 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135991, 134065, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great shot in all respects. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Great shot in all respects. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135994, 136606, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great color and symmetry, nice capture. Bumping up one.</td>', 'Great color and symmetry, nice capture. Bumping up one.', '2005-01-27 20:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135996, 136381, 9939, '<td valign="top">This feels overly contrived to me, but still a lovely shot.</td>', 'This feels overly contrived to me, but still a lovely shot.', '2005-01-27 20:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135997, 135836, 9939, '<td valign="top">Unusual, and great composition and texture.</td>', 'Unusual, and great composition and texture.', '2005-01-27 20:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1135998, 136625, 9939, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Very shiny. I wish we could see his whole face.</td>', 'Cool shot. Very shiny. I wish we could see his whole face.', '2005-01-27 20:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136006, 136704, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Would love a different crop though, either tigher on him or showing a little more on the bottom. Preferably the first of the two.</td>', 'Great capture. Would love a different crop though, either tigher on him or showing a little more on the bottom. Preferably the first of the two.', '2005-01-27 21:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136011, 132874, 9939, '<td valign="top">I haven''t read the book, but this is a nice capture and lovely coloring.</td>', 'I haven''t read the book, but this is a nice capture and lovely coloring.', '2005-01-27 21:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136014, 134322, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great capture of emotion and movement. Bumping this up one.</td>', 'Great capture of emotion and movement. Bumping this up one.', '2005-01-27 21:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136016, 134269, 9939, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and lack of color here. That reflection sure is odd though.</td>', 'I really like the color and lack of color here. That reflection sure is odd though.', '2005-01-27 21:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136018, 136469, 9939, '<td valign="top">Composition feels very cramped to the left- not sure why half his ear is missing. Nice capture of mood though.</td>', 'Composition feels very cramped to the left- not sure why half his ear is missing. Nice capture of mood though.', '2005-01-27 21:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136021, 134160, 9939, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely, would make an excellent postcard. The border really hurts it in my opinion- way overkill.</td>', 'This is really lovely, would make an excellent postcard. The border really hurts it in my opinion- way overkill.', '2005-01-27 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136024, 136205, 9939, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but the crop straight through the eyebrows feels really odd.</td>', 'Neat idea, but the crop straight through the eyebrows feels really odd.', '2005-01-27 21:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136026, 134899, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but doesn''t make me go wow.</td>', 'Pretty, but doesn''t make me go wow.', '2005-01-27 21:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136027, 132531, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the action. Shame we get no face.</td>', 'Great capture of the action. Shame we get no face.', '2005-01-27 21:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136028, 135892, 9939, '<td valign="top">Pretty. That''s a postcard.</td>', 'Pretty. That''s a postcard.', '2005-01-27 21:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136030, 136114, 9939, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Too small though!</td>', 'Great action shot. Too small though!', '2005-01-27 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136032, 136448, 9939, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t wow me, but has pretty light, nice tones.</td>', 'Doesn''t wow me, but has pretty light, nice tones.', '2005-01-27 21:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136034, 134513, 9939, '<td valign="top">Looks strangely posed, but as if it''s not supposed to look posed. Nice composition.</td>', 'Looks strangely posed, but as if it''s not supposed to look posed. Nice composition.', '2005-01-27 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136037, 133403, 9939, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and composition- looks like some more detail could be brought out on the cliffs.</td>', 'Nice perspective and composition- looks like some more detail could be brought out on the cliffs.', '2005-01-27 21:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136038, 136190, 9939, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot and some motion blur would work for me, but this is a bit too much.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot and some motion blur would work for me, but this is a bit too much.', '2005-01-27 21:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136044, 135207, 19708, '<td valign="top">This shot had a lot of potential but fell short in this unbelievable challenge and offer the following things that needed improvement: (and trust me, I know night shots aren''t easy)<br/>1)The horizon is off a little (needs CCW rotation)<br/>2) Focus/clarity is on the soft side. Perhaps camera movement?<br/>3) Brighness and / or contrast need to be increased.<br/>4) Main subject is dead-center. A more interesting composition would have it slightly off to one side.<br/>5) Noise level (or image compression) in the sky. Neat image may be of use here.<br/> <br/>I sincerly hope these help. Still voted this a ((5))</td>', 'This shot had a lot of potential but fell short in this unbelievable challenge and offer the following things that needed improvement: (and trust me, I know night shots aren''t easy)1)The horizon is off a little (needs CCW rotation)2) Focus/clarity is on the soft side. Perhaps camera movement?3) Brighness and / or contrast need to be increased.4) Main subject is dead-center. A more interesting composition would have it slightly off to one side.5) Noise level (or image compression) in the sky. Neat image may be of use here. I sincerly hope these help. Still voted this a ((5))', '2005-01-27 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136049, 136180, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great character captured here. Lighting is a bit on the harsh side, but on the other hand the shadows do add to the character of the shot. Nicely composed. ((7))</td>', 'Great character captured here. Lighting is a bit on the harsh side, but on the other hand the shadows do add to the character of the shot. Nicely composed. ((7))', '2005-01-27 21:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136071, 133028, 11756, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there is enough focus on the right.  You can''t see the eyes which kinda makes it look awkward.  NIce job w/ the dof, but I don''t really like the composition.</td>', 'I don''t think there is enough focus on the right.  You can''t see the eyes which kinda makes it look awkward.  NIce job w/ the dof, but I don''t really like the composition.', '2005-01-27 21:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136073, 136424, 11756, '<td valign="top">haha, how''d you do this?  wish the people were reacting to it....</td>', 'haha, how''d you do this?  wish the people were reacting to it....', '2005-01-27 21:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1136075, 132531, 11756, '<td valign="top">the danncer isn''t really in good view.  Nice sharpness.</td>', 'the danncer isn''t really in good view.  Nice sharpness.', '2005-01-27 21:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
