(1140456, 136417, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.<br/> <br/>Rubbish. Of course it does and this is really nice. It''s a bit overpowering on the floor but I find the image appealing.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero. Rubbish. Of course it does and this is really nice. It''s a bit overpowering on the floor but I find the image appealing.', '2005-01-30 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
