(1140470, 134979, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dustin - as I said before, this is great!  ; )<br/> <br/>I''m sure you''ll do well with it. It''s a heavily processed shot, but it looks better for it. Good luck.</td>', 'Dustin - as I said before, this is great!  ; ) I''m sure you''ll do well with it. It''s a heavily processed shot, but it looks better for it. Good luck.', '2005-01-30 17:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140475, 132255, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.<br/>; )<br/> <br/>Great view - love their poses (candid I assume). There''s a softness to this that doesn''t do a great deal for me. It works, although it suggests something a bit more evocative/romantic than this subject.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.; ) Great view - love their poses (candid I assume). There''s a softness to this that doesn''t do a great deal for me. It works, although it suggests something a bit more evocative/romantic than this subject.', '2005-01-30 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140479, 133415, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene - great composition.<br/> <br/>There''s a problem here for me which is one of excessive burning, resulting in an artificial and overpowering sky. As you can see how the sky really looked in the reflection, I would have been inclined to exercise restraint since your scene was lovely anyway.</td>', 'Lovely scene - great composition. There''s a problem here for me which is one of excessive burning, resulting in an artificial and overpowering sky. As you can see how the sky really looked in the reflection, I would have been inclined to exercise restraint since your scene was lovely anyway.', '2005-01-30 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140480, 135240, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.<br/>; )<br/> <br/>Lovely scene, but your processing has pushed this too far for me and the JPEG compression has yielded many artifacts. You''ve got a great subject and I think many will find it frustrating not to be able to see more of it.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.; ) Lovely scene, but your processing has pushed this too far for me and the JPEG compression has yielded many artifacts. You''ve got a great subject and I think many will find it frustrating not to be able to see more of it.', '2005-01-30 17:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140482, 134411, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.<br/>; )<br/> <br/>Just kidding - this is nice, but perhaps a little soft and won''t appeal to a majority of voters because of the ''flower thing''. The composition could be improved here by off-centering the subject and giving the viewer more to concentrate on by getting closer.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.; ) Just kidding - this is nice, but perhaps a little soft and won''t appeal to a majority of voters because of the ''flower thing''. The composition could be improved here by off-centering the subject and giving the viewer more to concentrate on by getting closer.', '2005-01-30 17:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140485, 135655, 8860, '<td valign="top">A stark subject (which I like) but I fear there''s not much else going on here to stay interested for long. The centred framing is not helping.</td>', 'A stark subject (which I like) but I fear there''s not much else going on here to stay interested for long. The centred framing is not helping.', '2005-01-30 17:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140487, 132814, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.<br/>; )<br/> <br/>Good subject, a lovely wood, but I feel it needs more interest in the form of an animal, person or other feature to retain interest. Colours/light are a bit flat.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge: zero.; ) Good subject, a lovely wood, but I feel it needs more interest in the form of an animal, person or other feature to retain interest. Colours/light are a bit flat.', '2005-01-30 17:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140499, 136414, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, but I find that the contrast is a little too harsh.  Beautiful sky.</td>', 'Very nice image, but I find that the contrast is a little too harsh.  Beautiful sky.', '2005-01-30 17:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140500, 132622, 11738, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky.  I do feel that the lightening of the grass is a bit overdone.  May I suggest either toning down the brightness for the grass or reducing yellow content and bumping slightly up the green?</td>', 'Awesome sky.  I do feel that the lightening of the grass is a bit overdone.  May I suggest either toning down the brightness for the grass or reducing yellow content and bumping slightly up the green?', '2005-01-30 17:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140507, 132456, 25143, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and mood , looks like an oil painting</td>', 'beautiful composition and mood , looks like an oil painting', '2005-01-30 17:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140510, 132737, 8860, '<td valign="top">You have a great composition here and a good subject but the shot is a little soft - or it was a small shot enlarged? Love the yellow foliage, but you will get hammered due to the quality element of the pic.</td>', 'You have a great composition here and a good subject but the shot is a little soft - or it was a small shot enlarged? Love the yellow foliage, but you will get hammered due to the quality element of the pic.', '2005-01-30 17:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
