(1140529, 134860, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting image treatment, but I find that the way the outside of her nose fades into white puts too much emphasis on her nostrils.  Her eyes, nose and lips need to be sharper yo alleviate this I think.</td>', 'Interesting image treatment, but I find that the way the outside of her nose fades into white puts too much emphasis on her nostrils.  Her eyes, nose and lips need to be sharper yo alleviate this I think.', '2005-01-30 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140533, 136770, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a very proficient shot, although totally unconvincing as a concept! I''m not sure if sepia works well here. I''d favour a subdued destauration of the colour shot.<br/> <br/>If wildness is desired I don''t think she''d stop to pose for the camera. A frantic, candid, or cowering figure would fit better.</td>', 'It''s a very proficient shot, although totally unconvincing as a concept! I''m not sure if sepia works well here. I''d favour a subdued destauration of the colour shot. If wildness is desired I don''t think she''d stop to pose for the camera. A frantic, candid, or cowering figure would fit better.', '2005-01-30 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
