(1140562, 136770, 18191, '<td valign="top">Stunning eyes and great pose. The ripped shorts, tattered shirt, and dirty body contrasts with the pure face. Great shot --- 9.</td>', 'Stunning eyes and great pose. The ripped shorts, tattered shirt, and dirty body contrasts with the pure face. Great shot --- 9.', '2005-01-30 18:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140565, 132597, 18191, '<td valign="top">The sense of framing here is perfect and the composition, extraodinary. This image I love. The red pot makes this absolutely outstanding. Unfortunately, to me, the pigeons are very distracting and detract from the piece. Just having the potted plant there would be even more effective, maybe possible with a person walking by it. This is still a phenomenal image to be very proud of.</td>', 'The sense of framing here is perfect and the composition, extraodinary. This image I love. The red pot makes this absolutely outstanding. Unfortunately, to me, the pigeons are very distracting and detract from the piece. Just having the potted plant there would be even more effective, maybe possible with a person walking by it. This is still a phenomenal image to be very proud of.', '2005-01-30 18:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140572, 135427, 13610, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is way too soft!</td>', 'In my opinion this is way too soft!', '2005-01-30 18:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140575, 136710, 13610, '<td valign="top">I think it would have worked better with more depth of field. It''s good that way but it could have been awesome. (6)</td>', 'I think it would have worked better with more depth of field. It''s good that way but it could have been awesome. (6)', '2005-01-30 18:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1140576, 136740, 13610, '<td valign="top">The composition make believe that the subject is the tree.</td>', 'The composition make believe that the subject is the tree.', '2005-01-30 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
