(1140585, 134971, 13610, '<td valign="top">The focus look a bit soft on both the trees and the mountain. While according to your title the mountain is the subject, it''s not obvious when looking at the image. (5)</td>', 'The focus look a bit soft on both the trees and the mountain. While according to your title the mountain is the subject, it''s not obvious when looking at the image. (5)', '2005-01-30 18:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
