(1140602, 134050, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ed - I''m sure I''ve commented on this before already (comment deleted???). Anyway, as I said before I think this is great. A wonderful observation, the right side of the light and so much lush colour and detail to look at. You may ribbon with this one I think.<br/> <br/>My only reservation is the noticeable gradation of the filtered sky/horizon, which i feel is unnecessary due to the natural beauty of the subject. Good luck!</td>', 'Ed - I''m sure I''ve commented on this before already (comment deleted???). Anyway, as I said before I think this is great. A wonderful observation, the right side of the light and so much lush colour and detail to look at. You may ribbon with this one I think. My only reservation is the noticeable gradation of the filtered sky/horizon, which i feel is unnecessary due to the natural beauty of the subject. Good luck!', '2005-01-30 18:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
