(1140880, 136395, 15204, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The sharpness and DOF are perfect.  I love the way the light is coming in from above and from the left, illuminating the baby''s face (great catchlights!)  I have one tiny nitpick with the crop.  For some reason, my eye is drawn to the nipple along the right hand side.  Maybe I''m just wierd :)  A 10!</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The sharpness and DOF are perfect.  I love the way the light is coming in from above and from the left, illuminating the baby''s face (great catchlights!)  I have one tiny nitpick with the crop.  For some reason, my eye is drawn to the nipple along the right hand side.  Maybe I''m just wierd :)  A 10!', '2005-01-30 21:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
