(1140966, 134009, 19408, '<td valign="top">this is pretty nice. the colors are fantastic and saturated. The exposure is great with a good natural looking fill-in flash. the subject has a wonderful relaxed content expression, an attractive triangular pose, and there''s some nice ocean breeze wind swept hair action going on. The thing I''m not sure of is the composition. The main element is the big tree trunk. In itself it isn''t a bad thing though I feel it''s placement within the image divides it up too much. It creates a large dead space on the right. Together with the vanishing line of the fence leads the eye right out of the picture. I think it might have been improved if it were more on the left or right edge of the frame. All in all a pretty picture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-01 11:25:35.</i></td>', 'this is pretty nice. the colors are fantastic and saturated. The exposure is great with a good natural looking fill-in flash. the subject has a wonderful relaxed content expression, an attractive triangular pose, and there''s some nice ocean breeze wind swept hair action going on. The thing I''m not sure of is the composition. The main element is the big tree trunk. In itself it isn''t a bad thing though I feel it''s placement within the image divides it up too much. It creates a large dead space on the right. Together with the vanishing line of the fence leads the eye right out of the picture. I think it might have been improved if it were more on the left or right edge of the frame. All in all a pretty picture.', '2005-01-30 22:18:58.000000', '2005-02-01 11:25:35.000000', 1),
