(1141527, 133963, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflection, strong diagonal composition. It''s pretty minor, but I wish it didn''t lose the top rail in the back -- I''m guessing something else needed to be cropped out -- trimming a tiny bit from the right might lessen the effect.</td>', 'Excellent reflection, strong diagonal composition. It''s pretty minor, but I wish it didn''t lose the top rail in the back -- I''m guessing something else needed to be cropped out -- trimming a tiny bit from the right might lessen the effect.', '2005-01-31 02:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141539, 136239, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting and exposure are good. Pose doesn''t look quite natural for playing, but it''s been a long time since I''ve watch someone play one up close. It looks to me as though extra sharpening may have been applied aroung the eyes, and for me it''s just a little too much, but maybe that''s just excellent focusing with good glass and my imagination : )</td>', 'Lighting and exposure are good. Pose doesn''t look quite natural for playing, but it''s been a long time since I''ve watch someone play one up close. It looks to me as though extra sharpening may have been applied aroung the eyes, and for me it''s just a little too much, but maybe that''s just excellent focusing with good glass and my imagination : )', '2005-01-31 02:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141547, 136804, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great use of light to show detail and create background.</td>', 'Great use of light to show detail and create background.', '2005-01-31 02:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141553, 132468, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping this is taken from the Queen Mary or something, and not while dangling from one of those water-ski/kite things ... the high perspective definitely adds.</td>', 'I''m hoping this is taken from the Queen Mary or something, and not while dangling from one of those water-ski/kite things ... the high perspective definitely adds.', '2005-01-31 02:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141559, 135918, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely toned &amp; detailed Macro. Foreground leaf a bit narrow on the depth of field and not sure if a different crop would have helped this a little. Nice in any regard. ((7))</td>', 'Nicely toned & detailed Macro. Foreground leaf a bit narrow on the depth of field and not sure if a different crop would have helped this a little. Nice in any regard. ((7))', '2005-01-31 02:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141561, 136818, 1031, '<td valign="top">Love the patterns in the foreground ice. Interesting combination of warm and cold sections.</td>', 'Love the patterns in the foreground ice. Interesting combination of warm and cold sections.', '2005-01-31 02:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141562, 133652, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely toned &amp; detailed Macro. A bit narrow on the depth of field and not sure if a different crop would have helped this a little. Nice in any regard. ((7))</td>', 'Nicely toned & detailed Macro. A bit narrow on the depth of field and not sure if a different crop would have helped this a little. Nice in any regard. ((7))', '2005-01-31 02:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141568, 133154, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely toned &amp; detailed Macro. Not sure if a different crop would have helped this a little, as the apple completely takes my eyes away from the Ladybug. Nice in any regard. ((7))</td>', 'Nicely toned & detailed Macro. Not sure if a different crop would have helped this a little, as the apple completely takes my eyes away from the Ladybug. Nice in any regard. ((7))', '2005-01-31 02:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141570, 132362, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed &amp; detailed Macro. Nice color levels without being over-saturated. ((7))</td>', 'Nicely composed & detailed Macro. Nice color levels without being over-saturated. ((7))', '2005-01-31 02:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141572, 134681, 1031, '<td valign="top">Gives a good hint of the chaos to come ... great combination of sharp focus and soft look.</td>', 'Gives a good hint of the chaos to come ... great combination of sharp focus and soft look.', '2005-01-31 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141576, 134669, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, detail in the feathers.</td>', 'Good lighting, detail in the feathers.', '2005-01-31 02:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141580, 136597, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well seen.<br/>As an avid B&amp;W lover, this shot seems a bit too neutral to me.  Brigning down the brightness and increasing the contrast a bit may help, and/or going into Photoshop, Selective Colors, drop-downs, and adjust Black &amp; Neutral levels. Hope this helps. I would Love to play with this shot. ((7))</td>', 'Nicely composed and well seen.As an avid B&W lover, this shot seems a bit too neutral to me.  Brigning down the brightness and increasing the contrast a bit may help, and/or going into Photoshop, Selective Colors, drop-downs, and adjust Black & Neutral levels. Hope this helps. I would Love to play with this shot. ((7))', '2005-01-31 02:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141585, 132324, 19708, '<td valign="top">I Love B&amp;W scenery shots like this. <br/>My suggestions here would be a little USM applied to the lightness channel in Lab Color (50, 0.3, 0), maybe even twice, then burning in the sky a little to bring it out a bit more.<br/>Overall nice shot regardless. ((7))</td>', 'I Love B&W scenery shots like this. My suggestions here would be a little USM applied to the lightness channel in Lab Color (50, 0.3, 0), maybe even twice, then burning in the sky a little to bring it out a bit more.Overall nice shot regardless. ((7))', '2005-01-31 02:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141610, 136871, 10658, '<td valign="top">*LOVE* the selective desaturization, his expression is wonderful, this really is a great photo, but I''m sure you''ve had plenty of comments to tell you so :)</td>', '*LOVE* the selective desaturization, his expression is wonderful, this really is a great photo, but I''m sure you''ve had plenty of comments to tell you so :)', '2005-01-31 03:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141613, 134735, 10658, '<td valign="top">This looks like it would''ve been a really nice entry had it been larger.  At this size it''s difficult to judge.  I do like the reflection of the sky, clouds and gear in the water.</td>', 'This looks like it would''ve been a really nice entry had it been larger.  At this size it''s difficult to judge.  I do like the reflection of the sky, clouds and gear in the water.', '2005-01-31 03:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141614, 133716, 10658, '<td valign="top">The colors are great!  This looks like something out of a travel magazine, it makes the viewer want to just step right into it.</td>', 'The colors are great!  This looks like something out of a travel magazine, it makes the viewer want to just step right into it.', '2005-01-31 03:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141661, 135150, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good colours, lighting a bit harsh.</td>', 'Good colours, lighting a bit harsh.', '2005-01-31 04:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141662, 135806, 14028, '<td valign="top">Very good shot, like the angle you choose to get the sun right on top of the light house, it looks that is lit up. And well exposed. congrats!</td>', 'Very good shot, like the angle you choose to get the sun right on top of the light house, it looks that is lit up. And well exposed. congrats!', '2005-01-31 04:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141664, 135836, 4517, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, are the missing arms saying something. Like this is why he doesn`t help anyone.</td>', 'Interesting photo, are the missing arms saying something. Like this is why he doesn`t help anyone.', '2005-01-31 04:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141665, 136468, 14028, '<td valign="top">Have looked several times to this photo and still wondering what you did to the laces. Very imaginative!</td>', 'Have looked several times to this photo and still wondering what you did to the laces. Very imaginative!', '2005-01-31 04:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141666, 133723, 4517, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo, sea looks amazing. Horizon just very slightly running down to the right.9</td>', 'Terrific photo, sea looks amazing. Horizon just very slightly running down to the right.9', '2005-01-31 04:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141668, 136426, 4517, '<td valign="top">Would make a great postcard.</td>', 'Would make a great postcard.', '2005-01-31 04:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141670, 132743, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great model but poor background with bin and doors.</td>', 'Great model but poor background with bin and doors.', '2005-01-31 04:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141682, 136174, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great timing, you can see the dent.</td>', 'Great timing, you can see the dent.', '2005-01-31 05:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141689, 133763, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great scene, shame the wind has blurred the greenery.</td>', 'Great scene, shame the wind has blurred the greenery.', '2005-01-31 05:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141842, 133722, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 6<br/>Composition: 8<br/>Technical: 7<br/>Appeal: 7<br/>Overall 7<br/></td>', 'Challenge: 6Composition: 8Technical: 7Appeal: 7Overall 7', '2005-01-31 08:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141843, 133012, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and beautiful B&amp;W. I love the extra dimension created with the reflections.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and beautiful B&W. I love the extra dimension created with the reflections.', '2005-01-31 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141847, 133145, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge-6<br/>Composition-8 Nice portrait shot.<br/>Technical-5 post processing could have been worked on more.<br/>appeal: 6 <br/>Overall 6</td>', 'Challenge-6Composition-8 Nice portrait shot.Technical-5 post processing could have been worked on more.appeal: 6 Overall 6', '2005-01-31 08:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141848, 134596, 21714, '<td valign="top">Fine composition and exposure. Beautiful.</td>', 'Fine composition and exposure. Beautiful.', '2005-01-31 08:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141857, 135820, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the ''expression'' with fine details.</td>', 'Nice capture of the ''expression'' with fine details.', '2005-01-31 08:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141863, 136630, 14671, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but not to fussy on the hand being in it.  I like the border and an awesome background.  Excelent colors and clarity.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I like the photo but not to fussy on the hand being in it.  I like the border and an awesome background.  Excelent colors and clarity.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-31 08:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141865, 132853, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow what a beautiful bird in an outstanding "in flight" shot.  Excellent colors and clarity and the bird goes well against the background.   Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Wow what a beautiful bird in an outstanding "in flight" shot.  Excellent colors and clarity and the bird goes well against the background.   Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-31 08:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141866, 136674, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot and great colors but the contrast is very bright which I find puts a blurry effect onto the photo.  I like this photo.  It''s a photo that one can get lost in and simple stare and think.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A beautiful shot and great colors but the contrast is very bright which I find puts a blurry effect onto the photo.  I like this photo.  It''s a photo that one can get lost in and simple stare and think.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <8>', '2005-01-31 08:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141867, 132597, 21714, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Interesting composition. I like it a lot.', '2005-01-31 08:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141868, 132277, 14671, '<td valign="top">It is what it is.  The railing part of the picture looks to be blurry and I find it lacking subject.  However if it had more clarity I think it would be a nice picture to look at.  Good luck and best wishes in 2005.</td>', 'It is what it is.  The railing part of the picture looks to be blurry and I find it lacking subject.  However if it had more clarity I think it would be a nice picture to look at.  Good luck and best wishes in 2005.', '2005-01-31 08:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141870, 136401, 14671, '<td valign="top">The choice of DoF has made the back part of the ear appear to be a little OoF.  I also find there is not much to look at altho the tittle goes well with the photo.  Good luck and all the best in 2005. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'The choice of DoF has made the back part of the ear appear to be a little OoF.  I also find there is not much to look at altho the tittle goes well with the photo.  Good luck and all the best in 2005. <6>', '2005-01-31 08:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141871, 134079, 14671, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would make for an excellent calender shot.  It has a good DoF and excellent clarity.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I think this shot would make for an excellent calender shot.  It has a good DoF and excellent clarity.  Well done and keep up the good work in 2005. <7>', '2005-01-31 08:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141878, 133588, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo but to many distracting hotspots and not much to look at.  I find it lacks substance or subject.  Good luck and all the best in 2005.</td>', 'Interesting photo but to many distracting hotspots and not much to look at.  I find it lacks substance or subject.  Good luck and all the best in 2005.', '2005-01-31 08:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141879, 136468, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very clever, well done.</td>', 'Very clever, well done.', '2005-01-31 08:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141881, 134026, 4517, '<td valign="top">I think it`s a bit over the top on saturation, looks unnatural.</td>', 'I think it`s a bit over the top on saturation, looks unnatural.', '2005-01-31 08:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141882, 132023, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good sky and angle.</td>', 'Good sky and angle.', '2005-01-31 08:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141883, 135207, 14671, '<td valign="top">Theres a lot of noise in this photo and its a little to dark.  I also find the level is off and the photo leans to the right which is very distracting.  It would be a nice picture tho and like the way you can see right thru the piramid.  Good luck and all the best in 2005.</td>', 'Theres a lot of noise in this photo and its a little to dark.  I also find the level is off and the photo leans to the right which is very distracting.  It would be a nice picture tho and like the way you can see right thru the piramid.  Good luck and all the best in 2005.', '2005-01-31 08:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141890, 135618, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great effect, looks more like a painting than a photo.</td>', 'Great effect, looks more like a painting than a photo.', '2005-01-31 09:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141893, 133728, 14671, '<td valign="top">hahahahahahahahahaha  no comment.&lt;8&gt;</td>', 'hahahahahahahahahaha  no comment.<8>', '2005-01-31 09:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141903, 132400, 8005, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It really shows the attack of winter.8</td>', 'Nice capture. It really shows the attack of winter.8', '2005-01-31 09:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141906, 136525, 8005, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2005-01-31 09:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1141907, 132225, 8005, '<td valign="top">10 from me. I really like it.</td>', '10 from me. I really like it.', '2005-01-31 09:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142006, 136626, 8610, '<td valign="top">Great capture, excellent sharpnes of focus and nice use of Bokeh(DOF) - 8</td>', 'Great capture, excellent sharpnes of focus and nice use of Bokeh(DOF) - 8', '2005-01-31 10:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142010, 135575, 8610, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection on the fork</td>', 'Nice reflection on the fork', '2005-01-31 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142154, 132524, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like to use leaves/branches as framing elements too.</td>', 'I like to use leaves/branches as framing elements too.', '2005-01-31 12:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142160, 136602, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good exposure/detail; poignant pose,</td>', 'Good exposure/detail; poignant pose,', '2005-01-31 12:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142163, 135819, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unconventional landscape subject, great colors.</td>', 'Unconventional landscape subject, great colors.', '2005-01-31 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142166, 132388, 1031, '<td valign="top">One of the only times I''ve been able to see the red tail -- excellent exposure and positioning.</td>', 'One of the only times I''ve been able to see the red tail -- excellent exposure and positioning.', '2005-01-31 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142169, 133747, 1031, '<td valign="top">This could star in your sci-fi movie as an alien. Nice alternative view for a flower shot!</td>', 'This could star in your sci-fi movie as an alien. Nice alternative view for a flower shot!', '2005-01-31 12:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142171, 134119, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like it when people figure a way to use the wirea and poles instead of always trying to get rid of them.</td>', 'I like it when people figure a way to use the wirea and poles instead of always trying to get rid of them.', '2005-01-31 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142173, 136426, 19708, '<td valign="top">Beautiful copmposition and worthy of  a Post Card.  Only things I see here that could use improvement is a possibly a little darker with more contrast or some saturation boost as it looks a bit "flat". Nicely done. ((7))</td>', 'Beautiful copmposition and worthy of  a Post Card.  Only things I see here that could use improvement is a possibly a little darker with more contrast or some saturation boost as it looks a bit "flat". Nicely done. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142175, 134079, 1031, '<td valign="top">Must be getting pretty ripe to be bent over like that. Beautiful use of contrasting backgrounds to frame the subject.</td>', 'Must be getting pretty ripe to be bent over like that. Beautiful use of contrasting backgrounds to frame the subject.', '2005-01-31 12:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142178, 136766, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Though I suspect this is the way it actually looked, a little more saturation in the yellow (will boost what looks green to us) and reds would make this richer. Nicely done. ((7))</td>', 'Nice composition.  Though I suspect this is the way it actually looked, a little more saturation in the yellow (will boost what looks green to us) and reds would make this richer. Nicely done. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142179, 132763, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like Grandpa just found out there''s no Santa Claus : )</td>', 'Looks like Grandpa just found out there''s no Santa Claus : )', '2005-01-31 12:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142181, 134342, 19708, '<td valign="top">Powerful and emotive shot. Well seen and captured. Though I don''t (and suspect most others) care to see animals in harm''s way, it is nature and it''s balance. Well Done. ((7))</td>', 'Powerful and emotive shot. Well seen and captured. Though I don''t (and suspect most others) care to see animals in harm''s way, it is nature and it''s balance. Well Done. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142184, 132365, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great timing to catch it at this stage. This would be a great shot to be part of a time-lapse movie.</td>', 'Great timing to catch it at this stage. This would be a great shot to be part of a time-lapse movie.', '2005-01-31 12:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142185, 133203, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very unusual composition, bold with color and very good detail quality. Nice control of the lighting in the leaves. Perhaps a little shift in hue/brightness in the background (darker green) would make it a bit better. ((7))</td>', 'Very unusual composition, bold with color and very good detail quality. Nice control of the lighting in the leaves. Perhaps a little shift in hue/brightness in the background (darker green) would make it a bit better. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142186, 132781, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating diagonal elements.</td>', 'I like the repeating diagonal elements.', '2005-01-31 12:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142190, 132479, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well done night shot. Detail level is good and colors are not over-saturated. Well seen. ((7))</td>', 'Well done night shot. Detail level is good and colors are not over-saturated. Well seen. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142191, 134782, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s one of the better views of this famous landmark I''ve seen. Great star pattern on that light in the left foreground too.</td>', 'That''s one of the better views of this famous landmark I''ve seen. Great star pattern on that light in the left foreground too.', '2005-01-31 12:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142193, 133123, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well composed shot. Not too saturated, good detail level and nice use of the diagonal in the frame. ((7))</td>', 'Well composed shot. Not too saturated, good detail level and nice use of the diagonal in the frame. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142194, 132247, 9906, '<td valign="top">I am normally a fan of soft focus images that are done well.  This one seems to be done well, but IMHO it''s not the best subject for one.  Once again IMHO a water drop shot should be nice and sharp...<br/>TC</td>', 'I am normally a fan of soft focus images that are done well.  This one seems to be done well, but IMHO it''s not the best subject for one.  Once again IMHO a water drop shot should be nice and sharp...TC', '2005-01-31 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1142197, 132694, 19708, '<td valign="top">What a precious moment caught. Any parent would beam having this on their wall.Only suggestion I have is to clone out the blue toy in the lower right corner. ((7))</td>', 'What a precious moment caught. Any parent would beam having this on their wall.Only suggestion I have is to clone out the blue toy in the lower right corner. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142200, 136350, 1031, '<td valign="top">I guess their lamp diffusers aren''t meant for portraiture, but it lets you avoid using the flash -- congratulations!</td>', 'I guess their lamp diffusers aren''t meant for portraiture, but it lets you avoid using the flash -- congratulations!', '2005-01-31 12:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142201, 134993, 19708, '<td valign="top">Precious moment captured here. As I scrolled to see all of it, a tighter crop to remove the two corner areas off the top seems to help this a bit. ((7))</td>', 'Precious moment captured here. As I scrolled to see all of it, a tighter crop to remove the two corner areas off the top seems to help this a bit. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142203, 132158, 1031, '<td valign="top">Classic composition and beautiful colors.</td>', 'Classic composition and beautiful colors.', '2005-01-31 12:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142204, 132948, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen, using the natural elements of framing. Only suggestion I have is possibly cloning out the one vertical black branch in the opening of the big branches. ((7))</td>', 'Nicely seen, using the natural elements of framing. Only suggestion I have is possibly cloning out the one vertical black branch in the opening of the big branches. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142206, 136204, 19708, '<td valign="top">Though not a big fan of IR shots, this works well, with the use of diagonals in the composition. ((8))</td>', 'Though not a big fan of IR shots, this works well, with the use of diagonals in the composition. ((8))', '2005-01-31 12:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142210, 135275, 19708, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and depth of field (yes, pun intended) on this. Not sure if the cow on the left is helping or hurting the composition. Well done regardless. ((7))</td>', 'Excellent detail and depth of field (yes, pun intended) on this. Not sure if the cow on the left is helping or hurting the composition. Well done regardless. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142211, 135249, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice panorama showing the rapid variations in terrain ... small DPC display size may hurt your score a bit : (</td>', 'Nice panorama showing the rapid variations in terrain ... small DPC display size may hurt your score a bit : (', '2005-01-31 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142212, 136651, 19708, '<td valign="top">Not really my style, but there is something haunting about this I like. Composition is good, not putting it in the center. ((7))</td>', 'Not really my style, but there is something haunting about this I like. Composition is good, not putting it in the center. ((7))', '2005-01-31 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142214, 132853, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.</td>', 'Great action shot.', '2005-01-31 12:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1142217, 136752, 32111, '<td valign="top">Flawless in my opinion - beautiful photograph.</td>', 'Flawless in my opinion - beautiful photograph.', '2005-01-31 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
