(1143159, 132458, 19708, '<td valign="top">Rarely do we get to see a view like this, and I am in awe. Perhaps a little down on brightness and a liitle up on contrast would make this shot pop. Beautiful regardless. ((7))</td>', 'Rarely do we get to see a view like this, and I am in awe. Perhaps a little down on brightness and a liitle up on contrast would make this shot pop. Beautiful regardless. ((7))', '2005-01-31 19:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
