(1143163, 133195, 19708, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, pin sharp and great use of diagonals splitting the frame. Not sure if I am a big fan of the toning, but took nothing away because of it. ((7))</td>', 'Excellent composition, pin sharp and great use of diagonals splitting the frame. Not sure if I am a big fan of the toning, but took nothing away because of it. ((7))', '2005-01-31 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
