(1143453, 135711, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great composition and tone, just not sure if I''m a big fan of the curvature of the horizon. Still a good shot regardless. ((7))</td>', 'Great composition and tone, just not sure if I''m a big fan of the curvature of the horizon. Still a good shot regardless. ((7))', '2005-01-31 22:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143459, 135208, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a simply wonderful capture and is my favorite for this challenge.  I hope others see the beauty in this!  Great work.</td>', 'This is a simply wonderful capture and is my favorite for this challenge.  I hope others see the beauty in this!  Great work.', '2005-01-31 22:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143460, 136685, 9906, '<td valign="top">That''s one impressively big border.  How much burning did you do on the sky?  Just curious.  Sorry if I''m wrong...<br/>TC</td>', 'That''s one impressively big border.  How much burning did you do on the sky?  Just curious.  Sorry if I''m wrong...TC', '2005-01-31 22:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143461, 132307, 12253, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before, but still anonymous because I don''t recall who''s it is.  But I suspect this wonderful photo will capture a ribbon!  Simply fabulous.</td>', 'I''ve seen this before, but still anonymous because I don''t recall who''s it is.  But I suspect this wonderful photo will capture a ribbon!  Simply fabulous.', '2005-01-31 22:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143463, 132781, 19708, '<td valign="top">Composition is great and tones/use of B&amp;W a good choice. Blown-out section on top (white) really hurts this image in my opinon. ((5))</td>', 'Composition is great and tones/use of B&W a good choice. Blown-out section on top (white) really hurts this image in my opinon. ((5))', '2005-01-31 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143464, 133415, 9906, '<td valign="top">You forgot to burn the sky in the water.  This gives the shot a rather unballanced feeling to it.  Like the overall tonality, but getting a little tired of the burnt sky treatment.<br/>TC</td>', 'You forgot to burn the sky in the water.  This gives the shot a rather unballanced feeling to it.  Like the overall tonality, but getting a little tired of the burnt sky treatment.TC', '2005-01-31 22:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143467, 135249, 19708, '<td valign="top">Image size and lack of good detail hurt this image in my opinion. A little less branch in the foreground, and dropping the brightness &amp; increasing the contrast would help the richness. ((5))</td>', 'Image size and lack of good detail hurt this image in my opinion. A little less branch in the foreground, and dropping the brightness & increasing the contrast would help the richness. ((5))', '2005-01-31 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143469, 136282, 19708, '<td valign="top">Though it is a very precious personal picture, it does fall a bit short on clarity/sharpness and with the main subject being dead center, kinda'' hurts the photographic composition aspect. ((5))</td>', 'Though it is a very precious personal picture, it does fall a bit short on clarity/sharpness and with the main subject being dead center, kinda'' hurts the photographic composition aspect. ((5))', '2005-01-31 22:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143470, 132114, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very elegant in it''s simplicity!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very elegant in it''s simplicity!TC', '2005-01-31 22:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143477, 135987, 19708, '<td valign="top">Dark, moody, excellent lighting and a very unusual pose/composition sets this aside from most. The eye detail grabs and holds my own eyes. Perhaps a little tighter crop may look better with just a bit off the top, just above the thumb, as the hair on top is a bit distracting in my opinion. ((7))</td>', 'Dark, moody, excellent lighting and a very unusual pose/composition sets this aside from most. The eye detail grabs and holds my own eyes. Perhaps a little tighter crop may look better with just a bit off the top, just above the thumb, as the hair on top is a bit distracting in my opinion. ((7))', '2005-01-31 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143483, 135053, 21621, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot with outstanding color, perfect if not for the tight crop.  Great work.</td>', 'Fantastic shot with outstanding color, perfect if not for the tight crop.  Great work.', '2005-01-31 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143488, 136675, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot.  However, for whatever reason, circumstance or perhaps lack of sufficent postprocessing, the lighting here isn''t as magical as the scene.  It seems to lack diversity--it''s generally bright and sterile.  I personally think that can be dealt with in the postprocessing, unless you are totally satisfied with it as is.  Even still, it''s in my top 20 picks of this challenge</td>', 'I think this is a great shot.  However, for whatever reason, circumstance or perhaps lack of sufficent postprocessing, the lighting here isn''t as magical as the scene.  It seems to lack diversity--it''s generally bright and sterile.  I personally think that can be dealt with in the postprocessing, unless you are totally satisfied with it as is.  Even still, it''s in my top 20 picks of this challenge', '2005-01-31 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143489, 134269, 32969, '<td valign="top">loves it &lt;3</td>', 'loves it <3', '2005-01-31 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143491, 132185, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic as an abstract.  A bit hard to look at closely because my eyes go batty, but it''s just a wonderful catch.  One small thing: it seems like it could use a bit of controlled sharpening.  In my top 10 of picks for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is fantastic as an abstract.  A bit hard to look at closely because my eyes go batty, but it''s just a wonderful catch.  One small thing: it seems like it could use a bit of controlled sharpening.  In my top 10 of picks for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2005-01-31 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143493, 133748, 19248, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.', '2005-01-31 22:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143495, 136208, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and great detail and color contrasts, even with somewhat understated colors, it''s fantastic.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very good composition and great detail and color contrasts, even with somewhat understated colors, it''s fantastic.  Good luck.', '2005-01-31 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143498, 133084, 19248, '<td valign="top">too blurry, like you were walking while you took the picture.</td>', 'too blurry, like you were walking while you took the picture.', '2005-01-31 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143501, 136435, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is just a great use of a super wide angle lens.  I hope I can do as well with my new 10-22mm lens.  So far, I haven''t!  Good luck in the challenge--this is one of my top pics.</td>', 'This is just a great use of a super wide angle lens.  I hope I can do as well with my new 10-22mm lens.  So far, I haven''t!  Good luck in the challenge--this is one of my top pics.', '2005-01-31 23:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143504, 134322, 12253, '<td valign="top">I just love this.  I hope the "shouldn''t be blurry crowd" doesn''t penalize you (been there).  I had given it an 8 on my first pass, but I''m bumping it all the way up.  Super job!!!!!!!</td>', 'I just love this.  I hope the "shouldn''t be blurry crowd" doesn''t penalize you (been there).  I had given it an 8 on my first pass, but I''m bumping it all the way up.  Super job!!!!!!!', '2005-01-31 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143507, 136424, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great catch of a decisive moment.  Seems like a dangerous beach if they keep coming in that low.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Great catch of a decisive moment.  Seems like a dangerous beach if they keep coming in that low.  Bumping up.', '2005-01-31 23:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143508, 136441, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  Painting with light/  Love the tones of the flower and the general surroundings.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  Painting with light/  Love the tones of the flower and the general surroundings.  Bumping up.', '2005-01-31 23:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143519, 136329, 21621, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot, I hope this gets the high score it deserves.  Great work.</td>', 'Outstanding shot, I hope this gets the high score it deserves.  Great work.', '2005-01-31 23:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143522, 133748, 9906, '<td valign="top">If your horizon was level this would be perfect!<br/>TC</td>', 'If your horizon was level this would be perfect!TC', '2005-01-31 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143524, 133717, 19708, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the bird in the water is nice, as is the color, but the upper area of this shot is over-exposed, hurting the overall look. ((5))</td>', 'The reflection of the bird in the water is nice, as is the color, but the upper area of this shot is over-exposed, hurting the overall look. ((5))', '2005-01-31 23:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143528, 132225, 10658, '<td valign="top">This is already a winner, but it''d be nice to see it place really highly in this competition :)</td>', 'This is already a winner, but it''d be nice to see it place really highly in this competition :)', '2005-01-31 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143529, 132361, 19708, '<td valign="top">Depth of field? What depth of field (LOL)<br/>Great Macro shot with an exceptional level of detail. ((7))</td>', 'Depth of field? What depth of field (LOL)Great Macro shot with an exceptional level of detail. ((7))', '2005-01-31 23:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143534, 132996, 19708, '<td valign="top">Makes me hungry looking at it (LOL)<br/>Lighting is too harsh on top of the bagel and is blown-out.  Decent color level without being over-saturated. Photographically speaking, the main subject in the dead center hurts the composition. ((5))</td>', 'Makes me hungry looking at it (LOL)Lighting is too harsh on top of the bagel and is blown-out.  Decent color level without being over-saturated. Photographically speaking, the main subject in the dead center hurts the composition. ((5))', '2005-01-31 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143536, 133335, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the slightly soft focus.  Are you getting negative comments for it?  It works perfectly here.<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the slightly soft focus.  Are you getting negative comments for it?  It works perfectly here.TC', '2005-01-31 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143540, 136747, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter for a shot. Here''s what I see needs improvement:<br/>The horizon is dead-center for one - this hurts an image as the eyes don''t know if they should go up or down. The trees are a bit harsh on contrast and could use adjustment in the saturation brightness area. Hope this helps. ((5))</td>', 'Nice subject matter for a shot. Here''s what I see needs improvement:The horizon is dead-center for one - this hurts an image as the eyes don''t know if they should go up or down. The trees are a bit harsh on contrast and could use adjustment in the saturation brightness area. Hope this helps. ((5))', '2005-01-31 23:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143542, 133415, 17851, '<td valign="top">Hey Danny I know this is yours because it was in the gallery, looks great here and it looked great framed...good luck ;)</td>', 'Hey Danny I know this is yours because it was in the gallery, looks great here and it looked great framed...good luck ;)', '2005-01-31 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143545, 135155, 24528, '<td valign="top">Very pretty</td>', 'Very pretty', '2005-01-31 23:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143546, 132693, 17851, '<td valign="top">Jacko! lol allready have this image in my favs., love the "splash" of red aswell as the clarity!...best of luck 10</td>', 'Jacko! lol allready have this image in my favs., love the "splash" of red aswell as the clarity!...best of luck 10', '2005-01-31 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143548, 133979, 19708, '<td valign="top">Composition is good regarding sky vs. land area. Image is not very clear/sharp and may benefit from a little more saturation to help the sky area"pop". ((5))</td>', 'Composition is good regarding sky vs. land area. Image is not very clear/sharp and may benefit from a little more saturation to help the sky area"pop". ((5))', '2005-01-31 23:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143549, 136307, 25754, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful sensuality in this shot! Very good.</td>', 'Wow, wonderful sensuality in this shot! Very good.', '2005-01-31 23:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143550, 136424, 24528, '<td valign="top">wow.. that to close for comfort.</td>', 'wow.. that to close for comfort.', '2005-01-31 23:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143552, 134904, 17851, '<td valign="top">WOW!, the tones here are amazing they create mood throughout the photo, love the stopped motion too!</td>', 'WOW!, the tones here are amazing they create mood throughout the photo, love the stopped motion too!', '2005-01-31 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143555, 136674, 17851, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!, I love how the boats contains such warm colors compared to the cold colors from the background. Great photo!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!, I love how the boats contains such warm colors compared to the cold colors from the background. Great photo!', '2005-01-31 23:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143560, 134342, 17851, '<td valign="top">Awesome timing!, I have never seen anything like it, great action aswell as stopped motion, a very unique photograph :)</td>', 'Awesome timing!, I have never seen anything like it, great action aswell as stopped motion, a very unique photograph :)', '2005-01-31 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143562, 132693, 12253, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, nice clarity and excellent catch!  Bumping up.</td>', 'Lovely colors, nice clarity and excellent catch!  Bumping up.', '2005-01-31 23:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143564, 135345, 17851, '<td valign="top">Excelent macro!, everything is in focus and the colors go great together, best of luck ;)</td>', 'Excelent macro!, everything is in focus and the colors go great together, best of luck ;)', '2005-01-31 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1143565, 134979, 25754, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I''m not so sure about your choice to go with the dead-center vanishing point, but otherwise a great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I''m not so sure about your choice to go with the dead-center vanishing point, but otherwise a great shot!', '2005-01-31 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
