(1143647, 134142, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beagleboy:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting image, but you''ve got a definite green cast.  I love his expression. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks -- with my red-green color vision defect I didn''t notice the cast -- I''ll have to check the numbers in Photoshop and see what I can do about it ... although none of the people who have gotten prints have mentioned it : )</td>', 'Originally posted by Beagleboy: Interesting image, but you''ve got a definite green cast.  I love his expression.  Thanks -- with my red-green color vision defect I didn''t notice the cast -- I''ll have to check the numbers in Photoshop and see what I can do about it ... although none of the people who have gotten prints have mentioned it : )', '2005-02-01 00:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
