(1143769, 134342, 10658, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t place higher.  I think people were traumatized by the subject and didn''t vote according to the quality of the photo.  I was horrified, but amazed at the same time when I came across this one during the voting process.  My mother has always told me that swans are vicious, but this was the first time I''d seen proof.  <br/> <br/>I was one of the 6 who gave this image a 10 and I''m truly saddened that so many others felt they had to vote it down.  It''s a brilliant capture worthy of National Geographic (at least).</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t place higher.  I think people were traumatized by the subject and didn''t vote according to the quality of the photo.  I was horrified, but amazed at the same time when I came across this one during the voting process.  My mother has always told me that swans are vicious, but this was the first time I''d seen proof.   I was one of the 6 who gave this image a 10 and I''m truly saddened that so many others felt they had to vote it down.  It''s a brilliant capture worthy of National Geographic (at least).', '2005-02-01 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
