(1143861, 134077, 8860, '<td valign="top">Oh s**t!<br/> <br/>Well, I''m a man of <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=98902" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">my word</a>...</td>', 'Oh s**t! Well, I''m a man of my word...', '2005-02-01 02:56:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143863, 135783, 8860, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. I knew his face direction would cause unrest! It did for me for a while, but I weighed it up and went for it anyway, despite the flaw.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I knew his face direction would cause unrest! It did for me for a while, but I weighed it up and went for it anyway, despite the flaw.', '2005-02-01 03:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143864, 132540, 8635, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite shots -- am surprised it did not do a hell of a lot better.  I gave it a 10... it''s a great example of photojournalism, and an image one can easily imagine seeing in LIFE or TIME... Great shot.</td>', 'This was one of my favorite shots -- am surprised it did not do a hell of a lot better.  I gave it a 10... it''s a great example of photojournalism, and an image one can easily imagine seeing in LIFE or TIME... Great shot.', '2005-02-01 03:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143873, 136769, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot; read each and every comment ten times over.</td>', 'Fantastic shot; read each and every comment ten times over.', '2005-02-01 03:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143876, 136576, 20779, '<td valign="top">I had this pegged as a top 5. Fantastic.</td>', 'I had this pegged as a top 5. Fantastic.', '2005-02-01 03:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143880, 136752, 16301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on yet another ribbon :D</td>', 'Congrats on yet another ribbon :D', '2005-02-01 03:24:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143883, 133084, 30364, '<td valign="top">Often post-challenge commentators will note with astonishment the handful of voters who scored an image as a 1 or 2.  But in the case of this adventurous work, a number of such scores has to be inevitable; and if they truly hated it, well OK, they''ve got to go low.  But what I can''t understand here is the great mass of voters scoring it in the 4 to 6 range.  Almost 60% of all votes!  How so many people can simply be indifferent to this image is beyond belief.  You must either love this, or you loathe it ... anything in between is just intellectual sloth.</td>', 'Often post-challenge commentators will note with astonishment the handful of voters who scored an image as a 1 or 2.  But in the case of this adventurous work, a number of such scores has to be inevitable; and if they truly hated it, well OK, they''ve got to go low.  But what I can''t understand here is the great mass of voters scoring it in the 4 to 6 range.  Almost 60% of all votes!  How so many people can simply be indifferent to this image is beyond belief.  You must either love this, or you loathe it ... anything in between is just intellectual sloth.', '2005-02-01 03:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143886, 135346, 16301, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, a timeless moment, great shot!</td>', 'Love the colors, a timeless moment, great shot!', '2005-02-01 03:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143888, 136752, 4281, '<td valign="top">Heiða, best í heimi!<br/> <br/>Congratulations, Heiða, on a terrific photo and yet another blue ribbon. :-)</td>', 'Heiða, best í heimi! Congratulations, Heiða, on a terrific photo and yet another blue ribbon. :-)', '2005-02-01 03:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
