(1143897, 132167, 16301, '<td valign="top">Great candid, I really liked it. Maybe B&amp;W or sepia would look better, but i''m not sure if thats something you''d like...</td>', 'Great candid, I really liked it. Maybe B&W or sepia would look better, but i''m not sure if thats something you''d like...', '2005-02-01 03:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
