(1143907, 132071, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your kind comments and votes. I am delighted with my top 10% placing. This was a great challenge with some superb entries from extremely talented photographers.</td>', 'Thank you all for your kind comments and votes. I am delighted with my top 10% placing. This was a great challenge with some superb entries from extremely talented photographers.', '2005-02-01 03:52:55.000000', NULL, 0),
