(1143916, 133785, 20608, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your wonderfull comment I am very happy I finnished top 100 and this is my highest ever score to date.. <br/> <br/>I wonder if it has anything to do with the fact that i just switched from WIN to MAC .. I think so.<br/> <br/>Thank you all<br/> <br/>edit - pic taken in Japan at a local shrine in Chiba.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-01 04:20:11.</i></td>', 'Thank you everyone for your wonderfull comment I am very happy I finnished top 100 and this is my highest ever score to date..  I wonder if it has anything to do with the fact that i just switched from WIN to MAC .. I think so. Thank you all edit - pic taken in Japan at a local shrine in Chiba.', '2005-02-01 04:13:19.000000', '2005-02-01 04:20:11.000000', 0),
