(1143920, 136752, 16493, '<td valign="top">Congratilations Heiða, nicely done!<br/>Very good picture as usual.</td>', 'Congratilations Heiða, nicely done!Very good picture as usual.', '2005-02-01 04:23:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143921, 135127, 13602, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 and I''m shocked about the final score, but that''s the way it is when most voters have verry little to do with photography and they just hate children images. Congrats, top 10 for me.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 and I''m shocked about the final score, but that''s the way it is when most voters have verry little to do with photography and they just hate children images. Congrats, top 10 for me.', '2005-02-01 04:24:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143924, 132255, 4805, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your nice comments. Oh how I wish they all took off their sunglasses, but I didn''t notice until later. The soft focus was an attempt to make a more traditional portrait out of a sports shot. Normally I don''t like soft focus either but I was trying something and I think it worked. In the prints I''ve done at a large size it''s less noticeable. <br/> <br/>Given that stroke seat (closest to the camera) is my girlfriend, the composition and the processing made sense. This image represents the calm before the storm...both the training session and their lead-up to racing later that summer in Spain. I have many photos from the trip there, and I might post some soon and tell the story.<br/> <br/>This, I got lucky. It''s an honour to be in such company.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your nice comments. Oh how I wish they all took off their sunglasses, but I didn''t notice until later. The soft focus was an attempt to make a more traditional portrait out of a sports shot. Normally I don''t like soft focus either but I was trying something and I think it worked. In the prints I''ve done at a large size it''s less noticeable.  Given that stroke seat (closest to the camera) is my girlfriend, the composition and the processing made sense. This image represents the calm before the storm...both the training session and their lead-up to racing later that summer in Spain. I have many photos from the trip there, and I might post some soon and tell the story. This, I got lucky. It''s an honour to be in such company.', '2005-02-01 04:26:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143925, 134229, 13602, '<td valign="top">I can''t belive this scored so low. I gave it a 10 and I expected to see it in the top 20 somewhere...</td>', 'I can''t belive this scored so low. I gave it a 10 and I expected to see it in the top 20 somewhere...', '2005-02-01 04:28:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143940, 136752, 9913, '<td valign="top">Við áttum aldrei séns:)<br/>Til hamingju sætust!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-01 05:02:13.</i></td>', 'Við áttum aldrei séns:)Til hamingju sætust!', '2005-02-01 05:01:52.000000', '2005-02-01 05:02:13.000000', 0),
(1143942, 132264, 13891, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that commented. This photograph was taken on Holy Island (aka Lindisfarne) in Northumberland, UK. For me, this area was an unfound jewel until 2004, when I decided to meander my way down the east coast on my way home from a trip to Scotland.<br/>I am not sure what the history of these huts is, but I have only seen them on the island, but these particular ones (which are adjacent to Lindisfarne Castle) are not the only ones there. I would guess that the old boats were originally used this way as a recycling measure and should certainly be waterproof.<br/></td>', 'Thanks to all that commented. This photograph was taken on Holy Island (aka Lindisfarne) in Northumberland, UK. For me, this area was an unfound jewel until 2004, when I decided to meander my way down the east coast on my way home from a trip to Scotland.I am not sure what the history of these huts is, but I have only seen them on the island, but these particular ones (which are adjacent to Lindisfarne Castle) are not the only ones there. I would guess that the old boats were originally used this way as a recycling measure and should certainly be waterproof.', '2005-02-01 05:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1143946, 132096, 32111, '<td valign="top">I''m astounded this didn''t rank higher. At least it got 31x10, which is more tens than almost any other!<br/> <br/>Again, great photo, one of my favourites from the competition.</td>', 'I''m astounded this didn''t rank higher. At least it got 31x10, which is more tens than almost any other! Again, great photo, one of my favourites from the competition.', '2005-02-01 05:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
