(1144242, 133137, 19408, '<td valign="top">holy smokes this is such a dichotomous shot! That voting bell looks like an X-Wing Fighter. I don''t remember ever seeing a bell that  perfectly polarized. I''m always amazed whenever two people look at the exact same thing and come up with wildly different conclusions. I thought this would''ve place top 20...but then there are others who thought it should place bottom 20. Oh well, c''est la DPC!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-03 18:51:49.</i></td>', 'holy smokes this is such a dichotomous shot! That voting bell looks like an X-Wing Fighter. I don''t remember ever seeing a bell that  perfectly polarized. I''m always amazed whenever two people look at the exact same thing and come up with wildly different conclusions. I thought this would''ve place top 20...but then there are others who thought it should place bottom 20. Oh well, c''est la DPC!', '2005-02-01 11:15:47.000000', '2005-02-03 18:51:49.000000', 0),
