(1144512, 133862, 20066, '<td valign="top">Well I think it was then my best from year 2004 since it is my highest voting ever.<br/> <br/>About comments.  Thanks for them all... but:<br/> <br/>The purse is an important object in that photo in my opinion.  So comment about I should have excluded the purse are not helpful at all!<br/> <br/>I can perhaps agree with comments about the frame but I don''t think that matters at all<br/> <br/>Perhaps I should have hada another title on it<br/> <br/>I didn''t know them and they didn''t notice me so I couldn''t let them do anything<br/> <br/>It is sunset/sunrise at midnight in Iceland but not the moon as dartompkins said<br/> <br/>There is no other version in different colors and the sky was in this color in reality that evening<br/> <br/>And finally.  It is just a point and shoot photo since I was on my inline skates during that evening and happened to have my little camerea with me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-01 14:24:18.</i></td>', 'Well I think it was then my best from year 2004 since it is my highest voting ever. About comments.  Thanks for them all... but: The purse is an important object in that photo in my opinion.  So comment about I should have excluded the purse are not helpful at all! I can perhaps agree with comments about the frame but I don''t think that matters at all Perhaps I should have hada another title on it I didn''t know them and they didn''t notice me so I couldn''t let them do anything It is sunset/sunrise at midnight in Iceland but not the moon as dartompkins said There is no other version in different colors and the sky was in this color in reality that evening And finally.  It is just a point and shoot photo since I was on my inline skates during that evening and happened to have my little camerea with me.', '2005-02-01 14:23:19.000000', '2005-02-01 14:24:18.000000', 0),
