(1152875, 134364, 14986, '<td valign="top">Okay, you said you''d like some feedback so I''ll jump in.  <br/> <br/>I gave your photo a 4.  I did so because I felt the subject wasn''t interesting to me at all, and because I didn''t like the composition or the lighting as well.  To me, it seemed very cut off on the left.  I didn''t feel like there were any real impactful features of the shot...the colors seem pretty bland and lighting flat to me, the composition as stated above, and (I''m sorry) but I think the grass covered cat is not pretty at all.<br/> <br/>It was in focus and the exposure seemed right, although perhaps just a shade dark.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry I don''t see the same thing in it as you do, but I suppose that''s the way it works many times.   If it makes you feel any better, I thought my 2004 shot should have scored better too :) !<br/> <br/>Hope the feedback is helpful.  I don''t intend to offend, but wanted to answer why someone might score it low as I felt I did.</td>', 'Okay, you said you''d like some feedback so I''ll jump in.   I gave your photo a 4.  I did so because I felt the subject wasn''t interesting to me at all, and because I didn''t like the composition or the lighting as well.  To me, it seemed very cut off on the left.  I didn''t feel like there were any real impactful features of the shot...the colors seem pretty bland and lighting flat to me, the composition as stated above, and (I''m sorry) but I think the grass covered cat is not pretty at all. It was in focus and the exposure seemed right, although perhaps just a shade dark. I''m sorry I don''t see the same thing in it as you do, but I suppose that''s the way it works many times.   If it makes you feel any better, I thought my 2004 shot should have scored better too :) ! Hope the feedback is helpful.  I don''t intend to offend, but wanted to answer why someone might score it low as I felt I did.', '2005-02-06 03:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1152944, 136307, 18450, '<td valign="top">This image is just beautiful!! So sensual and intimate. I''ve just sat here for the last 10 mins gazing in awe. Thankyou!!<br/> <br/>sue</td>', 'This image is just beautiful!! So sensual and intimate. I''ve just sat here for the last 10 mins gazing in awe. Thankyou!! sue', '2005-02-06 04:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1153055, 132512, 164, '<td valign="top">Thanx for your comments on mine. I gave yours a six. I think that is the picture does well at expressing the moment and is generally well lit. The objections would be that his hand is not on the guitar and yet it is still  blurry. I also think a little better angle would have improved it. I know that in these situations you have to take what you can get but that is how I see it. BTW, I would have been happy with a 5 average on mine.</td>', 'Thanx for your comments on mine. I gave yours a six. I think that is the picture does well at expressing the moment and is generally well lit. The objections would be that his hand is not on the guitar and yet it is still  blurry. I also think a little better angle would have improved it. I know that in these situations you have to take what you can get but that is how I see it. BTW, I would have been happy with a 5 average on mine.', '2005-02-06 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
