(1196498, 133848, 12253, '<td valign="top">Looking at these for your entry.  I love the scene here and the composition.  The light looks like it''s wonderfully interesting.  But something seems calibrated wrong.  It seems too dark, or maybe just too low contrast.  You might tweak it a little.  Depending on how it prints, it could be a real contender.</td>', 'Looking at these for your entry.  I love the scene here and the composition.  The light looks like it''s wonderfully interesting.  But something seems calibrated wrong.  It seems too dark, or maybe just too low contrast.  You might tweak it a little.  Depending on how it prints, it could be a real contender.', '2005-02-27 09:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
