(1212316, 135405, 7473, '<td valign="top">ClickNSee,<br/>   I love the lines in this photograph.  I love how all the lines are starting in the left and get broader as you move to the right.  Very nice!<br/> <br/>  Further to our other discussion, it seems that some of the same types of shots win quite a lot here.  It is amazing when you are voting, at how many times you see the same type of shot.  For instance with the "passing time" challenge there were at least 5 or 6 shots of chess.  The imagination or lack there of, of people always seems to lead them in the same direction in many cases in the challenge.  <br/> <br/>   Take Care,<br/>Ben<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-07 10:17:55.</i></td>', 'ClickNSee,   I love the lines in this photograph.  I love how all the lines are starting in the left and get broader as you move to the right.  Very nice!   Further to our other discussion, it seems that some of the same types of shots win quite a lot here.  It is amazing when you are voting, at how many times you see the same type of shot.  For instance with the "passing time" challenge there were at least 5 or 6 shots of chess.  The imagination or lack there of, of people always seems to lead them in the same direction in many cases in the challenge.      Take Care,Ben', '2005-03-07 10:17:25.000000', '2005-03-07 10:17:55.000000', 0),
(1213591, 136300, 34589, '<td valign="top">I love it, and the process details as well -bob</td>', 'I love it, and the process details as well -bob', '2005-03-07 20:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1221407, 136823, 21714, '<td valign="top">I had this on a 9 in the challenge. I was going through your portfolio and I appreciate this one even more now. I think it''s one of the images that keep getting better and better. Excellent work.</td>', 'I had this on a 9 in the challenge. I was going through your portfolio and I appreciate this one even more now. I think it''s one of the images that keep getting better and better. Excellent work.', '2005-03-11 09:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1225934, 134026, 2798, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot and got lots of useful comments. It''s an attractive scene that was enhanced with some sure handed post processing. You got the balance right here. If I have any suggestions for improvement it would be to try and bring back some of the detail in that very orange bush on the right. No other comments. Well done. This is a 9 from me.</td>', 'This is a stunning shot and got lots of useful comments. It''s an attractive scene that was enhanced with some sure handed post processing. You got the balance right here. If I have any suggestions for improvement it would be to try and bring back some of the detail in that very orange bush on the right. No other comments. Well done. This is a 9 from me.', '2005-03-14 05:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1226006, 136424, 17877, '<td valign="top">this is an INCREDIBLE capture...I have seen it replicated on many sites on the internet. even though that constitutes a form of plagarism, you should be flattered.</td>', 'this is an INCREDIBLE capture...I have seen it replicated on many sites on the internet. even though that constitutes a form of plagarism, you should be flattered.', '2005-03-14 06:40:27.000000', NULL, 0),
