(1260804, 135783, 21978, '<td valign="top">I think that only one thing could make this shot better (my opinion).<br/>If you could have got your son to look at the sunset so the sun lights up his face. (again just my opinion) Great shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-30 23:40:15.</i></td>', 'I think that only one thing could make this shot better (my opinion).If you could have got your son to look at the sunset so the sun lights up his face. (again just my opinion) Great shot!', '2005-03-31 00:39:16.000000', '2005-03-31 00:40:15.000000', 0),
