(1423859, 132255, 19746, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I miss rowing, although the early morning wakeup and the freezing cold would probably change my mind if ever I started again hehe.  Fantastic shot, one often forgets the off-water synchronicity while focusing on the classic togetherness of the actual stroke itself.  This photo helps show that a crew has to be entirely together to do well, right down to carrying the boat and pushing off before rowing to the start.  <br/> <br/>Great capture!  A well deserved placing amongst a highly competitive field.</td>', 'Sometimes I miss rowing, although the early morning wakeup and the freezing cold would probably change my mind if ever I started again hehe.  Fantastic shot, one often forgets the off-water synchronicity while focusing on the classic togetherness of the actual stroke itself.  This photo helps show that a crew has to be entirely together to do well, right down to carrying the boat and pushing off before rowing to the start.   Great capture!  A well deserved placing amongst a highly competitive field.', '2005-05-31 18:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
