(1625096, 135805, 18932, '<td valign="top">Very nice. In any other challenge may well have ribboned. The texture of the bark and her hair is cool, the tonal range across the shot is good. The subject is great, the look on her eyes the earring and the expression generally hint at something deeper than a simple portrait. Lovely take. I''m honoured that someone with your obvious talent liked my photo. Added you as a fave.</td>', 'Very nice. In any other challenge may well have ribboned. The texture of the bark and her hair is cool, the tonal range across the shot is good. The subject is great, the look on her eyes the earring and the expression generally hint at something deeper than a simple portrait. Lovely take. I''m honoured that someone with your obvious talent liked my photo. Added you as a fave.', '2005-08-19 23:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
