(1646467, 135805, 13026, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the b&amp;w is perfect, adds mood to the shot I think...<br/>I also commented on the original version of this shot, but this one is tons better than that one...the processing is very nice and you''ve highlighted her eyes perfectly.  This is great!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the b&w is perfect, adds mood to the shot I think...I also commented on the original version of this shot, but this one is tons better than that one...the processing is very nice and you''ve highlighted her eyes perfectly.  This is great!', '2005-08-26 00:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
