(1710477, 132096, 6349, '<td valign="top">and there i was saying that this was one of my all time favorite photos on the site...when it wasn''t even in my favorites!   I know it was at one time (or two), I''ve just had to refill my favorites so many times at this point...back again!</td>', 'and there i was saying that this was one of my all time favorite photos on the site...when it wasn''t even in my favorites!   I know it was at one time (or two), I''ve just had to refill my favorites so many times at this point...back again!', '2005-09-15 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1713894, 136823, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and composition here.  Is that the texture of the wall behind him - ah, no, it''s a beard!  The hot spots on the tuning knobs are a little distracting, but I love the tonal range.  Really nice shot.</td>', 'Great perspective and composition here.  Is that the texture of the wall behind him - ah, no, it''s a beard!  The hot spots on the tuning knobs are a little distracting, but I love the tonal range.  Really nice shot.', '2005-09-16 11:51:18.000000', NULL, 0),
