(1846589, 133785, 20608, '<td valign="top">Thanks PETRAKKA, This picture is kind of a landmark for me. This is a picture of my Girlfriend HANAE she is also a member here and shoots with a little Contax SL300R. This was our first Photo-date, I had explained to her that I was a member of this site and needed a picture to enter for the best of 2004. We decided to go to the temple for some enlightenment and I took my TOKAI guitar along for a song.. That guitar has since been stolen from my house along with 6 other guitars and various bits n pieces but our love still lives on stronger than ever.<br/> <br/>After looking at your work it makes me very proud you enjoy this shot as much as I, you are a fine photographer. Thank you very much.</td>', 'Thanks PETRAKKA, This picture is kind of a landmark for me. This is a picture of my Girlfriend HANAE she is also a member here and shoots with a little Contax SL300R. This was our first Photo-date, I had explained to her that I was a member of this site and needed a picture to enter for the best of 2004. We decided to go to the temple for some enlightenment and I took my TOKAI guitar along for a song.. That guitar has since been stolen from my house along with 6 other guitars and various bits n pieces but our love still lives on stronger than ever. After looking at your work it makes me very proud you enjoy this shot as much as I, you are a fine photographer. Thank you very much.', '2005-11-08 01:36:53.000000', NULL, 0),
