(2325871, 132531, 44066, '<td valign="top">I agree, it would be nice to see the face in this shot. Very nice exposure on the flames though, they''re sharp and I like the extra curl on the top right. It might also be nice to see a wider crop of this with more space on the left and top.<br/> <br/>All in all, well captured.<br/> <br/>cheers,<br/><a href="//www.luxotica.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">fireguy</a></td>', 'I agree, it would be nice to see the face in this shot. Very nice exposure on the flames though, they''re sharp and I like the extra curl on the top right. It might also be nice to see a wider crop of this with more space on the left and top. All in all, well captured. cheers,fireguy', '2006-04-19 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2335888, 132225, 48228, '<td valign="top">Love this image so much Skip, so much so I am adding it to my favorites along with my most favorite of yours.....I think from memory it is called "Absolutely Still".....</td>', 'Love this image so much Skip, so much so I am adding it to my favorites along with my most favorite of yours.....I think from memory it is called "Absolutely Still".....', '2006-04-23 00:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2376942, 135405, 55100, '<td valign="top">I like this shot alot!</td>', 'I like this shot alot!', '2006-05-03 12:12:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2383892, 136581, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hadn''t seen this one before Neil. Really nice. Totally inviting, the image just really draws you into it. Not only nice colors and motion, but neat how the shift from blues into the oranges make for a nice vertical split of the shot too. Composed great, the photo grabs your attention, then the eyes follow the split and the colors towards the top left, then the motion brings you back around to start over again. Great abstract!</td>', 'Hadn''t seen this one before Neil. Really nice. Totally inviting, the image just really draws you into it. Not only nice colors and motion, but neat how the shift from blues into the oranges make for a nice vertical split of the shot too. Composed great, the photo grabs your attention, then the eyes follow the split and the colors towards the top left, then the motion brings you back around to start over again. Great abstract!', '2006-05-05 01:14:39.000000', NULL, 0),
